able energy adoption, and lo','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://pageind.com/pages/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Reducing%20our%20carbon%20footprint%20through%20energy%20efficiency%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'362918809c89271f18434361d00af571','COMP_TOP200_132',NULL,'de36937905d3ad4b3b5760268b7d0368',NULL,'Reducing our carbon footprint through energy efficiency, renewable energy adoption, and low-carbon investment. Aligned to India\'s NDC and global climate goals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pageind.com/pages/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Reducing%20our%20carbon%20footprint%20through%20energy%20efficiency%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254','{}'),(153,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://pageind.com/pages/sustainability-esg#:~:text=FY%202024%20-%2025%20has%20been%20a','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5e08b518ca830b4c73502a551476b35d','COMP_TOP200_132',NULL,'e6799f6ee65c6b97cbc340f1e7d52460',NULL,'FY 2024 - 25 has been a defining year in our journey to integrate sustainability into every aspect of our operations. As wenavigated a complex economic and market environment, we are proud to achieve a revenue of ₹49,349 million while advancing several key initiatives that strengthen our environmental, social,and governance (ESG) performance and create long-term value for all stakeholders.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pageind.com/pages/sustainability-esg#:~:text=FY%202024%20-%2025%20has%20been%20a',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:05.404254','{}'),(154,'CSR Initiative: Download Environmental Monitoring report (Part','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/sustainability/reports#:~:text=Download%20Environmental%20Monitoring%20report%20%28Part%20-1%29%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'08554fd50d697d1d4ac1291376680900','COMP_TOP200_131',NULL,'db13831fe450865439d53f680cbdbbe8',NULL,'Download Environmental Monitoring report (Part -1) of Punjab site',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/sustainability/reports#:~:text=Download%20Environmental%20Monitoring%20report%20%28Part%20-1%29%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635','{}'),(155,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=-%20Other%20Information%20%3A%20If%20you%20use','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6a853a1ae9c46f6a77e5701713c4dbb0','COMP_TOP200_131',NULL,'229933a47e764dd0d0a71212b507fe71',NULL,'- Other Information : If you use our website or our app, we may collect information about your IP address and the browser you are using. We might look at what site you came from, the duration of time spent on our website, pages accessed or what site you visit when you leave us. We might also collect the type of mobile device you are using, or the version of the operating system your computer or device is running on',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=-%20Other%20Information%20%3A%20If%20you%20use',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635','{}'),(156,'CSR Initiative: We refrain from sharing any of your personal information with third party stakeholders oth','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=We%20refrain%20from%20sharing%20any%20of%20your','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5cdbd67c59a1ef72990858a513953e21','COMP_TOP200_131',NULL,'2124bb88431dc1acc0b15468217a428c',NULL,'We refrain from sharing any of your personal information with third party stakeholders other than service providers of ours who assist us in providing the information and/or services we are providing to you. Any non-personal information, communications and material you send to this site or to us by e-mail are on a non-confidential basis. We are free to use and reproduce any such information freely, and for any purpose whatsoever. We will be free to use any ideas, concepts, know-how or techniques contained in such information for any purpose, including developing, manufacturing or marketing products. Any piece of information you send to this site must be truthful, not violate the rights of others and be legal. Alike many other companies, we use \"cookie\" technology, where our servers deposit special codes on a visitor\'s computer. This information helps us determine in the aggregate the total number of visitors to the site on an ongoing basis and the types of Internet browsers and operating systems used by our visitors. We do not use this information to personally recognize visitors or cross-reference the information with any type of personal information that is voluntarily offered on or through the website. We may modify this policy at any time, in our sole discretion and all modifications will be effective immediately upon our posting of the modifications on this site.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=We%20refrain%20from%20sharing%20any%20of%20your',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635','{}'),(157,'CSR Initiative: \" At KNPL, we are unwavering in our commitment to driving positive change through a holist','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/sustainability.html#:~:text=%22%20At%20KNPL%2C%20we%20are%20unwavering%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a547383e8947aad3d43c100b8ca2c7fc','COMP_TOP200_131',NULL,'cc169790959bb932bfc32c25e3507ca8',NULL,'\" At KNPL, we are unwavering in our commitment to driving positive change through a holistic approach that prioritises environmental stewardship, social responsibility, and exemplary governance practices. Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) strategy has five key materialities: Decarbonisation, Resource Use, Quality of Life, Diversity, and Governance, which collectively shape our vision embedding sustainability into core operations and enabling long-term impact.\"',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.nerolac.com/sustainability.html#:~:text=%22%20At%20KNPL%2C%20we%20are%20unwavering%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:26.178635','{}'),(158,'CSR Initiative: · Right to erasure','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://marico.com/india/other/privacy-policy#:~:text=%C2%B7%20Right%20to%20erasure%3A%20You%20may%20request','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5eadb7100ba2ffcc3c8f5e27753e4fc7','COMP_TOP200_128',NULL,'13a82520d771ab75dd7c48d464fda5a1',NULL,'· Right to erasure: You may request for erasure of your personal data stored with us. Upon receipt of such a request, the personal data shall be erased from our system(s) unless retention of this data is necessary for any of the purpose(s) specified in this notice or for compliance with any law for the time being in force.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://marico.com/india/other/privacy-policy#:~:text=%C2%B7%20Right%20to%20erasure%3A%20You%20may%20request',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931','{}'),(159,'CSR Initiative: SECURITY SAFEGUARDS FOR STORING PERSONAL DATA WITHIN OUR ECOSYSTEM','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://marico.com/india/other/privacy-policy#:~:text=SECURITY%20SAFEGUARDS%20FOR%20STORING%20PERSONAL%20DATA%20WITHIN','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d00b43e997be4183aa4f9b3d239c512a','COMP_TOP200_128',NULL,'ec76e1036cb7ec6566692564b5db78ae',NULL,'SECURITY SAFEGUARDS FOR STORING PERSONAL DATA WITHIN OUR ECOSYSTEM:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://marico.com/india/other/privacy-policy#:~:text=SECURITY%20SAFEGUARDS%20FOR%20STORING%20PERSONAL%20DATA%20WITHIN',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:21.983931','{}'),(160,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://marico.com/india/other/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Platform%20usage%20information%3A%20Personal%20data%20collected','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'443e6608a5193032b41b9adf9d545dbc','COMP_TOP200_128',NULL,'8037aa3b726423886eb1dc94dc4b3ebb',NULL,'- Platform usage information: Personal data collected through cookies including IP address, device ID, location data, computer, and connection information such as browser type and version, time zone setting, browser plug-in types and versions, and operating system.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12