INK_OK',NULL,'eb20a62d0f5304b7af72dc22578189df','COMP_TOP200_108',NULL,'250018639569e84fb6e4fe5970a77b6d',NULL,'As a company, we\'re committed to minimizing the environmental impact of our operations on the planet. Through our Solar ATMs, solarised premises, green operations and supply chains – we\'re doing our bit in integrating environmental stewardship across our operations and investment portfolio.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.indusind.bank.in/in/en/csr-home.html#:~:text=As%20a%20company%2C%20we%27re%20committed%20to%20minimizing',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988','{}'),(280,'CSR Initiative: The core of our value system is rooted in the development of our economy, society and envi','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.indusind.bank.in/in/en/csr-home.html#:~:text=The%20core%20of%20our%20value%20system%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f9b7e6cc4beb53950520b9e0dcbba85d','COMP_TOP200_108',NULL,'2630f4b224f08b5d2862361220908b8e',NULL,'The core of our value system is rooted in the development of our economy, society and environment. We have embarked on a journey for a sustainable future through innovations in technology, backing like-minded institutions and collaborating with partner organizations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.indusind.bank.in/in/en/csr-home.html#:~:text=The%20core%20of%20our%20value%20system%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:27.626988','{}'),(281,'CSR Initiative: Mr C S Rajan, aged 66 years, is a successful leader with over 40 years of experience acros','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Mr%20C%20S%20Rajan%2C%20aged%2066%20years%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2cd1322f88c15da3fb7f7b4fbcf9025b','COMP_TOP200_107',NULL,'613970c30a8ba01d0384710b4e55fc36',NULL,'Mr C S Rajan, aged 66 years, is a successful leader with over 40 years of experience across significant government portfolios. In roles ranging from Sub-divisional Magistrate and Collector to Chief Secretary and then Whole-time Dy. Chairman of the Chief Minister’s Advisory Council, Mr. Rajan has served the Government of Rajasthan in key sectors including Agriculture and Rural Development, Industry (including MSME), Infrastructure (including Roads and Energy), Financial Services, General Administration and Business Management et al. Mr. Rajan has served on a number of inter-disciplinary teams for review of World Bank projects, and also as a Consultant to the World Bank on a Study on Farmer Participation in Agricultural Research and Extension System. Mr. Rajan is currently serving as a Government of India appointed Non-Executive Chairman of Infrastructure Leasing & Financial Services Limited and was also its Managing Director from April 2019 to October 2022. Mr. Rajan has a post graduate degree in History from St. Stephen’s College, University of Delhi and is a retired IAS officer of the 1978 Batch.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Mr%20C%20S%20Rajan%2C%20aged%2066%20years%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484','{}'),(282,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Mr.%20Dipak%20Gupta%2C%20aged%2060%20years%2C%20B.E.','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1d144ca5dc09873b643f746a53a73ab8','COMP_TOP200_107',NULL,'6c1cce36eb8525d144287ddd0b1c7141',NULL,'Mr. Dipak Gupta, aged 60 years, B.E. (Electronics), PGDM-IIM, Ahmedabad, is the Joint Managing Director of the Bank and has over 35 years of experience in the financial services sector, 29 years of which, have been with the Kotak Group. He is a Whole Time Director of the Bank from 1 st October, 1999. Mr. Gupta helms numerous functions of the Bank including Information Technology, Digital Initiatives, Internal Audit, Human Resources, Vigilance, Customer Experience, Marketing & Communications, Environment Social Governance, Corporate Social Responsibility and Priority Sector Lending. Mr. Gupta was responsible for leading the Kotak Group’s initiatives into the banking arena. He was the Chief Executive Officer of Kotak Mahindra Prime Limited and prior to joining the Kotak Group, was with A. F. Ferguson & Company for approximately six years.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Mr.%20Dipak%20Gupta%2C%20aged%2060%20years%2C%20B.E.',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484','{}'),(283,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Mr.%20Prakash%20Apte%2C%20aged%2067%20years%2C%20B.E.','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'54582467b40c93e408c4a63684759571','COMP_TOP200_107',NULL,'bdd958c154f47d42d57ff82d58366dfd',NULL,'Mr. Prakash Apte, aged 67 years, B.E. (Mechanical), served as Managing Director of Syngenta India Limited (“SIL”), an agricultural business company in India and a subsidiary of Syngenta Group, one of the largest research based agribusiness across the world, from November 2000 to April 2011. Mr. Apte has been the Non Executive Chairman of SIL from May 2011 till September 2021. He was instrumental in setting up the Syngenta Foundation India which focuses on providing knowledge and support for adopting scientific growing systems to resource poor farmers and enabling their access to market. In a career spanning over 40 years, he has extensive experience in various areas of management, business leadership and agriculture sector. In the more than 16 years of successful leadership experience in agriculture business, he has gained diverse knowledge in various aspects of businesses and has been involved with many initiatives for technology, knowledge and skills upgradation in this sector, which is vital for India’s food security. He was on the Boards of Syngenta Foundation India and Indo-Swiss Centre of Excellence upto 15th July, 2021 and 8th June, 2021, respectively. Mr. Apte was appointed as a Non-Executive Director of the Bank, with effect from 18th March,2011. He was appointed as the Part-time Chairman of the Bank, with effect from 20th July, 2018 and, thereafter, re-appointed for a period up to 31st December, 2023.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Mr.%20Prakash%20Apte%2C%20aged%2067%20years%2C%20B.E.',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484','{}'),(284,'CSR Initiative: Kotak Mahindra Bank Limited (KMBL/ Bank) is committed to its mission of creating value for','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Kotak%20Mahindra%20Bank%20Limited%20%28KMBL/%20Bank%29%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7f9258a1b52d198e80925716a306267f','COMP_TOP200_107',NULL,'f21dea0aca20a1b59648cf98d8a5e3eb',NULL,'Kotak Mahindra Bank Limited (KMBL/ Bank) is committed to its mission of creating value for all its stakeholders. The Bank benchmarks itself to deliver world-class financial services and customer experience, by empowering and inculcating a spirit of entrepreneurship in its workforce and leveraging technology. At the core of the Bank’s ethos is the commitment to maintain the highest standards of governance and risk management. It is the Bank’s constant endeavour to contribute towards sustainable development and growth by adopting responsible business practices which serve the interest of all its stakeholders, including the environment and society at large. This policy framework elucidates the Bank’s approach to align its business strategy, processes and disclosures with national and international ESG standards and frameworks.)',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=Kotak%20Mahindra%20Bank%20Limited%20%28KMBL/%20Bank%29%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484','{}'),(285,'CSR Initiative: better and minimise impact on the environment and society at large','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=better%20and%20minimise%20impact%20on%20the%20environment','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'33cfaefef4269ff986e384a185b0f0b7','COMP_TOP200_107',NULL,'36a1608562332ad13ee3ba345e99ea16',NULL,'better and minimise impact on the environment and society at large. It is the',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.kotak.bank.in/en/investor-relations/sustainability.html#:~:text=better%20and%20minimise%20impact%20on%20the%20environment',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:28.394484','{}'),(286,'CSR Initiative: Fostering scientific temper among schoolchildren, spending time with senior citizens, brin','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Fostering%20scientific%20temper%20among%20schoolchildren%2C%20spending%20time','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9e08867047f464187d119980abba53f7','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'053b679aa4229338446dd21d10adf0f1',NULL,'Fostering scientific temper among schoolchildren, spending time with senior citizens, bringing cheer to orphans, spreading awareness about traffic rules, working to restore a cyclone-ravaged zoo — the causes are many and diverse, but the commitment is the same.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Fostering%20scientific%20temper%20among%20schoolchildren%2C%20spending%20time',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(287,'CSR Initiative: We introduced the approach to integrate sustainability into our operations encompassing pe','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=We%20introduced%20the%20approach%20to%20integrate%20sustainability','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0c55023a7ff632d3d8070a384142bc3f','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'baf24b4511c2637459cea981de52f2c7',NULL,'We introduced the approach to integrate sustainability into our operations encompassing people, safety, quality, availability, environment, engineering excellence, productivity, continuous improvement, and community',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',N