 for the future, demonstrating our commitment to sustainability and responsible practices.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=In%202004%2C%20we%20took%20a%20significant%20step',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(290,'CSR Initiative: ESG Excellence Award 2024, Large','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=ESG%20Excellence%20Award%202024%2C%20Large-Cap%20Pharmaceuticals%20%26','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e2dd887ff332bdd572f6497a8b6a62e5','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'5caefb3fca521beccc8e42ee1a75689d',NULL,'ESG Excellence Award 2024, Large-Cap Pharmaceuticals & Healthcare category, KPMG',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=ESG%20Excellence%20Award%202024%2C%20Large-Cap%20Pharmaceuticals%20%26',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(291,'CSR Initiative: Winner, Masters of Risk','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Winner%2C%20Masters%20of%20Risk%20-%20Healthcare%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'491f42b832ded8daa8a9856942fa66c6','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'3a384e5000994085695fdba301230d7a',NULL,'Winner, Masters of Risk - Healthcare and Pharma category awards, India Risk Management Awards',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Winner%2C%20Masters%20of%20Risk%20-%20Healthcare%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(292,'CSR Initiative: By replacing fossil fuels with biofuels in boilers and expanding solar, wind, and hybrid e','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=By%20replacing%20fossil%20fuels%20with%20biofuels%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1751b308cd15fe60ee45893834dfa206','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'afb26bb9a9ef945bbaf1f9c144bccf2e',NULL,'By replacing fossil fuels with biofuels in boilers and expanding solar, wind, and hybrid energy use, we reduced Scope 1 and 2 emissions by 33% vs FY2023. Energy-saving initiatives also helped avoid 8,073 tonnes of CO₂ and saved 7.75 million kWh in FY2025.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=By%20replacing%20fossil%20fuels%20with%20biofuels%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(293,'CSR Initiative: Our ESG commitments are centred around creating positive social impact for our patients an','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20ESG%20commitments%20are%20centred%20around%20creating','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dcecc6e24210a9cebbadb16a85415902','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'72eb556bf8b4ad7d5b07a78031f97bbe',NULL,'Our ESG commitments are centred around creating positive social impact for our patients and employees, reducing our environmental footprint, and ensuring responsible business practices to build trust with our diverse stakeholders. Strong governance mechanisms and policy frameworks help us operationalise and deliver on our commitments, and our goal of reaching 1.5 billion patients by 2030 guides us as we work every day to enhance access, affordability, and innovation through our medicines, reduce the global disease burden, and improve patient health outcomes.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20ESG%20commitments%20are%20centred%20around%20creating',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(294,'CSR Initiative: Learn about our impact and what we’re doing to preserve the environment','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Learn%20about%20our%20impact%20and%20what%20we%E2%80%99re','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5bf5dd26f95abc63d09d6ea2ebcf730a','COMP_TOP200_106',NULL,'092d327fed130a4bb6bc9e3489daddd4',NULL,'Learn about our impact and what we’re doing to preserve the environment',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Learn%20about%20our%20impact%20and%20what%20we%E2%80%99re',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:43.501101','{}'),(295,'CSR Initiative: The mixed safety outcomes underline that continuous improvement remains essential despite ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20mixed%20safety%20outcomes%20underline%20that%20continuous','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e0797a9c9ebe3e4d36ae87b82f162a07','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'69b877b7daf722ae72dc41d3379647d7',NULL,'The mixed safety outcomes underline that continuous improvement remains essential despite advances in systems and technology. Strengthening contractor management, preventive controls and safety culture across every level of operations will remain critical as Tata Power continues to expand its business footprint.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20mixed%20safety%20outcomes%20underline%20that%20continuous',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(296,'CSR Initiative: Operating large','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Operating%20large-scale%20energy%20infrastructure%20requires%20a%20safety','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5d4b6d17a2ad0a0d76625881ee27b867','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'b11be6004db5b0758e0c41b6fe63620f',NULL,'Operating large-scale energy infrastructure requires a safety culture that evolves alongside business expansion. During FY26, Tata Power continued strengthening its health and safety systems through technology, training, governance and proactive risk management.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Operating%20large-scale%20energy%20infrastructure%20requires%20a%20safety',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(297,'CSR Initiative: The breadth of these programmes reflects an approach that extends beyond philanthropy towa','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20breadth%20of%20these%20programmes%20reflects%20an','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'560d879fdd2dfd8912a3f9515d52a35b','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'68df647916a0cced45f8ffc8433d0420',NULL,'The breadth of these programmes reflects an approach that extends beyond philanthropy towards long-term community development. As impact measurement continues to evolve, demonstrating measurable improvements in livelihoods, education and well-being can further strengthen the value created through these initiatives.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20breadth%20of%20these%20programmes%20reflects%20an',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(298,'CSR Initiative: The transition to a cleaner energy future also depends on creating meaningful social value','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20transition%20to%20a%20cleaner%20energy%20future','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0c84ec6a9a9a1f7c247513c78eedc0c3','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'3cc30694521740a5392e1dae73db96fb',NULL,'The transition to a cleaner energy future also depends on creating meaningful social value for the communities that support business operations. Tata Power continued to expand its CSR programmes across education, livelihoods, entrepreneurship and essential community services during FY26.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20transition%20to%20a%20cleaner%20energy%20future',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(299,'CSR Initiative: By combining conservation initiatives with globally recognized nature','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=By%20combining%20conservation%20initiatives%20with%20globally%20recognized','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'020f50ee6c6f72a1a8fd83304d56de3c','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'a1acb20624983a0888f94c22721f963d',NULL,'By combining conservation initiatives with globally recognized nature-related reporting frameworks, Tata Power is expanding the role biodiversity plays in business decision-making. This integrated approach can help balance infrastructure growth with ecosystem protection as renewable energy development continues to accelerate.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=By%20combining%20conservation%20initiatives%20with%20globally%20recognized',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(300,'CSR Initiative: Biodiversity is being brought into the business agenda through long','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Biodiversity%20is%20being%20brought%20into%20the%20business','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6c487018ed8937f3f247367543204c65','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'62bdc2b2275947c8947d22d348fd45fc',NULL,'Biodiversity is being brought into the business agenda through long-term commitments, conservation efforts and risk-based action -',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Biodiversity%20is%20being%20brought%20into%20the%20business',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(301,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Nature-related%20risks%20are%20gaining%20greater%20attention%20across','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f4177ad822e1714f9d0a8a9031531970','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'a772ba0113c7a7ff03d69f50edc9dab1',NULL,'Nature-related risks are gaining greater attention across the global energy sector, and Tata Power is broadening its biodiversity strategy accordingly. The nature-related disclosures in Tata Power’s sustainability integrated report 2026 combine long-running conservation programmes with the integration of biodiversity considerations into enterprise-level planning and risk management.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Nature-related%20risks%20are%20gaining%20greater%20attention%20across',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(302,'CSR Initiative: The results indicate that resource recovery is becoming an integral part of operational pl','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20results%20indicate%20that%20resource%20recovery%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bcef23c5c25a716034dec23aa33eac94','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'d5c035e69325cecbaa4fea119ad07b23',NULL,'The results indicate that resource recovery is becoming an integral part of operational planning rather than a standalone environmental initiative. As Tata Power expands its clean energy businesses, embedding circular practices across manufacturing, operations and supply chains can further strengthen resource efficiency and reduce environmental impact.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=The%20results%20indicate%20that%20resource%20recovery%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(303,'CSR Initiative: Circular economy principles are becoming increasingly relevant as energy companies diversi','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Circular%20economy%20principles%20are%20becoming%20increasingly%20relevant','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f0d4c8fafd8523809f09e203b315a6f8','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'88785bc75a90654437dae26f8fa6cac5',NULL,'Circular economy principles are becoming increasingly relevant as energy companies diversify into renewable technologies and manufacturing. In line with Tata Power’s sustainability goals, the FY26 disclosures demonstrate continued efforts to recover value from waste through recycling, reuse, and material recovery, rather than relying on conventional disposal methods.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Circular%20economy%20principles%20are%20becoming%20increasingly%20relevant',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(304,'CSR Initiative: For an integrated power company, responsible water management is closely linked with opera','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=For%20an%20integrated%20power%20company%2C%20responsible%20water','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1bf4f65dc2548d05ade97a67e7928152','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'3de6cf980f6deb4c1b533a74f663528d',NULL,'For an integrated power company, responsible water management is closely linked with operational continuity and environmental resilience. The water disclosures within the Tata Power sustainability report show how the company continued strengthening conservation, reuse and replenishment initiatives across its operations during FY26.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=For%20an%20integrated%20power%20company%2C%20responsible%20water',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(305,'CSR Initiative: While part of the decline reflects the temporary shutdown of the Mundra thermal power plan','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=While%20part%20of%20the%20decline%20reflects%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c686bea0b7