missions%20remains%20central%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'01d872289ad998a8f1289ccf012c2290','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'76c9647e89ea03b5efe43269a4ea7351',NULL,'Reducing greenhouse gas emissions remains central to Tata Power\'s climate strategy. The FY26 report highlights notable improvements in operational emissions while reinforcing the company\'s commitment to science-based climate targets and long-term decarbonization.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Reducing%20greenhouse%20gas%20emissions%20remains%20central%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(308,'CSR Initiative: Rather than simply adding renewable assets, the company is gradually reshaping its generat','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Rather%20than%20simply%20adding%20renewable%20assets%2C%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0439b7207266a2b81729508c1e78b2d4','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'60f916c258725c3793357fddf5229db6',NULL,'Rather than simply adding renewable assets, the company is gradually reshaping its generation mix to support India\'s clean energy transition. Continued investments in renewable capacity, coupled with improvements in operational efficiency, position Tata Power to accelerate its journey towards a lower-carbon energy portfolio over the coming years.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Rather%20than%20simply%20adding%20renewable%20assets%2C%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(309,'CSR Initiative: Renewable energy continues to move from being a growth segment to becoming the backbone of','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Renewable%20energy%20continues%20to%20move%20from%20being','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'77f702dfa653027ef8b0c3fb0c655b2d','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'392f9015a728948b9548c29367ced38c',NULL,'Renewable energy continues to move from being a growth segment to becoming the backbone of Tata Power\'s long-term business strategy. FY26 reflects steady progress in expanding clean generation while increasing the contribution of renewable sources across the company\'s overall energy portfolio.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Renewable%20energy%20continues%20to%20move%20from%20being',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(310,'CSR Initiative: That is what makes Tata Power’s ESG initiatives more than a collection of targets and annu','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=That%20is%20what%20makes%20Tata%20Power%E2%80%99s%20ESG','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2f685899aba68831e37cef0fb8ede9f5','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'048d7a479ad4aa5840b690778ff094d3',NULL,'That is what makes Tata Power’s ESG initiatives more than a collection of targets and annual data points. Together, they confront a far more consequential question: can an energy company grow at the scale India needs while reducing its environmental footprint and widening the value it creates? The nine takeaways that follow trace a business working towards that answer, with measurable progress, long-term ambition and the hope of an energy future built not only to expand, but to endure.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=That%20is%20what%20makes%20Tata%20Power%E2%80%99s%20ESG',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(311,'CSR Initiative: Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to I','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Somewhere%20between%20a%20cleaner%20megawatt%20entering%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2a73b6cf47100f88fd8f7881cfaf997d','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'e2c969f7f56d639b25d58d5bed34819c',NULL,'Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to India’s rivers and waste finding its way back into productive use, Tata Power’s energy transition is becoming visible in the details. The FY 2025–26 Tata Power integrated sustainability report does not treat sustainability as a promise running parallel to the business. It shows it moving through the business itself, from the generation mix and factory floor to water systems, workplaces, ecosystems and communities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Somewhere%20between%20a%20cleaner%20megawatt%20entering%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:26.260156','{}'),(312,'CSR Initiative: At any time you will have the right log in to the system to modify, correct or erase the p','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.asianpaints.com/footer-links/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=At%20any%20time%20you%20will%20have%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b5c93485cb631b9126e4c7783d967214','COMP_TOP200_104',NULL,'b57919efde7a3e30b57cadebcc8cd40f',NULL,'At any time you will have the right log in to the system to modify, correct or erase the personal information that you provided to use in your Job Profile or your resume. In the event that you erase your Job Profile or your resume, we will make your Job Profile or resume inactive. However, you understand that we will retain your Job Profile indefinitely for its own record-keeping purposes. For more detailed information regarding our online privacy practices, please see our Terms and Conditions. If you have any questions regarding our use of your personal information, you may do so by sending an email to customercare@asianpaints.com.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.asianpaints.com/footer-links/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=At%20any%20time%20you%20will%20have%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469','{}'),(313,'CSR Initiative: By applying for a job with us via the Careers section of our web site, you authorize us an','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.asianpaints.com/footer-links/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=By%20applying%20for%20a%20job%20with%20us','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'96365d3275a88b15bbdb86c171fe8e1a','COMP_TOP200_104',NULL,'f9008e601f7ebbe187ba403409b57331',NULL,'By applying for a job with us via the Careers section of our web site, you authorize us and/or our authorized agents to undertake a background investigation including, but not limited to, a criminal background check, a job reference check, and verification of any information you have provided, and you authorize all corporations, companies, educational institutions, persons, law enforcement agencies, criminal, civil and federal courts, and former employers to release information they may have about you.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.asianpaints.com/footer-links/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=By%20applying%20for%20a%20job%20with%20us',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469','{}'),(314,'CSR Initiative: Like many other companies, we use \"cookie\" technology, where our servers deposit special c','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.asianpaints.com/footer-links/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=Like%20many%20other%20companies%2C%20we%20use%20%22cookie%22','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'81cfc47833c54f009e7198c8e53b1307','COMP_TOP200_104',NULL,'4a0683501431722ab6d65eb2e0a2766c',NULL,'Like many other companies, we use \"cookie\" technology, where our servers deposit special codes on a visitor\'s computer. This information helps us determine in the aggregate the total number of visitors to the site on an ongoing basis and the types of Internet browsers and operating systems (e.g., Windows or Macintosh) used by our visitors. This information is used to enhance your on-line visits. Under no circumstances do we use this information to personally identify visitors or cross-reference the information with any type of personal information that is voluntarily offered on or through the site.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.asianpaints.com/footer-links/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy.html#:~:text=Like%20many%20other%20companies%2C%20we%20use%20%22cookie%22',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:24.905469','{}'),(315,'CSR Initiative: We have established an ISO14001','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20have%20established%20an%20ISO14001%3A2015%20compliant%20Environmental','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7bc7c169fea38d02ea038cbb519a0a27','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'5be60f1f894c01d43a1ebf712fd7abfd',NULL,'We have established an ISO14001:2015 compliant Environmental Management System and ISO 45001:2018 compliant Occupational Health and Safety Management System at our key manufacturing facilities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20have%20established%20an%20ISO14001%3A2015%20compliant%20Environmental',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(316,'CSR Initiative: As a part of this commitment, our EHS Policy provides for the creation of a safe and healt','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=As%20a%20part%20of%20this%20commitment%2C%20our','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d93bc61e8f29526b9dcf786ff379d553','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'b283523836340acab02cdb0f2abb6beb',NULL,'As a part of this commitment, our EHS Policy provides for the creation of a safe and healthy workplace and a clean environment for all employees and our served communities. Aiming for, and adhering to, the highest international standards in plant design, equipment selection, maintenance, and operations, our EHS policy is a core commitment of our operations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=As%20a%20part%20of%20this%20commitment%2C%20our',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(317,'CSR Initiative: At Sun Pharma, we remain fully committed to achieving excellence through our Environmental','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=At%20Sun%20Pharma%2C%20we%20remain%20fully%20committed','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e4db5b61cedf099dad926569cfee30be','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'34edd8bc8e15647e48ad8e588e338b24',NULL,'At Sun Pharma, we remain fully committed to achieving excellence through our Environmental, Health & Safety (EHS) programmes. Conducting our activities in a responsible, proactive manner is a core focus of our operations and culture.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=At%20Sun%20Pharma%2C%20we%20remain%20fully%20committed',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(318,'CSR Initiative: We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20support%20and%20encourage%20provision%20of%20safe','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f01d6c735662729358de93af9457e666','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'a9cd43d89f7220d9ace96a51d788b796',NULL,'We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily accessible hygiene services. Towards this end, we provide access to clean drinking water in villages, construct good quality individual toilets and implement effective behaviour change programmes.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20support%20and%20encourage%20provision%20of%20safe',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(319,'CSR Initiative: Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 peo','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Healthcare%20Units%20%28MHUs%29%20deliver%20primary','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0b51cf08b0e34c1d4eb3dde725f01d57','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'1172360ebe56f0e983b9031bd0fec629',NULL,'Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 people located around areas close to our manufacturing plants and other establishments. These MHUs serve a mix of rural and underserved populations, visiting villages to provide treatment for common ailments, conduct pathological tests, enable referrals, and provide free medicines. This project is implemented in India through Sun Pharma Community Healthcare Society in the states of Assam, Maharashtra, Jammu & Kashmir, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, Gujarat, Madhya Pradesh, Tamil Nadu and Sikkim.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Healthcare%20Units%20%28MHUs%29%20deliver%20primary',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(320,'CSR Initiative: The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20Sun%20Pharma%20Science%20Foundation%20is%20an','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e47e6bf7a092b873d54b5c9835484212','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'60f9e464884e4e7d59d2836a37b4d647',NULL,'The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20Sun%20Pharma%20Science%20Foundation%20is%20an',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(321,'CSR Initiative: We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20develop%20model%20schools%20in%20and%20around','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7adfbb042285375f3ecf4d8d0f028727','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'98ae3b646d757892ae372c93758376fc',NULL,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20develop%20model%20schools%20in%20and%20around',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(322,'CSR Initiative: We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communitie','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20will%20leverage%20our%20people%2C%20expertise%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d7149617b7fb20d7c834d7318e629391','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'cbe39e8948a327f0fc153b3724e48bee',NULL,'We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communities that we serve and thereby catalyse overall development. Being a global pharma company, we strongly believe that business and responsibility go hand-in-hand. Lasting value can only be created, if the right balance between the triple bottom lines of economic, environmental and social is achieved.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20will%20leverage%20our%20people%2C%20expertise%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{}'),(323,'CSR Initiative: Overseen by our CSR Committee of the Board and guided by our CSR Policy, our interventions','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Overseen%20by%20our%20CSR%20Committee%20of%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c8f2839ea6b2bbd427148fa6a096df0f','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'24f38600bc0aff12075d6ac35474c112',NULL,'Overseen by our CSR Committee of the Board and guided by our CSR Policy, our interventions adopt a multi-dimensional approach focusing on creating sustainable livelihoods in rural India, promoting education and skills development, supporting financial literacy and financial inclusion of un-banked and underbanked sections of the society and promoting environmental sustainability, and driven directly by the Bank, the Axis Bank Foundation or their experienced implementation partners.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Overseen%20by%20our%20CSR%20Committee%20of%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{}'),(324,'CSR Initiative: The Policy is implemented by a team of Environmental and Social Risk Experts housed with t','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=The%20Policy%20is%20implemented%20by%20a%20team','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c76b39620d12ef80ad1891993eae453d','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'ec251ddf31425b119ae920079e5b3fbf',NULL,'The Policy is implemented by a team of Environmental and Social Risk Experts housed with the Wholesale Credit Underwriting vertical.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=The%20Policy%20is%20implemented%20by%20a%20team',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{}'),(325,'CSR Initiative: Since 2016, we have in place the ESG Policy for Lending that integrates Environmental and ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Since%202016%2C%20we%20have%20in%20place%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fab18b80bc1c52373a7ffcb780c54942','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'2ceeb894e8cf9d736323e3fb73463c03',NULL,'Since 2016, we have in place the ESG Policy for Lending that integrates Environmental and social risk considerations into our corporate credit appraisal mechanisms. The Policy incorporates global standards and guidelines such as the IFC Performance Standards.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Since%202016%2C%20we%20have%20in%20place%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{}'),(326,'CSR Initiative: As a leading financial institution, we help facilitate capital flows into critical sectors','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=As%20a%20leading%20financial%20institution%2C%20we%20help','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'84ea5facec5db9e4b62fc26d7cfa651a','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'17c792d511cc0ed0b94f5be4971326f6',NULL,'As a leading financial institution, we help facilitate capital flows into critical sectors of the Indian economy and serve millions of customers across the socio-economic spectrum in every part of the country. In alignment with the global sustainable development agenda led by the SDGs and the Paris Agreement, we have strived to enhance our ESG-aligned business profile, focusing on scaling our sustainable banking and financing portfolio in both the retail and wholesale banking, lowering the carbon footprint of our business operations and helping move the needle through policy advocacy and thought leadership.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=As%20a%20leading%20financial%20institution%2C%20we%20help',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{}'),(327,'CSR Initiative: Our CSR philosophy has always been to make a meaningful and measurable impact to the lives','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20philosophy%20has%20always%20been%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'71bdc1bf8425d4c82dce33979a360667','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'368990f6078e309ab41ad7dc4f1dff26',NULL,'Our CSR philosophy has always been to make a meaningful and measurable impact to the lives of economically, physically and socially challenged communities of the country through an integrated approach of development. Our approach to community action aims to leverage our national presence, our strengths as a financial institution, and the strength of collaboration to bring positive and sustainable change in the lives of citizens in some of the most socio-economically deprived parts of the country. Overseen by our CSR Committee of the Board and guided by our CSR Policy, our interventions adopt a multi-dimensional approach focusing on creating sustainable livelihoods in rural India, promoting education and skills development, supporting financial literacy and financial inclusion of un-banked and underbanked sections of the society and promoting environmental sustainability, and driven directly by the Bank, the Axis Bank Foundation or their experienced implementation partners.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20philosophy%20has%20always%20been%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{}'),(328,'CSR Initiative: Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Axis%20Bank%20is%20guided%20by%20a%20strategy','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8dccd2e0b641a5287672d63920fbbfe1','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'2ca0c73df3d9869aeb4f01739988c961',NULL,'Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth for the organization while catalysing positive economic, social and environmental value creation for its stakeholders in the short and long term.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Axis%20Bank%20is%20guided%20by%20a%20strategy',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{}'),(329,'CSR Initiative: At Persistent Malaysia was allocated USD25,000 as donation to support Malaysia’s COVID','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.persistent.com/company-overview/community/#:~:text=At%20Persistent%20Malaysia%20was%20allocated%20USD25%2C000%20as','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ac2a7fa3218e7f4081b5c8c5501976b4','COMP_TOP200_098',NULL,'f76a545a1016c5256e56b23af1f57e05',NULL,'At Persistent Malaysia was allocated USD25,000 as donation to support Malaysia’s COVID-19 relief efforts. 2 organizations in Malaysia were identified to donate to, which are Mercy (Medical Relief Society Malaysia) and NADMA (The National Disaster Management Agency). The handover ceremony to NADMA was held on 1st July 2020 at Office of the Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (Special Functions) at Putrajaya. The cheque was received by Yb Datuk Seri Mohd Redzuan Bin Md Yusof, Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (special tasks).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.persistent.com/company-overview/community/#:~:text=At%20Persistent%20Malaysia%20was%20allocated%20USD25%2C000%20as',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315','{}'),(330,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.persistent.com/company-overview/community/#:~:text=-%20A%20ventilator%2C%20thermometers%2C%20COVID%20testing%20kits','Schedule VII 