Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'39278bf347c8b90f57b85623ac05d9d7','COMP_TOP200_093',NULL,'7ea982d318c9ad6081fd8fba3a779d7b',NULL,'At Aurobindo Pharma, our sustainability efforts are driven by a profound commitment to the planet and its people, balancing ambitious environmental goals with strategic initiatives. We are dedicated to enhancing the lives of people while upholding the highest standards of integrity and responsibility towards our communities and the environment, ensuring our actions today pave the way for a better tomorrow.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.aurobindo.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Aurobindo%20Pharma%2C%20our%20sustainability%20efforts%20are',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468','{}'),(338,'CSR Initiative: Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.aurobindo.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20journey%20is%20fueled%20by%20our%20commitment','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cd23d7f91bbf0198fa655aa551edd715','COMP_TOP200_093',NULL,'9ec9453593730b1058dc6b7086221c25',NULL,'Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well- being of the communities we engage with and nurture life on our planet. We are dedicated to integrating the ESG principles deeply into our daily operations, by reducing carbon emissions, transitioning from traditional to renewable energy and implementing responsible water, and waste management practices. Adopting renewable energy and innovating with sustainable packaging, every step we take is a step toward preserving our planet for future generations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:27.387468',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.aur