ority',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lauruslabs.com/#:~:text=Newspaper%20Publication%3A%20Transfer%20of%20Shares%20to%20Investor',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735','{}'),(346,'CSR Initiative: Laurus Labs Announces Q1 FY27 Results Revenue at ₹ 2,026 Cr','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.lauruslabs.com/#:~:text=Laurus%20Labs%20Announces%20Q1%20FY27%20Results%20Revenue','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d926bedfdc9b9dc65a62fecc8b910a91','COMP_TOP200_091',NULL,'be7c8d9a2dd4177c193b75fc60bc694a',NULL,'Laurus Labs Announces Q1 FY27 Results Revenue at ₹ 2,026 Cr; EBITDA at ₹ 644 Cr, 31.8% margins',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lauruslabs.com/#:~:text=Laurus%20Labs%20Announces%20Q1%20FY27%20Results%20Revenue',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:33.651735','{}'),(347,'CSR Initiative: Research & Development Project with IIT Madras','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Madras%3A','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7e6d77627ce24948f7ae38fecc883a5f','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'0a7996ab74cf42196a1d78930e87d4a6',NULL,'Research & Development Project with IIT Madras: In partnership with IIT Madras, we are conducting research on Glass Fibre Reinforced Polymer (GFRP) solutions to create stronger, lighter, and more sustainable infrastructure for the future. The project focuses on testing GFRP’s strength under tension, compression, shear, torsion, and bending to develop safe, standardized, and economical configurations. Additionally, the project also evaluates the durability and environmental benefits of GFRP compared to conventional materials like galvanized steel.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Madras%3A',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(348,'CSR Initiative: Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Bombay%3A','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'62dea63a379e201d54779b96fbfe7aaf','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'68e7b06bc528339e584f1912c7486705',NULL,'Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay: In partnership with IIT Bombay, we are conducting R&D in clean energy, focusing on perovskite solar and biomass-based batteries. The project aims to scale perovskite tandem solar cells and develop silicon-doped carbon anodes for sodium-ion batteries derived from rice straw. These initiatives are targeting higher solar efficiency and sustainable, cost-effective energy storage solutions for India’s green future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Bombay%3A',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(349,'CSR Initiative: Plantation and Livelihood Program','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Plantation%20and%20Livelihood%20Program%3A%20The%20program%20promotes','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b8f3fe543f648dd540a390a3e5eeda1b','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'eeee778bdaf0525058006c70c1b6f897',NULL,'Plantation and Livelihood Program: The program promotes agroforestry to improve green cover, enhance farmer incomes, and support carbon sequestration. By combining indigenous practices with modern techniques, it boosts farm productivity, reduces chemical inputs, and ensures sustainable livelihoods. Farmers benefit from intercropping, organic farming, and capacity-building initiatives. In partnership with 1t.org, Indus Towers has pledged to plant and nurture 1 million trees across India by 2027. This commitment supports the global Trillion Trees Movement and strengthens India’s climate goals by creating a vital carbon sink.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Plantation%20and%20Livelihood%20Program%3A%20The%20program%20promotes',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(350,'CSR Initiative: Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program)','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Nari%20Samman%20%28Sanitary%20Pad%20Program%29%3AMenstrual%20health%20remains','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7fc7d17f87014e54c69ec66359df1eb2','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'a0105f59ce257b972aa085b86b1a47cd',NULL,'Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program):Menstrual health remains a challenge in rural and underserved areas due to taboos and lack of resources. Indus Towers is addressing this by improving access to hygienic sanitary napkins through partnerships with Indian Railways and government schools. Vending machines with IoT-enabled monitoring have been installed at railway stations and schools, ensuring 24x7 availability and timely refills. Awareness sessions, reusable product distribution, and health camps further promote safe menstrual hygiene practices.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Nari%20Samman%20%28Sanitary%20Pad%20Program%29%3AMenstrual%20health%20remains',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(351,'CSR Initiative: Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom)','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Sanitation%20Program%20%28Construction%20of%20Girls%E2%80%99%20Washroom%29%3AThis%20program','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1f80973aa2936c0466f4290f3e228f2e','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'fb28b941345f5e92589e3d380d004c3c',NULL,'Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom):This program focuses on improving access to sanitation facilities and raise awareness about menstrual hygiene, by constructing girls’ washrooms in the government schools and conducting regular menstrual hygiene and sanitation awareness sessions for community members.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Sanitation%20Program%20%28Construction%20of%20Girls%E2%80%99%20Washroom%29%3AThis%20program',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(352,'CSR Initiative: Smart Classroom Program','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Smart%20Classroom%20Program%3AAligned%20with%20the%20Government%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'31bd55fab7ddc0d9d1f14042c2870e4f','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'05d8dafb199865b567f7aa50dc95cb03',NULL,'Smart Classroom Program:Aligned with the Government of India’s ‘Digital India’ mission, the initiative bridges the digital divide in government schools by training educators and providing modern learning tools. Smart Classrooms equipped with computers, LED Smart TVs, printers, and power backup ensure uninterrupted digital learning for teachers and students. As part of the program, various awareness sessions are also conducted near the schools.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Smart%20Classroom%20Program%3AAligned%20with%20the%20Government%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(353,'CSR Initiative: The solar powered vehicle is equipped with latest e','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20solar%20powered%20vehicle%20is%20equipped%20with','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0a75db70632bbe716d77a84a5915c2be','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'03f533d3f692f6f6a34fe27d85f56439',NULL,'The solar powered vehicle is equipped with latest e-learning tools, and provides certification courses in valuable, in-demand skills, including Digital Literacy, Basic IT Education, Cyber Security, Internet of Things and Financial Literacy. Additionally, the initiative includes awareness and mass literacy sessions for the community members.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20solar%20powered%20vehicle%20is%20equipped%20with',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(354,'CSR Initiative: Digital Transformation Van (DTV)','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Digital%20Transformation%20Van%20%28DTV%29%3A%20The%20Digital%20Transformation','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fba6456046d1a2d23ed953603275e293','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'b0b0cb0b19cebdd6bc3d859f1f7238ef',NULL,'Digital Transformation Van (DTV): The Digital Transformation Van primarily focuses on enhancing digital literacy for women, youth, and diverse social groups. The DTV travels to the most remote corners of India, bridging the digital gap in underdeveloped rural and urban areas of the country.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Digital%20Transformation%20Van%20%28DTV%29%3A%20The%20Digital%20Transformation',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(355,'CSR Initiative: Project Nurture','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Project%20Nurture%3A%20With%20the%20aim%20of%20providing','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fa7c4a3d333a78e5c24c8a1f582dd52d','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'43dd6a865c226f21e7be4ce7cff82a95',NULL,'Project Nurture: With the aim of providing a strong foundation for orphans, homeless, and abandoned children, Project Nurture delivers long-term, family-based care to ensure holistic development and empowerment. It also guarantees access to quality education and basic amenities across 22 districts in 18 states of India.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Project%20Nurture%3A%20With%20the%20aim%20of%20providing',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:26.715986','{}'),(356,'CSR Initiative: Girl Child Education Program The initiative aims to provide high','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Girl%20Child%20Education%20Program%20The%20initiative%20aims','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNT