althcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0963f8d1b2afc837a9253bf79ea35527','COMP_TOP200_090',NULL,'8d30d447ec1f3cc7ffa96b068725f6ec',NULL,'The obsession with innovative healthcare solutions has made us the most prescribed pharma company in India. We are architects of the future, setting new benchmarks in pharmaceutical excellence with drug discovery, advanced formulations, generic APIs, and biotechnology.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:09.774598',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:09.774598',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:09.774598',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.mankindpharma.com/#:~:text=The%20obsession%20with%20innovative%20healthcare%20solutions%20has',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:09.774598','{}'),(371,'CSR Initiative: Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Ltd (MDL), Mumbai is the only Shipyard which builds Destroyers c','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://mazagondock.in/English/csr#:~:text=Mazagon%20Dock%20Shipbuilders%20Ltd%20%28MDL%29%2C%20Mumbai%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cb6697c02a5f51d83efa05215e785ee1','COMP_TOP200_089',NULL,'275684035f73cefdc64a1904db561f38',NULL,'Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Ltd (MDL), Mumbai is the only Shipyard which builds Destroyers class of Ships and conventional Submarines. While the warships and submarines built by us help in securing nation and making it formidable power, MDL believes in what Mahatma Gandhi said “a chain is as strong as its weak link”. Therefore, strengthening of weakest link is our mantra while undertaking CSR activities. MDL is committed to undertake various programs for integrating social and business goals in a sustainable manner through inclusive growth so as to make a positive impact for the society at large. MDL has adopted Corporate Social Responsibility policy in compliance with Section 135 of the Companies Act 2013 and Rules framed there under. The CSR Budget of MDL for the FY 2024-25 was Rs 45.93 Cr (2% of average profit of the previous three financial years as per section 198 of Companies Act – 2013). An additional Rs 0.65 Cr has been spent in excess of budget during FY 2024-25 which was also set off in expenditure for FY 2025-26. Out of total obligation of Rs 45.28 Cr, MDL has spent Rs 46.81 Cr towards CSR activities during FY 2025-26. Thus, MDL has complied with the requirement of spending 2% of average net profit with an excess amount spent of Rs 1.53 Cr as part of CSR expenditure for FY 2025-26, which will be set off against expenditure for FY 2026-27 in accordance with rules governing CSR expenditure. MDL has executed 35 projects in FY 2025-26 as part of its CSR initiatives mainly in sectors of Education, Health & Nutrition, Skill Development, Armed Forces Welfare, Sanitation, Research & Heritage promotion. The details list of the projects undertaken are available under CSR projects.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:48.406647',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:48.406647',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:48.406647',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://mazagondock.in/English/csr#:~:text=Mazagon%20Dock%20Shipbuilders%20Ltd%20%28MDL%29%2C%20Mumbai%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:48.406647','{}'),(372,'CSR Initiative: “IHCL is best placed to leverage India\'s enormous potential in the tourism and hospitality','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ihcltata.com/#:~:text=%E2%80%9CIHCL%20is%20best%20placed%20to%20leverage%20India%27s','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2723485f2a4d23ce202fd3fa22fcd8e0','COMP_TOP200_085',NULL,'3e6d7ed2b9056d8dcc8a5afd669832ba',NULL,'“IHCL is best placed to leverage India\'s enormous potential in the tourism and hospitality sector. Our Accelerate 2030 strategy is aimed at creating world-class scale and profitability.”',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https: