d',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619','{}'),(382,'CSR Initiative: With an art of hospitality that has been perfected over a century, Taj conjures a panoply ','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ihcltata.com/#:~:text=With%20an%20art%20of%20hospitality%20that%20has','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'616b520939c866bdb98c3d46b945603a','COMP_TOP200_085',NULL,'3123ea5174a4a9bab1dedcc3de0f3c7e',NULL,'With an art of hospitality that has been perfected over a century, Taj conjures a panoply of superlatives, delivering unmatched experiences and lasting memories for guests around the world.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ihcltata.com/#:~:text=With%20an%20art%20of%20hospitality%20that%20has',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:46.124619','{}'),(383,'CSR Initiative: The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2a35d67f436e98dde5842d90a82a616b','COMP_TOP200_082',NULL,'1b216d4eb91ae9c94db8b3f883e6b84d',NULL,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937','{}'),(384,'CSR Initiative: Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'753749900866ff16207035b87598ed52','COMP_TOP200_082',NULL,'a8dafec775d3da46661fabe30233b053',NULL,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937','{}'),(385,'CSR Initiative: The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4461cd925b0c71a9c33d96d9034b3797','COMP_TOP200_082',NULL,'9ee375cc67e40ffb97f933ea128c49f2',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels to water conservation , emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, Ambuja Cement’s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937','{}'),(386,'CSR Initiative: Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e75bb15298773a83f9f785aed8fef188','COMP_TOP200_082',NULL,'7523670d4cc00a15aa32cc5a4f4220e3',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:54.010937','{}'),(387,'CSR Initiative: Through continuous innovation, improvement, and accountability, Lupin demonstrates a deep ','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=Through%20continuous%20innovation%2C%20improvement%2C%20and%20accountability%2C%20Lupin','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'90b12128777acec36d8bd8e275198b65','COMP_TOP200_081',NULL,'ca1289e749bea4baa9123709c7425944',NULL,'Through continuous innovation, improvement, and accountability, Lupin demonstrates a deep commitment to creating sustainable value for generations to come. This dedication is anchored in protecting nature, empowering and inspiring people and improving patient lives through responsible and ethical healthcare solutions.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=Through%20continuous%20innovation%2C%20improvement%2C%20and%20accountability%2C%20Lupin',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076','{}'),(388,'CSR Initiative: Our robust ESG governance framework integrates environmental and social priorities into a ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20robust%20ESG%20governance%20framework%20integrates%20environmental','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f74992eabf69fb6b6935501505bc0d09','COMP_TOP200_081',NULL,'f3c041773e6ab7a9969cf6eb960976ff',NULL,'Our robust ESG governance framework integrates environmental and social priorities into a clear business strategy, ensuring accountability and execution across the enterprise. At the board level, the Sustainability and Corporate Social Responsibility (SCSR) Committee provides strategic direction and ensures focused management of ESG risks and opportunities aligned with our long-term goals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20robust%20ESG%20governance%20framework%20integrates%20environmental',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076','{}'),(389,'CSR Initiative: change, resource intensity, regulatory expectations, and growing healthcare needs','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=change%2C%20resource%20intensity%2C%20regulatory%20expectations%2C%20and%20growing','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3213c0e44b8f5a1f2a86102e826dc47b','COMP_TOP200_081',NULL,'be81fa7108012fc3f442b09450a04630',NULL,'change, resource intensity, regulatory expectations, and growing healthcare needs. At Lupin,',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=change%2C%20resource%20intensity%2C%20regulatory%20expectations%2C%20and%20growing',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076','{}'),(390,'CSR Initiative: As a global pharmaceutical company, we operate in an environment shaped by climate','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=As%20a%20global%20pharmaceutical%20company%2C%20we%20operate','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f3423a71e9b60ae1807a9a0e8eb58eeb','COMP_TOP200_081',NULL,'db85c2ede80ac701ae46095025cf2049',NULL,'As a global pharmaceutical company, we operate in an environment shaped by climate',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:58.887076',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=As%20a%20global%20pharmaceutical%20company%2C%20we%20operate