any Limited (\"HDFC AMC\", \"we\" \"','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/privacy-policy#:~:text=At%20HDFC%20Mutual%20Fund%20%28%22HDFCMF%22%29%20/%20HDFC','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b6a1f33b99dce9c90b147e1f54b93f4a','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'d972ed8058880ab145cbada4707817bc',NULL,'At HDFC Mutual Fund (\"HDFCMF\") / HDFC Asset Management Company Limited (\"HDFC AMC\", \"we\" \"us\" \"our\", etc.), we recognize the importance of securing the Personal Data (as defined below) that we collect about our investors / clients and website users (“you”, “your” etc.). HDFC AMC has established policies and procedures concerning the handling and dealing of your Personal Data that will help us to protect your privacy. This Privacy Policy (as amended from time to time) describes how we handle and deal in Personal Data that we may collect and retain (\"Privacy Policy\"). This Privacy Policy applies to all Personal Data collected and received for and on behalf of HDFC MF/ HDFC AMC including on http://hdfcfund.com website (\"Site\"), through HDFC MF/HDFC AMC Social Media page/profile, mobile application of HDFC MF/ HDFC AMC, our mobile application/ site for investor education awareness and all Personal Data collected and/or received by us from you directly or through third parties, as detailed below. Please note that Personal Data collected by us in the physical form and through the Site, HDFC MF/HDFC AMC Social Media Page/Profile and mobile application of HDFC MF/ HDFC AMC or any other sources may be converted and stored in an electronic form at our sole discretion for the purposes as mentioned hereinunder. This Privacy Policy shall be read with and is subject to the Disclaimers notified on the Site.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/privacy-policy#:~:text=At%20HDFC%20Mutual%20Fund%20%28%22HDFCMF%22%29%20/%20HDFC',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(395,'CSR Initiative: We recognize that climate change is not just an environmental issue but also a business ri','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/esg#:~:text=We%20recognize%20that%20climate%20change%20is%20not','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9272c6d45d17e2bafc736829c31056a8','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'d2b1330b64bf4361137e92d207126923',NULL,'We recognize that climate change is not just an environmental issue but also a business risk. At HDFC AMC, we endeavour to reduce our carbon footprint and we have taken various initiatives towards this. We intend to continue identifying and acting on opportunities to reduce our negative impact on the environment and promote a culture of sustainability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/esg#:~:text=We%20recognize%20that%20climate%20change%20is%20not',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(396,'CSR Initiative: The HDFC Group has a longstanding tradition of impeccable corporate citizenship','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/esg#:~:text=The%20HDFC%20Group%20has%20a%20longstanding%20tradition','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ba7a5013da1e08ba606d9eae11a3f6c0','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'ad1ddd82cce3838b0d1649b609123b08',NULL,'The HDFC Group has a longstanding tradition of impeccable corporate citizenship. Social commitment, ethical conduct, and good governance are fundamental business values and are a part of the HDFC Group’s ethos. At HDFC AMC, we prioritize these values by collaborating with stakeholders to incorporate Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) principles into our business practices.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/esg#:~:text=The%20HDFC%20Group%20has%20a%20longstanding%20tradition',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(397,'CSR Initiative: Ashoka University','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Ashoka%20University%20-%20International%20Foundation%20for%20Research','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6a4b83f7940d9181407a0922f4af81a4','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'3914b91e49ea904d802fdf3a07787d7a',NULL,'Ashoka University - International Foundation for Research and Education',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Ashoka%20University%20-%20International%20Foundation%20for%20Research',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(398,'CSR Initiative: CSR Policy List of projects View CSR Committee Impact Assessment Report','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=CSR%20Policy%20List%20of%20projects%20View%20CSR','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'490d350df5b49904364987c9e2a695aa','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'560c92c4fabb7f1fa73a37eb6f7b9deb',NULL,'CSR Policy List of projects View CSR Committee Impact Assessment Report',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=CSR%20Policy%20List%20of%20projects%20View%20CSR',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(399,'CSR Initiative: Corporate Social Responsibility is an important part of HDFC AMC\'s culture and value syste','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Corporate%20Social%20Responsibility%20is%20an%20important%20part','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d97980162577de9562bdc4ce9b639418','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'2a42f7d78de01cf20e9a0ddb3ffbac51',NULL,'Corporate Social Responsibility is an important part of HDFC AMC\'s culture and value system and our initiatives are aligned towards sustainable development of the society and environment that we operate in. Our endeavour is to create social impact through the promotion of healthcare including preventive healthcare, promotion of education and social welfare, promotion of environment protection sustainability and promotion of sports in line with the provisions under Schedule VII of the Companies Act, 2013.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Corporate%20Social%20Responsibility%20is%20an%20important%20part',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(400,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/#:~:text=-%20Systematic%20rebalancing%20helps%20avoid%20behavioral%20biases','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a57c5203c8288c3f49225ec5a4b6e25d','COMP_TOP200_079',NULL,'4297bbcdd37df7621e9b55d248fc72a3',NULL,'- Systematic rebalancing helps avoid behavioral biases associated with DIY rebalancing.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfcfund.com/#:~:text=-%20Systematic%20rebalancing%20helps%20avoid%20behavioral%20biases',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:33.667466','{}'),(401,'CSR Initiative: We have a shared responsibility to restore the natural resources on which we all depend','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=We%20have%20a%20shared%20responsibility%20to%20restore','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'aa04f99014422c483c0e5e8ee26fe1b6','COMP_TOP200_078',NULL,'da5ac0d4ef7aac4fc771ea486ccafe3b',NULL,'We have a shared responsibility to restore the natural resources on which we all depend. We’re building the resilience of our supply chain by supporting farmers to be more resource-efficient and to adopt regenerative agriculture practices to reduce the impacts of climate change.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=We%20have%20a%20shared%20responsibility%20to%20restore',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954','{}'),(402,'CSR Initiative: We continue to respond proactively to consumer demand and legislation for sustainable prod','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=We%20continue%20to%20respond%20proactively%20to%20consumer','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4cf99f17c999cc6e190a0d240d9483ad','COMP_TOP200_078',NULL,'e66cd8899900de7c185ed59dd5511091',NULL,'We continue to respond proactively to consumer demand and legislation for sustainable products and are committed to reducing our value chain carbon footprint by reducing packaging weight, increasing our recycled content, reducing single use packaging and deploying and scaling circular business models.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=We%20continue%20to%20respond%20proactively%20to%20consumer',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954','{}'),(403,'CSR Initiative: We’re working towards a lower carbon future and are following a science','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=We%E2%80%99re%20working%20towards%20a%20lower%20carbon%20future','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'caf60b7b22b8c7f782490fbacd539210','COMP_TOP200_078',NULL,'97df743b392de7456989bf4bd333299d',NULL,'We’re working towards a lower carbon future and are following a science-based approach to drive the pace and scale of change required. Our targets to achieve net zero carbon emissions demonstrate our commitment to mitigating our impact on climate change',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=We%E2%80%99re%20working%20towards%20a%20lower%20carbon%20future',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:20.194954','{}'),(404,'CSR Initiative: Core to our Spirit of Progress action plan is sustainability across our entire value chain','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.diageoindia.com/en/esg/pioneer-grain-to-glass-sustainability#:~:text=Core%20to%20our%20Spirit%20of%20Progress%20action','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'567989ff36bfc4bd869f2410f3c6ce51','COMP_TOP200_078',NULL,'51f695efe51e2d904963031046fb864d',NULL,'Core to o