ship','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Gold%20Rating%20in%20Water%20Conservation%20by%20CII','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'667e6664865f649095c7d884e787aa23','COMP_TOP200_073',NULL,'e8df811f85f5c01e870428409a258dc6',NULL,'Gold Rating in Water Conservation by CII Blue rating system (Gurgaon Plant)',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Gold%20Rating%20in%20Water%20Conservation%20by%20CII',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476','{}'),(421,'CSR Initiative: Embracing the principles of a circular economy, we are dedicated to minimising waste and m','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Embracing%20the%20principles%20of%20a%20circular%20economy%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'192f60af76e893e55c61cc93559b9c86','COMP_TOP200_073',NULL,'e2730de3b1ec8e9fa470954fe77df263',NULL,'Embracing the principles of a circular economy, we are dedicated to minimising waste and maximising resource efficiency. Through innovative design, efficient recycling processes, and the use of sustainable materials, we aim to create products that align with the highest standards of environmental responsibility.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Embracing%20the%20principles%20of%20a%20circular%20economy%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476','{}'),(422,'CSR Initiative: At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognisin','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=At%20Hero%20MotoCorp%2C%20we%20are%20unwavering%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5f0ebea62ddb4ea040374cd89193cbfc','COMP_TOP200_073',NULL,'9748d011d0b5a8ae4bc44d8461e0b1ec',NULL,'At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognising the pivotal role we play in saving water, a precious resource. We ensure that our painting processes are waterless, and also we have a five pronged approach to water conservation: reduce water consumption at our factories and workplaces, recycle all waste water, recharge rainwater by harvesting, reuse treated water and respect every drop of water.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=At%20Hero%20MotoCorp%2C%20we%20are%20unwavering%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476','{}'),(423,'CSR Initiative: Our first and foremost commitment is to revolutionize our manufacturing processes by inves','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20first%20and%20foremost%20commitment%20is%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cb3e305c0045b7a0148f7b199c54efc1','COMP_TOP200_073',NULL,'30f1531dae321636b959a11f2e9cc8a6',NULL,'Our first and foremost commitment is to revolutionize our manufacturing processes by investing in cutting-edge technologies and adopting eco-friendly practices to minimize our carbon footprint. We aim to enhance energy efficiency, increase the use of renewable energy, and utilize offsets to mitigate residual emissions.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20first%20and%20foremost%20commitment%20is%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:58.969476','{}'),(424,'CSR Initiative: Muthoot Finance has been accoladed as India’s No','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.muthootfinance.com/#:~:text=Muthoot%20Finance%20has%20been%20accoladed%20as%20India%E2%80%99s','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'949e7674fc3df07f4d327f09dc4f3efb','COMP_TOP200_071',NULL,'8af1fc3ebd8bd947f7115cf0bc2129db',NULL,'Muthoot Finance has been accoladed as India’s No. 1 Most Trusted Financial Services Brand for 10 years since 2016 by TRA’s Brand Trust Report consecutively. We are also India’s largest gold financing company in terms of loan portfolio. We are a reputed ‘Systemically Important Non-deposit taking NBFC’.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.muthootfinance.com/#:~:text=Muthoot%20Finance%20has%20been%20accoladed%20as%20India%E2%80%99s',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316','{}'),(425,'CSR Initiative: Muthoot Finance renovated the Eye Block of General Hospital, Ernakulam','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.muthootfinance.com/#:~:text=Muthoot%20Finance%20renovated%20the%20Eye%20Block%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dcd476eace1a6d908d30dbb348414fd8','COMP_TOP200_071',NULL,'95a8ec2a17f2cc94044d31e570d58b18',NULL,'Muthoot Finance renovated the Eye Block of General Hospital, Er