nt%20transformative%20projects','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7b20adafd81d0d33ee10ad81ce883b99','COMP_TOP200_066',NULL,'2ec0e192a05bb41503d09777fd844e2f',NULL,'Through Lodha Foundation, we implement transformative projects in Education, Women\'s Empowerment, and Sustainable Urbanization to create a positive impact on the environment and society. We are recognized in global sustainability indices and rankings for the work we do to address the environmental impact of the built environment.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lodhagroup.com/esg-sustainablity-environmental-social-governance#:~:text=Through%20Lodha%20Foundation%2C%20we%20implement%20transformative%20projects',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171','{}'),(475,'CSR Initiative: Lodha is committed to using our capabilities to create a positive impact on the environmen','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.lodhagroup.com/esg-sustainablity-environmental-social-governance#:~:text=Lodha%20is%20committed%20to%20using%20our%20capabilities','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7ab3be22088113be43a0e573d4179e5c','COMP_TOP200_066',NULL,'1c47341239a880383a9e456360380acd',NULL,'Lodha is committed to using our capabilities to create a positive impact on the environment and on society. As we grow, so does the scale of the impact we can make.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lodhagroup.com/esg-sustainablity-environmental-social-governance#:~:text=Lodha%20is%20committed%20to%20using%20our%20capabilities',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.495171','{}'),(476,'CSR Initiative: Primavera commenced operations in India two decades ago through the employees of Robert Bo','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Primavera%20commenced%20operations%20in%20India%20two%20decades','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'855bfca785d11fdb70373824a36341b7','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'dd03ca658bcc8d4c4516366fa3d6d034',NULL,'Primavera commenced operations in India two decades ago through the employees of Robert Bosch. In the country, Primavera is involved in aiding a variety of initiatives such as educational programs, healthcare, and livelihood support for underprivileged children residing in orphanages, refugee camps, residential schools, and day care centers including those with special needs.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Primavera%20commenced%20operations%20in%20India%20two%20decades',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{}'),(477,'CSR Initiative: Primavera was established by a group of 10 individuals from Bosch Germany with the primary','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Primavera%20was%20established%20by%20a%20group%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0718a8452e0a685cf645187f7aecce8c','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'6eecfbbe79469684bf2b95af2adb73ef',NULL,'Primavera was established by a group of 10 individuals from Bosch Germany with the primary objective of assisting underprivileged children living in slums in developing or emerging nations, and providing them with a fresh outlook on life. The core mission of Primavera is to uplift children from the poverty line by focusing on crucial aspects such as education, healthcare, nutritious food, and vocational training.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Primavera%20was%20established%20by%20a%20group%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{}'),(478,'CSR Initiative: Bosch India Foundation is the social engagement arm of Bosch in India','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%20Foundation%20is%20the%20social%20engagement','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c01c4ff38e44919273e95bfd5ba68c5e','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'2ce25093677af71ab4c5b8ac032a3047',NULL,'Bosch India Foundation is the social engagement arm of Bosch in India. Founded in March 2008, it focused on vocational skills and holistic community development. The Foundation currently works in more than 230 Villages and several urban locations across 6 States in India. Its community based interventions promote skill development and integrated community development through environment & water conservation, promoting education, and preventive healthcare. The Foundation also executes CSR projects for Bosch entities in India, including Bosch Limited, Bosch Chassis System India Private Limited, Bosch Rexroth India Private Limited, Bosch Automotive Electronics India Private Limited, Engineering Tools Application & Services Automotive India Private Limited, etc. With a team of professionals driving the community development strategy, BIF has created a strong grassroots connect across its intervention locations and works very closely with government, non-profit organizations, corporates, and academic institutions.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%20Foundation%20is%20the%20social%20engagement',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{}'),(479,'CSR Initiative: There is a dedicated team of full','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=There%20is%20a%20dedicated%20team%20of%20full-time','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b22059d3586659774d2ba4a12ddb7b93','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'9adde4e6f75d356520b80751ab0d6d27',NULL,'There is a dedicated team of full-time professionals at the CSR department who work on planning, implementing, monitoring, improving, and reporting on CSR activities and projects. The team works in close coordination with Bosch India Foundation colleagues based at plant locations, as well as coordinate with a range of external stakeholders including the social sector and the government in ensuring long-term sustainability and impact of the CSR projects undertaken by the company.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=There%20is%20a%20dedicated%20team%20of%20full-time',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{}'),(480,'CSR Initiative: Bosch India has a CSR Committee at the board level which oversees implementation of CSR','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%20has%20a%20CSR%20Committee%20at','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2dc7325215a335a3b498ffb542c7d036','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'4c894f912b067a2132030a067c85379a',NULL,'Bosch India has a CSR Committee at the board level which oversees implementation of CSR. The Bosch Limited CSR Steering Committee comprising of senior leadership of Bosch reports to the Board CSR Committee. The long-term vision and thematic areas have been identified by these Committees, which also facilitate the provision of appropriate budget support for consolidated social engagement. The Committee guides on improving projects and programs, the sustainability and scalability of interventions and creating synergy to build stronger and enhanced engagement with society. The Committee also encourages active involvement through volunteering by Boschlers to actualize the higher vision of social action on the ground.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%20has%20a%20CSR%20Committee%20at',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{}'),(481,'CSR Initiative: Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%E2%80%99s%20social%20engagement%20is%20characterized%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8c1ccf80a85e0ea06bb7c4756c26888b','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'0399508e53bbe7cc3fec5e02574f9eef',NULL,'Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability. The organization is committed to making a positive impact on society by addressing its most relevant needs. Each project or program is designed to create compelling and influential narratives that align with social objectives, with the ultimate goal of improving people’s lives. Bosch ensures that it’s projects not only benefit the beneficiaries and stakeholders but are also sustainable and scalable over time. By concentrating its social responsibility efforts on key areas such as employment enhancing vocational skill development, environmental and water conservation, healthcare, education and integrated community development, Bosch demonstrates its commitment to making a lasting difference to the communities it serves.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%E2%80%99s%20social%20engagement%20is%20characterized%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{}'),(482,'CSR Initiative: Contribution of ₹ 100','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/about-us/social-commitment#:~:text=Contribution%20of%20%E2%82%B9%20100.00%20lakh%20to%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b4f137195a8ee58f7c686c2a14f10b58','COMP_TOP200_062',NULL,'78e03b354de7d62bbb8943d92ebad733',NULL,'Contribution of ₹ 100.00 lakh to the Chief Minister’s Relief Fund (CMRF), Bihar to support in the State’s relief and redevelopment activities due to floods.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:21.052379',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:21.052379',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:21.052379',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/about-us/social-commitment#:~:text=Contribution%20of%20%E2%82%B9%20100.00%20lakh%20to%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:21.052379','{}'),(483,'CSR Initiative: Contribution of ₹ 120','CSR Project Partne