Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9ed860f5eca77da9bebcb36fe599b65a','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'e9e514cb401d262004dbbdd7396164bc',NULL,'In Balgera, members of Sharada Mahila Sangam launched an oil extraction unit in May 2025. With machinery, hands-on training, and marketing support, each member earns ₹8,000–₹10,000 per month by selling freshly extracted oil in neighboring villages and markets.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20Balgera%2C%20members%20of%20Sharada%20Mahila%20Sangam',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(533,'CSR Initiative: In Gattu village, Sri Sunanda Varalakshmi Mahila Sangam established a roti making unit thr','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20Gattu%20village%2C%20Sri%20Sunanda%20Varalakshmi%20Mahila','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'65fac8ae04b09a3c9ca1c41558834bb5','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'e13b53b4de0befbb72474c19b4fc2bf5',NULL,'In Gattu village, Sri Sunanda Varalakshmi Mahila Sangam established a roti making unit through similar financial support and beneficiary contributions. With strong daily demand from nearby markets, each woman now earns ₹15,000–₹18,000 per month, making it one of the most successful enterprises in the cluster.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20Gattu%20village%2C%20Sri%20Sunanda%20Varalakshmi%20Mahila',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(534,'CSR Initiative: Members of Sri Chaitanya Mahila Sangam selected paper plate production as a viable and low','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Members%20of%20Sri%20Chaitanya%20Mahila%20Sangam%20selected','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'529875e4277d7796d32ef07cb4ec8552','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'444e4d5ab89043bac5fc61e5fecef194',NULL,'Members of Sri Chaitanya Mahila Sangam selected paper plate production as a viable and low-cost enterprise. With ₹1,50,000 support from LTM and additional group contributions, a paper plate making unit was set up in March 2025. The unit now provides each member with a stable monthly income of ₹8,000–₹10,000, with products sold in local markets and community events.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Members%20of%20Sri%20Chaitanya%20Mahila%20Sangam%20selected',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(535,'CSR Initiative: In the villages of Gattu Block in Jogulamba Gadwal District, many women from self','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20villages%20of%20Gattu%20Block%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'47cd44c3b388417a8bb57d2bcd8f068d','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'25676cd03542f37f41f254af83f140c8',NULL,'In the villages of Gattu Block in Jogulamba Gadwal District, many women from self-help groups (SHGs) relied on seasonal agricultural wage labor, earning around ₹200 per day during sowing and harvesting periods. For the rest of the year, limited income opportunities left families financially vulnerable. Under the IVDP 2024–25, Bhavishya Bharat Trust identified this gap and introduced micro-enterprise development to create steady, year-round livelihoods for women.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20villages%20of%20Gattu%20Block%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(536,'CSR Initiative: Rural Development & Livelihood Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Micro-enterprises%20empowers%20rural%20women%20entrepreneurs%20of%20Telengana','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9abd25a9b2dc1d60ac01dc9143f2b7d0','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'51222c598757d6a11ae71234986ad327',NULL,'Micro-enterprises empowers rural women entrepreneurs of Telengana',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Micro-enterprises%20empowers%20rural%20women%20entrepreneurs%20of%20Telengana',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(537,'CSR Initiative: Project Impact','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20The%20rejuvenated%20water%20bodies%20now','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3b0bef599fe5aecda36e0f56526f3216','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'d3f99030d612e97f03352b14e22b73dd',NULL,'Project Impact: The rejuvenated water bodies now benefit 356 farming families, supporting irrigation and livestock across 168 acres of agricultural land. The intervention has revived five open wells and two bore wells, with several more experiencing improved recharge, strengthening the community’s year-round access to water. Farmers are now better equipped to cultivate crops such as maize, cotton, pulses, and vegetables with greater reliability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20The%20rejuvenated%20water%20bodies%20now',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(538,'CSR Initiative: Creation of a Bio','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Creation%20of%20a%20Bio-Island%20a%20raised%20mud','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a3ea3d6de3989f7ba075363b40d18097','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'7b23378e633ca7d510f782c26b43f003',NULL,'Creation of a Bio-Island a raised mud formation at the center of the waterbody to encourage local biodiversity through the growth of native flora and fauna.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Creation%20of%20a%20Bio-Island%20a%20raised%20mud',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(539,'CSR Initiative: For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communitie','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=For%20years%2C%20these%20traditional%20tanks%20had%20been','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0cdf5d913e11fc6726c59d74892604a5','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'b52b2667bd9d0c987120d39759adf068',NULL,'For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communities due to heavy siltation and weakened structures. Reduced storage capacity, declining groundwater levels, and irregular water availability had begun affecting irrigation, livestock needs, and overall livelihoods. To address this, a systematic rejuvenation effort was undertaken during FY 2025–26 to restore the tanks’ ecological and functional balance.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=For%20years%2C%20these%20traditional%20tanks%20had%20been',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(540,'CSR Initiative: As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of t','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=As%20part%20of%20the%20Integrated%20Village%20Development','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e943b45771d1b8875d5d460f7a636133','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'82027748b93e7ab9f94de6473dc99e3f',NULL,'As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of two vital traditional water bodies—the Vaduganeri M.I. Tank and Kadantheri Lake of Tamil Nadu. These efforts were carried out in Koothur Village Panchayat and Pilimisai Village of Alathur Block, Perambalur District, along with LTM’s implementation partner.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=As%20part%20of%20the%20Integrated%20Village%20Development',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(541,'CSR Initiative: Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Frequent%20floods%20in%20Mandia%20Block%20in%20Assam','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'305c82508f3bc946a61e762d830f02a9','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'c55651893c3735d54935fbfcd93a1b0e',NULL,'Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean-water access. LTM introduced raised toilets and elevated hand pumps to ensure functionality even during heavy flooding. The structures reduce waterlogging and prevent contamination. They also help communities avoid waterborne diseases.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Frequent%20floods%20in%20Mandia%20Block%20in%20Assam',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(542,'CSR Initiative: Raised toilets and hand pumps improve hygiene and living conditions in Assam','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Raised%20toilets%20and%20hand%20pumps%20improve%20hygiene','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a28cdd9020d78306dbef3ed47922bd04','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'bd2304bcd6f569a1fa9f23064b8d12d9',NULL,'Raised toilets and hand pumps improve hygiene and living conditions in Assam',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Raised%20toilets%20and%20hand%20pumps%20improve%20hygiene',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(543,'CSR Initiative: Sikkim’s rich agricultural base inspired LTM’s CSR initiative to establish a noodle and tu','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Sikkim%E2%80%99s%20rich%20agricultural%20base%20inspired%20LTM%E2%80%99s%20CSR','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b78e16be472deb72fa78f2ba762546fb','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'02f5858bfc683b28312b7dbd27958e01',NULL,'Sikkim’s rich agricultural base inspired LTM’s CSR initiative to establish a noodle and turmeric processing unit. The facility sources turmeric from local farms and focuses on organic practices. The project supports women’s self-help groups by creating employment and building skills in processing and packaging.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Sikkim%E2%80%99s%20rich%20agricultural%20base%20inspired%20LTM%E2%80%99s%20CSR',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(544,'CSR Initiative: The program reaches 2,800 students across 32 schools','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20program%20reaches%202%2C800%20students%20across%2032','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6cb7945be4e3f6f9d01aff3b6798f778','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'9a5f63150589994097cfb58172420b08',NULL,'The program reaches 2,800 students across 32 schools. Attendance stays steady at 70–75%, and learning outcomes have improved by 10–15%. For many children, these vans mark their first exposure to digital learning.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20program%20reaches%202%2C800%20students%20across%2032',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(545,'CSR Initiative: In the tribal belts of Surgana and Wadwani, Maharashtra, digital access used to be limited','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20tribal%20belts%20of%20Surgana%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'409378efc1e1754c8c9d6ef45a10a616','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'776a58b7214ee71eb91df2b60a53710f',NULL,'In the tribal belts of Surgana and Wadwani, Maharashtra, digital access used to be limited. LTM’s FLN and STEM Mobile Van Program is changing this landscape. Each van operates as a mobile classroom with laptops and regional-language content. Local youth trained as instructors deliver lessons aligned with NIPUN Bharat and NEP 2020.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20tribal%20belts%20of%20Surgana%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(546,'CSR Initiative: A new community service centre in Subir is simplifying citizens’ access to government sche','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=A%20new%20community%20service%20centre%20in%20Subir','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b393afc31f3cfcae7d8a2fc299b73b4e','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'acfffa3f21e19ba27be19d3c005c503a',NULL,'A new community service centre in Subir is simplifying citizens’ access to government schemes. The center, built under the IVDP, assists communities across health, livelihood, education, agriculture, and documentation.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=A%20new%20community%20service%20centre%20in%20Subir',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(547,'CSR Initiative: The initiative benefits over 500 residents','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20initiative%20benefits%20over%20500%20residents.%20For','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ca82ff8d652b9f20f2b211e25ef0649c','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'4c72df0e89ab41eedfd515849ae61bb7',NULL,'The initiative benefits over 500 residents. For women and adolescent girls, access to toilets within their homes ensures privacy and security, while for families, it means cleaner surroundings and reduced disease risk. By addressing one of the most fundamental needs of rural life, LTM continues to empower communities and champion sustainable rural development—one household, one village at a time.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20initiative%20benefits%20over%20500%20residents.%20For',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(548,'CSR Initiative: The intervention serves 4,500 small and marginal farmers','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20intervention%20serves%204%2C500%20small%20and%20marginal','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cf17002d1530bf929ad3e078da6d9b02','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'5e8bfb4f748c15efd0d5eb6e37b021d2',NULL,'The intervention serves 4,500 small and marginal farmers. It enables irrigation across 600 acres, strengthening climate-resilient agriculture and community participation.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20intervention%20serves%204%2C500%20small%20and%20marginal',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(549,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20drought-prone%20Wadwani%20block%2C%20in%20Beed%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d1616dc1ab29d4986069eb003b536f92','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'a32c0f4dfd7896d88b9e3f44fa8212bd',NULL,'In drought-prone Wadwani block, in Beed of Maharashtra, water scarcity hindered year-round farming. LTM’s Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP) addressed this through well-planned watershed work.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20drought-prone%20Wadwani%20block%2C%20in%20Beed%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(550,'CSR Initiative: Watershed development renews 600 acres of farmlands in Beed, Maharashtra','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Watershed%20development%20renews%20600%20acres%20of%20farmlands','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fad072f17b10c6105a4bc9f722421292','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'fb03c0ba73ca94eb8184e815eaada4ed',NULL,'Watershed development renews 600 acres of farmlands in Beed, Maharashtra',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Watershed%20development%20renews%20600%20acres%20of%20farmlands',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(551,'CSR Initiative: Household medical expenses linked to mosquito','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Household%20medical%20expenses%20linked%20to%20mosquito-borne%20diseases','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'140a1897759932f47ec6b6e6c11036cc','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'9904bc2560018eff5c4ef5a017ac66c2',NULL,'Household medical expenses linked to mosquito-borne diseases dropped by an estimated ₹3,500–₹4,000 per family.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Household%20medical%20expenses%20linked%20to%20mosquito-borne%20diseases',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(552,'CSR Initiative: To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner,','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=To%20confront%20this%20growing%20challenge%2C%20LTM%2C%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'222088845d1e9183fd3bf77c6c83ac25','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'4bc6b9d730447f15c8d9eb5ebd07a5b6',NULL,'To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner, under the Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP), launched a focused fumigation support program. Fifteen fumigation machines were provided across fifteen gram panchayats, five each in Madanpur Rampur, Gudvella, and Paikmal, to ensure local ownership and long-term use.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=To%20confront%20this%20growing%20challenge%2C%20LTM%2C%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(553,'CSR Initiative: In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20western%20Odisha%E2%80%99s%20remote%20hills%20and%20villages%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3884fa53a5ba312bf1a08a8a17fe7d88','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'582cb304d6c873d2f8dc0cc2dfa090b2',NULL,'In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector-borne diseases such as malaria and dengue have long strained public health and household incomes. Districts such as Kalahandi, Balangir, and Bargarh have seen repeated outbreaks, with Madanpur Rampur Block identified as one of the worst-affected regions. The rise in cases has been steep. Kalahandi recorded 3,841 cases in 2022, 7,543 in 2023, and 14,399 in 2024. Of these, 11,075 were severe Plasmodium falciparum infections. Similar spikes were reported in Gudvella and Paikmal blocks, leaving communities vulnerable and health systems under pressure.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20western%20Odisha%E2%80%99s%20remote%20hills%20and%20villages%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(554,'CSR Initiative: This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=This%20expanded%20cropping%20pattern%20across%2070%20acres','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1ad60306f139df9df511c0e1142edb44','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'e9e7835446453b2c3189459665eec485',NULL,'This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10–12 lakh inadditional annual income for the farming households. The check dam has not only stabilized agricultural productivity but has also strengthened economic security for families who once faced an uncertain year after year.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=This%20expanded%20cropping%20pattern%20across%2070%20acres',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(555,'CSR Initiative: Project Impact','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20Agriculture%20in%20the%20Madanpur%20Rampur','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'de1861850fc9c4c21b62fdfabf88394a','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'a7dca194911502cce8446327a7ec850c',NULL,'Project Impact: Agriculture in the Madanpur Rampur block has always been at the mercy of erratic rainfall. Before the intervention, farmers could grow only one monsoon crop, often risking crop loss in dry spells. The check dam has changed that reality. Farmers can now irrigate their paddy fields whenever required and cultivate additional Rabi crops, an opportunity that never existed earlier due to water scarcity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20Agriculture%20in%20the%20Madanpur%20Rampur',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(556,'CSR Initiative: With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from re','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=With%20guidance%20from%20civil%20surveys%20and%20feasibility','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'87ad47321cd923db14d254b4552cf3b1','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'8d2a138ad829a0f2e917677c1d543534',NULL,'With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from residents across 3–4 neighboring villages, the check dam was constructed at a point where it could direct water across 70 acres of farmland. This intervention now supports 35–40 farmers who previously struggled to cultivate beyond a single paddy cycle.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=With%20guidance%20from%20civil%20surveys%20and%20feasibility',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(557,'CSR Initiative: To address this challenge, LTM, under its CSR initiative Integrated Village Development Pr','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=To%20address%20this%20challenge%2C%20LTM%2C%20under%20its','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0b4021610503af17207f98c68fbf72f1','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'eff5ab2fa1bd0cc78f9c542bb16692f0',NULL,'To address this challenge, LTM, under its CSR initiative Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP), worked with its implementation partner to strengthen local water security. During the community needs assessment, a crucial opportunity was identified: a strategically placed check dam that could support irrigation for Juger and nearby villages.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=To%20address%20this%20challenge%2C%20LTM%2C%20under%20its',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(558,'CSR Initiative: In the secluded hamlet of Juger in Manikera Gram Panchayat, farming families have long dep','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20secluded%20hamlet%20of%20Juger%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a4908b148285818c7dd40b13e0aecd1b','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'18d2f59cb705f3ec8440d7feec17e6d5',NULL,'In the secluded hamlet of Juger in Manikera Gram Panchayat, farming families have long depended on uncertain monsoons to sustain their fields. With just 10-12 households surrounded by dense forests, the community relied on a single rain-fed crop each year, leaving livelihoods fragile and incomes unpredictable.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20secluded%20hamlet%20of%20Juger%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(559,'CSR Initiative: Check dam improves agricultural outcome, empowers farmers in Odisha','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Check%20dam%20improves%20agricultural%20outcome%2C%20empowers%20farmers','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9812e90ad9e6831941ca42f85fb44fca','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'efcb0aa124c7dff3a48a28513914e18d',NULL,'Check dam improves agricultural outcome, empowers farmers in Odisha',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Check%20dam%20improves%20agricultural%20outcome%2C%20empowers%20farmers',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(560,'CSR Initiative: The processing unit runs on solar power and handles up to 10 quintals daily','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20processing%20unit%20runs%20on%20solar%20power','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6160eb6807408f7762313cd7279b5729','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'1356263f37ef54e262d674455eebcc91',NULL,'The processing unit runs on solar power and handles up to 10 quintals daily. Through exposure visits, training, and machinery support, 210 farmers across 37 villages strengthened their income. In just six months, the FPC generated ₹5,88,600 lakhs in revenue. The initiative now stands as a strong livelihood model driven by value addition and reliable market connections.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20processing%20unit%20runs%20on%20solar%20power',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(561,'CSR Initiative: A local farmers’ group in Lakhanpur, Jhasuguda in Odisha, evolved into a full','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=A%20local%20farmers%E2%80%99%20group%20in%20Lakhanpur%2C%20Jhasuguda','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'be0ca222074f4110ebc71fde8f440b90','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'e19a1173b3cb4c4d82827ce338ab3e82',NULL,'A local farmers’ group in Lakhanpur, Jhasuguda in Odisha, evolved into a full-fledged enterprise through the IVDP project led by LTM and its implementation partner. Maa Padmasini Women Farmers Producer Company Limited now manages procurement, processing, branding, and sales of ginger-based products.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=A%20local%20farmers%E2%80%99%20group%20in%20Lakhanpur%2C%20Jhasuguda',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(562,'CSR Initiative: Farmers turn enterpreneurs with solar','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Farmers%20turn%20enterpreneurs%20with%20solar-powered%20ginger%20processing','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b949dd198d57b5f8e5159ebe55ab24bf','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'73756442bcf0c9928a379ede2ff5e036',NULL,'Farmers turn enterpreneurs with solar-powered ginger processing in Odisha',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Farmers%20turn%20enterpreneurs%20with%20solar-powered%20ginger%20processing',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(563,'CSR Initiative: Access to affordable medical care in Lucknow received a strong boost when LTM donated an U','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Access%20to%20affordable%20medical%20care%20in%20Lucknow','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f0cbd964920a920a17eb99d525f175fb','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'4aca3e9267c2593b053b72e9764c8098',NULL,'Access to affordable medical care in Lucknow received a strong boost when LTM donated an Ultrasound machine and a C-Arm system to Sri Radha Krishna Hospital. The C-Arm provides real-time X-ray support during complex surgeries. With an investment of ₹67 lakhs, the hospital can now offer high-quality diagnostics and surgical services. This contribution expands healthcare access for the city’s general population.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Access%20to%20affordable%20medical%20care%20in%20Lucknow',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(564,'CSR Initiative: Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Lucknow%2C%20Uttar%20Pradesh%3A%20Democratizing%20access%20to%20quality','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b1dec10d76ebab7b54d17b0731dd530c','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'da1320ae3fe1b0ce4a3a98fe6bf162c8',NULL,'Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh: Democratizing access to quality healthcare',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Lucknow%2C%20Uttar%20Pradesh%3A%20Democratizing%20access%20to%20quality',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(565,'CSR Initiative: LTM constructed this earthen check dam under the Integrated Village Development Program (I','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=LTM%20constructed%20this%20earthen%20check%20dam%20under','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'eba853f643ee456b85f5c8ab37643739','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'d84871866b7eb2bc6261efb509f40dd8',NULL,'LTM constructed this earthen check dam under the Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP) initiative. Across India, 137 such units now strengthens rural water security.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=LTM%20constructed%20this%20earthen%20check%20dam%20under',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(566,'CSR Initiative: What once seemed impossible in the dry Math village is now reshaping lives','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=What%20once%20seemed%20impossible%20in%20the%20dry','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'09e4274009dc6580e3fc8736686351c7','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'75349e7276a82e130bf8cd87c53dbec2',NULL,'What once seemed impossible in the dry Math village is now reshaping lives. A two-meter-high earthen check dam in Gangapur City, Rajasthan, can store 11.62 crore liters of water. Erratic rainfall filled it four times this year. As a result, more than 250 once-dry wells now hold water again. This shift supports 25,000 people. Farmers are using the stored water to cultivate an additional cropping cycle.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=What%20once%20seemed%20impossible%20in%20the%20dry',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(567,'CSR Initiative: Communities inspire every CSR initiative at LTM','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Communities%20inspire%20every%20CSR%20initiative%20at%20LTM.','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e45c4330f231f273a3d4c9b94baa84a9','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'78ce5f92a192a856071d882b3891aaf0',NULL,'Communities inspire every CSR initiative at LTM. In collaboration with local partners, we create programs that empower women, young people, and marginalized groups. The LTM Foundation answers essential needs in education, health, livelihoods, housing, and the environment. This is how we shape skills and create long-term opportunities. This is how we champion diversity and inclusion. This is how we create lasting change for our communities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Communities%20inspire%20every%20CSR%20initiative%20at%20LTM.',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(568,'CSR Initiative: Our approach to ESG is founded on measurable impact through clearly defined, time','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20approach%20to%20ESG%20is%20founded%20on','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f37175449725205106426a9b90ad435a','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'a8680cf480ac08899d2fca1f09e004dd',NULL,'Our approach to ESG is founded on measurable impact through clearly defined, time-bound commitments. From becoming water positive by 2030 to achieving net-zero emissions by 2040. It’s about tracking progress across diversity, leadership representation and supplier inclusion. Community initiatives that positively impact millions of lives through education and digital empowerment.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20approach%20to%20ESG%20is%20founded%20on',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(569,'CSR Initiative: Our sustainability journey is grounded in rigor, transparency, and purposeful action','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20sustainability%20journey%20is%20grounded%20in%20rigor%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'678d8731a878d6685235fc107a2ece7d','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'4a1df05a55693b5a210b5946a931c641',NULL,'Our sustainability journey is grounded in rigor, transparency, and purposeful action. As we align with global frameworks, we move towards achieving our ambitious targets for Net Zero emissions, renewable energy, and water positivity, all while fostering diversity and community empowerment. By integrating technology practices with responsible stewardship, we continue to strengthen the maturity of our ESG vision and create meaningful, measurable impact across the organization and the communities we serve.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20sustainability%20journey%20is%20grounded%20in%20rigor%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(570,'CSR Initiative: Our responsibility in an AI','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20responsibility%20in%20an%20AI-first%2C%20agentic%20era','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d09e8dcd6f2138fcf43be2480f72b661','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'3c62bc367a2aba7e1346e116a5bac90d',NULL,'Our responsibility in an AI-first, agentic era goes beyond deploying advanced technology. It lies in shaping an organization that applies intelligence with accountability, grows with purpose, operates with transparency, and creates lasting value for our clients, our people, and the ecosystems we are part of. By strengthening our culture, expanding our capabilities, and integrating sustainability into the way we serve our clients and communities, we are building an organization that stands resilient today and remains relevant for decades to come.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20responsibility%20in%20an%20AI-first%2C%20agentic%20era',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(571,'CSR Initiative: People are the heart of our business','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=People%20are%20the%20heart%20of%20our%20business.','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8ade8ff053fd80709455b83be7bebd55','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'1af1e0cb339bdf9bf1731a483157ea7e',NULL,'People are the heart of our business. We foster an inclusive workplace where everyone can grow, thrive, and make meaningful contributions. Beyond our organization, we support communities through education, skill development, and digital inclusion initiatives.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=People%20are%20the%20heart%20of%20our%20business.',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(572,'CSR Initiative: We are committed to achieving net','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=We%20are%20committed%20to%20achieving%20net-zero%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'547b3fe846abd65fe86bba0e5e661853','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'cdb29169748630769894ab794c36e444',NULL,'We are committed to achieving net-zero by 2040 and are working to reduce emissions and minimise our carbon footprint across our business. Our technology-led solutions are also helping clients achieve their own sustainability goals through the smarter use of data, cloud, and digital platforms.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=We%20are%20committed%20to%20achieving%20net-zero%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(573,'CSR Initiative: We lead with purpose, protecting the environment, nurturing our people, and supporting the','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=We%20lead%20with%20purpose%2C%20protecting%20the%20environment%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f6a3cb8e08abaf9d7de6509d6f0576d6','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'3a80ad8958d573fa833eaafd95b78f2c',NULL,'We lead with purpose, protecting the environment, nurturing our people, and supporting the communities we serve. Through responsible governance and inclusive practices, we create long-term value for every stakeholder. This is how we turn commitment into meaningful impact and enduring progress.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=We%20lead%20with%20purpose%2C%20protecting%20the%20environment%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(574,'CSR Initiative: Our approach to sustainability is driven by intention and grounded in impact','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20approach%20to%20sustainability%20is%20driven%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cc8a7ae359eb433c7be384cab9e1dba0','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'00dfc57805b8d2a22464ff32f22cf75f',NULL,'Our approach to sustainability is driven by intention and grounded in impact. ESG principles guide every step we take, turning ambition into measurable, lasting change. From education and environment to empowerment, health and nutrition, we consistently seek to build trust, stengthen value, and shape a better tomorrow.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Our%20approach%20to%20sustainability%20is%20driven%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{}'),(575,'CSR Statutory Partnership: Sustainability Report CY2022','CSR Grant / Program','Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.varunbeverages.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/2-VBL-SR_2022_02_03_23.pdf','Statutory annual filing CSR opportunity for Varun Beverages Limited.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d99cba393a4e56c1116ab8c43f3e5342','COMP_TOP200_049',NULL,'c835fa0b93889fb2f6ee280b1615aa33',NULL,'Sustainability Report CY2022',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.varunbeverages.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/2-VBL-SR_2022_02_03_23.pdf',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354','{}'),(576,'CSR Statutory Partnership: Sustainability Report for CY2023','CSR Grant / Program','Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.varunbeverages.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/1-Placement-Document-1.pdf','Statutory annual filing CSR opportunity for Varun Beverages Limited.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4dccaadec9811f98c434bb257dc39505','COMP_TOP200_049',NULL,'21409d3030c08edfbd0f4750ee08ed7b',NULL,'Sustainability Report for CY2023',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.varunbeverages.com/wp-