4',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.varunbeverages.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VBL-Sustainability-GRI-Report_2024_C-to-C_24042025.pdf',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:20.202354','{}'),(580,'CSR Initiative: Nature has provided us with a powerful tool for organic farming','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Nature%20has%20provided%20us%20with%20a%20powerful','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2784ed822e89ab4006ee675e1db96a7a','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'fdbf6e34e72c4e780ae7a800a0fe5955',NULL,'Nature has provided us with a powerful tool for organic farming: Jivamrut. Rich in essential nutrients like carbon, nitrogen, phosphorous, and potassium, it serves as a natural pesticide and fertiliser. Its impact is so significant that we\'ve established a dedicated setup to produce Jivamrut alongside our vermicompost project.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Nature%20has%20provided%20us%20with%20a%20powerful',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(581,'CSR Initiative: We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20consider%20environmental%20preservation%20a%20vital%20aspect','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'529fdca73bff51e2d09e38475e85818c','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'c30cf19c7cb1cc477b9f76befceb79c7',NULL,'We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business. Understanding the importance of a healthy planet for the sustainability of human societies, we are dedicated to playing our part in protecting the environment. We believe this responsibility is shared by individuals, governments, and businesses, and we are committed to safeguarding the environment for future generations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20consider%20environmental%20preservation%20a%20vital%20aspect',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(582,'CSR Initiative: Recognizing the pivotal role of women\'s financial independence in societal progress, we ar','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Recognizing%20the%20pivotal%20role%20of%20women%27s%20financial','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f9c064287a4e0bdab5efd78fb904350a','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'0edb05672a647243e23e5688d8bc8a46',NULL,'Recognizing the pivotal role of women\'s financial independence in societal progress, we are committed to empowering women through diverse skill development initiatives. Our efforts include martial arts for girls, collaboration with Self Help Groups (SHGs) for agarbatti making, and implementation of sewing courses, among other initiatives.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Recognizing%20the%20pivotal%20role%20of%20women%27s%20financial',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(583,'CSR Initiative: At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=At%20Polycab%2C%20we%20believe%20that%20skill%20development','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a9178d0183c6420a42c09ec4d48d5d5d','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'6917c16cf9f8a34509eefbce4f605cf3',NULL,'At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future. Our flagship CSR initiative, ‘Polycab Utkarsh,’ is driven by a single, powerful goal, uplifting India’s electrician community through structured training. Launched in September 2024 under the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) framework, Utkarsh is aligned with Skill India, Construction Skill Development Council curriculum. The program offers 2-days intensive training module. Its unique dual-mode training on live and de-energized electrical circuit is complemented by safety awareness, communication skills, and customer management techniques. This ensures participants are ready for real-world challenges and can deliver safer, more reliable services to communities nationwide.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=At%20Polycab%2C%20we%20believe%20that%20skill%20development',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(584,'CSR Initiative: We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp a','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20have%20partnered%20with%20Shree%20Halol%20Stree','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7d8ebb492f7885dcbd48ea3eaea15300','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'bedd7855cffeff9f076be3706a5d0722',NULL,'We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp and held health camps in various locations such as rural areas, hospitals, industries, institutes, public healthcare centres, and government offices, reaching a wide audience. In FY23 alone, 4,500+ women have benefited from our health camps, and we\'ve made a special effort to raise awareness about breast cancer through targeted interventions.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20have%20partnered%20with%20Shree%20Halol%20Stree',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(585,'CSR Initiative: Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultat','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Medical%20Units%20%28MMUs%29%20bring%20vital','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0849b7642f23cf55c9abeb723980f890','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'4d63f4131713ec93e81976a710868198',NULL,'Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultations, medication supply, and health counselling, directly to communities. With an average of 125 patients served daily, our designated MMUs focus on rural areas, providing guidance on nutrition, healthy lifestyles, and personalized health actions. Health Mobilisers, working under medical supervision, play a crucial role in enhancing the well-being of the communities we serve.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Medical%20Units%20%28MMUs%29%20bring%20vital',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(586,'CSR Initiative: We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health ini','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20improving%20the%20healthcare','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5129ba3e89990ffde20811815380957d','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'09f5b7a2f2275bc1acc1a4a99c009f3a',NULL,'We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health initiatives and providing health outreach programs to vulnerable communities. The foundation\'s overarching goal is to ensure that high-quality primary, secondary, and tertiary healthcare services are accessible to everyone.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20improving%20the%20healthcare',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(587,'CSR Initiative: Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hinde','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Several%20government%20schools%20face%20a%20shortage%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d4baf4d84d6dee6c87f98dec95ea6ed4','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'9235c5da9a5990fcf46666f30da753a8',NULL,'Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hindering practical demonstrations of classroom theories. To address this gap, we have established science laboratories in K.G.B.V Hirapur for 100 students, giving them access to hand on experience to improve their academic performance and foster a growing interest in Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) subjects.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Several%20government%20schools%20face%20a%20shortage%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(588,'CSR Initiative: Our LEAAD programme, which is aimed at fostering leadership qualities among students, was ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20LEAAD%20programme%2C%20which%20is%20aimed%20at','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'35cf9a228c3bd3117bcf3295169380ab','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'01c8c30e8c1f48c08960a05e64343ed3',NULL,'Our LEAAD programme, which is aimed at fostering leadership qualities among students, was undertaken in 12 schools and has impacted 1,194 children. This programme has proven successful, as evidenced by significant behavioural changes, increased self confidence, and a new-found eagerness to embrace challenges and acquire new knowledge.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20LEAAD%20programme%2C%20which%20is%20aimed%20at',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(589,'CSR Initiative: At Polycab, we believe that education is the key to a brighter future, and we remain commi','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=At%20Polycab%2C%20we%20believe%20that%20education%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c589d50c037804a2b8593434301310b5','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'4444805a5880b2b1e4942a0a560c8b27',NULL,'At Polycab, we believe that education is the key to a brighter future, and we remain committed to empowering India\'s youth to achieve their full potential.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=At%20Polycab%2C%20we%20believe%20that%20education%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{}'),(590,'CSR Initiative: We have been recognized for the development of BEFS and IARA portals, effective compliance','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Sk