vers can influence the trajectories marine tropical fisheries take towards sustainability or overharvest.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=-%20Oceans%20and%20coasts%20program%20-%20To',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(610,'CSR Initiative: Rural Development & Livelihood Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=-%20High%20altitude%20program%20in%20Spiti%20-','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b6d4a20d3d0221494c36a0c0fdb3d4ff','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'20b3bf24b3524e61a20031c1fd625252',NULL,'- High altitude program in Spiti - A village-level livestock security program that allows villagers to seek compensation for livestock killed by snow leopards and wolves.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=-%20High%20altitude%20program%20in%20Spiti%20-',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(611,'CSR Initiative: Environment Sustainability Conservation in High Altitude & Oceans program','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Environment%20Sustainability%20Conservation%20in%20High%20Altitude%20%26','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e02573539b996c7c7d220539523eb18d','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'3098cd09d94d9f2121b4447bc187039f',NULL,'Environment Sustainability Conservation in High Altitude & Oceans program',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://w