enerating and exchanging knowledge. Additionally, there are Collections, Archiving, Conservation and Library, Research, Arts and Museum Management, Exposure and Orientation for school students, Exhibitions, Events, Cultural Tourism, Crafts shop, Crafts bazaar, Administration and Finance.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=The%20Dakshina%20Chitra%20Museum%20-%20Cholamandalam%20Arts',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(614,'CSR Initiative: Arts & Culture Arts Education Programme Elements The project is designed to see arts educa','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Arts%20%26%20Culture%20Arts%20Education%20Programme%20Elements','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8fe1e9268d7da5e1090fb7a4974ff45c','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'114ead48736c4a5b9fabe3b171098a54',NULL,'Arts & Culture Arts Education Programme Elements The project is designed to see arts education as an integral part of the development of students where they explore the joy of learning within and beyond their curriculum. To enable teachers to connect the lived experiences of their students to the syllabus in their textbooks through exploring local arts and cultural forms and practices.Area of Implementation: Bangalore, Karnataka',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Arts%20%26%20Culture%20Arts%20Education%20Programme%20Elements',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(615,'CSR Initiative: Class rooms at Government Girls Higher Secondary School Construction of another set of cla','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Class%20rooms%20at%20Government%20Girls%20Higher%20Secondary','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6b5baa645a9df1d4f9daf51e8f7e1608','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'89b8e57ccebaf37b8fbbfd92411d99d6',NULL,'Class rooms at Government Girls Higher Secondary School Construction of another set of classrooms at the Government Girls Higher Secondary School at Mogappair, Chennai to facilitate the Higher classes and more intake of girls from weaker sections of society in the area.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Class%20rooms%20at%20Government%20Girls%20Higher%20Secondary',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(616,'CSR Initiative: Financial literacy plus allied services Financial Literacy and Health Awareness among comm','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Financial%20literacy%20plus%20allied%20services%20Financial%20Literacy','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c9dacc8d2c64d03db61bffd106517424','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'baa1f1e1eb540039b89074b24bcdda7a',NULL,'Financial literacy plus allied services Financial Literacy and Health Awareness among commercial vehicle crew members (CVCM) and their family members (especially women). The program trains the CVCMs and their family members on Financial Planning, Government Schemes, Banking, Digital Transactions & Safety, Insurance, Investments and Saving Practices etc.Area of Implementation: Gujarat, Rajasthan',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Financial%20literacy%20plus%20allied%20services%20Financial%20Literacy',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(617,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Mini-Library%20for%20Anganwadis%20The%20project%20aims%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7a7db4347eed5d07abe7b981eaee1d6f','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'c517b4f3b6102f966876e1a55abe49ad',NULL,'Mini-Library for Anganwadis The project aims to ensure the inclusion of children with disabilities (CWDs) in their nearest anganwadis and provide quality pre-school education to all children. Chola provided \'mini-library\' resource kits comprising a set of 20 multi-sensory educational and play items and a cabinet, to 50 Anganwadi centres that completed the six month teacher training.Area of Implementation: Karjat, Maharashtra',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Mini-Library%20for%20Anganwadis%20The%20project%20aims%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(618,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=AKKAM%20-%20STEM%20Education%20%26%20Labs%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7e56986e8be8a7badf601b33ba7ef12c','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'b34626939ca80f06a968f0f1ede4b778',NULL,'AKKAM - STEM Education & Labs in Government School Providing STEM facilities for the selected 5 Government schools in Chennai to improve the education status of the students. This will help students to improve their aptitude and performance, increase the self-confidence of students, and increase enrolment.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=AKKAM%20-%20STEM%20Education%20%26%20Labs%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(619,'CSR Initiative: My Dream Scholarship Program My Dream Scholarship Program is a comprehensive poverty allev','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=My%20Dream%20Scholarship%20Program%20My%20Dream%20Scholarship','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'62ac47cec35e6d0dcadfd86b54114212','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'67dd0cc2555a2eece0380273686ce231',NULL,'My Dream Scholarship Program My Dream Scholarship Program is a comprehensive poverty alleviation model that focuses on children from the CVCM (Commercial Vehicle Crew Members) trucker communities. The objective of this program is to provide severely underprivileged children with Scholarships for college education, technical education or higher studies.Area of Implementation: Salem, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=My%20Dream%20Scholarship%20Program%20My%20Dream%20Scholarship',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(620,'CSR Initiative: Education Arts in Education The programs enable a joyful learning experience for children ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Education%20Arts%20in%20Education%20The%20programs%20enable','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9533d55e877bf8ad962e3f0c071646ea','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'613f2f21c4900f91f45184bcea219820',NULL,'Education Arts in Education The programs enable a joyful learning experience for children in primary classes, strengthen their foundational learning, help them engage better in classrooms, enhance their creativity and imagination and provide them with a safe environment to acquire these skills.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Education%20Arts%20in%20Education%20The%20programs%20enable',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(621,'CSR Initiative: Swaccha Telangana Project','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Swaccha%20Telangana%20Project%20-%20Phase%20VI%20The','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a402e2fdb3a38b24fe992e13ffa46969','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'704181a02b1f2a9b7cc22bb189d43be2',NULL,'Swaccha Telangana Project - Phase VI The project aims to arrange Purified Drinking Water for remote villages by providing ‘Any Time Water’ (ATW) of Ultra Filtration (UF) plants.Area of Implementation: Telangana',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Swaccha%20Telangana%20Project%20-%20Phase%20VI%20The',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(622,'CSR Initiative: Water & Sanitation Swachha Odisha Gram Vikas Odisha is one of the poorest states in the co','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Water%20%26%20Sanitation%20Swachha%20Odisha%20Gram%20Vikas','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d19409acf7c4f9888d294f46a498b92a','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'5c4b5d6aa2ddd593e93989386c0bd735',NULL,'Water & Sanitation Swachha Odisha Gram Vikas Odisha is one of the poorest states in the country. Due to low per capita income, the living conditions of a large proportion of the people of the state are poor. This project aims to improve access to water, safe sanitation and awareness of a healthy environment by practicing healthy sanitary habits through the use of toilets. Ensuring access to water to every household in the village. Building of overhead water tanks for the storage and supply of water to each toilet.Area of Implementation: Odisha',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Water%20%26%20Sanitation%20Swachha%20Odisha%20Gram%20Vikas',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(623,'CSR Initiative: Health care services for rural communities and hydrogiological study to map water bodies i','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Health%20care%20services%20for%20rural%20communities%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'82ffa53672dfe3f7ceb232d5d8794b3a','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'70b50380440875d2024ef7071265c6ef',NULL,'Health care services for rural communities and hydrogiological study to map water bodies in and around Oonaiyur The purpose of the health services for rural community is to offer healthcare to the poor and underprivileged groups of society in the Cuddalore district. People from 36 villages can now receive better diagnosis and treatment at the AMM hospital in Pallathur, thanks to renovations and expansion that added more up-to-date diagnostic facilities.Area of Implementation: Cuddalore, Pudukkottai - Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Health%20care%20services%20for%20rural%20communities%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(624,'CSR Initiative: Promoting quality health care and education to marginalized section','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Promoting%20quality%20health%20care%20and%20education%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0e8b0a6d09d59f4db0de43ebb2e18dd1','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'17623f72463d9b27f265db60fcf5cc8a',NULL,'Promoting quality health care and education to marginalized section. The initiative cares for the elderly and sick through Hospitals, nursing homes, maternity homes, and other public healthcare facilities. Additionally, it gave grants, presents, or other forms of support to the needy, destitute, orphans, widows, and underprivileged children who needed help paying for their education.Area of Implementation: Assam, Gujarat, Uttrakhand & Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Promoting%20quality%20health%20care%20and%20education%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(625,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=SAMHITA-%20Integrated%20Rehabilitation%20Center%20for%20Children%20with','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'595f26cc5b2b12d618b850256ba691c0','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'034f350c7114321f8b92b5ff42faa935',NULL,'SAMHITA- Integrated Rehabilitation Center for Children with Developmental Delays A patient-centred rehabilitation centre for the delivery of multispecialty primary care for children with development delays from middle and low socio-economic backgrounds. The developmental delays include a general and systemic examination, including plotting growth centiles, hearing and vision assessment, baseline blood tests if deemed necessary, referral to a developmental paediatrician, and counselling the parents.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=SAMHITA-%20Integrated%20Rehabilitation%20Center%20for%20Children%20with',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(626,'CSR Initiative: Hospital Clowning & Creative Therapy Workshops Creative Therapy Workshops for children und','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Hospital%20Clowning%20%26%20Creative%20Therapy%20Workshops%20Creative','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e997494552c9b9f984b4495acd7a7136','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'4016910f18313d73760098e8d25e09d6',NULL,'Hospital Clowning & Creative Therapy Workshops Creative Therapy Workshops for children undergoing chemotherapy for cancer and terminally ill children in Children’s Government Hospital, Egmore. It imparts laughter Therapy which helps long-term patients, caregivers, hospital staff, Nurses and Doctors with mental well-being and reduces pain medication.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Hospital%20Clowning%20%26%20Creative%20Therapy%20Workshops%20Creative',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(627,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=CHOLA%20%E2%80%93%20Arogyasarthy%20Truck%20drivers%20suffer%20from','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2203e8305e509a65786f7bd8bbfc8dca','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'ff24c3b763343e984a99e920a324db16',NULL,'CHOLA – Arogyasarthy Truck drivers suffer from many lifestyle-related health problems like diabetes, blood pressure, anemia and other gastric related ailments. The project aims at providing free primary health care services to truck drivers for their overall health & well-being. The mobile medical van also have provisions for giving physiotherapy treatment to the drivers for their bodily pain issues like backaches, joint, muscle and neck pains.Area of Implementation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=CHOLA%20%E2%80%93%20Arogyasarthy%20Truck%20drivers%20suffer%20from',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(628,'CSR Initiative: Action for Rural Rejuvenation Mobile Health Clinics (MHC) and Isha Rural Health Clinics (I','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Action%20for%20Rural%20Rejuvenation%20Mobile%20Health%20Clinics','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'eff616dea16b7d58b05a777d0e99fa8e','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'59467d6cf85119e4b59e897afc532b8b',NULL,'Action for Rural Rejuvenation Mobile Health Clinics (MHC) and Isha Rural Health Clinics (IRHC), which provide primary healthcare to tribal and rural populations in the Thondamuthur Block in Coimbatore district and Panamarathupatti Taluk in Salem district.Area of Implementation: Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Action%20for%20Rural%20Rejuvenation%20Mobile%20Health%20Clinics',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(629,'CSR Initiative: Strengthening the Maternal Health Maternal Deliveries and New Born care by providing free','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Strengthening%20the%20Maternal%20Health%20Maternal%20Deliveries%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fb2ae4d246592ab9fb77cb85b9004f7e','COMP_TOP200_047',NULL,'a4dbe64b07518675e7b52c7e9ee81288',NULL,'Strengthening the Maternal Health Maternal Deliveries and New Born care by providing free-of-cost services to women from Commercial Vehicle Crew Members (CVCMs). Sri Sathya Sai Sanjeevani Mother & Child Hospital (Mamatva) in a program of 9 months where pregnant mothers get access to safe institutional deliveries and essential medical services. This will reduce the neonatal and newborn mortality rate, reduce the maternal mortality and morbidity rate.Area of Implementation: Chhattisgarh, Haryana, Maharashtra.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cholamandalam.com/community-relations#:~:text=Strengthening%20the%20Maternal%20Health%20Maternal%20Deliveries%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:57.088086','{}'),(630,'CSR Initiative: Our CSR programs are carried out as a blended activity along with business','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://