’ New Power business segment, launching March 8, 2023','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.cummins.com/en-in/meet-accelera#:~:text=Accelera%20is%20the%20new%20brand%20for%20Cummins%E2%80%99','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'26aa89febe1dcb14ea8fe8536ac5f6ce','COMP_TOP200_048',NULL,'fa5de6db236e95a97c93d6d1ea240684',NULL,'Accelera is the new brand for Cummins’ New Power business segment, launching March 8, 2023. Accelera is an energy technology leader committed to securing a sustainable future for the industries that keep the world running. A diverse portfolio of zero-emissions solutions includes battery systems, fuel cells, ePowertrain systems and electrolyzers.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:48.305988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:48.305988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:48.305988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.cummins.com/en-in/meet-accelera#:~:text=Accelera%20is%20the%20new%20brand%20for%20Cummins%E2%80%99',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:48.305988','{}'),(637,'CSR Initiative: HMIF provides apprenticeship training to over 2500+ youth at its manufacturing facility in','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=HMIF%20provides%20apprenticeship%20training%20to%20over%202500%2B','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4d8738f805ca0a313adb675d93cc642d','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'0a983e9d3b43df4a206c7c8689cb00d3',NULL,'HMIF provides apprenticeship training to over 2500+ youth at its manufacturing facility in India. The initiative focuses on enhancing vocational education and industry-aligned skill development, particularly in the automotive sector. Along with this we are also empowering underserved youth, including women, through structured driver training and employment opportunities across 5 states through our Driver Training Program – Drive4Progress',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=HMIF%20provides%20apprenticeship%20training%20to%20over%202500%2B',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(638,'CSR Initiative: Vidya Vahini delivers holistic education through mobile science laboratories, bringing lea','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Vidya%20Vahini%20delivers%20holistic%20education%20through%20mobile','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d56642ff0f393b21c5e7b983e4a96f12','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'dec2a67fe7171c132991d40a030dd90c',NULL,'Vidya Vahini delivers holistic education through mobile science laboratories, bringing learning to students’ doorsteps. The curriculum emphasises creative learning in physics, chemistry, and biology, supported by hands-on science experiments and teacher training for enhanced educational outcomes.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Vidya%20Vahini%20delivers%20holistic%20education%20through%20mobile',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(639,'CSR Initiative: It also drives digital financial literacy, empowering beneficiaries with essential financi','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=It%20also%20drives%20digital%20financial%20literacy%2C%20empowering','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5df7c3fd34aa1d11c178a8df0451bad8','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'c75db75f49eee64dcb24afb3d6d9659f',NULL,'It also drives digital financial literacy, empowering beneficiaries with essential financial skills.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=It%20also%20drives%20digital%20financial%20literacy%2C%20empowering',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(640,'CSR Initiative: Samarth is Hyundai\'s initiative to empower individuals with disabilities and provide them ','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Samarth%20is%20Hyundai%27s%20initiative%20to%20empower%20individuals','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5c56829b72613e5c87e4af2c06e9755e','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'afa5999b5bd4ec988d50767f0540ed76',NULL,'Samarth is Hyundai\'s initiative to empower individuals with disabilities and provide them training, mobility support and social inclusion. The program opens pathways to independence, confidence and dignified livelihoods. Through technology, partnerships and product innovations and storytelling samarth brings innovative and accessible solutions to communities. It embodies Hyundai\'s spirit of fostering an inclusive and progressive future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Samarth%20is%20Hyundai%27s%20initiative%20to%20empower%20individuals',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(641,'CSR Initiative: Easy Roads is Hyundai Motor India Foundation’s integrated road safety initiative built on ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Easy%20Roads%20is%20Hyundai%20Motor%20India%20Foundation%E2%80%99s','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a234c3c64144b16e5e62bc872190ae04','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'3b96dbd4abc6abe51440ad1947a7f85e',NULL,'Easy Roads is Hyundai Motor India Foundation’s integrated road safety initiative built on the 4E framework—Engineering, Enforcement, Emergency, and Education. It enhances infrastructure in high-risk zones across Haryana, Tamil Nadu, and Maharashtra with smart upgrades like LED signals, solar blinkers, Solar Street lights etc.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Easy%20Roads%20is%20Hyundai%20Motor%20India%20Foundation%E2%80%99s',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(642,'CSR Initiative: Sparsh Sanjeevani is a technology driven healthcare initiative that delivers primary medic','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Sparsh%20Sanjeevani%20is%20a%20technology%20driven%20healthcare','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4a0194a7f2964c33442656e4940f5bf0','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'a1d65d9fa5e981370f39f5d83a82964d',NULL,'Sparsh Sanjeevani is a technology driven healthcare initiative that delivers primary medical services to underserved communities through mobile units and telemedicine centres. By integrating digital tools, it ensures affordable healthcare access to over 13.5 lakh people across 16 states, through 52 clinics and 10 mobile medical units.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Sparsh%20Sanjeevani%20is%20a%20technology%20driven%20healthcare',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(643,'CSR Initiative: Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in co','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20Hope%20for%20Cancer%20is%20a%20pioneering','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8a57af0bcc69eda042d5d1ab1a0cf32c','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'0cc8dd27f01c767860f8dea250abc74a',NULL,'Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in collaboration with IIT Madras, focused on transforming pediatric cancer care through genomic-led research. It aims to improve diagnosis and treatment of childhood cancers like leukemia and lymphoma by establishing India’s first community-based Cancer Tissue Biobank and the Hyundai Centre for Cancer Genomics. The initiative supports the development of a national childhood cancer genome database, enabling personalized care and advancing scientific understanding. By combining innovation with social impact, Hyundai Hope for Cancer is helping build a more inclusive and effective pediatric oncology ecosystem in India.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20Hope%20for%20Cancer%20is%20a%20pioneering',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(644,'CSR Initiative: Through our healthcare initiatives we envision on delivering inclusive health solutions th','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Through%20our%20healthcare%20initiatives%20we%20envision%20on','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c67866bc492f69d59b899340b1dc844f','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'0c84701d128c0cfe88dec8a190719837',NULL,'Through our healthcare initiatives we envision on delivering inclusive health solutions that bridge geographic and social gaps in access to care.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Through%20our%20healthcare%20initiatives%20we%20envision%20on',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(645,'CSR Initiative: EcoGram complements Hyundai’s broader environmental strategy, serving as a live demonstrat','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=EcoGram%20complements%20Hyundai%E2%80%99s%20broader%20environmental%20strategy%2C%20serving','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'850e031dc85538416de790bf55f47ed6','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'502180e4c9a41504607a25ab1d967b27',NULL,'EcoGram complements Hyundai’s broader environmental strategy, serving as a live demonstration of how innovation, community engagement, and sustainability can work together to build cleaner, greener urban ecosystems.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=EcoGram%20complements%20Hyundai%E2%80%99s%20broader%20environmental%20strategy%2C%20serving',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(646,'CSR Initiative: Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF)','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20IONIQ%20Forest%20is%20a%20flagship%20initiative','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'47be8f0affe28131c71acf657592952a','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'9f70b7707462b9433d5b0c7d4bc7874a',NULL,'Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF), dedicated to fostering ecological balance and expanding green cover across urban and rural landscapes. Key efforts include converting 12.6 acres of land near the Irungattukottai plant into green space, implementing agroforestry programs in Andhra Pradesh that have significantly improved tribal farmland productivity—demonstrating a scalable model for sustainable agriculture—and establishing one of the largest urban forests in Maharashtra, with 90.5 acres of land in Dange Chowk, Pune, where over 1 million trees have been planted using the Miyawaki method by 2026',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20IONIQ%20Forest%20is%20a%20flagship%20initiative',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(647,'CSR Initiative: At Hyundai, environmental responsibility is a core priority','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=At%20Hyundai%2C%20environmental%20responsibility%20is%20a%20core','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6e44648cc0f1a4a282ca70bc72b3a9c6','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'d5ad3ac3337e867796da81ed0613c00a',NULL,'At Hyundai, environmental responsibility is a core priority. In line with this commitment, we have made significant efforts with focus on key areas such as water management and conservation, community plantations, waste management, and upcycling.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=At%20Hyundai%2C%20environmental%20responsibility%20is%20a%20core',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:47.032535','{}'),(648,'CSR Initiative: On a path to achieving ‘Progress for Humanity’, Hyundai Motor India Foundati