L,'https://trentlimited.com/pages/overview-new#:~:text=Environmental%20protection%20is%20fundamental%20to%20the%20ethos','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0ddb8c6fcc06ddd2cc85fcc2f64d3c06','COMP_TOP200_046',NULL,'1b28ca84415b02caefc6e517dbdf6fb0',NULL,'Environmental protection is fundamental to the ethos of the Tata Group and is deeply ingrained in our pledge to craft our brands with responsibility.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://trentlimited.com/pages/overview-new#:~:text=Environmental%20protection%20is%20fundamental%20to%20the%20ethos',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323','{}'),(655,'CSR Initiative: Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) is an integral part of our culture','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://trentlimited.com/pages/csr-philosophy#:~:text=Corporate%20Social%20Responsibility%20%28CSR%29%20is%20an%20integral','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'529b0d64d5ab9340ac674b5f4d5767aa','COMP_TOP200_046',NULL,'746415ca8785c8b3706326a806df28f0',NULL,'Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) is an integral part of our culture. The Company strongly believes in the Tata ethos that “what comes from the community should go back many times”. One of the key features of our CSR projects is their focus on a participatory and collaborative approach with the community. The Company continues to emphasize the implementation of the key areas denoted and chosen for its sustainability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://trentlimited.com/pages/csr-philosophy#:~:text=Corporate%20Social%20Responsibility%20%28CSR%29%20is%20an%20integral',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:05.233323','{}'),(656,'CSR Initiative: Torrent Pharma is committed towards “Not just healthcare but lifecare”','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.torrentpharma.com/ourstory/overview/#:~:text=Torrent%20Pharma%20is%20committed%20towards%20%E2%80%9CNot%20just','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ae6a220c38469e3489a73eafeb2d674b','COMP_TOP200_045',NULL,'63f220f92727a56080668c33a3e9f3fc',NULL,'Torrent Pharma is committed towards “Not just healthcare but lifecare”.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.torrentpharma.com/ourstory/overview/#:~:text=Torrent%20Pharma%20is%20committed%20towards%20%E2%80%9CNot%20just',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605','{}'),(657,'CSR Initiative: The acquisition of Elder Pharma\'s Indian branded business in 2014, Dermaceutical business ','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.torrentpharma.com/ourstory/overview/#:~:text=The%20acquisition%20of%20Elder%20Pharma%27s%20Indian%20branded','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'15523b918e9b17588dec9febed421ae3','COMP_TOP200_045',NULL,'036850cb993df8750619c17199fa35f4',NULL,'The acquisition of Elder Pharma\'s Indian branded business in 2014, Dermaceutical business of Zyg Pharma in 2015, API plant of Glochem Industries in 2016, women healthcare brands from Novartis, Unichem\'s Indian branded business along with its Sikkim Plant in 2017 and Curatio in 2022 strengthened Torrent Pharma\'s position in the Indian Pharma market.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.torrentpharma.com/ourstory/overview/#:~:text=The%20acquisition%20of%20Elder%20Pharma%27s%20Indian%20branded',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:57.978605','{}'),(658