priate technical and organizational measures to protect your information against accidental loss, destruction or alteration, unauthorized disclosure or access, or unlawful destruction. The Internet, however, cannot be guaranteed to be 100% secure, and we cannot ensure the security of any personal information provided to us.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.is%20committed%20to%20helping',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(686,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.stores%20your%20personal%20information','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0a3cc7d5f9b796201c76792eb709aed0','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'9dae8810221546dcbf5bed0ecf53d5ed',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.stores your personal information for as long as you use the Services, and no longer than is necessary for the purposes for which the information was collected, or for which it is legitimately further processed. Thereafter, Solar Industries India Ltd.retains personal information for a period of time set forth in its corporate retention schedules. In the case of organizational Services data, Solar Industries India Ltd.retains personal information according to the timeframes set forth in relevant customer agreements, or in lieu of an agreement, for as long as a legitimate business purpose exists.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.stores%20your%20personal%20information',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(687,'CSR Initiative: Personal information that Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Personal%20information%20that%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.processes','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'19710cea9c111223a8a5bb1b467035df','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'3e61af34656c00f8f1b85e95b67e8ed1',NULL,'Personal information that Solar Industries India Ltd.processes is transferred to, and stored and processed in, the United States or any other country in which Solar Industries India Ltd.or its affiliates or subcontractors maintain facilities. The data protection laws in these countries are different from, and could be less stringent than, those in your country of residence. We take steps to ensure that the data we collect under this Statement is processed according to the provisions of this Statement and the requirements of applicable law wherever the data is located.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Personal%20information%20that%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.processes',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(688,'CSR Initiative: Certain Services must disclose information to third parties assisting us in processing a t','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Certain%20Services%20must%20disclose%20information%20to%20third','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'44c3dbdf043d4787b7fe0d6154814f84','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'7a5d5ad85fa2e329c74c41a726c89921',NULL,'Certain Services must disclose information to third parties assisting us in processing a transaction requested by you (e.g., credit card service providers). In addition, Solar Industries India Ltd.hires service providers to perform work on its behalf. Any such service providers will be permitted to obtain data from the Services only to deliver the services Solar Industries India Ltd.has retained them to provide and will be prohibited from using data for any other purpose. Solar Industries India Ltd.discloses personal information to these service providers for the purposes identified in Collection and use of personal information, including to send promotional communications to you via email, postal mail, fax, SMS and phone as permitted by local law and subject to your contact preferences. In order to cooperate with legitimate governmental requests, subpoenas, or court orders, to protect Solar Industries India Ltd.and/or Boeing\'s systems and customers, to establish, protect, or exercise our legal rights or defend against legal claims, or to ensure the integrity and operation of Solar Industries India Ltd.and/or Solar Industries India Ltd.business and systems, Solar Industries India Ltd.accesses and discloses the necessary and appropriate information under the circumstances.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Certain%20Services%20must%20disclose%20information%20to%20third',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(689,'CSR Initiative: When you provide personal information to Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=When%20you%20provide%20personal%20information%20to%20Solar','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3a709eebfee2b8f14af745cbb1f60089','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'fe54ac52cf071c3d859dae1cf98f5d82',NULL,'When you provide personal information to Solar Industries India Ltd.or its entities and brands, we share that information with other Solar Industries India Ltd.entities and brands to provide a more unified customer experience.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=When%20you%20provide%20personal%20information%20to%20Solar',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(690,'CSR Initiative: | Support Data | Information we collect when you contact or engage Solar Industries India ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Support%20Data%20%7C%20Information%20we%20collect','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f98aa4f999376c4b935869e42159eb61','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'97aa6b48742812024769b4072209145d',NULL,'| Support Data | Information we collect when you contact or engage Solar Industries India Ltd.for support. It includes information you submit in a support request, or about the condition of the device and the app where an error may have occurred, including error-tracking files. We use Support Data to resolve your support incident. In addition to using Support Data to resolve your support incident, we also use it to operate, improve and personalize the products and services we offer. Phone conversations, online chat sessions, or remote troubleshooting sessions with support professionals are recorded and/or monitored. Following a support incident, we typically send you a survey about your experience. |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Support%20Data%20%7C%20Information%20we%20collect',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(691,'CSR Initiative: | Payment Data | Includes payment instrument number (e','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Payment%20Data%20%7C%20Includes%20payment%20instrument','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'39ea9848ffd949f408e5f916ec9d0988','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'d7be55d41066fa80de47dace35e72e0d',NULL,'| Payment Data | Includes payment instrument number (e.g., credit card), name and billing address, the security code associated with the payment instrument, organizational tax ID, and other financial data. Organizations that make purchases will be asked to provide Payment Data, which we use to complete transactions, as well as to detect and prevent fraud. When you provide Payment Data online, we will store that data to help you complete future transactions. You can update or remove Payment Data associated with your organization’s account by logging in to individual Services or by contacting customer support. After you close an account or remove Payment Data, however, Solar Industries India Ltd.will retain that information for as long as reasonably necessary to complete transactions, to comply with Boeing’s legal and reporting requirements, and to detect and prevent fraud. |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Payment%20Data%20%7C%20Includes%20payment%20instrument',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(692,'CSR Initiative: | Account Data | Information provided to Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Account%20Data%20%7C%20Information%20provided%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c891b99952edbd9ac88862efe4b2bf02','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'59834314fda85894e580f3f0472e7ad1',NULL,'| Account Data | Information provided to Solar Industries India Ltd.during sign-up, purchase, or administration of the organizational Services. Account Data includes the names, addresses, phone numbers, and email addresses you provide, as well as aggregated usage information related to your organization’s accounts and administrative data. We use Account Data to provide the Services, complete transactions, service the account, and detect and prevent fraud. We use Account Data to contact your organization to provide information about accounts, subscriptions, billing, and updates to the Services, including information about new features, security or other technical issues. We also contact your organization regarding government or other third-party inquiries we receive regarding its use of the Services. You or your organization will not be able to unsubscribe from these non-promotional communications. Subject to contact preferences, we also send promotional communications about our products and services. You can manage your contact preferences in your account profile or by contacting your Solar Industries India Ltd.sales representative. With limited exceptions, Solar Industries India Ltd.processes Account Data under the direction of its organizational customers, and has no direct control or ownership of the personal data it processes. The organizations are responsible for complying with any regulations or laws that require providing notice, disclosure and/or obtaining consent prior to transferring Account Data to Solar Industries India Ltd.for processing purposes. We share Account Data or Payment Data with third parties for purposes of fraud prevention, to process payment transactions, or to enable a requested purchase, subscription, or use of a third-party offering. |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Account%20Data%20%7C%20Information%20provided%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(693,'CSR Initiative: | Customer Data | Data, including traveler profiles, maintenance records, and other text o','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Customer%20Data%20%7C%20Data%2C%20including%20traveler','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1055ffeea40f10822efcc2bf47b5ea90','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'537b650a59ecfee1385259ee4a3f2be3',NULL,'| Customer Data | Data, including traveler profiles, maintenance records, and other text or image files provided to Solar Industries India Ltd.by you or your organization through use of our Services. Customer Data is used to provide the Services, including compatible related purposes. For example, we use Customer Data to provide a personalized experience, improve service reliability, combat spam or other malware, or to improve features and functionality of the Services. Solar Industries India Ltd.processes Customer Data under the direction of organizational customers, and has no direct control or ownership of the Customer Data it processes. The organizations are responsible for complying with any regulations or laws that require providing notice, disclosure and/or obtaining consent prior to transferring Customer Data to Solar Industries India Ltd.for processing purposes. We will not disclose Customer Data outside of Solar Industries India Ltd.except as a customer directs, as described here or in relevant agreement(s), as required by law, or in response to legitimate governmental requests. Should law enforcement contact Solar Industries India Ltd.with a lawful demand for Customer Data, Solar Industries India Ltd.will attempt to redirect the law enforcement agency to request that data directly from the organizational customer. In support of the above, Solar Industries India Ltd.provides basic organizational contact information to the third party. |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Customer%20Data%20%7C%20Data%2C%20including%20traveler',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(694,'CSR Initiative: Many Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Many%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services%20are%20intended','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e7f8e4c8a720430a3601257b88da60bd','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'1e0a08abd7863c56fb0788daffb16c62',NULL,'Many Solar Industries India Ltd.Services are intended for use by organizations. If you interact with our Services through an account provided by your organization, the organization typically administers your Services account, and controls and accesses your data, including the contents of files stored on our Services. Solar Industries India Ltd.is not responsible for the privacy or security practices of organizational customers, which differ from those set forth in this Statement, as they are administered by these organizations. The types of data processed by our Services include the following:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Many%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services%20are%20intended',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(695,'CSR Initiative: Data collected from a particular browser, app, or device can be used with a linked compute','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Data%20collected%20from%20a%20particular%20browser%2C%20app%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2ab26c35a0f3441dc902cb2eeabbdfc0','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'6f52392fb71c8d46965e4fd5045d14ed',NULL,'Data collected from a particular browser, app, or device can be used with a linked computer or device. For example, we or our third-party service providers display ads to you on your laptop or other device based on the fact that you visited Solar Industries India Ltd.Services on your smartphone. You can opt out of cross-device tracking on each of your browsers and devices by using the links provided above (see Interest-based advertising). Please note that the opt-out will apply only to the specific browser or device from which you opt out, and you need to opt out separately on all of your browsers and devices.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Data%20collected%20from%20a%20particular%20browser%2C%20app%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(696,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.also%20enables%20cookies%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'536b32a2e2c96891966774759c15fe8c','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'c0807854d2495af10ce7f9b05398e40c',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.also enables cookies and third-party tracking mechanisms to collect your information for use in interest-based advertising. For example, third parties use the fact that you visited our Services to target online ads for Solar Industries India Ltd.Services to you on non-Solar Industries India Ltd.websites. In addition, our third-party advertising networks use information about your use of our Services to help target non-Solar Industries India Ltd.advertisements based on your online behavior in general. Learn more about interest-based advertising, or opt out of the practice, by visiting the following links:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.also%20enables%20cookies%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(697,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services%20often%20contain%20cookies','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4fe2becb4342937bba851449a5d1e7f9','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'8c6ab1de20fde27a02389215a42d347a',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.Services often contain cookies or similar technologies from third-party providers that help us compile statistics about the effectiveness of our promotional campaigns, perform analytics, enable social networking features, and other operations. These technologies enable the third-party providers to set or read their own cookies or other identifiers on your device, through which they can collect information about your online activities across the Services and other, unaffiliated devices, applications, websites, or services. You can opt out of data collection or use by some of these third-party providers by visiting the following links:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services%20often%20contain%20cookies',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(698,'CSR Initiative: | _ga | Records a particular ID used to come up with data about website usage by the user','CSR Project Partnership','E