00_044',NULL,'9dc4f9cc71160039eccd3d00f4fc04bd',NULL,'| Advertising and Remarketing | These cookies are used to understand and deliver ads, make them more relevant to you, and analyze the effectiveness of our advertising programs. They use the fact that you visited our Services to target online ads for Solar Industries India Ltd.Services to you on non-Solar Industries India Ltd.websites. Some of these cookies are placed on your device by a third party with which we contract to provide certain services. Blocking or deleting these cookies will not impact Service functionality. For details and to opt out, see Interest-based advertising. |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Advertising%20and%20Remarketing%20%7C%20These%20cookies',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(701,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.uses%2C%20and%20permits%20service','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f9218631f058c79c5f78ccd1da71147b','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'53823de9ceb5f6c79e47bf029371be5d',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.uses, and permits service providers to use, tracking scripts or \"tracers\" and web beacons that recognize a unique identifier from a cookie placed on your device by another website. For example, we use a tracer to determine whether you visit our pages after visiting a site where we placed a banner ad. We also use these technologies to compile information about your website usage and your interaction with email or other communications, to measure performance, and to provide content and ads that are more relevant to you. A web beacon is typically a transparent graphic image that can be embedded in online content, videos, and emails, and can allow a server to read certain types of information from your device, know when you have viewed the beacon, and the IP address of your device. For example, we include web beacons in our promotional email messages or newsletters to determine whether our messages have been opened or interacted with and whether our mailing tools are working properly.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.uses%2C%20and%20permits%20service',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(702,'CSR Initiative: Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and und','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Cookies%20are%20currently%20the%20best%20way%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'16c5539c6d9a2ffb2e8a9be72dbe5f91','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'fd707c07b00e58389aaaa93c21bb644d',NULL,'Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and understand how they navigate our Services. Cookies are small data files placed on your device by a website when you visit. Solar Industries India Ltd.uses cookies set by us or other companies for tracking purposes or to make our Services easier to use and tailored for individual users. Like many websites, we do not currently respond to “do not track” browser headers except where legally required. But with most Web browsers, you can take steps to limit tracking by erasing cookies from your device and by setting your browser to block all cookies or warn you before a cookie is stored. Cookies offer enhanced functionality to the user, but whether you allow a cookie to be placed on your device is up to you.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Cookies%20are%20currently%20the%20best%20way%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(703,'CSR Initiative: When you visit Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=When%20you%20visit%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c280f8b8e537763f99cd268a1d77d7a3','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'e0d537cd06f19a7db3d215b9699ed847',NULL,'When you visit Solar Industries India Ltd.Services and you have not otherwise identified yourself (e.g., via registration with a Solar Industries India Ltd.Service), our web servers automatically recognize your domain name, but not your e-mail address. We also collect firmographic information about your company, if you are visiting Solar Industries India Ltd.Services from your company domain. We collect the domain name and monitor general site use and traffic patterns to improve the Services that we offer.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=When%20you%20visit%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(704,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.uses%20various%20digital%20analytics','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1ede892250763a5c7f4e21b70a532728','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'013aeff6c64a880d0ffacac7c8b3a076',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.uses various digital analytics tools to collect data for metrics, fraud prevention, and service improvement purposes and to customize the content and layout of our pages for each individual visitor. Each time you visit Solar Industries India Ltd.Services, we may automatically collect certain types of information. Some examples of information automatically collected are as follows:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.uses%20various%20digital%20analytics',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(705,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.applications%20use%20geolocation%20features','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a146961a5a77b6df120e3678f89f0ba5','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'58bfae7fe60298f3862553715d3ce1cf',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.applications use geolocation features (GPS or network-based) to support your use of location-based tools such as airport/map views, city code searches and other features, as well as to improve Solar Industries India Ltd.applications. When you use Solar Industries India Ltd.Services, we collect and process information about your pinpointed location, after obtaining consent as required by local law. We use various technologies to determine location, including IP address, GPS, and other sensors that, for example, provide us with information on nearby devices, Wi-Fi access points, and cell towers. Location data is used in accordance with Collection and use of personal information, and disclosed in accordance with Disclosure of personal information.You are able to withdraw your permission for Solar Industries India Ltd.to acquire pinpointed location information from your device through your device settings, although Solar Industries India Ltd.does not control this process. If your device is owned by your organization, your ability to withdraw your permission for pinpointing location information will depend on your organization’s policies.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.applications%20use%20geolocation%20features',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(706,'CSR Initiative: You can choose to follow our brands and companies on social media, or log in to some Solar','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=You%20can%20choose%20to%20follow%20our%20brands','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6f788dbae3a09d7225e79ca6fa9fabf2','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'80c62885d1def0991a783529e4a78dac',NULL,'You can choose to follow our brands and companies on social media, or log in to some Solar Industries India Ltd.Services using social media account credentials. Your use of social media features could result in the collection or sharing of information about you, depending on the feature. The details we receive depends on your social network account privacy settings. We encourage you to review the privacy practices and settings of the social media sites you use to make sure you understand the personal information that may be collected, used, and shared by those sites.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=You%20can%20choose%20to%20follow%20our%20brands',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(707,'CSR Initiative: We and our service providers also use the information you provide to send you communicatio','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=We%20and%20our%20service%20providers%20also%20use','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'399fdf53e340444d300930532405fdbd','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'e0cdbca1074cf198940bca60c3fa7693',NULL,'We and our service providers also use the information you provide to send you communications, including promotional messages about Solar Industries India Ltd.and topics of interest, via email, postal mail, fax, SMS and phone, as permitted by local law and subject to your contact preferences. Although we hope you will find our promotional communications of interest, you are able to opt out of receiving them by following the instructions included in each communication.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=We%20and%20our%20service%20providers%20also%20use',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(708,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.%20uses%20your%20personal','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7aca62b3e09521a9f0157b4681b1e7e1','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'dbd0901dcb7ac71f224e0dc111ec34b6',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd. uses your personal information in a variety of ways, depending on how you interact with Solar Industries India Ltd., including to:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.%20uses%20your%20personal',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(709,'CSR Initiative: Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.%20collect%20personal%20information','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'58061d29f93e2029216ba625afe2afa5','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'11f19bc32047e2990139103aeb8fdcb9',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd. collect personal information from and about individuals for a variety of purposes. In some cases, Solar Industries India Ltd. requests personal information from you, or from your employer in the case of organizational Services. In other cases, we obtain personal information by noting how you and the devices you use interact with our Services. Examples of personal information include:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.%20collect%20personal%20information',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(710,'CSR Initiative: For your convenience, Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=For%20your%20convenience%2C%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cf3cb40810ea3ac8e6705eb1f6921fed','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'11418d2945a67c7d071f9cacb3d6bb3a',NULL,'For your convenience, Solar Industries India Ltd. Services enable contact with the respective departments of solar Industries India Ltd. Via email. online services from other entities with different privacy practices, and the personal data collected in those instances will be governed by the respective privacy policies or statements of those other entities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=For%20your%20convenience%2C%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(711,'CSR Initiative: This Statement applies to visitors and users of Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=This%20Statement%20applies%20to%20visitors%20and%20users','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'51a11aa2b78402336393284987a2cc50','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'5e604b1acc05135ba1baa0f214078a04',NULL,'This Statement applies to visitors and users of Solar Industries India Ltd. Services that link to this Statement. Some of our services adopt different privacy statements, or privacy notices that supplement this Statement, to better fit transactions taking place on those Solar Industries India Ltd. Services or in accordance with local privacy laws. If a Service or brand has its own privacy statement or a supplementary notice, the provisions of that statement or supplementary notice will take priority if conflicting with this Statement.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=This%20Statement%20applies%20to%20visitors%20and%20users',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(712,'CSR Initiative: Thank you for reviewing the Solar Industries India Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Thank%20you%20for%20reviewing%20the%20Solar%20Industries','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c433a2a896fd2b62d9e4b9c364a26c21','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'e04479f2a0f1d9d0ca15ef4e512d3fe5',NULL,'Thank you for reviewing the Solar Industries India Ltd. and Cookie Statement (“Statement”). The Solar Industries India Ltd. and its group of companies, which use brands including, but not limited to (collectively “Solar Industries India Ltd.”) are sensitive to the issue of confidentiality in online interactions and are committed to protecting individual privacy across our range of websites, mobile applications, products, solutions, and services (collectively our \"Services\").',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Thank%20you%20for%20reviewing%20the%20Solar%20Industries',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(713,'CSR Initiative: Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our prod','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20environmental%20priorities%20are%20an%20integral%20part','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3ccc4fb65cb7993f4808a2c40ed022a5','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'b0f9f5f23a0848cba2e878e692e89708',NULL,'Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our product creation, processes and policies as we endeavour to shape a better future together. Remaining steadfast in our commitment to sustainability, we invest prudently in eco-friendly technologies, lowering resource dependence and reducing our environmental impact. We monitor climate change, strive hard to curb greenhouse gas emissions and employ innovative energy-saving solutions. We collaborate with our value chain partners to implement sustainable solutions throughout our value chain.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.solargroup.com/sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20environmental%20priorities%20are%20an%20integral%20part',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{}'),(714,'CSR Initiative: Motherson is proud to support the principles of the United Nations Global Compact across h','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=Motherson%20is%20proud%20to%20support%20the%20principles','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4d3ac76f50e0b8fbd035ce2be1ddf3bc','COMP_TOP200_042',NULL,'baabdbd70cb21f3151d348b5a1199620',NULL,'Motherson is proud to support the principles of the United Nations Global Compact across human rights, labour standards, environmental responsibility and anti-corruption. This commitment is embedded in the way we operate, as a core part of how we do business. It reflects the shared values of our people and our belief in long-term, responsible growth. By integrating these principles into our daily decisions and maintaining open dialogue with our stakeholders, we aim to contribute meaningfully to a more sustainable and transparent global economy.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=Motherson%20is%20proud%20to%20support%20the%20principles',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481','{}'),(715,'CSR Initiative: This commitment goes beyond compliance','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=This%20commitment%20goes%20beyond%20compliance%3B%20it%27s%20a','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'eff7e81d4d21b5c68690346960ff57f5','COMP_TOP200_042',NULL,'94d2a51d94cf5e2bf46d4a54a7de9d96',NULL,'This commitment goes beyond compliance; it\'s a shared responsibility across the people of Motherson. We understand that sustainable practices are vital for reducing our environmental impact, fostering innovation, and building resilience. Through ongoing engagement with stakeholders, we strive to create a future that benefits both our business and the communities we serve.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=This%20commitment%20goes%20beyond%20compliance%3B%20it%27s%20a',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481','{}'),(716,'CSR Initiative: At Motherson, sustainability is at the heart of everything we do','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=At%20Motherson%2C%20sustainability%20is%20at%20the%20heart','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'079787d9d1c8a65008385e67c67aa221','COMP_TOP200_042',NULL,'fc0abd96963439cdab684e7ca9d3a4cd',NULL,'At Motherson, sustainability is at the heart of everything we do. Our vision is to be a globally preferred sustainable solutions provider, embedding sustainability into every aspect of our operations—from managing energy and water to engaging with suppliers and preserving biodiversity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=At%20Motherson%2C%20sustainability%20is%20at%20the%20heart',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481','{}'),(717,'CSR Initiative: Planet focuses on minimising environmental impact through efforts like reducing emissions,','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=Planet%20focuses%20on%20minimising%20environmental%20impact%20through','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5dc46e06f4c1edc331971ea987065dfe','COMP_TOP200_042',NULL,'8ac3a061eee7500b08379beb3e647bfd',NULL,'Planet focuses on minimising environmental impact through efforts like reducing emissions, conserving resources, managing waste, and protecting biodiversity for a sustainable future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=Planet%20focuses%20on%20minimising%20environmental%20impact%20through',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481','{}'),(718,'CSR Initiative: In an increasingly complex global environment, sustainability remains central to how we op','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=In%20an%20increasingly%20complex%20global%20environment%2C%20sustainability','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'280875e63a193bda9ca5988124cd4c4d','COMP_TOP200_042',NULL,'d16b813d519214ecacf82c0ec3dc5cd0',NULL,'In an increasingly complex global environment, sustainability remains central to how we operate, invest and create long-term value. We are committed to balancing growth with responsibility, embedding sustainable practices into our business decisions and supporting a resilient future for all our stakeholders.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.motherson.com/company/sustainability-and-global-citizenship#:~:text=In%20an%20increasingly%20complex%20global%20environment%2C%20sustainability',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.716481','{}'),(719,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20We%20provide%20role-based%20access%20to%20Users','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b9bde335de3bdd8fa1b3c039cb4ab984','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'a7c4a93a6457f5c01ff6653f899def07',NULL,'- We provide role-based access to Users who need to login to our Websites information systems, data processing systems, secure data vaults, etc. strictly on need to have basis.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20We%20provide%20role-based%20access%20to%20Users',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878','{}'),(720,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Aadhaar%20number%20and%20any%20connected%20Aadhaar','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ab59868cfbd09f9296208a759eb639fe','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'fbd2d08809b897f49159312c0d51f730',NULL,'- Aadhaar number and any connected Aadhaar data is stored on separate and highly secure ‘data vault’ infrastructure by means of strong encryption and in a highly restricted network zone, as per UIDAI regulations. Aadhaar number and Aadhaar related information is not stored in any other operational systems/databases outside the secure data vault.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Aadhaar%20number%20an