//www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=7.%20Personal%20Information%20of%20beneficiaries/dependents/other%20individuals','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8f9c0929542171f238b5e29de0c9a9ef','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'8d3c86e08e9b0d0552d1d3c6dbcf9219',NULL,'7. Personal Information of beneficiaries/dependents/other individuals',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=7.%20Personal%20Information%20of%20beneficiaries/dependents/other%20individuals',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878','{}'),(724,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Other%20sensitive%20information%3A%20In%20certain%20cases%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'31946acb7742a540d6a8d8b51a55c43d','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'060c200ba1935b880a40f3866b387a2a',NULL,'- Other sensitive information: In certain cases, we may receive sensitive information about you for example, if you apply for insurance through a third-party marketing partner that is a professional, trade, political, religious or community organization. In addition, we may obtain information about your criminal record or civil litigation history in the process of preventing, detecting and investigating fraud. We may also obtain sensitive information if you voluntarily provide it to us (for example, if you express preferences regarding medical treatment based on your religious beliefs).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Other%20sensitive%20information%3A%20In%20certain%20cases%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878','{}'),(725,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Medical%20condition%20and%20health%20status%3A%20Current','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cfae67a63a3dc5a901eb64c46e202ecc','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'0ee69cdff044690f50b4eeb0595bf936',NULL,'- Medical condition and health status: Current or former physical or mental or medical condition; health status; injury or disability information; medical procedures performed; personal habits (for example, smoking or consumption of alcohol); prescription information; and medical history.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Medical%20condition%20and%20health%20status%3A%20Current',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878','{}'),(726,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20General%20identification%2C%20personal%20and%20contact%20information%3AYour','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6d1f96e3728623a41130f02c0d09d4fc','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'329bf20aa2d255b8193b975e2854c302',NULL,'- General identification, personal and contact information:Your name; address; e-mail and telephone details; gender; occupation; avocation; marital status; family status; date of birth; passwords on our systems; educational background; physical attribute s; activity records, such as driving records; photos; employment history, skills and experience; professional licenses and affiliations; relationship to the policyholder, insured or claimant; and date and cause of death, injury or disability. Information you provide: In order to access certain Services offered on the website, you must register and create an account. Typically, we request registration information such as your name, email address, policy number (if applicable), and other details that ou voluntarily supply to enable us to personally identify you. To create and maintain your online account, you will need this information. You can promptly amend or remove information that has changed if it was provided during this registration, unless it is required for legal or legitimate business objectives. On the other hand, maintaining an audit trail may need that we preserve a copy or log of this data.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20General%20identification%2C%20personal%20and%20contact%20information%3AYour',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878','{}'),(727,'CSR Initiative: We believe meaningful progress begins with empathy, compassion, and a shared sense of resp','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20believe%20meaningful%20progress%20begins%20with%20empathy%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f991f8ce8fa04f7884659bb01b29377d','COMP_TOP200_040',NULL,'8ebb203a5543575ac58b1c893218a09f',NULL,'We believe meaningful progress begins with empathy, compassion, and a shared sense of responsibility toward people and communities. Through our corporate initiatives, we work to create long-term impact by strengthening communities, supporting education, strengthening healthcare, and caring for the environment. Each effort reflects our vision of a secure inclusive future where opportunity, dignity, and hope reach every life we touch with respect and responsibility.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.sbilife.co.in/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20believe%20meaningful%20progress%20begins%20with%20empathy%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:28.423878','{}'),(728,'CSR Initiative: All efforts are made to execute projects in an environment','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=All%20efforts%20are%20made%20to%20execute%20projects','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'81fb48b538e9d4d03bd6d03b4429a128','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'367408e2f7f4e8a7d534c444944a7250',NULL,'All efforts are made to execute projects in an environment-friendly & sustainable manner by avoiding forest land. In some cases where forest land is encountered, standard procedure for Forest Diversion is followed to obtain the Right of Way (RoW) for execution of the project and impact caused if any to environment is mitigated through Compensatory Afforestation as per the guidelines and directives from regulatory authorities as applicable.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=All%20efforts%20are%20made%20to%20execute%20projects',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474','{}'),(729,'CSR Initiative: At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%2C%20while','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b888b130a6fabd6f388b99d9254e167b','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'73ceb5adea5d4dcbd58b66942a7a40aa',NULL,'At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%2C%20while',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474','{}'),(730,'CSR Initiative: Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%20believes%20that','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c251439920addb32ba8636cb73528747','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'cf97a298c55f64bd124bcd65b336342c',NULL,'Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the ecosystem in which we operate. AESL has a ‘Biodiversity Policy’ signed by MD&CEO. One of the focus areas of the policy is to work towards achieving a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. AESL has also signed India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 17th July 2020. IBBI is a business led initiative with an objective to mainstream biodiversity in Indian Businesses. AESL commits to conduct the business with no net loss to biodiversity and leave positive impact on the environment and surroundings of its operations by integrating the biodiversity aspects in management systems. Also, AESL is working towards assessing and mapping biodiversity at our operation sites to determine what level of biodiversity importance exists on the land and to identify the potential impacts of our operations on that biodiversity, if any.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%20believes%20that',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474','{}'),(731,'CSR Initiative: Adani Energy Solutions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply co','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20and%20its%20subsidiary%2C%20Adani','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b0e91e6d305331950b14030e1397a627','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'22770d6f3c9cb1f28597e9c073c9e900',NULL,'Adani Energy Solutions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply committed to the decarbonisation of power generation and to bringing green electricity to Mumbai residents.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20and%20its%20subsidiary%2C%20Adani',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474','{}'),(732,'CSR Initiative: While the energy we transmit helps support national economic growth and also improves qual','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=While%20the%20energy%20we%20transmit%20helps%20support','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5e62f00e6f478cafefc6fe2ac08fdba8','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'e30d350637d4829901df1154cff269cd',NULL,'While the energy we transmit helps support national economic growth and also improves quality of life for millions of people, we also aim to give back to society through our Corporate Social Responsibilities (CSR). Thus we strive to be a world-class operator as well as a responsible corporate citizen. Communities residing in the villages situated near substations, transmission lines and project area are key beneficiaries of our CSR activities. Our CSR mission is to play the role of a facilitator for the benefit of people without distinction of caste or community, sect or religion, class or creed – in the field of education, community health and promotion of social and economic welfare and upliftment of people in general.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=While%20the%20energy%20we%20transmit%20helps%20support',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474','{}'),(733,'CSR Initiative: Aligned to the Adani Group’s core philosophy “Nation Building” and “Growth with Goodness” ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Aligned%20to%20the%20Adani%20Group%E2%80%99s%20core%20philosophy','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'79b2169eed47bdfec2c093fa4fff3f78','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'ffc88b4ebd328d0738cf91612567697d',NULL,'Aligned to the Adani Group’s core philosophy “Nation Building” and “Growth with Goodness” we are adding sustainable value globally and contributing to energize our nation. In the pursuit of, we ensure high benchmarks bolster our ties with customers and business partners, positioning AESL as environmentally and socially sensitive market leader. In our pursuit of this vision, we aim to add value to all our businesses by delivering an outstanding performance. We believe that this focus will also deepen our relationships across six capital i.e. Financial, Manufactured, Natural, Human, Intellectual, and Social & Relationship capitals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Aligned%20to%20the%20Adani%20Group%E2%80%99s%20core%20philosophy',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:05.363474','{}'),(734,'CSR Initiative: We understand how to reframe the traditional tech stack of an IT department starting with ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.wipro.com/sustainability/services/wipro-sustainable-technology/#:~:text=We%20understand%20how%20to%20reframe%20the%20traditional','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a86f7ba98f129f8b5dd122fc2d239fbe','COMP_TOP200_038',NULL,'a3595ec20e51d8f842ade8a42c0f0014',NULL,'We understand how to reframe the traditional tech stack of an IT department starting with the importance of ingraining all sustainability initiatives in strategy. Direct impact can reduce redundancy and minimize unnecessary IT infrastructure while indirect impact will reduce environmental impact while also creating efficient IT infrastructure and optimizing asset lifecycle. From planning to execution, our experts will guide you through requirements and priorities, guiding principles, policies and standards, SDLC/methodology, and governance.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.wipro.com/sustainability/services/wipro-sustainable-technology/#:~:text=We%20understand%20how%20to%20reframe%20the%20traditional',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964','{}'),(735,'CSR Initiative: Wipro helps our clients transform business models, decarbonize value chains, and embark on','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.wipro.com/sustainability/#:~:text=Wipro%20helps%20our%20clients%20transform%20business%20models%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6f44571e428e0d575ea8701cdd185046','COMP_TOP200_038',NULL,'fee90d14a81daa4b327ba272376d61d1',NULL,'Wipro helps our clients transform business models, decarbonize value chains, and embark on a sustainable future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.wipro.com/sustainability/#:~:text=Wipro%20helps%20our%20clients%20transform%20business%20models%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:31:05.410964','{}'),(736,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Without%20in%20any%20way%20waiving%20any','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'69b399aa9987063883e387e9088eb542','COMP_TOP200_035',NULL,'23c21819e2e2a26c3da348e421700732',NULL,'- Without in any way waiving any of the EICHER MOTORS LIMITED\'s rights, you may download, print copy of this information on this site for your personal and non-commercial home use only, provided you do not delete or change any copyright, trademark or other proprietary notices. You are not authorise to distribute text or graphics to others, copy this information on any other server or modify or reuse text or graphics on this or any other system, without express written consent of EICHER MOTORS LIMITED.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20Without%20in%20any%20way%20waiving%20any',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303','{}'),(737,'CSR Initiative: Work started in 1996 by providing support to an initiative based in Rai Bareilly district ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=Work%20started%20in%201996%20by%20providing%20support','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f9d0bb2f5a56c08b29a9eaca739abe5e','COMP_TOP200_035',NULL,'44e6c34d758d8a2faae53297fbdbc9df',NULL,'Work started in 1996 by providing support to an initiative based in Rai Bareilly district in U.P. This project covered 63 schools and has Goodearth Education Foundation benefited about 15,000 children over a period of 4 years. In 1998, further efforts were initiated in Thane district (Maharashtra), Alwar district (Rajasthan) and Solan district (Himachal Pradesh) where in the first phase we are covering a total of approximately 90 schools and 9,000 children.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=Work%20started%20in%201996%20by%20providing%20support',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303','{}'),(738,'CSR Initiative: The work of the Foundation has, as its focus, interventions for improvement in quality of ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=The%20work%20of%20the%20Foundation%20has%2C%20as','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'aca5dcb06c7fcb822365fac867049ecc','COMP_TOP200_035',NULL,'08a5539984fdad686b2ab871c18bf7ad',NULL,'The work of the Foundation has, as its focus, interventions for improvement in quality of education initially in the government primary schools in rural areas.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=The%20work%20of%20the%20Foundation%20has%2C%20as',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303','{}'),(739,'CSR Initiative: This mission statement emerged from the deep desire among Founder members of the company t','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=This%20mission%20statement%20emerged%20from%20the%20deep','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'eb11b232d633737f224c5bdbbcc80705','COMP_TOP200_035',NULL,'757dbf224bd210ba0ed47d94355504d2',NULL,'This mission statement emerged from the deep desire among Founder members of the company to contribute to efforts in the field of education, which they believe is a key area for facilitating change and progress in India.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=This%20mission%20statement%20emerged%20from%20the%20deep',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303','{}'),(740,'CSR Initiative: Foundation set up by the Eicher Group of companies to implement its mission','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=Foundation%20set%20up%20by%20the%20Eicher%20Group','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'70f3c7133823005c7fe0ad6593804bf3','COMP_TOP200_035',NULL,'a4ceb8ebc1578676cb026505af84176d',NULL,'Foundation set up by the Eicher Group of companies to implement its mission: \"To educate India\'s children with a special emphasis on the girl child starting with primary education for the rural poor.\"',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.eicher.in/community-initiatives#:~:text=Foundation%20set%20up%20by%20the%20Eicher%20Group',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:46.528303','{}'),(741,'CSR Initiative: The project was introduced with the intent to reduce dropouts of girl students in schools ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=The%20project%20was%20introduced%20with%20the%20intent','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4645bc5eff150df87066189e74a22288','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'e943a963e6806843930c99b7293d0958',NULL,'The project was introduced with the intent to reduce dropouts of girl students in schools due to lack of Sanitation and Hygiene. The Schools devoid of basic infrastructure. Under the CSR initiative of POWERGRID, basic Infrastructure has been developed in these Schools. POWERGRID has handed over gender-segregated toilets to the Schools helping students continue their schooling with dignity and confidence.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=The%20project%20was%20introduced%20with%20the%20intent',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(742,'CSR Initiative: Construction of Classrooms, toilets & infrastructure development work in Government School','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Construction%20of%20Classrooms%2C%20toilets%20%26%20infrastructure%20development','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ea30aedbebeed0685aeec68fc9bf6956','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'f06e5ce1fc4da899853af07a5bc5d22d',NULL,'Construction of Classrooms, toilets & infrastructure development work in Government Schools',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Construction%20of%20Classrooms%2C%20toilets%20%26%20infrastructure%20development',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(743,'CSR Initiative: Through, this CSR initiative of POWERGRID it was expected that the students can attend the','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Through%2C%20this%20CSR%20initiative%20of%20POWERGRID%20it','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3e4ead8cf6c088b1df5f351b3e30ae0b','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'32fdd186ddf43d6fb3b651fe3333c57e',NULL,'Through, this CSR initiative of POWERGRID it was expected that the students can attend the classes comfortably and with utmost interest once the School reopens post COVID-19. This has encouraged the rural masses to send their child in greater numbers thereby helping in strengthening and enhancing the literacy rate of Salem district.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Through%2C%20this%20CSR%20initiative%20of%20POWERGRID%20it',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(744,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID modernized the school by undertaking general renovation, provided furniture, con','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20modernized%20the%20school%20by%20undertaking%20general','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e83712ec8fcd80a5a0185b1cac53df34','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'346c57d5a9c31c30aa4067a9b242a9d7',NULL,'POWERGRID modernized the school by undertaking general renovation, provided furniture, constructed new class rooms for +2 students and upgraded the existing class rooms to smart class rooms. The students are from the rural background whose parents are mostly dependent on agriculture.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20modernized%20the%20school%20by%20undertaking%20general',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(745,'CSR Initiative: Restoration of lakes in Aurangabad and Rohtas Districts','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Restoration%20of%20lakes%20in%20Aurangabad%20and%20Rohtas','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b31e281188644b951021dfe54a49481b','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'86b6586990e93bec3bef32cdb610377a',NULL,'Restoration of lakes in Aurangabad and Rohtas Districts : Most of the population in the district of Aurangabaad and Rohtas depends on agriculture for their livelihood. Ground water scarcity is major challenge in both the Districts. The areas are fertile but they lack proper irrigation facility. POWERGRID excavated and renovated the existing 20 ponds/lakes in the districts of Aurangabad and Rohtas and helped farmers to reap maximum benefits from agriculture.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Restoration%20of%20lakes%20in%20Aurangabad%20and%20Rohtas',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(746,'CSR Initiative: Promotion of Solar Energy','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Promotion%20of%20Solar%20Energy%20%3A%20Compared%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2690e3887ba58d59566084ff7ae29b6f','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'46efe004dead964d22ebb948e3b32cda',NULL,'Promotion of Solar Energy : Compared to conventional energy sources such as coal, gas, oil and nuclear - reserves of which are finite - clean energies are just as available as the sun from which they originate. Approx. 3439 nos. of Solar lights have been installed by POWERGRID across different States of India. Some of the notable places where Solar lights have been installed are Balia, Mau, Bhadoi, Lucknow, Varanasi, Chandauli, Baghpat, Ghazipur, Saharanpur, kushinagar, Srikakulam, Trichy, Jaggampetta, Jodhpur and Damoh. With the CSR intervention from POWERGRID it has been experienced by the rural masses that enhanced street lighting system in remote and rural communities can actually improve road safety, personal security and raise the standard of living. And it is also expected that with the introduction of proper Lighting through Solar lights, the crime rate also gets proportionately down.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Promotion%20of%20Solar%20Energy%20%3A%20Compared%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(747,'CSR Initiative: Tree Plantation','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Tree%20Plantation%20%3A%20Considering%20the%20ecological%20concern%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b60a55f010578714f9b21207e17ed36b','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'ff1c2eb6ce28c7d457684ce24ee542cb',NULL,'Tree Plantation : Considering the ecological concern, a number of CSR initiatives are undertaken by POWERGRID. Tree plantation drive has been carried out at several locations by POWERGRID owing the benefits attributable to tree plantation, since it helps in reduce the amount of storm water runoff, which reduces erosion and pollution in our waterways and reduces the effects of flooding. Some of the notable plantation drives carried out by POWERGRID across the country are :',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Tree%20Plantation%20%3A%20Considering%20the%20ecological%20concern%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(748,'CSR Initiative: Corporate CSR Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=CIPET%20%3A%20A%206%20-%20Month%20Certificate','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'182c08121ecfc30c424ec747f4b0f891','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'7050ab5d14ee35e10d773cf442a5a617',NULL,'CIPET : A 6 - Month Certificate Course for Machine Operators on four different plastic manufacturing technologies Supported by POWERGRID under CSR Initiative with CIPET, IPT, Murthal is an exemplary CSR initiative of POWERGRID. The program is designed to support 160 youths from underprivileged backgrounds comprising SC, ST, OBC, EWS candidates, free of cost, with an employment assurance of 70%.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=CIPET%20%3A%20A%206%20-%20Month%20Certificate',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(749,'CSR Initiative: Training Programme for 275 nos','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20Programme%20for%20275%20nos.%20of%20unemployed','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'04c6df17233712906a2663f135b87b46','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'0871126be069759cb51148a98d423887',NULL,'Training Programme for 275 nos. of unemployed youth, Damoh-CEDMAP : POWERGRID provided financial assistance to train 325 nos. of unemployed youths of Damoh District through CEDMAP (Centre for Entrepreneurship Development Madhya Pradesh). The duration of the programe was for 4 months, training course has helped the beneficiaries in fetching good employment opportunity to earn a respectable and dignified living.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20Programme%20for%20275%20nos.%20of%20unemployed',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(750,'CSR Initiative: Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20classes%20for%2006%20months%20in%20tailoring','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dfae80a54c32cb58173697d59e15bc05','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'b62c2621bd5742c39351ce0bc360ec5d',NULL,'Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women : To improve the economic condition of the underprivileged women, Employment linked Skill Development programmes are continuously undertaken to provide them with self-employment opportunities. In this regard, POWERGRID has undertaken training programme on tailoring for the girls and women belonging to the weaker sections of the society. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. They needed to learn newer vocational skills such as tailoring (sewing) which can help them earn more income and become economically self-sufficient and independent. This will alleviate poverty, help them support their family needs without being dependent of husband and parents. In order to help them, POWERGRID started free tailoring (sewing) training centers in the villages.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20classes%20for%2006%20months%20in%20tailoring',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(751,'CSR Initiative: The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygieni','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=The%20motif%20behind%20providing%20Sanitary%20napkin%20vending','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f6d78c9e349ed9cc958b44f9435b4720','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'7b24e1cbb792fefffceff6f483317647',NULL,'The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygienic menstrual health of women and adolescent girls. This will discourage them against using traditional unhygienic methods. Aiming towards adolescent girls’ health and hygiene, sanitary napkin machines have been installed at various government schools at Firozpur under the aegis of POWERGRID CSR.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=The%20motif%20behind%20providing%20Sanitary%20napkin%20vending',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(752,'CSR Initiative: To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=To%20empower%20women%20and%20improve%20economic%20status','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b1fcf41e339da5f040bf73a821834e71','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'111f32d31cc705717d03ee8c9f1975fc',NULL,'To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business skills and education, POWERGRID have provided women with sewing machines and training on tailoring skills in Beed, Gurugram and Koteshwar. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. This technical education is a means to eradicate unemployment among the unemployed women and provide them an opportunity to join vocational courses where they can learn skills and shape up their career that prepares them to earn a livelihood and support their families.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=To%20empower%20women%20and%20improve%20economic%20status',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(753,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installat','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20made%20an%20Agreement%20with%20District%20Administration%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c6560b967a49e46cf8293b02c376d681','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'85d939a217f5f768a0fe7bcdbb3aa0f2',NULL,'POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installation and Commissioning of 20 Units of 120W (60W X 02Nos) of LED based Solar Street Lighting systems on NH-16 of Kasibugga in Andhra Pradesh. In absence of sufficient illumination, drivers and pedestrians are miserably failing to see the connecting approach roads, junctions, dividers and potential obstacles on road junctions during dusk and and night, which lead to road accidents many times. In order to address this issue local authorities have requested to provide the illumination at identified places on NH-16 at Kasibugga Sub-Division Limits from Kotabommali to Ichapuram PS limits in Srikakulam district, Andhra Pradesh',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20made%20an%20Agreement%20with%20District%20Administration%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(754,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=20%20Nos.%20of%20120W%20%282Nos.%20X%2060W%29','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cdccb79e381c0b48faa75bf5eec528ce','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'9ce8d3ab783b465cb898fa8011ea61fc',NULL,'20 Nos. of 120W (2Nos. X 60W) LED based Solar Street Lighting Systems on NH-16 at Kasibugga sub- division in Srikakulam District',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=20%20Nos.%20of%20120W%20%282Nos.%20X%2060W%29',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(755,'CSR Initiative: With the construction of ‘pakka’ road the impact has been positive on the Rural Community','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=With%20the%20construction%20of%20%E2%80%98pakka%E2%80%99%20road%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'62265565b765de4708b766b2b0d4833a','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'307db3902387574c183ee527d3e65330',NULL,'With the construction of ‘pakka’ road the impact has been positive on the Rural Community. The villagers now found it easier for Commuting for school children, office going people, elderly and those who wish to access various services. Access to various public service centers is now faster than before. It is said that creation of infrastructure especially linking villages to highways and nearby cities has the potential to bring all out development of the village. The domains such as health, environment, safety and security are likely to get positively impacted by this intervention. At the same time the marginalized communities are also going to benefit in the long run.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=With%20the%20construction%20of%20%E2%80%98pakka%E2%80%99%20road%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(756,'CSR Initiative: Carrying out rural developmental works in Jalalsar village of Bikaner District, Rajasthan','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Carrying%20out%20rural%20developmental%20works%20in%20Jalalsar','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2e7fb557802222acfbf34b0ecba1b883','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'2255e03b052ba82a5b79a20eb5df7db6',NULL,'Carrying out rural developmental works in Jalalsar village of Bikaner District, Rajasthan',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Carrying%20out%20rural%20developmental%20works%20in%20Jalalsar',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(757,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20supported%20the%20International%20Crops%20Research','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'91246dc40e7ad32ab99c874c14c5c953','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'3e967fda0758f9df20a3dc564ca883e6',NULL,'POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi-Arid Tropics (ICRISAT) in developing a scalable site of learning to improve livelihoods and build resilience through integrated watershed management in 10 villages of Jaipatna block, Kalahandi district, Odisha. The watershed comprises an area of around 2500 ha. The overall objective is to develop capacity of the farmer in the region for improving rural livelihood through farmer friendly knowledge sharing and dissemination strategy to enhance awareness among different stakeholders about climate smart water efficient and nutritious cereals and vegetables for cultivating and its integration in regular diet.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20supported%20the%20International%20Crops%20Research',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(758,'CSR Initiative: Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Improving%20Agriculture%20Productivity%20and%20Rural%20Livelihood%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c52f5ac89efcba1e480b047def330fc2','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'a334b09c909345ef8cd0c3c27640bb67',NULL,'Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Improving%20Agriculture%20Productivity%20and%20Rural%20Livelihood%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(759,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20provided%20medical%20equipment%20%26%20ambulances%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5e892c99a22c377da5373609edfe318c','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'289db03427818910e3b84d852a1a8d6b',NULL,'POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt. hospitals, distributed Aid & Appliances to Persons with Disabilities and organized health camps in various parts of the country. POWERGRID in association with Artificial Limbs Manufacturing Corporation of India Ltd (ALIMCO) distributed free assistive aids like Motorized Tricycles, Tricycle wheelchair, Walking Sticks, Brail Kit , Crutches , artificial limbs, and hearing aids to 188 Divyangjan ( PwDs) at Damoh District of Madhya Pradesh.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20provided%20medical%20equipment%20%26%20ambulances%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(760,'CSR Initiative: With an aim to provide much needed shelter to attendants and care givers of aling hospital','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=With%20an%20aim%20to%20provide%20much%20needed','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b2590d80bd2d570bb75dea65aa0c1b0a','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'a3d06fc990c758740a4cf9636a0cc2e0',NULL,'With an aim to provide much needed shelter to attendants and care givers of aling hospitalised patients POWERGRID at the same hospitals as below :',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=With%20an%20aim%20to%20provide%20much%20needed',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(761,'CSR Initiative: Vishram Sadan for attendants/care givers for ailing hospitalized patients','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Vishram%20Sadan%20for%20attendants/care%20givers%20for%20ailing','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'975360fac3370ae868cdc19a470ba527','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'dbbc1dfa5f6a0eccac96ba7ab0d50997',NULL,'Vishram Sadan for attendants/care givers for ailing hospitalized patients.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Vishram%20Sadan%20for%20attendants/care%20givers%20for%20ailing',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(762,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID, to augment the emergency pre','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%2C%20to%20augment%20the%20emergency%20pre-hospital%20medical','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dae64426f651c82085ac9a2a891b552e','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'600dbd34b9f306bc7c34516556cb15e2',NULL,'POWERGRID, to augment the emergency pre-hospital medical care, patient transfer, ease of access to health services particularly to rural areas provided ambulances to Government hospitals / Medical colleges / Rural Health Centers.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%2C%20to%20augment%20the%20emergency%20pre-hospital%20medical',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(763,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Shri%20V.%20K.%20Singh%2C%20Director%20%28Personnel%29%20POWERGRID','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1461d7326bb3c93c884afa27ec7eece3','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'17328f4d76098f8bae9aad174f9e9143',NULL,'Shri V. K. Singh, Director (Personnel) POWERGRID handed over the medical equipments to Shri Tashi Gyalson, Chief Executive Counsellor, Leh, in august presence of Shri Ravinder Kumar, Secretary (Energy) Leh, Shri Kailash Rathore, Executive Director, NR-II, POWERGRID, Shri Shrikant Balasaheb Suse, DC, Leh, Shri Tarun Bajaj, Chief General Manager (Projects) POWERGRID and other senior officials of POWERGRID, Jammu Kashmir Power Development Department (JKPDD) and Health Department of Leh on 29.06.2021. On this occasion, Chief Executive Counsellor (Leh) flagged off vaccine delivery van, dedicated to people of Leh.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Shri%20V.%20K.%20Singh%2C%20Director%20%28Personnel%29%20POWERGRID',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(764,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=-%20Established%20Oxygen%20plant%20at%20Tau%20Devi','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b02a2b1809c67a38e070367d07a1f637','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'8226280700d7bbddd26809c68af010e1',NULL,'- Established Oxygen plant at Tau Devi lal Stadium, Gurugram & District Hospital, Jaisalmer',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=-%20Established%20Oxygen%20plant%20at%20Tau%20Devi',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(765,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=-%20Nitrogen%20cylinders%20converted%20to%20oxygen%20cylinders','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ad665e8c680c5d4658096a554855a946','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'a5b5761e604719aa214055771225cf07',NULL,'- Nitrogen cylinders converted to oxygen cylinders and given to nearby Hospitals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=-%20Nitrogen%20cylinders%20converted%20to%20oxygen%20cylinders',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(766,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID contributed ₹200 crore to PM CARES Fund in 2020','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20contributed%20%E2%82%B9200%20crore%20to%20PM%20CARES','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'646061e72c7c1122512523e07171840d','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'a5d4dc62d22f525ad4532b9e6d9592d7',NULL,'POWERGRID contributed ₹200 crore to PM CARES Fund in 2020-21 to support India’s fight against COVID Pandemic. In 2021-22 it has again contributed an amount of ₹75 crores to PM CARES Fund for Assistance and Relief in Emergency Situations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20contributed%20%E2%82%B9200%20crore%20to%20PM%20CARES',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(767,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=COVID-19%20pandemic%20has%20wreaked%20havoc%20in%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'434a76db5090256188398aa435d1dd61','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'f9d104d287df8f580e753e473d25fcf7',NULL,'COVID-19 pandemic has wreaked havoc in the whole world. During the pandemic POWERGRID took up the responsibility of Mission Zero Hunger. POWERGRID activated all its establishments spread across the nation to distribute dry ration & meal packets to the needy in and around its establishments. PPE kits/ Masks/Gloves, sanitizers, etc. were distributed to Medical professionals, Police personnel, migrant laborers, etc to help them protect themselves from getting infected from the deadly virus. POWERGRID also extended financial help to State/District authorities for buying medical items/PPE kits and other essential items. POWERGRID extended help across the country from Leh to Kerala.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=COVID-19%20pandemic%20has%20wreaked%20havoc%20in%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(768,'CSR Initiative: POWERGRID has been contributing to the society through its CSR interventions even before t','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20been%20contributing%20to%20the%20society','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'47c09c7a0445a18303d507500213abc3','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'702ddb0e7539151289b100e538d6a898',NULL,'POWERGRID has been contributing to the society through its CSR interventions even before the CSR Act, 2013 came into force. POWERGRID has aligned with 15 out of 17 Sustainable Development Goals launched by the United Nations in 2015. POWERGRID adopts 360° project approach for implementation of its CSR interventions thereby ensuring sustainable implementation of its CSR projects for the targeted beneficiaries. While designing and implementation of the interventions, POWERGRID consults and engages with all stakeholders. Techniques like, Need-Profile Analysis and Need-prioritization are used as effective community participation tools. Communities are also involved in the process of implementation as well as during participatory monitoring phases of the programs.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20been%20contributing%20to%20the%20society',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{}'),(769,'CSR Initiative: With one of the best environmental policies in the business, the chemicals business follow','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.grasim.com/sustainability#:~:text=With%20one%20of%20the%20best%20environmental%20policies','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4f2fd9554d0a81a611db6d7c7a5901da','COMP_TOP200_034',NULL,'eada8212647c1f7d897e7a8402e442a0',NULL,'With one of the best environmental policies in the business, the chemicals business follows environment-friendly processes and adheres to global safety standards. New processes and technologies are continuously adopted to minimise pollution and waste. In addition, natural resources are used responsibly and by products are disposed safely.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.grasim.com/sustainability#:~:text=With%20one%20of%20the%20best%20environmental%20policies',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174','{}'),(770,'CSR Initiative: To achieve its green goals, the viscose business employs a 360 degree sustainability appro','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.grasim.com/sustainability#:~:text=To%20achieve%20its%20green%20goals%2C%20the%20viscose','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5eed9cd7b27c26098b0dba9363c8ddca','COMP_TOP200_034',NULL,'65017cb0e3f4e39dfd1da07826be84ca',NULL,'To achieve its green goals, the viscose business employs a 360 degree sustainability approach which minimises the environmental impact of its processes. This plan ensures that processes are constantly moni