nitiative: For Grasim, sustainability is more than protecting the environment','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.grasim.com/sustainability#:~:text=For%20Grasim%2C%20sustainability%20is%20more%20than%20protecting','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b20cdd2eaec4381b82b8e1705c93eaa4','COMP_TOP200_034',NULL,'4ca1d8dbe439a4418ec2d45ffc01c0a1',NULL,'For Grasim, sustainability is more than protecting the environment. It is adopting new processes and technology to ensure safety at the plant and providing sustainable livelihood opportunities to surrounding communities while safeguarding the environment. Know more about the Birla Cellulose\'s sustainability goals',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.grasim.com/sustainability#:~:text=For%20Grasim%2C%20sustainability%20is%20more%20than%20protecting',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:16.407174','{}'),(776,'CSR Initiative: To plant our vast zero deforestation programme, we’re adhering to strict guidelines whereb','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=To%20plant%20our%20vast%20zero%20deforestation%20programme%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'105972b3bf07f486191539a471d6ed14','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'6b168f3979f56a52dd51a37136f9bbe8',NULL,'To plant our vast zero deforestation programme, we’re adhering to strict guidelines whereby we don’t expand or produce on areas converted from High Carbon Stock (HCS) forests and habitats such as peatland of any depth (except where farming practices protect peat), wetland and savannas after 31st December 2015, as defined in the High Carbon Stock Approach Toolkit and IUCN protected areas categories I-IV, UNESCO World Heritage Sites and wetlands on the Ramsar List. Furthermore, we have also been identifying and protecting the High Conservation Values (HCV) lands in and around our sites.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=To%20plant%20our%20vast%20zero%20deforestation%20programme%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(777,'CSR Initiative: At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to br','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29%2C%20while','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bb8c7ff713053b3d72eb539f3d009606','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'5c3a1e5e38d9094d98eaba30505201ef',NULL,'At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29%2C%20while',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(778,'CSR Initiative: Health and safety, Human rights, Environment, Community, Business ethics and governance an','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=Health%20and%20safety%2C%20Human%20rights%2C%20Environment%2C%20Community%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e43b544c230ac50eb6a5f815636612d9','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'7dd0c732713140f6eeb25407ec47c423',NULL,'Health and safety, Human rights, Environment, Community, Business ethics and governance and Intellectual Property are some of the guiding principles of AGEL and shall be integral part in its quest to become a 50 GW renewable energy generator by 2030.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=Health%20and%20safety%2C%20Human%20rights%2C%20Environment%2C%20Community%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(779,'CSR Initiative: The Contract documents in AGEL ensure Contractors, Sub','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Contract%20documents%20in%20AGEL%20ensure%20Contractors%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f08e2597b8e818de4cf1c6259d1b57bd','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'290842c66b6bd35aeb8c28e25d9816f1',NULL,'The Contract documents in AGEL ensure Contractors, Sub-Contractors and Suppliers shall comply with policies, codes and guidelines pertaining to ESG requirement, employ management systems for ESG risks and opportunities and commit to continuous improvements, ensure fair terms and conditions of employment for its sub-contractors, employees and personnel, asses and mitigate health, safety and environmental risks and focus on corporate responsibility.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Contract%20documents%20in%20AGEL%20ensure%20Contractors%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(780,'CSR Initiative: We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20at%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dd5d5faebcaa95ba67f0a43f9d75fdf6','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'9b0d8886d72efa8fc73aaeb9ec4690fd',NULL,'We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the health of the ecosystem in which we operate. Fortifying our commitment towards biodiversity conservation is a comprehensive policy – the framework of which is under the direct administration of the company’s CEO. One of the key focus areas of the policy is to ensure a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. Further, AGEL became a signatory in the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 23rd July 2020. The objective of this initiative is to sensitize and mentor Indian business organizations for biodiversity conservation and enhancement. AGEL is devoted to integrate the biodiversity aspects in its management systems to create a sustainable and positive impact on the surroundings. To this end, the company is currently assessing and mapping the biodiversity at its operation sites and identifying impacts, if any.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20at%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(781,'CSR Initiative: In total, this translates to a USD 5','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=In%20total%2C%20this%20translates%20to%20a%20USD','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'04fa16107287ed3d03de51e57bc95bb8','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'19f4d7143a99e585fd7d01aefaf863b8',NULL,'In total, this translates to a USD 5.3bn in investments in green power and decarbonization, out of the USD 20bn we have pledged to invest in green infrastructure.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=In%20total%2C%20this%20translates%20to%20a%20USD',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(782,'CSR Initiative: AGEL has also recently completed the acquisition of SB Energy, a 5 GW renewable portfolio ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=AGEL%20has%20also%20recently%20completed%20the%20acquisition','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5839d9adfd9c9eef0aae193d2e28f026','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'7b7d5d50695087d6b6ab31ff00c3eb20',NULL,'AGEL has also recently completed the acquisition of SB Energy, a 5 GW renewable portfolio in India with a capex outlay of USD 3.5bn',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=AGEL%20has%20also%20recently%20completed%20the%20acquisition',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(783,'CSR Initiative: AGEL has invested in renewable power projects, including a 1,690 MW project in Jaisalmer, ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=AGEL%20has%20invested%20in%20renewable%20power%20projects%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'92452aa27461343edf1cec839ddd7351','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'0ce32cd2dc504828058a78ea190093ac',NULL,'AGEL has invested in renewable power projects, including a 1,690 MW project in Jaisalmer, Rajasthan with a capital outlay of USD ~1.8bn, funded in collaboration with 12 international banks and through the internal resources of AGEL.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=AGEL%20has%20invested%20in%20renewable%20power%20projects%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(784,'CSR Initiative: Adani Green Energy Limited is deeply committed to the decarbonisation of power generation','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20is%20deeply%20committed','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5ec1adb2586c0d0e27931ab80421f1c0','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'e58fae73bf5b6384d88aa1dced226382',NULL,'Adani Green Energy Limited is deeply committed to the decarbonisation of power generation.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20is%20deeply%20committed',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(785,'CSR Initiative: At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), we are committed to a sustainable roadmap in contrib','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29%2C%20we','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d6a8d85b6f639548682532c540325aa1','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'6cde2c51d676d57ef2778cc695ce943c',NULL,'At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), we are committed to a sustainable roadmap in contributing to one of the world’s largest renewable energy expansion programmes along with catering to India’s climate change goals. On 15th October, 2019, AGEL became the privileged signatory of the United Nation Global Impact. This means that we are committed to support the ten principles of the United Nations Global Compact in human rights, labour, environment and anti-corruption.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29%2C%20we',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.858988','{}'),(786,'CSR Initiative: Tata Steel Europe’s Community Partnership Programme ‘Future Generations’, with sub','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20Europe%E2%80%99s%20Community%20Partnership%20Programme%20%E2%80%98Future','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a75930287cbc13e64d4323f0182197a7','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'675bb9c34c4d4cfa89d9e24ce7f1d0b1',NULL,'Tata Steel Europe’s Community Partnership Programme ‘Future Generations’, with sub-themes of education, environment, health and well-being, works across the UK, assisting job and wealth creation by supporting small and medium businesses with finance and business premises. click here to know more about Tata Steel UK and Tata Steel Nederland',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20Europe%E2%80%99s%20Community%20Partnership%20Programme%20%E2%80%98Future',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(787,'CSR Initiative: Tata Steel has a grievance redressal mechanism to ensure that community concerns are addre','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20has%20a%20grievance%20redressal%20mechanism','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3c12e0d4eadb74238329ad309633b7c0','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'c91d1022fb51f14ec1a9361b66af5a49',NULL,'Tata Steel has a grievance redressal mechanism to ensure that community concerns are addressed. With a focus on improving marginalized communities through replicable CSR models, TSL employs a system for real-time feedback and issue resolution involving:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20has%20a%20grievance%20redressal%20mechanism',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(788,'CSR Initiative: We maintain constructive engagement with stakeholders and local communities through inclus','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=We%20maintain%20constructive%20engagement%20with%20stakeholders%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b8d6789e972a6f95b0937fc57fe8a9ad','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'1a0aaf6a43de5a6998a1fcc9d7df9705',NULL,'We maintain constructive engagement with stakeholders and local communities through inclusive dialogue that provides clarity on relevant matters and opportunities for their views to be considered in CSR plans, business, and beyond. Our approach is designed to enable open participation, respect diverse perspectives, and integrate them into decision-making while ensuring that interactions take place in an environment of mutual respect and trust.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=We%20maintain%20constructive%20engagement%20with%20stakeholders%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(789,'CSR Initiative: Tata Steel places a strong emphasis on public consultation, stakeholder engagement, and so','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20places%20a%20strong%20emphasis%20on','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e9dcec10de270208deef221354be9d0c','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'d8fdd792aea12ef896c016ca7599c8cc',NULL,'Tata Steel places a strong emphasis on public consultation, stakeholder engagement, and social consent to operate as foundational pillars of its sustainability and governance framework. The company recognizes that meaningful dialogue with communities, regulatory bodies, and other stakeholders is essential not only for transparency and trust-building but also for ensuring that its operations align with societal expectations and environmental responsibilities. By actively seeking and respecting social consent, Tata Steel reinforces its commitment to ethical practices and inclusive development, thereby securing its social license to operate and contributing to long-term value creation for all stakeholders. Many of our operational areas are in and around indigenous communities, making community consultation crucial in protecting their rights.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20places%20a%20strong%20emphasis%20on',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(790,'CSR Initiative: We endeavour to preserve and promote tribal culture and heritage through various initiativ','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=We%20endeavour%20to%20preserve%20and%20promote%20tribal','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8eb74f67e5a4504f4c65357d05a05c7b','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'3adfbf0f72772f40d9a6e2ad5b6cbbda',NULL,'We endeavour to preserve and promote tribal culture and heritage through various initiatives including tribal leadership programme, Samvaad tribal conclave, tribal language centres, curated tribal literature programmes, imparting training on tribal musical instruments and documenting stories of tribal legacy. In healthcare, we partner with governments and independent organisations worldwide to work towards improving the overall health and hygiene of the community in and around areas where we operate.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=We%20endeavour%20to%20preserve%20and%20promote%20tribal',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(791,'CSR Initiative: Balancing economic prosperity, environmental responsibility and social benefits for the co','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Balancing%20economic%20prosperity%2C%20environmental%20responsibility%20and%20social','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a896c96140ea7c2bcdecfb409dc366b0','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'de95bd75a1fe7b8ca6cbea9a3fb66b3c',NULL,'Balancing economic prosperity, environmental responsibility and social benefits for the community are the rules by which Tata Steel operates.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Balancing%20economic%20prosperity%2C%20environmental%20responsibility%20and%20social',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(792,'CSR Initiative: At Tata Steel, our community','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=At%20Tata%20Steel%2C%20our%20community-centric%20initiatives%20emphasise','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7454dac19c7e5905bc5e27ffd397af2e','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'cf3f5f7faf670c18afd262118d531372',NULL,'At Tata Steel, our community-centric initiatives emphasise the spread of quality education, healthcare and sustainable livelihood opportunities in all our operating locations in India and globally. We empower communities through agriculture development and market linkages, skill development of youth, promoting entrepreneurship and preservation of ethnicity and culture of indigenous communities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=At%20Tata%20Steel%2C%20our%20community-centric%20initiatives%20emphasise',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:28.398884','{}'),(793,'CSR Initiative: Our business philosophy and ethics are guided by Aditya Birla Group\'s values of integrity ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20business%20philosophy%20and%20ethics%20are%20guided','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bf7129e63984d1d270b301b8237102f4','COMP_TOP200_031',NULL,'735dba59351f83f904c318bf2f9dfee7',NULL,'Our business philosophy and ethics are guided by Aditya Birla Group\'s values of integrity and commitment. Our transparent processes ensure that our people conduct themselves with the highest ethical standards. We have set clear policies and an institutional framework that allows us to systematically monitor performance, encourage continuous improvements and innovative practices, and deepen dialogue with all stakeholders.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20business%20philosophy%20and%20ethics%20are%20guided',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213','{}'),(794,'CSR Initiative: Nature is our most precious capital, and as a responsible business, our key focus is on im','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=Nature%20is%20our%20most%20precious%20capital%2C%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4f19dcdc69868fd26fa65c8fb41d4b10','COMP_TOP200_031',NULL,'fce40dd77fd67d6c7af0b943c3670f2f',NULL,'Nature is our most precious capital, and as a responsible business, our key focus is on improving our operational efficiencies to prevent, halt and restore our impact on the ecosystem. Our sustainability initiatives span our entire operational value chain. Our key focus areas–emissions, water, waste and biodiversity are designed to help us go beyond our limits and drive positive change.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=Nature%20is%20our%20most%20precious%20capital%2C%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213','{}'),(795,'CSR Initiative: Our commitment to sustainability reflects in our consistent performance and growth','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20sustainability%20reflects%20in%20our','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'27a03d1412ced2dc9cbb87bd56c6f8fc','COMP_TOP200_031',NULL,'55e0f73a601c4450304b410a49fe6796',NULL,'Our commitment to sustainability reflects in our consistent performance and growth. Our sustainability initiatives focus on four key axes–emissions, water, waste and biodiversity. Each area has ambitious targets, which we aim to achieve through strategic investments and by spearheading the adoption of green technology and circular innovation.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20sustainability%20reflects%20in%20our',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213','{}'),(796,'CSR Initiative: At Hindalco, sustainability means more than manufacturing products that are sustainable an','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Hindalco%2C%20sustainability%20means%20more%20than%20manufacturing','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6ebe75074fe2cb73f5d1b492a8b6f45c','COMP_TOP200_031',NULL,'ea22aa2aa0ae4c81f051097a21865b39',NULL,'At Hindalco, sustainability means more than manufacturing products that are sustainable and reducing our carbon footprint. Being a global metals powerhouse, it is our responsibility to embrace sustainability as a way of life and work towards making the world greener, stronger and smarter.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Hindalco%2C%20sustainability%20means%20more%20than%20manufacturing',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213','{}'),(797,'CSR Initiative: To achieve net zero, water positive, no net loss to biodiversity and zero waste to landfil','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=To%20achieve%20net%20zero%2C%20water%20positive%2C%20no','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ed4078e319aa4a59d38111cf67d8aede','COMP_TOP200_031',NULL,'fb6969f39652ae2b90733c6275251f0c',NULL,'To achieve net zero, water positive, no net loss to biodiversity and zero waste to landfill status by 2050',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hindalco.com/sustainability#:~:text=To%20achieve%20net%20zero%2C%20water%20positive%2C%20no',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:20:02.350213','{}'),(798,'CSR Initiative: Scholarships supported over 3,85,000 students from multiple regions of the country for sec','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.shriramfinance.in/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Scholarships%20supported%20over%203%2C85%2C000%20students%20from%20multiple','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ffd1ed967ca23fa1a367c7769fc56cb3','COMP_TOP200_027',NULL,'4bf1a660c4522aff74f304ad8fcf5956',NULL,'Scholarships supported over 3,85,000 students from multiple regions of the country for secondary and higher secondary education.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.shriramfinance.in/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Scholarships%20supported%20over%203%2C85%2C000%20students%20from%20multiple',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628','{}'),(799,'CSR Initiative: Scholarships are given to students between standards 8 and 12 (secondary and higher second','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Developmen