ls and a better future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.shriramfinance.in/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Shriram%27s%20Education%20Programme%20aims%20to%20create%20enabling',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628','{}'),(805,'CSR Initiative: In our quest to serve the underserved and promote prosperity, we have been engaging in sev','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.shriramfinance.in/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=In%20our%20quest%20to%20serve%20the%20underserved','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'eef6ca7202d16e2f21b27a9f47ff89e4','COMP_TOP200_027',NULL,'3d4035a4675310fae74a2a05c7e4330b',NULL,'In our quest to serve the underserved and promote prosperity, we have been engaging in several social welfare and empowerment projects to train youth from economically disadvantaged backgrounds, provide them with employable skills, and access to employment as well as entrepreneurship opportunities. Previously undertaken by Shriram Transport Finance Company and Shriram City Union Finance and now driven by the merged entities under Shriram Finance Limited, our CSR program encompasses Skill Development and Livelihood, Vocational Training, Education and Scholarships for our beloved community',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.shriramfinance.in/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=In%20our%20quest%20to%20serve%20the%20underserved',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:29.309628','{}'),(806,'CSR Initiative: Shriram Finance Limited strongly supports the Nation’s growth and development through vari','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.shriramfinance.in/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Sh