students coming from underprivileged areas, who are aspiring to join STEM fields; Rupa Rahul Bajaj Scholarship Scheme which started in 2023 to award deserving students scholarships for pursuing STEM higher education in top-ranking universities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20various%20programs%20include%20STEM%20Education%20Support',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(821,'CSR Initiative: Our dedication lies in enhancing the well','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20dedication%20lies%20in%20enhancing%20the%20well-','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f0dedcf26170b1d63d5a84d2b210a790','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'cb441ff10a3f0cadd8c0b3be872d5d37',NULL,'Our dedication lies in enhancing the well- being of individuals, with a particular focus on marginalized communities residing in proximity to our manufacturing plants. We also contribute to education, health, environment, animal welfare projects, and other relevant areas for the sustainable development of the community and the nation. Through our CSR arm, Janki Bajaj Gram Vikas Sanstha (JBGVS), we implement and fund many projects that aims to uplift people from communities on the margins.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20dedication%20lies%20in%20enhancing%20the%20well-',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(822,'CSR Initiative: Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Manufacturing%20Systems%20%28BMS%29%20a%20flagship%20CSR','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9450bf89819f78615160f9c94eef792d','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'c9e23fbdb10ad20bf4517084540f0d8a',NULL,'Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e-learning, self-paced course that aims to impart industry knowledge to ITI and polytechnic students using Bajaj’s experience in operational excellence. BMS continues to revolutionize ITI training by integrating industry-relevant modules based on Total Productive Maintenance (TPM) principles.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Manufacturing%20Systems%20%28BMS%29%20a%20flagship%20CSR',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(823,'CSR Initiative: We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20have%20committed%20approximately%20INR%20350%20crore','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c21b77c14aa3ea67c1cf594ff4f86496','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'0959818917cbaef6ab4f5d6af12a2506',NULL,'We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative. The second phase of BEST Program will have new verticals such as Electronics Manufacturing Systems (EMS), Firmware Development (FD), Systems Validation (SV) and E-Mobility (EM).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20have%20committed%20approximately%20INR%20350%20crore',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(824,'CSR Initiative: Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd ','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Engineering%20Skills%20Training%20%28BEST%29%20is%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'47acce6f1d02bf52f515d1a016f8ce15','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'688c7e26cba86a022833fdba238eab56',NULL,'Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd that provides best-in-class manufacturing skills training to young engineers. It is implemented in partnership with India’s top universities and engineering colleges by setting up state-of-the-art laboratories, with world-class equipment procured from across the globe. The centres provide skill training in contemporary and evolving technologies to engineering graduates (with both degrees and diplomas), helping them become competent and employable, thus bridging the industry-academia skill gap. BEST aims to support young learners from the economically weaker sections of society, those hailing from tier 2, tier 3 and tier 4 colleges/cities, and disadvantaged areas to enhance their employment opportunities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Engineering%20Skills%20Training%20%28BEST%29%20is%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(825,'CSR Initiative: Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Auto%20is%20committed%20to%20promoting%20science','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d59af8adb1082cd46665323ab0784a2d','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'fcae9bff803a683f24cc228c17012edd',NULL,'Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas i.e. Skill-development in STEM. Our CSR initiatives are designed to address skill-gaps in STEM from school education to higher education. We are deeply committed to improving the livelihoods of the youth of our country by skilling and empowering them. We envision bringing Indian youth to the forefront of industrial transformation through BAL CSR Skilling Initiatives, the first two flagship CSR initiatives are Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) and Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Auto%20is%20committed%20to%20promoting%20science',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(826,'CSR Initiative: The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20Bajaj%20Group%20companies%20have%20contributed%20over','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'da2ea05cc2adae64341c432d4f63b67d','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'cc754a17c4cfd359f28abf3f7824cf29',NULL,'The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs. 1,300 Cr. to projects focusing on Skilling and Education, Health, Livelihoods, and Water Conservation since CSR rules were first announced in 2014.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20Bajaj%20Group%20companies%20have%20contributed%20over',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:15:05.673534','{}'),(827,'CSR Initiative: NTPC is India’s largest power conglomerate with roots planted way back in 1975 to accelera','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://ntpc.co.in/ntpc-overview#:~:text=NTPC%20is%20India%E2%80%99s%20largest%20power%20conglomerate%20with','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'19acbe56a61c029c106a8ed308f2845b','COMP_TOP200_018',NULL,'bcfb9e09952f9c58f69b6df42e2eb9a3',NULL,'NTPC is India’s largest power conglomerate with roots planted way back in 1975 to accelerate power development in India. Since then, it has established itself as the dominant power major with presence in the entire value chain of the power generation business. From fossil fuels it has forayed into generating electricity via hydro, renewable energy and nuclear sources. This foray will play a major role in lowering its carbon footprint by reducing greenhouse gas emissions. To strengthen its core business, the corporation has diversified into the fields of consultancy, power trading, training of power professionals, rural electrification, ash utilization and coal mining as well.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://ntpc.co.in/ntpc-overview#:~:text=NTPC%20is%20India%E2%80%99s%20largest%20power%20conglomerate%20with',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130','{}'),(828,'CSR Initiative: NTPC has pioneered green hydrogen projects, reducing carbon footprint, and promoting susta','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://ntpc.co.in/sustainability#:~:text=NTPC%20has%20pioneered%20green%20hydrogen%20projects%2C%20reducing','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under En