rises.com/sustainability#:~:text=Sustainability%20is%20a%20strategic%20focus%20area%20for',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:07.036900','{}'),(834,'CSR Initiative: ITC is one of India\'s foremost private sector companies with a Gross Revenue of ₹ 80,867 c','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://itcportal.com/about-itc/sustainability.html#:~:text=ITC%20is%20one%20of%20India%27s%20foremost%20private','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f13cf72e606b8efeaff2715303c68945','COMP_TOP200_015',NULL,'e2134b9249c4c95d1b7165f35a134d9d',NULL,'ITC is one of India\'s foremost private sector companies with a Gross Revenue of ₹ 80,867 crores and EBITDA of ₹ 25,208 crores (as on 31.03.2026) with presence in FMCG, Packaging, Paperboards & Specialty Papers, Agri & IT Businesses.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://itcportal.com/about-itc/sustainability.html#:~:text=ITC%20is%20one%20of%20India%27s%20foremost%20private',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058','{}'),(835,'CSR Initiative: The world today is confronted with daunting global challenges emerging from the existentia','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://itcportal.com/about-itc/sustainability.html#:~:text=The%20world%20today%20is%20confronted%20with%20daunting','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a9a62f14e1cd7c2f63ddbdd08dbcb4a0','COMP_TOP200_015',NULL,'13f3a2a749acb969b72d5a4d85e7a17d',NULL,'The world today is confronted with daunting global challenges emerging from the existential climate crisis, concerns over food and nutrition security, inadequate livelihood opportunities and widening social inequity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:47.981058',NULL,NULL,NULL