 emissions, energy reduction, water management, waste management, biodiversity management, resource management, community relationship management, occupational health and safety, human rights management, employee well-being and product development.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ultratechcement.com/corporate/sustainability/sustainability#:~:text=UltraTech%20is%20committed%20to%20driving%20sustainability%20across',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917','{}'),(844,'CSR Initiative: Our Chairman wrote this vision for sustainability that is rooted in the high standards of ','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.ultratechcement.com/corporate/sustainability/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Chairman%20wrote%20this%20vision%20for%20sustainability','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'25da77faf4212b08399a66fd3ad76f8d','COMP_TOP200_016',NULL,'e70ac87f36f094e536e2f027c10bfe07',NULL,'Our Chairman wrote this vision for sustainability that is rooted in the high standards of corporate behaviour and is driven by a strong sense of purpose to lead sustainable business practices globally. To realise this vision, UltraTech is committed to run its operations in a way that we grow business while conserving natural resources, minimizing our carbon and water footprint, increasing our positive impact on communities, and making a meaningful impact for our stakeholders.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ultratechcement.com/corporate/sustainability/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Chairman%20wrote%20this%20vision%20for%20sustainability',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:16.553917','{}'),(845,'CSR Initiative: Beyond India, we deliver CSR initiatives across the regions where we operate by focusing o','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Beyond%20India%2C%20we%20deliver%20CSR%20initiatives%20across','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9011b25bc739bf39cfc0e3ca532c08eb','COMP_TOP200_014',NULL,'d313b8aa939535bd5c1fe2526a025264',NULL,'Beyond India, we deliver CSR initiatives across the regions where we operate by focusing on locally relevant interventions that address community priorities. In the Americas, the HCLTech Grant for Climate Action advances this commitment by supporting nonprofit organizations working on climate resilience and biodiversity conservation. Through a commitment of $5 million over five years, the grant supports scalable and sustainable climate solutions across the Americas, recognizing and empowering organizations creating lasting environmental impact.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Beyond%20India%2C%20we%20deliver%20CSR%20initiatives%20across',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461','{}'),(846,'CSR Initiative: Driven by a 500+ strong team, HCLFoundation implements flagship programs such as Samuday a','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Driven%20by%20a%20500%2B%20strong%20team%2C%20HCLFoundation','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f27c4b7ce529927ae4694258d5abd5a5','COMP_TOP200_014',NULL,'3b7a2125fc35ea92ac9078638267cb3f',NULL,'Driven by a 500+ strong team, HCLFoundation implements flagship programs such as Samuday and HCLTech Grant (Rural Development), Uday and My Clean City (Urban Development) and Harit (Environment Action), along with initiatives like Power of One, Sports for Change, Academy and My E-Haat.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Driven%20by%20a%20500%2B%20strong%20team%2C%20HCLFoundation',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461','{}'),(847,'CSR Initiative: Anchored by HCLFoundation, HCLTech’s CSR efforts in India focus on building equitable and ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Anchored%20by%20HCLFoundation%2C%20HCLTech%E2%80%99s%20CSR%20efforts%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'63ea7ff451c1f9a4b0efec5518a19668','COMP_TOP200_014',NULL,'ea797b66a8591a715b8cb9da47e93242',NULL,'Anchored by HCLFoundation, HCLTech’s CSR efforts in India focus on building equitable and sustainable communities at scale. HCLFoundation drives long-term socioeconomic and environmental impact through a structured, scalable and integrated life cycle-based approach across education, health and sanitation, livelihoods, environment and disaster risk reduction and response.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Anchored%20by%20HCLFoundation%2C%20HCLTech%E2%80%99s%20CSR%20efforts%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461','{}'),(848,'CSR Initiative: At HCLTech, we combine the power of technology and our people to drive progress responsibl','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=At%20HCLTech%2C%20we%20combine%20the%20power%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bfcebbc497ce98e1cda4d9a68a01968a','COMP_TOP200_014',NULL,'b6aa9493ad2a0f32caf0f982cd5a2d2a',NULL,'At HCLTech, we combine the power of technology and our people to drive progress responsibly and at scale. Our approach is rooted in inclusion, sustainability and shared value, with a focus on protecting the environment, strengthening communities and ensuring progress reaches those who need it most.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hcltech.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=At%20HCLTech%2C%20we%20combine%20the%20power%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:29.614461','{}'),(849,'CSR Initiative: Our Environmental Policy guides environmental management across all sites','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%20Policy%20guides%20environmental%20management%20across','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8bf7ed804a49f1162930596909b962d0','COMP_TOP200_013',NULL,'e63097cf85aa510c5ea5d95a61ca33ea',NULL,'Our Environmental Policy guides environmental management across all sites.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%20Policy%20guides%20environmental%20management%20across',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604','{}'),(850,'CSR Initiative: Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable componen','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20the%20Environment%2C%20Social%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e8b03a5ea308bb61f2ebf8825b0fa679','COMP_TOP200_013',NULL,'01e8867f7f38732902e18be60150a57a',NULL,'Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable component of how we approach business. We have embedded the ESG framework to our core philosophy of value creation – keeping the interests of investors, community, and the environment in focus. Our sustainability roadmap is based on formulating appropriate policies, conforming to regulatory norms, mitigating risks, making regular disclosures, setting targets for minimizing our environmental footprint and strengthening corporate governance to meet those targets. We see these as a set of intertwined parameters that are all linked and manifest as a set of metrics that must speak for themselves. We view governance as not just the letter of the law, but equally about the spirit for us, to proactively understand regulations, stay ahead of any unforeseen violations and ensure transparency in all that we do.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20the%20Environment%2C%20Social%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604','{}'),(851,'CSR Initiative: We have embraced the philosophy of growth with goodness where along with focus on the fina','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=We%20have%20embraced%20the%20philosophy%20of%20growth','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9668876c9ab1cce428d4befa493400b2','COMP_TOP200_013',NULL,'684763e2d5e1f3f9f10f45cceff02ded',NULL,'We have embraced the philosophy of growth with goodness where along with focus on the financial and operational performance; environment conservation, optimum utilisation of resources, community efforts and engagement with all stakeholders are anchored in our business strategy.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=We%20have%20embraced%20the%20philosophy%20of%20growth',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604','{}'),(852,'CSR Initiative: We believe that the foundation for effective ESG management is robust and transparent gove','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20the%20foundation%20for%20effective','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'448d8028de0a27b9c23a7e8ff4dd2c3c','COMP_TOP200_013',NULL,'ec85ae256de79978e245a57afc62ee22',NULL,'We believe that the foundation for effective ESG management is robust and transparent governance and integration of these considerations into the way we do business. This includes alignment with our overall strategy and embedding relevant matters into our risk management framework and our service offerings. We intend to further accelerate our green contribution and become the benchmark for environmental stewardship.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20the%20foundation%20for%20effective',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604','{}'),(853,'CSR Initiative: Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Power%20Limited%20%28APL%29%20is%20deeply%20committed','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7714a8dca0d2e3c9797eca258b1b19f3','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'d006b6c17ce2ad2a838b6cb5dbe75821',NULL,'Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which we operate. Our \'Biodiversity Policy,\' signed by our MD&CEO, aims for No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. By signing the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 22nd February 2020, we pledged to integrate biodiversity aspects into our management systems, ensuring No Net Loss and a positive environmental impact. We prioritise protecting and enhancing the natural environment around our plant locations, ensuring our operations do not harm high biodiversity areas or endangered species within our radius. We have implemented measures to reduce water consumption, minimize pollution, and lower air emissions intensity, including installing Flue Gas Desulphurisers (FGDs) at multiple locations. Our recycling programs and waste minimisation efforts further support our sustainability goals. As part of the Adani Group’s 100 million trees plantation pledge, we are committed to planting 7.85 million trees. Our site-specific restoration plans, such as the \'A New Leaf: Tiroda’s Green Belt Development Project,\' focus on re-vegetation and habitat restoration, significantly reviving degraded ecosystems and promoting biodiversity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Power%20Limited%20%28APL%29%20is%20deeply%20committed',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{}'),(854,'CSR Initiative: We aim to continuously improve our climate governance','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20aim%20to%20continuously%20improve%20our%20climate','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f39f6599141f6a43a221f8f3a2c24714','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'8855db4691164f9a18c04783a5a61976',NULL,'We aim to continuously improve our climate governance. Recently, Adani Power Limited received assessment from CDP – the global environmental disclosure system – to measure the risks and opportunities on climate change as well as water security. The company has received a CDP score (Climate Change Score) of D which is a Disclosure band. This is as same as the Asia regional average of D, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. The company also received a C band (Water Security) which is an Awareness Band. This is lower than the Asia regional average of B, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. These CDP Score Reports will enable us to progress towards our sustainability goals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20aim%20to%20continuously%20improve%20our%20climate',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{}'),(855,'CSR Initiative: At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' an','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Power%2C%20we%20are%20driven%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0156e9460f16ba7ff1fb97528e208737','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'6303a6310dbd2b5c7f68e10d8b7e01a7',NULL,'At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' and a vision to be a world-class leader in businesses that enrich lives and contribute to nation-building through sustainable value creation. We are well-positioned to capitalize on any future opportunities for growth, empowered by our commitment to sustainability and our passion for making a positive impact on the environment and society. Join us on our journey to illuminate the nation and sustain excellence in sustainability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Power%2C%20we%20are%20driven%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{}'),(856,'CSR Initiative: We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accor','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20are%20in%20our%2010th%20year%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'189fbed25c75fe9bc062e129b9b487fe','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'aa6a1059686da41a035db2f9fa9c79cb',NULL,'We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accordance with the Global Reporting Initiative (GRI) and aligned with other reporting standards and guidelines. Our ESG performance is reflected through our ESG ratings, including a percentile score of 73 for Adani Power Limited in the Corporate Sustainability Assessment by DJSI-S&P Global. We have also received a \'B\' score for our performance towards Climate Change and Water Security commitments as per the Carbon Disclosure Project (CDP).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20are%20in%20our%2010th%20year%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{}'),(857,'CSR Initiative: We are proud to be a pioneer in the energy sector, navigating the ever','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20are%20proud%20to%20be%20a%20pioneer','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8f63e4fad37be35d7aa5cbe6dbb74947','COMP_TOP200_0