%20think.','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a524313407819a2525796cfc2222c702','COMP_TOP200_007',NULL,'9c3cd5bcc1e037d08fab9b11bf93a3bb',NULL,'The future is closer than you think. There are basic and massive changes occurring in the ecosystem; energy change, sustainability as a way of life and digitalisation is impacting every aspect of business. We must be future ready.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:30.970447',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:30.970447',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:30.970447',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lntsustainability.com/#:~:text=The%20future%20is%20closer%20than%20you%20think.',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:30.970447','{}'),(873,'CSR Initiative: You may refuse to accept cookies by activating the setter on your browser, which allows yo','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=You%20may%20refuse%20to%20accept%20cookies%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ff02247ee160d3af1f6e69f1f6557388','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'e9f5a7cd79ea70adf0812a1b39f83846',NULL,'You may refuse to accept cookies by activating the setter on your browser, which allows you to refuse the setting of cookies. However, this may cause certain parts of our website to remain inaccessible to you. Until you have set your browser setting to refuse cookies, our system will continue to issue cookies when you log onto our site. Please take note of the fact that our advertisers may also use cookies and we have no control over this. For more information on how to control and/or disable cookies please click here.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=You%20may%20refuse%20to%20accept%20cookies%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(8