SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(876,'CSR Initiative: The records of access, instructions, transactions and other activities maintained or cause','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=The%20records%20of%20access%2C%20instructions%2C%20transactions%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5f7acc7e1ae941d9eb964e6f94fd75d7','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'fcda67c6baaee803f2e19439ff035a1f',NULL,'The records of access, instructions, transactions and other activities maintained or caused to be maintained by ICICI Bank through its or a third party\'s computer systems or on tape or other recording or storage device or otherwise shall be admissible in evidence, shall not be challenged by the Registered User and shall be accepted as genuine, accurate, conclusive and binding for all purposes including the recording of the time thereof.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=The%20records%20of%20access%2C%20instructions%2C%20transactions%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(877,'CSR Initiative: However, the Internet is an open system and ICICI Bank cannot, and does not, guarantee tha','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=However%2C%20the%20Internet%20is%20an%20open%20system','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c6733e16c8b4a86b6cb890ab87528997','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'363597fc5f6ca48a6cad87ef36de992b',NULL,'However, the Internet is an open system and ICICI Bank cannot, and does not, guarantee that the personal information which the Registered User furnishes will not be intercepted or accessed by others and decrypted. ICICI Bank, its affiliates and partners, and its and their respective directors, employees, agents and representatives shall not be liable or responsible should any confidential or other information provided by or pertaining to the Visitor (including credit card numbers, bank account numbers, passwords, personal identification numbers, IDs, transaction details, etc.) be intercepted and subsequently used by an unintended recipient.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=However%2C%20the%20Internet%20is%20an%20open%20system',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(878,'CSR Initiative: ICICI Bank uses 128','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=ICICI%20Bank%20uses%20128-bit%20encryption%2C%20which%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'19f6e5c853bb537540fb6f8cc6c77d4b','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'bfc26281c4daf774d2c26069a1a98793',NULL,'ICICI Bank uses 128-bit encryption, which is currently the permitted level of encryption in India, for the transmission of Visitor registration and transaction requests and information. When the information provided by Visitor is not transmitted through this encryption, the Visitor’s computer system (if configured accordingly) will display an appropriate message.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=ICICI%20Bank%20uses%20128-bit%20encryption%2C%20which%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(879,'CSR Initiative: The security of customer’s personal information is a priority and the same is protected by','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=The%20security%20of%20customer%E2%80%99s%20personal%20information%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'08ba16c0352e84ed5bc6799bc4494dbb','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'ae1bc5f0d58c86811a22d8acd6c0c532',NULL,'The security of customer’s personal information is a priority and the same is protected by maintaining adequate physical, electronic and procedural safeguards that meet applicable laws and regulatory guidelines. The Bank implements and maintains its security systems to ensure that the personal Information of the customer is appropriately protected.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=The%20security%20of%20customer%E2%80%99s%20personal%20information%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(880,'CSR Initiative: Watch how ICICI Bank has created positive impact on the environment and society','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=Watch%20how%20ICICI%20Bank%20has%20created%20positive','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'742dc9e41d5b54aa68285ff3f0b78826','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'cc41f80f151f78ddcca31acb2b13f865',NULL,'Watch how ICICI Bank has created positive impact on the environment and society',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=Watch%20how%20ICICI%20Bank%20has%20created%20positive',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(881,'CSR Initiative: It is our constant endeavour to minimise the environmental impact of our operations','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=It%20is%20our%20constant%20endeavour%20to%20minimise','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'51b0ea399c2a13b36f534cbf46ef04f1','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'e5036559e93ce2982bbd5038ab9fa195',NULL,'It is our constant endeavour to minimise the environmental impact of our operations. We have actively pursued opportunities to adopt new technologies and energy-efficient practices in our operations to reduce emissions.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=It%20is%20our%20constant%20endeavour%20to%20minimise',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(882,'CSR Initiative: to become carbon neutral in Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions by fiscal 2032','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=to%20become%20carbon%20neutral%20in%20Scope%201','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b511661d7172df717a87317001c36656','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'4cf8238b1249da4eeab2cee6d8ad90ae',NULL,'to become carbon neutral in Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions by fiscal 2032',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=to%20become%20carbon%20neutral%20in%20Scope%201',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(883,'CSR Initiative: To adopt sustainable business practices that ensure the long','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=To%20adopt%20sustainable%20business%20practices%20that%20ensure','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'eb7e716ba9c51af87f49945edddf15bc','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'c102859c38ac4ca66939cc85c39f0ee1',NULL,'To adopt sustainable business practices that ensure the long-term success of the organisation and have a positive impact on the environment and society.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=To%20adopt%20sustainable%20business%20practices%20that%20ensure',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(884,'CSR Initiative: ESG is integral to our journey towards building responsible and sustainable business pract','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=ESG%20is%20integral%20to%20our%20journey%20towards','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8f03216293a7f23801eb9440d92c40e2','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'4b759c0d666d11fd33c2d81055ebff6a',NULL,'ESG is integral to our journey towards building responsible and sustainable business practices. The Board-approved Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) Policy reflects the core values and focus that drive our efforts.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.icici.bank.in/about-us/esg#:~:text=ESG%20is%20integral%20to%20our%20journey%20towards',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:04.631559','{}'),(885,'CSR Initiative: No single organization can create a sustainable future','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.tcs.com/who-we-are/tcs-sustainable-business-carbon-neutrality#:~:text=No%20single%20organization%20can%20create%20a%20sustainable','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0f6b63c9400a49afde7f9f7c448eb70f','COMP_TOP200_005',NULL,'d7e980b2b5883cac638f441899971fd8',NULL,'No single organization can create a sustainable future. Sustainability is nurtured within an ecosystem. We engage with clients and partners to help shape their journeys to more sustainable and future-fit businesses that thrive within an ecosystem. Our co-innovation network that comprises academia, startups, and business partners, focuses on social innovation and sustainability initiatives that impact people at the grassroots. Here’s our full suite of services to help you meet your sustainability goals',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tcs.com/who-we-are/tcs-sustainable-business-carbon-neutrality#:~:text=No%20single%20organization%20can%20create%20a%20sustainable',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090','{}'),(886,'CSR Initiative: Business sustainability is linked to the planet’s sustainability','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tcs.com/who-we-are/tcs-sustainable-business-carbon-neutrality#:~:text=Business%20sustainability%20is%20linked%20to%20the%20planet%E2%80%99s','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c8218d4556e41434f4993f51d2d1a95b','COMP_TOP200_005',NULL,'332524221035d1a497d8bced159aa5e1',NULL,'Business sustainability is linked to the planet’s sustainability. Together with our employees, shareholders, suppliers, clients, and the youth in the community, we drive accelerated action toward climate change mitigation, achieving carbon neutrality, and natural resource preservation. Read our annual report.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tcs.com/who-we-are/tcs-sustainable-business-carbon-neutrality#:~:text=Business%20sustainability%20is%20linked%20to%20the%20planet%E2%80%99s',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090','{}'),(887,'CSR Initiative: TCS follows the Tata group philosophy of building sustainable businesses that are rooted i','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.tcs.com/who-we-are/tcs-sustainable-business-carbon-neutrality#:~:text=TCS%20follows%20the%20Tata%20group%20philosophy%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e95fea5070ea37f74430c78f025d842b','COMP_TOP200_005',NULL,'cf3decd52ca0bf176f0bba649c36e05b',NULL,'TCS follows the Tata group philosophy of building sustainable businesses that are rooted in the community and demonstrate care for the environment. Corporate sustainability is folded into our triple bottom line focus of people, planet, and purpose. Our thrust is on reducing carbon footprint, using renewable energies, and focusing on a regenerative approach to business. How do we enable this? By creating a greater consciousness of the environment we live in through collaborations with our employees, suppliers, customers, and the community at large.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.tcs.com/who-we-are/tcs-sustainable-business-carbon-neutrality#:~:text=TCS%20follows%20the%20Tata%20group%20philosophy%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:13.580090','{}'),(888,'CSR Initiative: For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem a','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://razorpay.com/about/#:~:text=For%20a%20long%20time%2C%20we%20have%20felt','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8749b65c0db2161e64bdbc39d94c671e','COMP_0',NULL,'d64159589209b3409c244ec78a64d740',NULL,'For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem and nobody seems to be doing it right. We decided to tackle it ourselves. Founded by IIT Roorkee alumni, Razorpay aims to revolutionize money management for online businesses by providing clean, developer-friendly APIs and hassle-free integration. We offer a fast, affordable and secure way for merchants, schools, ecommerce and other companies to accept and disburse payments online, own a fully-functional current account and avail working capital loans.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://razorpay.com/about/#:~:text=For%20a%20long%20time%2C%20we%20have%20felt',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621','{}'),(889,'CSR Initiative: Corporate CSR Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Not-ongoing%20projects%3A%20The%20unutilised%20part%20is%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'13a31e6eeb324bbd84e6c1740c16ec52','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'e410fc0fbe69d374f6898e795d42d859',NULL,'Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Not-ongoing%20projects%3A%20The%20unutilised%20part%20is%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628','{}'),(890,'CSR Initiative: CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or mor','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=CSR%20provisions%20don%27t%20apply%20to%20companies%20whose','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f6f93aadb8cda45e81597465ebe653f4','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'9fe0e4345221fc7a46099f0a607b1b98',NULL,'CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or more, turnover of ₹1,000 crore or more, or net profits of ₹5 crore or more during the immediately preceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=CSR%20provisions%20don%27t%20apply%20to%20companies%20whose',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628','{}'),(891,'CSR Initiative: Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Socia','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Every%20company%20which%20satisfies%20the%20specified%20criteria','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'60fa5b8faa0afe5ad1778f4a1550a99c','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'75f71536a38352fac7a3bd43493a0dd0',NULL,'Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Social Responsibility Committee of the board. The committee shall consist of 3 or more Directors, out of which 1 Director should be an Independent Director. In case a company is not required to appoint an Independent Director under Section 149(4), then its CSR committee should have at least 2 or more Directors.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Every%20company%20which%20satisfies%20the%20specified%20criteria',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628','{}'),(892,'CSR Initiative: Veterinary professionals provide world','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.ril.com/about/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Veterinary%20professionals%20provide%20world-class%20medical%20care%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b245232bc3780ce9f0581f97ce439f48','COMP_TOP200_001',NULL,'fba818e945182d6ba0a4cfdacc174468',NULL,'Veterinary professionals provide world-class medical care to rescued wildlife in Vantara',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ril.com/about/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Veterinary%20professionals%20provide%20world-class%20medical%20care%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858','{}'),(893,'CSR Initiative: Women empowered through livelihood and entrepreneurial initiatives across programmes*','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.ril.com/about/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Women%20empowered%20through%20livelihood%20and%20entrepreneurial%20initiatives','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d58675e38608f1fec5b726b425e494b8','COMP_TOP200_001',NULL,'5e4acd548a8c738eb34f3e651811937d',NULL,'Women empowered through livelihood and entrepreneurial initiatives across programmes*',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.ril.com/about/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Women%20empowered%20through%20livelihood%20and%20entrepreneurial%20initiatives',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858','{}'),(894,'CSR Init