als Sunday Doctors appointment page.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Booking%20early%20allows%20you%20to%20confirm%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(913,'CSR Initiative: Advance booking may not always be mandatory, but it is strongly recommended for Sunday doc','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Advance%20booking%20may%20not%20always%20be%20mandatory%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'06d9d14d905d310fdc98e705051fe8fc','COMP_TOP200_063',NULL,'bf4f7edc098deeb344763d9bb630c0e7',NULL,'Advance booking may not always be mandatory, but it is strongly recommended for Sunday doctor consultations at Apollo Hospitals. Weekend appointment slots may be limited because fewer doctors or departments may be available compared with regular weekdays. Popular specialists may also have limited availability or become fully booked in advance.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Advance%20booking%20may%20not%20always%20be%20mandatory%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(914,'CSR Initiative: Patients should check the latest appointment timings displayed on the Apollo Hospitals Sun','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Patients%20should%20check%20the%20latest%20appointment%20timings','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fa043069a3b2159e009ba82a1b44fcc0','COMP_TOP200_063',NULL,'32f79e5cf65479eef6a491463e37eab2',NULL,'Patients should check the latest appointment timings displayed on the Apollo Hospitals Sunday Doctors booking page. Confirming the consultation time in advance can help avoid delays and ensure that the doctor is available when you arrive. Check the current Sunday doctor consultation timings before planning your visit.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Patients%20should%20check%20the%20latest%20appointment%20timings',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(915,'CSR Initiative: Sunday doctor consultation timings are not the same at every Apollo Hospitals location','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Sunday%20doctor%20consultation%20timings%20are%20not%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d59be5b63c9ec18f59f7d23c0872eb77','COMP_TOP200_063',NULL,'bedded170071ad371ac792ea78ba2b94',NULL,'Sunday doctor consultation timings are not the same at every Apollo Hospitals location. Timings may vary based on the hospital, department, specialty, doctor, and number of available appointment slots. Some doctors may offer consultations during specific morning or afternoon hours, while others may have different Sunday schedules.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Sunday%20doctor%20consultation%20timings%20are%20not%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(916,'CSR Initiative: If you need a specific specialist, it is recommended that you check the doctor’s Sunday av','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=If%20you%20need%20a%20specific%20specialist%2C%20it','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a61544ff41c61923ff1af0c717dc6c11','COMP_TOP200_0