 leading multispeciality hospital group in India due to its clinical depth, advanced infrastructure, and integrated care delivery across specialties. Its leadership in healthcare has been independently acknowledged through national and global assessments, including recognition by Times Network India Health Awards, The Week–Hansa Research Best Hospitals Survey, Times Health Survey, and Newsweek World’s Best Hospitals, reflecting consistent performance in clinical outcomes, patient safety, and care quality.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Apollo%20Hospitals%20is%20recognised%20as%20a%20leading',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(955,'CSR Initiative: Why is Apollo Hospitals recognised as one of the leading multispeciality hospital groups i','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Why%20is%20Apollo%20Hospitals%20recognised%20as%20one','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3955302f1544d2a65e143dc661497518','COMP_TOP200_063',NULL,'4c1f82deaf6795413dcef3f3dfbfae52',NULL,'Why is Apollo Hospitals recognised as one of the leading multispeciality hospital groups in India?',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Why%20is%20Apollo%20Hospitals%20recognised%20as%20one',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(956,'CSR Initiative: Explore detailed answers to commonly asked questions about healthcare services, specialist','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Explore%20detailed%20answers%20to%20commonly%20asked%20questions','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'92af51a7db637be51e8e4e6b9ddb21c3','COMP_TOP200_063',NULL,'2ac45d13e9681dffbd0bfb991b89f971',NULL,'Explore detailed answers to commonly asked questions about healthcare services, specialist consultations, treatment processes, and patient care at Apollo Hospitals, one of India’s leading multispeciality hospital networks.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Explore%20detailed%20answers%20to%20commonly%20asked%20questions',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(957,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Dear%20Dr.%20Jayanti%2C%20I%20want%20to%20thank','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8e7e9d2020a51f7766a6bf5eba9bcc6b','COMP_TOP200_063',NULL,'d5c54b54a10e411361da655351fe2afa',NULL,'Dear Dr. Jayanti, I want to thank you for the exceptional care you provided during my lumpectomy. Your precise surgical skills and compassionate approach laid the foundation for my recovery and every medical professional since has praised your work. Despite initial challenges with my treatment, I’m thrilled to share that I’ve completed chemotherapy and will soon begin radiation and hormone therapy. Your expertise has been a constant source of strength throughout this journey.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=Dear%20Dr.%20Jayanti%2C%20I%20want%20to%20thank',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:12:05.144172','{}'),(958,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.apollohospitals.com/#:~:text=I%20am%20a%2058-year-old%20mechanical%20engineer%20who','Sched