o this website, such as the pages you visit, the website you came from and some of the searches you perform. Such information is used by us to help improve the contents of the site and to compile aggregate statistics about individuals using our site for internal, market research purposes. In doing this, we may install “cookies” that collect the domain name of the user, your internet service provider, your operating system, and the date and time of access. A “cookie” is a small piece of information which is sent to your browser and stored on your computer’s hard drive. Cookies do not damage your computer. You can set your browser to notify you when you receive a “cookie,” this will enable you to decide if you want to accept it or not. If you do not want us to install cookies, please email us at privacy-officer@3iinfotech. com. We would like to inform you, however, that if you do not accept you may not be able to use all functionality of your browser software. We may obtain the services of outside parties to assist us in collecting and processing the information described in this Section.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.3i-infotech.com/privacy-policy/#:~:text=We%20may%20collect%20and%20process%20information%20about',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511','{}'),(988,'CSR Initiative: Personal Data must be safeguarded from unauthorized access and unlawful processing or disc','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.3i-infotech.com/privacy-policy/#:~:text=Personal%20Data%20must%20be%20safeguarded%20from%20unauthorized','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'418047ca0074495ceb54d78999cc37fa','COMP_TOP200_160',NULL,'34c3c833cbb4f89b7588d7caedede041',NULL,'Personal Data must be safeguarded from unauthorized access and unlawful processing or disclosure, as well as accidental loss, modification or destruction. This applies regardless of whether data is processed electronically or in paper form. Before the introduction of new methods of data processing, particularly new IT systems, technical and organizational measures to protect personal data must be defined and implemented. These measures must be based on the state of the art, the risks of processing, and the need to protect the data (determined by the process for information classification).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.3i-infotech.com/privacy-policy/#:~:text=Personal%20Data%20must%20be%20safeguarded%20from%20unauthorized',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511','{}'),(989,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.3i-infotech.com/#:~:text=-%20NuRe%20Campus%20Recognized%20as%20a%20Representative','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bbb4b6dfef4abb32132a3a7a89fe4650','COMP_TOP200_160',NULL,'315c353c1e8f2936ad97f34672422a70',NULL,'- NuRe Campus Recognized as a Representative Vendor in Gartner\'s 2024 Market Guide for Higher Education Student Information Systems',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.3i-infotech.com/#:~:text=-%20NuRe%20Campus%20Recognized%20as%20a%20Representative',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:26.693511','{}'),(990,'CSR Statutory Partnership: Download','CSR Grant / Program','Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.mahindra.com/sites/default/files/2023-10/Mahindra-Sustainability-Report-2022-23.pdf','Statutory annual filing CSR opportunity for Mahindra & Mahindra Limited.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'429a83534e47afb3d7198dbf59e50716','COMP_TOP200_011',NULL,'7abf51d4c4