 12:22:36.100786','{}'),(996,'CSR Initiative: Promoting education, including special education and employment enhancing vocation skills ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Promoting%20education%2C%20including%20special%20education%20and%20employment','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b31e58f92bc718fef1ac7bfaab71cf68','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'154496f07c7bd144f492e9f7af0d8876',NULL,'Promoting education, including special education and employment enhancing vocation skills especially among children, women, elderly.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Promoting%20education%2C%20including%20special%20education%20and%20employment',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(997,'CSR Initiative: LPL Foundations program ‘Strengthening Primary Health Care Delivery Services’ is aimed at ','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=LPL%20Foundations%20program%20%E2%80%98Strengthening%20Primary%20Health%20Care','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9d3ee176eccd0d962c9749f3a749d8cc','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'e1343a9b7d69189e7d5b5fef27f03cd0',NULL,'LPL Foundations program ‘Strengthening Primary Health Care Delivery Services’ is aimed at optimising the Government’s programs to be accessed by the communities seamlessly. The objective of the program is to leverage existing public and institutional primary health services and technology to reach rural areas for healthcare. Promote healthcare awareness and preventive healthcare among communities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=LPL%20Foundations%20program%20%E2%80%98Strengthening%20Primary%20Health%20Care',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(998,'CSR Initiative: During the pandemic, Lal PathLabs Foundation played a vital role by contributing 1','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=During%20the%20pandemic%2C%20Lal%20PathLabs%20Foundation%20played','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'83df2426b38f2a39bbbe79b12942a050','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'2cb29af2fbe6aa361036d30eeab0d691',NULL,'During the pandemic, Lal PathLabs Foundation played a vital role by contributing 1.2 Crore to the PM Cares Fund. Additionally, the foundation donated equipment and testing kits valued at Rs 70 Lacs to the Assam State Government, along with providing N95 masks and a Neonatal Ambulance.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=During%20the%20pandemic%2C%20Lal%20PathLabs%20Foundation%20played',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(999,'CSR Initiative: Under our community health initiative in Indore (MP), we provide vital dialysis services t','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20our%20community%20health%20initiative%20in%20Indore','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0d2dc16e76a5631b630c0cf84d9aa04d','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'c019501848c171c6e1709f16798fba1a',NULL,'Under our community health initiative in Indore (MP), we provide vital dialysis services to the underprivileged, addressing the healthcare gap. Additionally, our focus on prevention and awareness targets chronic diseases, emphasizing kidney care. In Mumbai, our Women Empowerment Program positively impacts 2,000 underprivileged women, with 200 engaging in income-generating activities. The Help Care Society receives aid through blanket donations, while Akshay Patra benefits from our support in the Airtel Delhi Half Marathon, assisting underprivileged children.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20our%20community%20health%20initiative%20in%20Indore',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1000,'CSR Initiative: Comprehensive School HealthProgram (CSHP) is a unique healthcurriculum','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Comprehensive%20School%20HealthProgram%20%28CSHP%29%20is%20a%20unique','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'db10b8f1522ccb6b8a1665832465a026','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'9cfb8a7c4b375f6cdb99f91216c21432',NULL,'Comprehensive School HealthProgram (CSHP) is a unique healthcurriculum-based program forschool students in Class VI & VII.The curriculum covers health care, health awareness and aims atbehavioral change towards betterhealth management with a focuson non-communicable diseases. The program also covers a trainthe-trainer program where teachersare trained to drive positive healthbehavior among their students in Delhi-NCR and Tri-City Chandigarh.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Comprehensive%20School%20HealthProgram%20%28CSHP%29%20is%20a%20unique',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1001,'CSR Initiative: Creating new knowledge, thought leadership and research specific to healthcare, LPL Founda','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Creating%20new%20knowledge%2C%20thought%20leadership%20and%20research','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'71232cb30cb36000e2705d6d848192f4','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'4f77ed4e4ef3dc30e74b41bd99f6b923',NULL,'Creating new knowledge, thought leadership and research specific to healthcare, LPL Foundation signed an MOU with Indian Institute of Management, Ahmedabad to establish a professional chair in healthcare at the institutetitled ‘Dr Lal PathLabs Chair in Healthcare’. This is an ongoing project that commenced in FY 2022- 23 and this phase of the program continues until 2025.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Creating%20new%20knowledge%2C%20thought%20leadership%20and%20research',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1002,'CSR Initiative: Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issue','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20the%20comprehensive%20community%20health%20initiative%2C%20LPL','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'db5e03e2d04b2e29b8910b786c228466','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'ab5f279c31c72a738b2c6767bb562870',NULL,'Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issues holistically, emphasizing community capacity building and awareness on various health issues, including preventive healthcare, first-aid, nutrition, anemia, kitchen gardening, immunization, adolescence health, water and sanitation, and access to health services via telemedicine. In Kanpur and Kanpur Rural, Uttar Pradesh, the foundation supports 60-70 \'Ekal Vidyalaya\' centers, providing informal primary education to tribal children. The initiative also includes backing \'Swachh Bharat Abhiyan\' with dustbin units in North-West Delhi, aiding the \'Paryas Society\' in Himachal Pradesh with dengue-testing kits, and supporting the TB eradication program of \'Delhi Commonwealth Women Association.\' Additionally, assistance is provided to \'The Lepra Trust India\' for leprosy-affected families.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20the%20comprehensive%20community%20health%20initiative%2C%20LPL',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1003,'CSR Initiative: The program has a three','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=The%20program%20has%20a%20three-pronged%20approach%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fb9e1987c119e6e03feccfe2669cc99e','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'c1daf0fde4907823d9dbe748aba8754e',NULL,'The program has a three-pronged approach to provide support to existing TB patients with nutritional support to maintain a healthy diet align the communities with the Government’s national drive to eradicate TB through community awareness programs and strengthen health delivery systems by working with communities and district health officials.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=The%20program%20has%20a%20three-pronged%20approach%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1004,'CSR Initiative: Supporting and serving as a Ni','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Supporting%20and%20serving%20as%20a%20Ni-Kshay%20Mitra%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'321337d8bfb1636e1bb80d40f6fc2c38','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'e24d7c762c9b017b1f41d0937d6fc262',NULL,'Supporting and serving as a Ni-Kshay Mitra, LPL Foundation providing nutritional support to all the TB patients of the District Mewat (Nuh), Haryana.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Supporting%20and%20serving%20as%20a%20Ni-Kshay%20Mitra%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1005,'CSR Initiative: The LPL Academy for Laboratory Medicine serves as the flagship initiative of the Lal PathL','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=The%20LPL%20Academy%20for%20Laboratory%20Medicine%20serves','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2e223a4b51280ca5d5e7ba8635310b84','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'3a5641f9279bbbc0b9f1f2ed66de4280',NULL,'The LPL Academy for Laboratory Medicine serves as the flagship initiative of the Lal PathLabs Foundation. Acknowledging the noted challenges and the significant shortfall of trained healthcare professionals, Dr Lal PathLabs Ltd. has dedicated its focus to the skill development of healthcare practitioners through its CSR endeavors.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=The%20LPL%20Academy%20for%20Laboratory%20Medicine%20serves',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:18:37.649201','{}'),(1006,'CSR Initiative: I sincerely thank our partners, teams, and stakeholders who make this mission possible','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=I%20sincerely%20thank%20our%20partners%2C%20teams%2C%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3d61307ee48937cd4732e7b6c3a4b93b','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'9c15889a