l nutrition and nutraceutical industries of the world.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:04.772292',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:04.772292',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:04.772292',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.avtnatural.com/#:~:text=AVT%20Natural%20is%20a%20leading%20vertically%20integrated',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:04.772292','{}'),(1036,'CSR Initiative: Sustainability extends beyond our operations','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Sustainability%20extends%20beyond%20our%20operations.%20We%20actively','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3a8555503b4ff34a4d56c3c839ec8230','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'52d1dd1d8bcf5981a31072ea7cae10c1',NULL,'Sustainability extends beyond our operations. We actively prioritize biodiversity conservation, avoiding wildlife corridors and ensuring all vehicles are PUC-compliant to safeguard ecosystems. Our commitment also includes employee training and stakeholder partnerships that embed sustainability deeply into our culture. By aligning our efforts with global climate goals, we strive to protect both the planet and the communities we serve.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Sustainability%20extends%20beyond%20our%20operations.%20We%20actively',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511','{}'),(1037,'CSR Initiative: Warehouses use solar energy and efficient HVAC systems to ensure sustainable, eco','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Warehouses%20use%20solar%20energy%20and%20efficient%20HVAC','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0859465ba0cf5019cf9c4ec2cc73447c','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'89673c9ee2443b02dfa1149ddae08079',NULL,'Warehouses use solar energy and efficient HVAC systems to ensure sustainable, eco-friendly operations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Warehouses%20use%20solar%20energy%20and%20efficient%20HVAC',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511','{}'),(1038,'CSR Initiative: Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20sustainability%20is%20reflected%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e4459b8de4e205f9c18a435dedc5adac','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'9bdce5664457719e65e090679b221573',NULL,'Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move. A growing share of our fleet now runs on electric vehicles (EVs) and alternative fuels, significantly cutting emissions at the source. Using AI-driven route optimization, we reduce mileage, fuel use, and carbon output across operations. Our energy-efficient warehouses, powered by solar energy and equipped with smart lighting systems, lower energy consumption by up to 30%. Additionally, comprehensive recycling and waste-to-resource initiatives ensure we contribute as little as possible to landfills—turning waste into opportunity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20sustainability%20is%20reflected%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511','{}'),(1039,'CSR Initiative: At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=At%20AVG%20Logistics%2C%20environmental%20stewardship%20is%20more','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f3b312aeca24bf24c9aab7d9c0e7fbbf','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'83827a78edde32f4f59a1cdf2e716e37',NULL,'At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment—it’s embedded in our DNA. We\'ve implemented a holistic sustainability strategy that integrates cutting-edge technologies, alternative energy solutions, and ethical business practices. From optimizing route efficiency to adopting cleaner fuels, every step we take is aimed at minimizing our ecological footprint—while maximizing impact for a greener future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=At%20AVG%20Logistics%2C%20environmental%20stewardship%20is%20more',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511','{}'),(1040,'CSR Initiative: In an era defined by climate urgency, sustainability isn’t optional','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=In%20an%20era%20defined%20by%20climate%20urgency%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'16675fbdb2c3ebcc881b21e131dd88f1','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'ed84f8f64205b61e45c3c0a211e73d5c',NULL,'In an era defined by climate urgency, sustainability isn’t optional—it’s essential. The supply chain industry, long dependent on fossil fuels, bears a critical responsibility to reduce carbon emissions and lead the shift toward eco-conscious operations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=In%20an%20era%20defined%20by%20climate%20urgency%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12