'952051fed25ab391ca8390e3127ef269',NULL,'Millions of children of school-going age don’t have access to good educational infrastructure at the primary level. We have partnered with several',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=Millions%20of%20children%20of%20school-going%20age%20don%E2%80%99t',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359','{}'),(1072,'CSR Initiative: We have constructed over 100 toilets with running water supply in the Manjipura village, N','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=We%20have%20constructed%20over%20100%20toilets%20with','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7a4f83052975115da6d1a5fdfc8346b7','COMP_TOP200_171',NULL,'36b10bdd01268114b241e75aa428e54e',NULL,'We have constructed over 100 toilets with running water supply in the Manjipura village, Nadiad district, where our manufacturing unit is located. In addition, we’ve conducted several outreach programmes to educate villagers about proper sanitation and hygiene practices.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=We%20have%20constructed%20over%20100%20toilets%20with',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359','{}'),(1073,'CSR Initiative: Further, we gave donation to a hospital located at Nadiad run by The Dharmsinh Desai Found','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=Further%2C%20we%20gave%20donation%20to%20a%20hospital','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a7209b5b1670d4c39c2e9401df59449b','COMP_TOP200_171',NULL,'213d756b46c21387893680d06e7436d5',NULL,'Further, we gave donation to a hospital located at Nadiad run by The Dharmsinh Desai Foundation for acquisition of PPE kits for the staff treating COVID patients.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=Further%2C%20we%20gave%20donation%20to%20a%20hospital',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359','{}'),(1074,'CSR Initiative: We partnered with a NGO called Uddhar Vikas Sanstha for food and hygiene kit distribution ','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=We%20partnered%20with%20a%20NGO%20called%20Uddhar','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f2b24d209563462b9f3ef942d14dd634','COMP_TOP200_171',NULL,'e7295cf636577d370f9b2410a96feed0',NULL,'We partnered with a NGO called Uddhar Vikas Sanstha for food and hygiene kit distribution to slums and village children affected by COVID-19 in Pune and Ahmednagar districts of Maharashtra.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=We%20partnered%20with%20a%20NGO%20called%20Uddhar',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359','{}'),(1075,'CSR Initiative: Our business philosophy goes beyond the bottom line, with an aim to give back','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=Our%20business%20philosophy%20goes%20beyond%20the%20bottom','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'33e8406ef3fa040b2bf2c065409f0898','COMP_TOP200_171',NULL,'a4676e87cc53ea0b21bc0db465e05b77',NULL,'Our business philosophy goes beyond the bottom line, with an aim to give back. We support and work with organisations involved in community development, education, women empowerment, animal welfare and more.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://adf-foods.com/csr-initiatives/#:~:text=Our%20business%20philosophy%20goes%20beyond%20the%20bottom',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.381359','{}'),(1076,'CSR Initiative: ACS Technologies transformed our business with their custom software solutions','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.acstechnologies.co.in/#:~:text=ACS%20Technologies%20transformed%20our%20business%20with%20their','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'343368a8db7137021c9c12e05dc807cf','COMP_TOP200_170',NULL,'7439bd63d65a51a585c787f4a39f456f',NULL,'ACS Technologies transformed our business with their custom software solutions. Their ability to integrate seamlessly with our systems improved our operations significantly. A true game-changer!',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.acstechnologies.co.in/#:~:text=ACS%20Technologies%20transformed%20our%20business%20with%20their',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322','{}'),(1077,'CSR Initiative: ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers w','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.acstechnologies.co.in/#:~:text=ACS%20Technologies%20was%20incorporated%20in%201980%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'df028f66c53c4e497b21918fbb7da189','COMP_TOP200_170',NULL,'b4e5768474536ce1375d567033d57b45',NULL,'ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers who had built their expertise at institutions that defined the global technology landscape — IBM, Bell Labs, IIM, ECIL, and ASCI. At a time when computing in India was in its infancy, these founders saw not just possibility, but obligation: to build a company that could bring world-class technology capability to Indian organisations. That founding conviction — rigorous expertise, applied boldly — has never changed. Today, listed on both BSE (Scrip Code: 530745) and NSE (Symbol: ACSTECH), with deployments ranging from AI systems for the Indian Armed Forces to geospatial work with ISRO and smart facility platforms across the Gulf, ACS Technologies stands as one of India\'s longest-standing and most trusted independent technology companies.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.acstechnologies.co.in/#:~:text=ACS%20Technologies%20was%20incorporated%20in%201980%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:57.032322','{}'),(1078,'CSR Initiative: The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6728da5612550bd9f0cdb120a626272c','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'b760640f991e06dc698203e21c640840',NULL,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{}'),(1079,'CSR Initiative: Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e78a11eb3df93dc99708b0bb3ad87a57','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'e1de98964c41ae67bf11ccedc5b0c680',NULL,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{}'),(1080,'CSR Initiative: The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a6d2ee4d5bfbb256f10d5286ed99e33a','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'f2f7b5db449bd6453315a401009dabb3',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{}'),(1081,'CSR Initiative: Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ebdcfe8f3373c471a348ef9938bbd962','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'8513461eb39a8cf913a6f8908c6d51d2',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{}'),(1082,'CSR Initiative: The turnover of the Company in years 2023','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.abmintl.in/#:~:text=The%20turnover%20of%20the%20Company%20in%20years','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'19618f0ce32cf84399d1e61c61c1e665','COMP_TOP200_167',NULL,'bc51921f40a2869c95092487603709c5',NULL,'The turnover of the Company in years 2023-2024 has increased to Rs.93.64 Crores as against Rs.85.37 Crores in the previous year 2022-2023, resulting in increase of 9.68%. However in the year 2023-24, the company has reduced its losses and incurred a loss of Rs.3.43 Crores as compared to a loss of Rs.6.69 Crores in the previous year 2022-23. The Earnings per share(EPS) for the year is Rs.-3.65 per share as compared to Rs-7.11 per share in the previous year. DIVIDEND The Directors have not recommended any dividend for this financial year. RESERVES Taking into account the overall financial performances of the Company, your Directors have not transferred any amount to the General Reserve Account. DEPOSITS During the year under review, your Company did not accept any deposits within the meaning of provisions of Chapter V-Acceptance of Deposits by Companies of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the Companies (Acceptance of Deposits) Rules, 2014.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:41.438888',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:41.438888',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:41.438888',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.abmintl.in/#:~:text=The%20turnover%20of%20the%20Company%20in%20years',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:41.438888','{}'),(1083,'CSR Initiative: Awarded from ONGC (Mehsana Asset) 1HP & LP','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.aakashexploration.com/#:~:text=Awarded%20from%20ONGC%20%28Mehsana%20Asset%29%201HP%20%26','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2b866f7eab4d5e1a0d86dce8041ef050','COMP_TOP200_193',NULL,'2416ea46a8fecf8e4c18caffaaa1b2ae',NULL,'Awarded from ONGC (Mehsana Asset) 1HP & LP-MSU - 5 Months | Awarded from ONGC (Ankleshwar Asset) 1HOC - 6months | Awarded from ONGC (Ahmedabad Asset) 3LP-MSU - 5 Years | Awarded LOI from VEDANTA LIMITED for BOP (Barmer, Rajasthan) | Awarded LOI from VEDANTA LIMITED for RRU (Barmer, Rajasthan) | Awarded LOI from VEDANTA LIMITED for WHG (Barmer, Rajasthan) | Awarded LOI from ONGC (Ahmedabad Asset) 1LP-MSU - 5 Years | Awarded LOI from GSPC for MSU - 2 Years | ONGC for 50Ton WOR RIG | Awarded LOI from VEDANTA LIMITED | CRISIL RATING | Blood Donation Camp @ Sertha | A Footstep towards Quality, Health, Safety and Environment protection | New Arrival | 40 Ton Work Over Rig | 50 ton Work Over Rig | Heating Unit | Another Achievement | Certification of Appreciation | Reward & Recognition | Safety Appreciation Award at Cairn Barmer | Certificate of Commitment |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:09:39.511003',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:09:39.511003',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:09:39.511003',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.aakashexploration.com/#:~:text=Awarded%20from%20ONGC%20%28Mehsana%20Asset%29%201HP%20%26',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:09:39.511003','{}'),(1084,'CSR Initiative: At 20 Microns, we take numerous initiatives that contribute towards comprehensive developm','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.20microns.com/sustainable-development#:~:text=At%2020%20Microns%2C%20we%20take%20numerous%20initiatives','Schedule VII CSR partnership under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'813d1513d3adb759a9a8215bc5cb4bf2','COMP_TOP200_154',NULL,'0d42acf73fbf0218f5fff744601348d7',NULL,'At 20 Microns, we take numerous initiatives that contribute towards comprehensive development of community and environment. All our business, operational and manufacturing processes are aligned with our commitment of sustainable contributions to social wellbeing, environmental conservation and economic prosperity.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.20microns.com/sustainable-development#:~:text=At%2020%20Microns%2C%20we%20take%20numerous%20initiatives',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED',NULL,'{}'),(1085,'CSR Initiative: Woven intricately in the operational and decision','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.20microns.com/sustainable-development#:~:text=Woven%20intricately%20in%20the%20operational%20and%20decision-making','Schedule VII CSR partnership under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3057d26348f22305afaa5bfdba6e0899','COMP_TOP200_154',NULL,'174f3c71880f4d54fc91729203da673a',NULL,'Woven intricately in the operational and decision-making process, Sustainable Development is a part of 20 Microns’ long-term vision and company goals. Our strong governance system ensures adherence to national and international regulations of sustainable development. We aspire for perennial growth system to ascertain community development, economic growth as well as harmonious ecological balance.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.20microns.com/sustainable-development#:~:text=Woven%20intricately%20in%20the%20operational%20and%20decision-making',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED',NULL,'{}'),(1086,'CSR Initiative: Sustainable Development takes a top precedence at 20 Microns','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.20microns.com/sustainable-development#:~:text=Sustainable%20Development%20takes%20a%20top%20precedence%20at','Schedule VII CSR partnership under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'91faada302d2c0c7204b4ed4b6d7cfb7','COMP_TOP200_154',NULL,'8fa2d5a869201ad923af96848418eabd',NULL,'Sustainable Development takes a top precedence at 20 Microns. Sustainable Development integrates the use of energy resources to meet the human needs while conserving the natural environment. Energy resources that are used optimally to meet the existing as well as prospective demands of current and future generations of human beings.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:07:49.292843',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.20microns.com/sustainable-development#:~:text=Sustainable%20Development%20takes%20a%20top%20precedence%20at',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED',NULL,'{}'),(1087,'CSR Initiative: List of CSR projects approved by 360 ONE WAM Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.360.one/compliance/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=List%20of%20CSR%20projects%20approved%20by%20360','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4452e66f1ae423f8917cc09f5a74da19','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,'fdf0cfe2a81989f6767328360fbf93be',NULL,'List of CSR projects approved by 360 ONE WAM Ltd.’s Board click here to view',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/compliance/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=List%20of%20CSR%20projects%20approved%20by%20360',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1088,'CSR Initiative: When you register with or view our site, our servers automatically record certain informat','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.360.one/wealth/privacy-policy#:~:text=When%20you%20register%20with%20or%20view%20our','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7637d1d10fca424f705e193b24c9f581','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'When you register with or view our site, our servers automatically record certain information that your web browser sends whenever you visit our website. The kind of information that is gathered automatically includes the type of browser you are using (e.g. Internet Explorer, Firefox, etc.), the type of Operating System you are using (e.g. Windows or Mac OS) and the domain name of your Internet Service Provider, the date and time of your visit and the pages on our website. We sometimes use this information to improve our website(s) design, content and primarily to give you a better browsing experience.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/wealth/privacy-policy#:~:text=When%20you%20register%20with%20or%20view%20our',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1089,'CSR Initiative: 360 ONE WAM Group uses commercially reasonable physical, managerial, and technical safegua','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.360.one/wealth/privacy-policy#:~:text=360%20ONE%20WAM%20Group%20uses%20commercially%20reasonable','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5054fe226035cad9ef146ebb290f3235','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'360 ONE WAM Group uses commercially reasonable physical, managerial, and technical safeguards to preserve the integrity and security of your personal information. 360 ONE WAM Group cannot, however, ensure or warrant the security of any information you transmit to 360 ONE WAM Group and you do so at your own risk. Once we receive your transmission of information, 360 ONE WAM Group makes commercially reasonable efforts to ensure the security of our systems. However, please note that this is not a guarantee that such information may not be accessed, disclosed, altered, or destroyed by breach of any of our physical, technical, or managerial safeguards.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/wealth/privacy-policy#:~:text=360%20ONE%20WAM%20Group%20uses%20commercially%20reasonable',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1090,'CSR Initiative: Based on a clear understanding of the social or environmental problem to be solved, and th','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Based%20on%20a%20clear%20understanding%20of%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9800ff19ae9716afbc727780b72d461f','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Based on a clear understanding of the social or environmental problem to be solved, and the type of capital needed.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Based%20on%20a%20clear%20understanding%20of%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1091,'CSR Initiative: The 360 ONE Foundation reinforces the group’s commitment to maximise both financial and so','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20360%20ONE%20Foundation%20reinforces%20the%20group%E2%80%99s','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9ba652c24bc9309405ecb24d70738bde','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The 360 ONE Foundation reinforces the group’s commitment to maximise both financial and social returns. Our interventions focus on employability and entrepreneurship, using financial access and inclusion as one of the key levers to improve livelihoods.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20360%20ONE%20Foundation%20reinforces%20the%20group%E2%80%99s',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1092,'CSR Initiative: At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=At%20360%20ONE%20Foundation%2C%20we%20back%20bold','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5d3818b4665705b30e3a8425417bb63b','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods. Our approach goes beyond simple cheque-writing. We leverage catalytic capital, where every rupee spent gives assurance that it has resulted in real change, not just the promise of one.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=At%20360%20ONE%20Foundation%2C%20we%20back%20bold',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1093,'CSR Initiative: India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods','CSR Project Partnership','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=India%20faces%20a%20dual%20challenge%20with%20respect','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Rural Development & Livelihood.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d5a228550f39f8e2a597296a72913f0d','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods. Despite the country’s demographic dividend, its youth face rising underemployment due to limited job creation and mismatched skills. At the same time, millions of nano enterprises remain mostly unorganised, informal and hyper-local. Unlocking the full potential of India’s workforce and enterprises is critical to India’s economic growth.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=India%20faces%20a%20dual%20challenge%20with%20respect',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1094,'CSR Initiative: We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerab','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20strive%20to%20build%20necessary%20bridges%20between','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ab6f38fb2d8beea090c1a753c1dd3d92','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerable communities towards formal credit sources. We believe in holistic, long-term solutions which not only develop skills and capacities, digital and financial literacy, and enable market and government linkages, but also overlay financial access and inclusion. This mainstreams individuals and small businesses into the formal economy to facilitate sustained, market-linked livelihoods.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20strive%20to%20build%20necessary%20bridges%20between',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1095,'CSR Initiative: Embracing our role as impact architects, 360 ONE Foundation leads the way in creating infl','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Embracing%20our%20role%20as%20impact%20architects%2C%20360','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'aef044321aa998f04828f13b4e279fe0','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Embracing our role as impact architects, 360 ONE Foundation leads the way in creating influential thought leadership with leading industry partners. To encourage adoption of these game-changing approaches, we publicly share our reports, articles, and insights with the ecosystem, helping stakeholders learn, adapt, and accelerate impact. Explore our resource library and join the journey.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Embracing%20our%20role%20as%20impact%20architects%2C%20360',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{}'),(1096,'CSR Initiative: After the Company’s exit from the joint venture arrangement with Kimberly Clark, USA, Pudu','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3pland.com/#:~:text=After%20the%20Company%E2%80%99s%20exit%20from%20the%20joint','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7c6ee6f5803644c61be18c46c81650f1','COMP_TOP200_159',NULL,NULL,NULL,'After the Company’s exit from the joint venture arrangement with Kimberly Clark, USA, Pudumjee Hygiene Products Ltd., a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company, was incorporated in 2004 to promote and market hygiene products.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3pland.com/#:~:text=After%20the%20Company%E2%80%99s%20exit%20from%20the%20joint',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278','{}'),(1097,'CSR Initiative: The businesses of manufacturing and sale of hygiene products have been demerged in January','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3pland.com/#:~:text=The%20businesses%20of%20manufacturing%20and%20sale%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e4e457b8ca19ebdb6d2664dec6727f2e','COMP_TOP200_159',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The businesses of manufacturing and sale of hygiene products have been demerged in January 2016 into Pudumjee Paper Products Ltd. The company is currently venturing into the real estate business.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3pland.com/#:~:text=The%20businesses%20of%20manufacturing%20and%20sale%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278','{}');
INSERT INTO `admin_panel_csropportunity` VALUES (1098,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3pland.com/#:~:text=Mr.%20Romie%20Shivhari%20Halan%20was%20appointed%20as','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0a38cd71d46991fdc9eab263a1d11f39','COMP_TOP200_159',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mr. Romie Shivhari Halan was appointed as Non Executive Independent Director by the shareholders, not liable for retirement by rotation for another term of five years w.e.f. 01st September, 2025 to 31st August, 2030. Mr. Romie Halan is MBA Marketing and Finance. He also serves as a Director of Supreme Holdings & Hospitality (India) Limited, Kanmedh Private Limited and designated partner of Kontur Packaging LLP.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3pland.com/#:~:text=Mr.%20Romie%20Shivhari%20Halan%20was%20appointed%20as',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:38.278278','{}'),(1099,'CSR Initiative: As a responsible business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined a','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/csr-policy#:~:text=As%20a%20responsible%20business%2C%203B%20BlackBio%20Dx','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3667384d7f161cef3a39c0f9334f4d60','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'As a responsible business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined and focuses on sustained and effective Corporate Social Responsibility Projects. Today we define Corporate Social Responsibility as the way a company balances it’s economic, social and environmental objectives while addressing stakeholder expectations and enhancing shareholder value. Our employees are also encouraged to volunteer their time and skills and enjoy the experience of giving back to the communities in which they work.Read more',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/csr-policy#:~:text=As%20a%20responsible%20business%2C%203B%20BlackBio%20Dx',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1100,'CSR Initiative: We believe that healthcare shouldn’t be a privilege but the right of every individual','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20healthcare%20shouldn%E2%80%99t%20be%20a','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'672b5a134963a7126e4998ef3f481a15','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We believe that healthcare shouldn’t be a privilege but the right of every individual. With this in mind, our healthcare initiatives are implemented directly or through collaboration with communities and NGOs etc. The Company intends to improve the lives of children and adults and mission to ensure health with dignity to underprivileged children and adults.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20healthcare%20shouldn%E2%80%99t%20be%20a',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1101,'CSR Initiative: We believe in the saying “Give a man a fish and you feed him for a day, but teach a man to','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20in%20the%20saying%20%E2%80%9CGive%20a','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'874dc765cd9dfbef16b6f1c95b600827','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We believe in the saying “Give a man a fish and you feed him for a day, but teach a man to fish and you feed him for a lifetime”; Education enables people to build better lives for themselves and their families, and improves the quality of life for the present and future generations of our country. We organise skill development and income-generating programmes for local communities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20in%20the%20saying%20%E2%80%9CGive%20a',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1102,'CSR Initiative: Our education and employment initiatives are implemented directly or through collaboration','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20education%20and%20employment%20initiatives%20are%20implemented','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d3a90ad7b2798ffea5e45e0d66a812ae','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Our education and employment initiatives are implemented directly or through collaboration with communities and NGOs, etc. The Company’s aim is to provide education to the underprivileged children and students by providing merit based scholarships. Assistance is given to such communities by helping them develop technical skills to enhance livelihood/employability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20education%20and%20employment%20initiatives%20are%20implemented',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1103,'CSR Initiative: We believe in customizing the implementation of CSR activities as per the need of the soci','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20in%20customizing%20the%20implementation%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'216dd197e3992a34506dee44a13e0661','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We believe in customizing the implementation of CSR activities as per the need of the society and a call from nearby communities. Company found some basic needs of the society in nearby connecting villages and decided to fulfill it by providing the supply of food and necessary items during the COVID-19 Pandemic to the people in need. We also provided healthcare and hygiene supplies to fight the pandemic. The company also contributes to provide relief to the disaster-stricken communities and regions during the times of floods, cyclones, earthquakes and other such natural calamities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20in%20customizing%20the%20implementation%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1104,'CSR Initiative: Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessib','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Cachar%20Cancer%20Hospital%20%26%20Research%20Centre%20is','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6ebb3838879ce6d1d6d3f3f4541eade5','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessible',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Cachar%20Cancer%20Hospital%20%26%20Research%20Centre%20is',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1105,'CSR Initiative: to support the hospital in its mission to expand access to quality cancer care and bring h','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=to%20support%20the%20hospital%20in%20its%20mission','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'48ad3cae07c1b759597d61eb29b2c8dd','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'to support the hospital in its mission to expand access to quality cancer care and bring hope to',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=to%20support%20the%20hospital%20in%20its%20mission',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1106,'CSR Initiative: ARUSHI works with children and adults who need special care, education and training to dea','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=ARUSHI%20works%20with%20children%20and%20adults%20who','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2aac6a972c426ef87871cdd5977fdddb','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'ARUSHI works with children and adults who need special care, education and training to deal with situations at different stages of their life.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=ARUSHI%20works%20with%20children%20and%20adults%20who',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1107,'CSR Initiative: The math and mission run around 1200 educational institutions (schools, colleges, a deemed','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20math%20and%20mission%20run%20around%201200','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3613d23931201cc35f6fb4cfd98e1db1','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The math and mission run around 1200 educational institutions (schools, colleges, a deemed university); 14 hospitals, 116 Dispensaries, 57 Mobile-Medical Units, 7 Nursing Training Institutes. Medical camps and eye camps are organized regularly for rural and needy patients. They conduct relief and rehabilitation operations, during natural or man-made disasters, rehabilitation activities include construction of houses, townships, bridges and roads. The Math and the Mission also provide various services for the development of rural areas.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20math%20and%20mission%20run%20around%201200',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1108,'CSR Initiative: During the Amphan super','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=During%20the%20Amphan%20super-cyclone%2C%20Ramakrishna%20Mission%20undertook','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ebdbf2de7f543e89f32884cbd593ae57','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'During the Amphan super-cyclone, Ramakrishna Mission undertook a project for relief and rehabilitation services. The project\'s two objectives included: providing primary relief and then ascertaining the number of houses adversely affected by the cyclone and helping them rebuild their roofs for the number of around 199 houses. 3B made a contribution for the construction of a primary school as part of the relief and rehabilitation services.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=During%20the%20Amphan%20super-cyclone%2C%20Ramakrishna%20Mission%20undertook',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1109,'CSR Initiative: Muskaan is a non','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Muskaan%20is%20a%20non-profit%20organization%20which%20works','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'aac3e4b4b661cdc544bc744d63a957da','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Muskaan is a non-profit organization which works with vulnerable slum communities in Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh on issues of education, identity, violence, health and survival needs. Their primary focus is on the education of children unable to access mainstream schools. Other programs differ across slums, depending on the critical needs of the community and the capacities and resources within the organization to address them. They recognized a need to sustain the effort to really make ‘education’ a workable option for children in these communities, and therefore took on the decision to formulate an organization. New members joining the team brought their perspective on poverty and gender and enriched the response of the organization.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Muskaan%20is%20a%20non-profit%20organization%20which%20works',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1110,'CSR Initiative: Under their CSR initiative, 3B collaborated with Muskaan to facilitate projects under “Liv','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Under%20their%20CSR%20initiative%2C%203B%20collaborated%20with','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dfb1c5f3f10d6728b66aedf80f6c7576','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Under their CSR initiative, 3B collaborated with Muskaan to facilitate projects under “Livelihood Development Programs”; the aim of one of the programs is to provide baking training to a group of 20 students at IHM Bhopal. This was done in joint collaboration with IHM to bear the cost of the education of these students. This initiative will enable these students to find and sustain a good means of making an income and supporting themselves and their families while Muskaan will provide support to them to help develop and improve their resumes to help increase their chances of successfully getting employed. 3B also made additional contributions to cover the cost of transportation for these students and provided financial support to some of the older students to set up their food carts in market areas to sustain themselves and support their families.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Under%20their%20CSR%20initiative%2C%203B%20collaborated%20with',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1111,'CSR Initiative: Friends of the Tribal Society','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20the%20Tribal%20Society%20-%20Project','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3c0b8177d09f2e4ded3f163ea6deaf3f','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Friends of the Tribal Society - Project for \"EKAL VIDYALAYA - One Teacher School\" in tribal villages',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20the%20Tribal%20Society%20-%20Project',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1112,'CSR Initiative: Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20Tribals%20Society%20%28FTS%29%20established%20on','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4fd5ca376710e8cedf492d84ff98db94','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non-profit organisation dedicated to the upliftment of tribals. FTS runs One Teacher School (OTS) or Ekal Vidyalaya, which imparts non- formal primary education to children between 6 and 14 years of age. An OTS typically comprises 25 – 30 children of classes I to III. An Ekal Vidyalaya imparts five-fold education; primary education, health care education, development education, awareness education and sanskar education. As on March 31, 2021, FTS was running 102,552 Ekal Vidyalaya supporting basic education of 26,32,065 students. Development Education or Gramothan is another aspect of Ekal’s five fold education which has been considered necessary after running of OTSs in the villages. Out of the realisation that the village community should be linked with a self – sustainable economic development programs by using local resources.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20Tribals%20Society%20%28FTS%29%20established%20on',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1113,'CSR Initiative: 3B BlackBio is supporting the FTS to set up \"Ekal Vidyalaya\" in the villages in Tribal are','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=3B%20BlackBio%20is%20supporting%20the%20FTS%20to','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'252c158fd17ca24f32570071df185a8c','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'3B BlackBio is supporting the FTS to set up \"Ekal Vidyalaya\" in the villages in Tribal areas of Raisen, Bareli and Betul districts of Madhya Pradesh.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=3B%20BlackBio%20is%20supporting%20the%20FTS%20to',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1114,'CSR Initiative: Sahara Saksharta is a social initiative dedicated to promoting education and literacy amon','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Sahara%20Saksharta%20is%20a%20social%20initiative%20dedicated','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'03115e43b2b92dec13e7a6faade4dbee','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sahara Saksharta is a social initiative dedicated to promoting education and literacy among',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Sahara%20Saksharta%20is%20a%20social%20initiative%20dedicated',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{}'),(1115,'CSR Initiative: empowering individuals through educational support, skill development, and awareness','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=empowering%20individuals%20through%20educa