L,'All stacks are adequate in height and critical stacks are linked to an online stack monitoring system. AIA Engineering Ltd. / Vega Industries contracts third-party agencies and experts to monitor air quality as per the ambient air quality standards stipulated by the State Pollution Control Board.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=All%20stacks%20are%20adequate%20in%20height%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1147,'CSR Initiative: Additionally, AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=Additionally%2C%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d50107da914849957afb7c3984cb7ca7','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Additionally, AIA Engineering Ltd. / Vega Industries has an internal process to ensure emission-free production. The Dust Extraction (DE) system or Fume Extraction (FE) system is linked to the production equipment functioning, and failure in any of these will trigger an alarm which automatically shuts down production.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=Additionally%2C%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1148,'CSR Initiative: At AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'91f1e9a3ec40daf21be6fa918b856c52','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'At AIA Engineering Ltd. / Vega Industries, water is utilized for industrial purposes such as cooling the furnace coils, in the moulding process, and in the cooling towers. Other activities where water is used includes in canteens for drinking, sanitation, and gardening. We have a robust system for water management:',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1149,'CSR Initiative: AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries%20have','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4653476dffc56501ff232ff730de9ac4','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'AIA Engineering Ltd. / Vega Industries have installed a rainwater harvesting system to recharge groundwater. Rooftop and run off rainwater are recharged through recharge wells along with the presence of a pre-filtration system',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries%20have',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1150,'CSR Initiative: AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries%20ensures','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3b0e368ede27293f03719608859ad588','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'AIA Engineering Ltd. / Vega Industries ensures Complete Zero Liquid Discharge (ZLD) is maintained. Dry-type cooling tower is installed which reduces blow down drastically. The cooling tower blow-down is then further reused in the plant. Similarly, grey water or sewage is treated in the STP plant, which comprise of a three-tier system and an ultra-filtration water purification system. Treated water is reused in the plant.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20/%20Vega%20Industries%20ensures',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1151,'CSR Initiative: In order to move to a sustainable model of waste management, AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=In%20order%20to%20move%20to%20a%20sustainable','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8dfbbb4edddc4438b9412beb1fb4f119','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'In order to move to a sustainable model of waste management, AIA Engineering Ltd. / Vega Industries is transitioning from a ‘linear business model’ to a cradle-to-cradle ‘circular business model’.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=In%20order%20to%20move%20to%20a%20sustainable',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1152,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=-%20We%20ensure%20strict%20compliance%20with%20the','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9d0829e6398e84ae3b45cb5e1c02be4b','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- We ensure strict compliance with the stipulated norms in line with the laws related to hazardous waste management, batteries, and e-waste management. All waste generated by us is re-melted into the furnace or recycled through authorised recyclers and vendors',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=-%20We%20ensure%20strict%20compliance%20with%20the',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1153,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=-%20We%20believe%20that%20continuous%20improvement%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dcd17662d4683c6f235a904084a75d0c','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- We believe that continuous improvement in our Occupational Health, Safety and Environmental practices and performance shall be the key to the company’s future development and success. Our ultimate ambition is zero harm. Our commitment to the Occupational health & safety of all employees, contract workforce and visitors to our sites is set out in Occupational Health & Safety Policy',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=-%20We%20believe%20that%20continuous%20improvement%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1154,'CSR Initiative: Our CSR initiatives are an extension of our values and commitment to the society','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20initiatives%20are%20an%20extension%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c06bec760a0c02675e1bf5b791a771a4','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Our CSR initiatives are an extension of our values and commitment to the society. Since inception, we have made a conscious effort to contribute in meaningful ways to the community who positively impact AIA Engineering Ltd.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20initiatives%20are%20an%20extension%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1155,'CSR Initiative: At AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20are%20committed','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3359e9f295361d7a594ac00d7b0caf73','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'At AIA Engineering Ltd. we are committed to supporting India’s education system through innovative engineering solutions and are proud to contribute towards the flourishment of young minds of the country.As part of this initiative, AIA helped setup the GTU (Gujarat Technological University)-AIA Foundry Skill Development Centre at GPERI, Mehsana, India. Through industry-oriented curriculum, state-of-the-art equipment and expert-led training programs, the Centre aims to equip Degree and Diploma students with cutting-edge skills in metallurgy, induction heating, and foundry technologies',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20are%20committed',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1156,'CSR Initiative: At AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20believe%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6e9ce986047ff613d8c6346a6de0f61b','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'At AIA Engineering Ltd. we believe in the value of investing in health, and in the physical and mental wellbeing of the society. We have undertaken a number of initiatives to help and provide food, nutrition supplement, clothes, etc. to various sections of the society. Initiatives like holding meditation sessions by Chetana Empowerment Foundation and Covid 19 relief and rehabilitation have proved to be beneficial to more than 15000 people. AIA has also made CSR contributions to Zydus Foundation, Gujarat Cancer Society, Sanjivani Health and Relief Committee amongst others for health and well-being of public at large.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20believe%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1157,'CSR Initiative: We believe that preserving the country’s national heritage is a moral responsibility of a ','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20preserving%20the%20country%E2%80%99s%20national','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e8af642ac9d5289ed1b7a4bf4d46eaa8','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We believe that preserving the country’s national heritage is a moral responsibility of a corporate entity, as it is an intangible treasure that we pass on to our future generations. In line with our beliefs and value systems, we regularly contribute towards preserving and upkeep of India’s national heritage monuments. The Shiva Statue at Nathdwara, Rajasthan, is one of the projects that AIA Engineering Ltd. recently collaborated with the Govt. Of Rajasthan. This not only promotes tourism but also improves employment opportunities for locals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20preserving%20the%20country%E2%80%99s%20national',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1158,'CSR Initiative: AIA Engineering Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20understands%20the%20importance%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'664ba1a118ad8f044c2dfbffdd061cc2','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,NULL,NULL,'AIA Engineering Ltd. understands the importance of conserving the environment, reducing the impact of industrial waste production, and the active role of corporations required to achieve sustainability. While as a company we are green in our operations and believe in reuse and recycling, as a part of our CSR activities, the company has undertaken numerous tree plantation drives, the creation of oxygen parks and land reclamation projects to support the green initiatives.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20understands%20the%20importance%20of',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{}'),(1159,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://arclorganics.com/privacy-policy/#:~:text=%28e.g.%2C%20Netscape%2C%20Internet%20Explorer%29%2C%20the%20type%20of','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Ski