hat empowerment begins with access access to education, healthcare and sustainable livelihoods and more. We are building bridges to a more equitable future-not merely filling gaps but unlocking potential and exploring new possibilities',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20journey%20has%20been%20marked%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948','{}'),(1173,'CSR Initiative: Our journey embodies the spirit of Atmanirbhar Bharat, where every intervention strengthen','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20journey%20embodies%20the%20spirit%20of%20Atmanirbhar','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a09c2095ba57375d5abd531a173779ad','COMP_TOP200_184',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Our journey embodies the spirit of Atmanirbhar Bharat, where every intervention strengthens the foundation of community resilience. Our CSR portfolio encompasses skill development, women entrepreneurship, sports ecosystem creation, healthcare enhancement, environment and water conservation & other need based initiativeis-cach strategically designed to create lasting ripple effects.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20journey%20embodies%20the%20spirit%20of%20Atmanirbhar',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948','{}'),(1174,'CSR Initiative: The Bank endeavours to safeguard and ensure the security of the information provided by th','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=The%20Bank%20endeavours%20to%20safeguard%20and%20ensure','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ef68bfc297c3bb5121c7cfa2a013c10a','COMP_TOP200_184',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Bank endeavours to safeguard and ensure the security of the information provided by the customers. The Bank uses 128-bit encryption, for the transmission of the information, which is currently the permitted level of encryption in India. When the information provided by the customers is not transmitted through this encryption, the system (if configured accordingly) will display an appropriate message ensuring the best level of secrecy for the customer\'s information. Customer’s data is stored securely in India as per Bank’s policy ensuring compliance, statutory and regulatory obligations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=The%20Bank%20endeavours%20to%20safeguard%20and%20ensure',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948','{}'),(1175,'CSR Initiative: The Bank is committed to safeguarding your privacy and security','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=The%20Bank%20is%20committed%20to%20safeguarding%20your','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5eb6be89f57b923f8d012a786941342e','COMP_TOP200_184',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Bank is committed to safeguarding your privacy and security. With regards to facial recognition for second-factor authentication in our banking application, we want to assure you that we do not store any facial data. Your facial features are only used for real-time authentication during the login process and are not retained or stored by the bank\'s systems.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.au.bank.in/privacy-policy#:~:text=The%20Bank%20is%20committed%20to%20safeguarding%20your',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:11.743948','{}'),(1176,'CSR Initiative: Our expertise lies in yarns for wall','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.aymsyntex.com/bcf-yarns#:~:text=Our%20expertise%20lies%20in%20yarns%20for%20wall-to-wall','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'92cd97d997a0427f73ebcc247dd51840','COMP_TOP200_191',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Our expertise lies in yarns for wall-to-wall carpets - (Tufted & woven) carpet tiles, hospitality, contract, automotive mats, rugs, bath mats & CHROMOJET printed etc. We also have yarns suitable for handmade carpet industry.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.aymsyntex.com/bcf-yarns#:~:text=Our%20expertise%20lies%20in%20yarns%20for%20wall-to-wall',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318','{}'),(1177,'CSR Initiative: Partially Oriented Yarn (POY) is a primary form of filament yarn made through polymerising','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://www.aymsyntex.com/textile-yarns/hosiery-narrow-fabrics#:~:text=Partially%20Oriented%20Yarn%20%28POY%29%20is%20a%20primary','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bd051d3717210f3d843faacb1582d90d','COMP_TOP200_191',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Partially Oriented Yarn (POY) is a primary form of filament yarn made through polymerising and spinning processes and is known for its durability and resistance to chemicals. It is the primary raw material to produce Draw Texturized yarn (DTY). AYM offers a comprehensive range of POY and has the flexibility to manufacture exactly as per client’s specifications. We have the capacity to manufacture POY in deniers 75-500 having filaments: 36-384 in all lustres.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.aymsyntex.com/textile-yarns/hosiery-narrow-fabrics#:~:text=Partially%20Oriented%20Yarn%20%28POY%29%20is%20a%20primary',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:44.414318','{}'),(1178,'CSR Initiative: We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20deeply%20committed%20to%20ensuring%20environmental','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2cc448b96f95565bae2f6f17be27cc8f','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in our community. Recognizing the critical importance of soil and water quality, we actively contribute to water conservation. Through these collective endeavors, we strive to improve ground water levels to boost agriculture and drinking water availability for villagers. Our focus on these initiatives reflects our commitment to building a sustainable future that prioritizes the well-being of the present and future generations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20deeply%20committed%20to%20ensuring%20environmental',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{}'),(1179,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20By%20working%20hand%20in%20hand%20with','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ef6318378d6ba3d01c675c1bc4a62fb6','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- By working hand in hand with local communities, environmental organizations, and government bodies.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20By%20working%20hand%20in%20hand%20with',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{}'),(1180,'CSR Initiative: Environment & Sustainability Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20We%20aim%20to%20create%20a%20lasting','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Environment & Sustainability.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ee3a585d4ad21f82def8f3885e01fd6c','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- We aim to create a lasting and positive impact on the environment.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20We%20aim%20to%20create%20a%20lasting',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{}'),(1181,'CSR Initiative: We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emp','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20fostering%20skill%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6e15b5b6f7a63ad383ba940792fab16c','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,NULL,NULL,'We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emphasis on inclusive education and vocational training. Our initiatives target youth and women, empowering them with the skills needed for meaningful employment as well as helping existing technicians with upskilling programs. Through focused projects, we aim to bridge skill gaps and create opportunities for diverse segments of the population. Our goal is not only to enhance livelihoods but also to promote entrepreneurship, fostering economic growth and self-sustainability. We envision a society where everyone can unlock their full potential and contribute meaningfully to the workforce and community.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20fostering%20skill%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{}'),(1182,'CSR Initiative: Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=Our%20mission%20is%20rooted%20in%20a%20steadfast','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'229b027c8756cfb7e024c78dc98a9270','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well-being of the community around our manufacturing units. Our focus is on promoting education for all, targeting underprivileged communities by providing remedial classes as well as offering scholarship for girls to create an inclusive learning environment. Beyond education, we embark on livelihood enhancement projects tailored to the unique needs of the community, ensuring a holistic approach to care. Our goal is to build a community that values continuous learning while prioritizing the care and support needed for each member to thrive.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=Our%20mission%20is%20rooted%20in%20a%20steadfast',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{}'),(1183,'CSR Initiative: Over the years, Fortis Healthcare Ltd','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=Over%20the%20years%2C%20Fortis%20Healthcare%20Ltd.%20and','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'42cb1ab44ffda722a59b47ab3e3004b5','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Over the years, Fortis Healthcare Ltd. and its subsidiaries through its hospitals and Foundation across India, is committed towards providing healthcare for the socially marginalized and deprived sections of the society. We not only make sure that our programs are efficient, but also ensure that they are sustainable and relevant to those meant to benefit from them.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=Over%20the%20years%2C%20Fortis%20Healthcare%20Ltd.%20and',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1184,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20More%20than%2015%2C000%20Health%20And%20Hygiene','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c94efffa54b9c9b38e0df4a5ff33d8cd','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- More than 15,000 Health And Hygiene Awareness Books Contributed to NGO Partners For Children',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20More%20than%2015%2C000%20Health%20And%20Hygiene',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1185,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%201%2C100%20Govt.%20School%20Students%20Trained%20in','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ee8a3919b573d2447b461f98db8943ff','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- 1,100 Govt. School Students Trained in First Aid and Basic Life Support',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%201%2C100%20Govt.%20School%20Students%20Trained%20in',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1186,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20Support%20to%20ICMR%20%28The%20Indian%20Council','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e4847362d1d4cd7af7329b9b3fd93de5','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- Support to ICMR (The Indian Council of Medical Research) Support to ICMR (The Indian Council of Medical Research) fund for research and development projects in the field of science, technology, engineering and medicine. The fund to ICMR is duly approved CSR fund as per Schedule VII of Section 135 of the Companies Act. The ICMR has always attempted to address itself to the growing demands of scientific advances in biomedical research on the one hand, and to the need of finding practical solutions to the health problems of the country, on the other.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20Support%20to%20ICMR%20%28The%20Indian%20Council',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1187,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20Contribution%20to%20%E2%80%98Prime%20Minister%E2%80%99s%20National%20Relief','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b10bdffe513d21ceff0a0de80ad34414','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- Contribution to ‘Prime Minister’s National Relief Fund” (PMNRF) Contribution to ‘Prime Minister’s National Relief Fund” (PMNRF) to provide immediate relief to families of those killed in natural calamities like floods, cyclones and earthquakes, etc. and to the victims of the major accidents and riots. Assistance from PMNRF is also rendered, to partially defray the expenses for medical treatment like heart surgeries, kidney transplantation, cancer treatment and acid attack etc. Disbursements are made with the approval of the Prime Minister. Our contribution will support the victims individually or collectively who have suffered harm, including physical or mental injury, emotional suffering and economic loss.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20Contribution%20to%20%E2%80%98Prime%20Minister%E2%80%99s%20National%20Relief',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1188,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20NIKSHAY%20PROJECT%20The%20Nikshay%20project%2Csupported%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c07c50d6d7cdef69a9678288beea3c37','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- NIKSHAY PROJECT The Nikshay project,supported by Fortisand Agilus, was implemented by MAMTA - Health Institute for Mother and Child. This project focused on meeting the nutritional needs of recovering Tuberculosis (TB) patients across Maharashtra, Haryana, and Punjab. The project aligned with the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare\'s (MoHFW) National StrategicPlan to achieve End TB targets by 2025. Highlights 26076 kits distributed. 9739 patients supported 7 districts across 3 states By providing essential nutrition kits,the project supported the recovery process and contributed to the overall well-being of individuals diagnosed with Tuberculosis.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20NIKSHAY%20PROJECT%20The%20Nikshay%20project%2Csupported%20by',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1189,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20ANAEMIA%20ERADICATION%20The%20Anaemia%20eradication%20project%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2e90641ec85682086fbfd708cf557ec3','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- ANAEMIA ERADICATION The Anaemia eradication project, supported by Fortis, was implemented by the American Indian Foundation. The project aimed to design and implement a comprehensive Social and Behavior Change Communication (SBCC) strategy to address Anaemia among at-risk groups in the Nuh district of Haryana. The long-term objectives of the project are to increase awareness, emphasize the importance of preventive action, address nutritional needs and beliefs, and provide training to frontline workers in the communities. These activities are intended to significantly reduce the prevalence of Anaemia and enhance the health-seeking behavior of the community in the long term.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20ANAEMIA%20ERADICATION%20The%20Anaemia%20eradication%20project%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1190,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20PATIENT%20SAFETY%20EDUCATION%20PROGRAM%20The%20Patient','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8f8b025ccfb8f038d17291bb2f93c63f','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- PATIENT SAFETY EDUCATION PROGRAM The Patient Safety Education Program, supported by Fortis and implemented by NATHealth - Healthcare Federation of India, focused on enhancing public awareness. NATHealth launched a dedicated microsite, “Choose Safer Healthcare” as a pivotal component of a widespread patient education campaign. This microsite disseminated crucial information, aiming to raise awareness and enhance knowledge among the general public regarding safety measures when accessing healthcare services. It also highlighted the correlation between patient safety and individual responsibility, advocating for adherence to guidelines and the adoption of safety precautions in healthcare practices 6488 people have pledged to choose safer healthcare through the website',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20PATIENT%20SAFETY%20EDUCATION%20PROGRAM%20The%20Patient',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1191,'CSR Initiative: Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20STRENGTHENING%20EMERGENCY%20SERVICES%20Under%20the%20ambulance','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3029fe32dc9475455343df1518763702','COMP_TOP200_141',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- STRENGTHENING EMERGENCY SERVICES Under the ambulance donation project, Agilus collaborated with the Directorate of Health Services, Government of Kerala, to strengthen emergency healthcare delivery in the state. The aim was to improve the quality and delivery time of emergency services and to enhance the capacity for critical care response. This was achieved through the provision of one Advanced Cardiac Life Support (ACLS) ambulance and two Basic Cardiac Life Support (BCLS) ambulances in Thiruvananthapuram. 1 BCLS ambulances provided 2 ACLS ambulance provided These ambulances were equipped with the necessary life- saving equipment to handle a wide range of emergencies and provided life-supporting treatment while transporting patients to healthcare facilities.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.fortishealthcare.com/csr#:~:text=-%20STRENGTHENING%20EMERGENCY%20SERVICES%20Under%20the%20ambulance',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:00.063471','{}'),(1192,'CSR Initiative: Shop on Havells One App','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://havells.com/#:~:text=Shop%20on%20Havells%20One%20App%20%E2%80%93%20Enjoy','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'52828c26688a89ba3713b26d1832bad7','COMP_TOP200_135',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Shop on Havells One App – Enjoy Up to ₹ 1000 Cashback on Your First Order. Install Now!*T&C Apply',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://havells.com/#:~:text=Shop%20on%20Havells%20One%20App%20%E2%80%93%20Enjoy',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958','{}'),(1193,'CSR Initiative: Corporate CSR Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'https://havells.com/#:~:text=-%20Epic%20Storm%20HS%20BLDC%20Ceiling%20FanAs','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Schedule VII Statutory CSR.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e2cb47294cf3747d1541f9d3ea728c39','COMP_TOP200_135',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- Epic Storm HS BLDC Ceiling FanAs low as ₹ 3 590.00 (incl. of all taxes) MRP ₹ 5 740.00 37% Off',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:24.564958',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://havells.com/#:~:text=-%20Epic%20Storm%20HS%20BLDC%20Ceiling%20FanAs',NULL,'SO