mation, life skills and supportive environments that enable informed decision-making and positive behavioural change.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Adolescence%20is%20a%20critical%20stage%20in%20shaping',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578','{}'),(1274,'CSR Initiative: Through Kishori Manch groups and Girl Champions, we create safe, peer','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Through%20Kishori%20Manch%20groups%20and%20Girl%20Champions%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bc5784621b8e729c459c35fbef3215cc','COMP_TOP200_143',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Through Kishori Manch groups and Girl Champions, we create safe, peer-led spaces where adolescents can build confidence, develop life skills and participate in creating change within their communities. The programme brings together adolescents, parents, Panchayats, ASHAs, Anganwadi workers and government health programmes to strengthen community participation and ownership.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Through%20Kishori%20Manch%20groups%20and%20Girl%20Champions%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578','{}'),(1275,'CSR Initiative: Prevention is an important part of building healthier communities','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Prevention%20is%20an%20important%20part%20of%20building','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7430b11055be3b2c6160fbf0848c3f8e','COMP_TOP200_143',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Prevention is an important part of building healthier communities. Our preventive healthcare initiatives focus on awareness, early detection, timely intervention and access to care across priority public health challenges. Through community partnerships and targeted interventions, we work across areas including tuberculosis, diabetes and anaemia combining awareness with screening, counselling, referrals and treatment support.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Prevention%20is%20an%20important%20part%20of%20building',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578','{}'),(1276,'CSR Initiative: Combines nutritional support with a peer educator model to encourage treatment adherence a','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Combines%20nutritional%20support%20with%20a%20peer%20educator','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'7d42c0e2c125c780f9a241a2903badeb','COMP_TOP200_143',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Combines nutritional support with a peer educator model to encourage treatment adherence and recovery.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Combines%20nutritional%20support%20with%20a%20peer%20educator',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578','{}'),(1277,'CSR Initiative: Promotes early detection through community awareness, screening and referrals to healthcar','CSR Project Partnership','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Promotes%20early%20detection%20through%20community%20awareness%2C%20screening','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Healthcare & Nutrition.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c9421c7e0111e3971edeed4bf5d8afee','COMP_TOP200_143',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Promotes early detection through community awareness, screening and referrals to healthcare providers.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Promotes%20early%20detection%20through%20community%20awareness%2C%20screening',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578','{}'),(1278,'CSR Initiative: Launched in 2018, MedEngage is Metropolis Healthcare’s flagship initiative dedicated to ex','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Launched%20in%202018%2C%20MedEngage%20is%20Metropolis%20Healthcare%E2%80%99s','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1e8a6c464b82d3239b8a9f6852d56aea','COMP_TOP200_143',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Launched in 2018, MedEngage is Metropolis Healthcare’s flagship initiative dedicated to expanding access to medical education and research opportunities for deserving students and young researchers. Through scholarships, research grants, mentorship and experiential learning, MedEngage equips aspiring healthcare professionals with the knowledge, skills and exposure needed to contribute to India’s evolving healthcare ecosystem.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=Launched%20in%202018%2C%20MedEngage%20is%20Metropolis%20Healthcare%E2%80%99s',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:24:52.160578','{}'),(1279,'CSR Initiative: We remain committed to socio','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.metropolisindia.com/aboutus#:~:text=We%20remain%20committed%20to%20socio-economic%20inclusion%20by','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ad130447ee187a75467943096183e4cb','COMP_TOP200_143'