 if you have provided Personal Data while raising a query, We may retain this Personal Data if your account still is active on Our system. If your Personal Data is no longer needed for such purposes, We will promptly remove it or anonymize it by removing any identifiable details. Nevertheless, there are certain circumstances where We may need to keep your Personal Data for legitimate business or legal reasons or provide substantial evidence of record. These may include obligations related to compliance with applicable laws, for regulatory compliance, audit, accounting contractual purposes or reporting requirements. Additionally, certain data may be kept for extended periods to fulfil purposes such as ensuring security, preventing fraud and abuse, keeping financial records and/or to resolve any future dispute.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.voltas.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=We%20only%20retain%20your%20Personal%20Data%20for',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139','{}'),(1300,'CSR Initiative: Education & Skill Development Initiative','CSR Project Partnership','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'https://www.voltas.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20We%20review%20Our%20information%20collection%2C%20storage%2C','Schedule VII CSR collaboration under Education & Skill Development.','INVALID_SYNTHETIC',1,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9711ada5dd8c14b29b0aaf59ee55ea21','COMP_TOP200_134',NULL,NULL,NULL,'- We review Our information collection, storage, and processing practices, including physical security measures, to prevent unauthorized access to Our systems;',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.voltas.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=-%20We%20review%20Our%20information%20collection%2C%20storage%2C',NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:30:31.729139','{}'),(1301,'CS