ts) Rules, 2014.',NULL,NULL,'rs 2023','https://www.abmintl.in/#:~:text=The%20turnover%20of%20the%20Company%20in%20years',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:11.421909+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'746b048592f1b193a9e98cf11380e9e5','COMP_TOP200_167',NULL,'bc51921f40a2869c95092487603709c5',NULL,'The turnover of the Company in years 2023-2024 has increased to Rs.93.64 Crores as against Rs.85.37 Crores in the previous year 2022-2023, resulting in increase of 9.68%. However in the year 2023-24, the company has reduced its losses and incurred a loss of Rs.3.43 Crores as compared to a loss of Rs.6.69 Crores in the previous year 2022-23. The Earnings per share(EPS) for the year is Rs.-3.65 per share as compared to Rs-7.11 per share in the previous year. DIVIDEND The Directors have not recommended any dividend for this financial year. RESERVES Taking into account the overall financial performances of the Company, your Directors have not transferred any amount to the General Reserve Account. DEPOSITS During the year under review, your Company did not accept any deposits within the meaning of provisions of Chapter V-Acceptance of Deposits by Companies of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the Companies (Acceptance of Deposits) Rules, 2014.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.421909',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.421909',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.421909',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:11.421909','{\"title\": \"The turnover of the Company in years 2023\", \"summary\": \"The turnover of the Company in years 2023-2024 has increased to Rs.93.64 Crores as against Rs.85.37 Crores in the previous year 2022-2023, resulting in increase of 9.68%. However in the year 2023-24, the company has reduced its losses and incurred a loss of Rs.3.43 Crores as compared to a loss of Rs.6.69 Crores in the previous year 2022-23. The Earnings per share(EPS) for the year is Rs.-3.65 per share as compared to Rs-7.11 per share in the previous year. DIVIDEND The Directors have not recommended any dividend for this financial year. RESERVES Taking into account the overall financial performances of the Company, your Directors have not transferred any amount to the General Reserve Account. DEPOSITS During the year under review, your Company did not accept any deposits within the meaning of provisions of Chapter V-Acceptance of Deposits by Companies of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the Companies (Acceptance of Deposits) Rules, 2014.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.abmintl.in/#:~:text=The%20turnover%20of%20the%20Company%20in%20years\", \"budget_allocated\": \"rs 2023\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'rs 2023','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'The turnover of the Company in years 2023'),(1293,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability','Environment & Sustainability','Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:11.827961+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'38d00ecafd35c7e330bf24f1204467ce','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'8513461eb39a8cf913a6f8908c6d51d2',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961','{\"title\": \"Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability\", \"summary\": \"Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability'),(1294,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum','Environment & Sustainability','The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:11.827961+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'ca9593b253d89b7200f5d78f0f102480','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'f2f7b5db449bd6453315a401009dabb3',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961','{\"title\": \"The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum\", \"summary\": \"The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum'),(1295,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons','Environment & Sustainability','Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:11.827961+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'968e35102397e1a43e8ad61e9fa78c3a','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'e1de98964c41ae67bf11ccedc5b0c680',NULL,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961','{\"title\": \"Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons\", \"summary\": \"Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons'),(1296,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which','Education & Skill Development','The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:11.827961+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'2be0c5fbf5064cadb20293b794f54408','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'b760640f991e06dc698203e21c640840',NULL,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:11.827961','{\"title\": \"The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which\", \"summary\": \"The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which'),(1297,'ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers w','Education & Skill Development','ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers who had built their expertise at institutions that defined the global technology landscape — IBM, Bell Labs, IIM, ECIL, and ASCI. At a time when computing in India was in its infancy, these founders saw not just possibility, but obligation: to build a company that could bring world-class technology capability to Indian organisations. That founding conviction — rigorous expertise, applied boldly — has never changed. Today, listed on both BSE (Scrip Code: 530745) and NSE (Symbol: ACSTECH), with deployments ranging from AI systems for the Indian Armed Forces to geospatial work with ISRO and smart facility platforms across the Gulf, ACS Technologies stands as one of India\'s longest-standing and most trusted independent technology companies.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acstechnologies.co.in/#:~:text=ACS%20Technologies%20was%20incorporated%20in%201980%20by',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:12.846979+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'1a0a7acb2ea80ee06e13620a7dc907ad','COMP_TOP200_170',NULL,'b4e5768474536ce1375d567033d57b45',NULL,'ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers who had built their expertise at institutions that defined the global technology landscape — IBM, Bell Labs, IIM, ECIL, and ASCI. At a time when computing in India was in its infancy, these founders saw not just possibility, but obligation: to build a company that could bring world-class technology capability to Indian organisations. That founding conviction — rigorous expertise, applied boldly — has never changed. Today, listed on both BSE (Scrip Code: 530745) and NSE (Symbol: ACSTECH), with deployments ranging from AI systems for the Indian Armed Forces to geospatial work with ISRO and smart facility platforms across the Gulf, ACS Technologies stands as one of India\'s longest-standing and most trusted independent technology companies.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:12.846979',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:12.846979',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:12.846979',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:12.846979','{\"title\": \"ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers w\", \"summary\": \"ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers who ha