tions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply committed to the decarbonisation of power generation and to bringing green electricity to Mumbai residents.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20and%20its%20subsidiary%2C%20Adani',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:14.357252+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'956812c706896a6461b48cb244e8b4db','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'22770d6f3c9cb1f28597e9c073c9e900',NULL,'Adani Energy Solutions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply committed to the decarbonisation of power generation and to bringing green electricity to Mumbai residents.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252','{\"title\": \"Adani Energy Solutions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply co\", \"summary\": \"Adani Energy Solutions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply committed to the decarbonisation of power generation and to bringing green electricity to Mumbai residents.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20and%20its%20subsidiary%2C%20Adani\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Adani Energy Solutions and its subsidiary, Adani Electricity Mumbai Limited, are deeply co'),(1302,'Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is ','Education & Skill Development','Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the ecosystem in which we operate. AESL has a ‘Biodiversity Policy’ signed by MD&CEO. One of the focus areas of the policy is to work towards achieving a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. AESL has also signed India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 17th July 2020. IBBI is a business led initiative with an objective to mainstream biodiversity in Indian Businesses. AESL commits to conduct the business with no net loss to biodiversity and leave positive impact on the environment and surroundings of its operations by integrating the biodiversity aspects in management systems. Also, AESL is working towards assessing and mapping biodiversity at our operation sites to determine what level of biodiversity importance exists on the land and to identify the potential impacts of our operations on that biodiversity, if any.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%20believes%20that',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:14.357252+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'3c3b3e9214d18fcf3c2df803fc28e7fc','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'cf97a298c55f64bd124bcd65b336342c',NULL,'Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the ecosystem in which we operate. AESL has a ‘Biodiversity Policy’ signed by MD&CEO. One of the focus areas of the policy is to work towards achieving a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. AESL has also signed India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 17th July 2020. IBBI is a business led initiative with an objective to mainstream biodiversity in Indian Businesses. AESL commits to conduct the business with no net loss to biodiversity and leave positive impact on the environment and surroundings of its operations by integrating the biodiversity aspects in management systems. Also, AESL is working towards assessing and mapping biodiversity at our operation sites to determine what level of biodiversity importance exists on the land and to identify the potential impacts of our operations on that biodiversity, if any.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252','{\"title\": \"Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is \", \"summary\": \"Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the ecosystem in which we operate. AESL has a ‘Biodiversity Policy’ signed by MD&CEO. One of the focus areas of the policy is to work towards achieving a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. AESL has also signed India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 17th July 2020. IBBI is a business led initiative with an objective to mainstream biodiversity in Indian Businesses. AESL commits to conduct the business with no net loss to biodiversity and leave positive impact on the environment and surroundings of its operations by integrating the biodiversity aspects in management systems. Also, AESL is working towards assessing and mapping biodiversity at our operation sites to determine what level of biodiversity importance exists on the land and to identify the potential impacts of our operations on that biodiversity, if any.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%20believes%20that\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL) believes that the sustainability of our business is '),(1303,'At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed ','Education & Skill Development','At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%2C%20while',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:14.357252+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'f41c61ee41785ec2dd93a7b674f1668b','COMP_TOP200_039',NULL,'73ceb5adea5d4dcbd58b66942a7a40aa',NULL,'At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:14.357252','{\"title\": \"At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed \", \"summary\": \"At Adani Energy Solutions Limited (AESL), while we are totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanienergysolutions.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Energy%20Solutions%20Limited%20%28AESL%29%2C%20while\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_categ