 & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=In%20total%2C%20this%20translates%20to%20a%20USD\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'In total, this translates to a USD 5'),(1310,'We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is','Education & Skill Development','We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the health of the ecosystem in which we operate. Fortifying our commitment towards biodiversity conservation is a comprehensive policy – the framework of which is under the direct administration of the company’s CEO. One of the key focus areas of the policy is to ensure a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. Further, AGEL became a signatory in the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 23rd July 2020. The objective of this initiative is to sensitize and mentor Indian business organizations for biodiversity conservation and enhancement. AGEL is devoted to integrate the biodiversity aspects in its management systems to create a sustainable and positive impact on the surroundings. To this end, the company is currently assessing and mapping the biodiversity at its operation sites and identifying impacts, if any.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20at%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:16.735206+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'6ef169758545f37cc29160a85824192b','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'9b0d8886d72efa8fc73aaeb9ec4690fd',NULL,'We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the health of the ecosystem in which we operate. Fortifying our commitment towards biodiversity conservation is a comprehensive policy – the framework of which is under the direct administration of the company’s CEO. One of the key focus areas of the policy is to ensure a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. Further, AGEL became a signatory in the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 23rd July 2020. The objective of this initiative is to sensitize and mentor Indian business organizations for biodiversity conservation and enhancement. AGEL is devoted to integrate the biodiversity aspects in its management systems to create a sustainable and positive impact on the surroundings. To this end, the company is currently assessing and mapping the biodiversity at its operation sites and identifying impacts, if any.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206','{\"title\": \"We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is\", \"summary\": \"We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is intricately linked with the health of the ecosystem in which we operate. Fortifying our commitment towards biodiversity conservation is a comprehensive policy – the framework of which is under the direct administration of the company’s CEO. One of the key focus areas of the policy is to ensure a minimum of No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. Further, AGEL became a signatory in the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 23rd July 2020. The objective of this initiative is to sensitize and mentor Indian business organizations for biodiversity conservation and enhancement. AGEL is devoted to integrate the biodiversity aspects in its management systems to create a sustainable and positive impact on the surroundings. To this end, the company is currently assessing and mapping the biodiversity at its operation sites and identifying impacts, if any.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20at%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We at Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL) believe that the sustainability of our business is'),(1311,'The Contract documents in AGEL ensure Contractors, Sub','Education & Skill Development','The Contract documents in AGEL ensure Contractors, Sub-Contractors and Suppliers shall comply with policies, codes and guidelines pertaining to ESG requirement, employ management systems for ESG risks and opportunities and commit to continuous improvements, ensure fair terms and conditions of employment for its sub-contractors, employees and personnel, asses and mitigate health, safety and environmental risks and focus on corporate responsibility.',NULL,NULL,'rs,','https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Contract%20documents%20in%20AGEL%20ensure%20Contractors%2C',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:16.735206+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'9b9010acf8cc4db8051429ad90c14de6','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'290842c66b6bd35aeb8c28e25d9816f1',NULL,'The Contract documents in AGEL ensure Contractors, Sub-Contractors and Suppliers shall comply with policies, codes and guidelines pertaining to ESG requirement, employ management systems for ESG risks and opportunities and commit to continuous improvements, ensure fair terms and conditions of employment for its sub-contractors, employees and personnel, asses and mitigate health, safety and environmental risks and focus on corporate respo