%20is%20a%20strategic%20focus%20area%20for',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:15.837387+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'2161d7a2748dfa298808e036aa9d955e','COMP_TOP200_017',NULL,'558343cc965e6cc3326ec273dc34bf6c',NULL,'Sustainability is a strategic focus area for Adani Enterprises Limited. AEL’s guiding principle is ‘Growth with Goodness’. Growth for us is the impact we have created, the lives we have touched, the communities we have empowered, and the future we inspire. Our vision is to excel at sustainable value creation by creating and managing businesses that enrich lives and contribute to the nation. Our ESG strategy focuses on incubating environmental stewardship, enhancing the social impact and value creation enabled by our robust governance structure.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:15.837387',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:15.837387',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:15.837387',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:15.837387','{\"title\": \"Sustainability is a strategic focus area for Adani Enterprises Limited\", \"summary\": \"Sustainability is a strategic focus area for Adani Enterprises Limited. AEL’s guiding principle is ‘Growth with Goodness’. Growth for us is the impact we have created, the lives we have touched, the communities we have empowered, and the future we inspire. Our vision is to excel at sustainable value creation by creating and managing businesses that enrich lives and contribute to the nation. Our ESG strategy focuses on incubating environmental stewardship, enhancing the social impact and value creation enabled by our robust governance structure.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanienterprises.com/sustainability#:~:text=Sustainability%20is%20a%20strategic%20focus%20area%20for\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified 