unities. We believe that these goals and targets create a strong foundation for lasting success and the ability to deliver tangible results.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanienterprises.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20AEL%2C%20we%20are%20committed%20to%20pursuing\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'At AEL, we are committed to pursuing ESG goals and targets that are aligned with advancing'),(1316,'At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to br','Education & Skill Development','At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29%2C%20while',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:16.735206+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'0a2925a9263bc6972fdfbf74187ab6ae','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'5c3a1e5e38d9094d98eaba30505201ef',NULL,'At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:16.735206','{\"title\": \"At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to br\", \"summary\": \"At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to bringing about a green transformation from the abundant natural resources, we ensure that any kind of business activities are performed in the most sustainable manner without disturbing the ecosystem.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Green%20Energy%20Limited%20%28AGEL%29%2C%20while\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'At Adani Green Energy Limited (AGEL), while we’re totally and consistently committed to br'),(1318,'To plant our vast zero deforestation programme, we’re adhering to strict guidelines whereb','Environment & Sustainability','To plant our vast zero deforestation programme, we’re adhering to strict guidelines whereby we don’t expand or produce on areas converted from High Carbon Stock (HCS) forests and habitats such as peatland of any depth (except where farming practices protect peat), wetland and savannas after 31st December 2015, as defined in the High Carbon Stock Approach Toolkit and IUCN protected areas categories I-IV, UNESCO World Heritage Sites and wetlands on the Ramsar List. Furthermore, we have also been identifying and protecting the High Conservation Values (HCV) lands in and around our sites.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanigreenenergy.com/sustainability#:~:text=To%20plant%20our%20vast%20zero%20deforestation%20programme%2C',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:16.735206+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'887e8d662158b670eb190f0d99021967','COMP_TOP200_033',NULL,'6b168f3979f56a52dd51a37136f9bbe8',NULL,'To plant our vast zero deforestation programme, we’re adher