lity#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability'),(1350,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum','Environment & Sustainability','The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels to water conservation , emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, Ambuja Cement’s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:26.659853+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'c8a2541475543e73d136ffd0289c4560','COMP_TOP200_082',NULL,'9ee375cc67e40ffb97f933ea128c49f2',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels to water conservation , emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, Ambuja Cement’s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853','{\"title\": \"The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum\", \"summary\": \"The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels to water conservation , emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, Ambuja Cement’s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum'),(1351,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons','Environment & Sustainability','Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%2