ironmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons'),(1352,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which','Education & Skill Development','The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ambujacement.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:26.659853+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'5f317a85faf8a112945d2c8ce841fa85','COMP_TOP200_082',NULL,'1b216d4eb91ae9c94db8b3f883e6b84d',NULL,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:26.659853','{\"title\": \"The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which\", \"summary\": \"The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well