crobial Resistance (AMR) as part of our sustainability agenda.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.aurobindo.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20focus%20of%20our%20sustainability%20efforts%20at',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:37.266103+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'411ce83a8e12613a6d87477ec5291755','COMP_TOP200_093',NULL,'08f49c1b67983b9cb24a31f44811f581',NULL,'The focus of our sustainability efforts at APL is centred around the responsible and sustainable use of natural resources, including energy, water, and waste management. We also prioritise addressing critical issues such as Pharmaceuticals in the Environment (PiE) and Antimicrobial Resistance (AMR) as part of our sustainability agenda.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103','{\"title\": \"The focus of our sustainability efforts at APL is centred around the responsible and susta\", \"summary\": \"The focus of our sustainability efforts at APL is centred around the responsible and sustainable use of natural resources, including energy, water, and waste management. We also prioritise addressing critical issues such as Pharmaceuticals in the Environment (PiE) and Antimicrobial Resistance (AMR) as part of our sustainability agenda.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.aurobindo.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20focus%20of%20our%20sustainability%20efforts%20at\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'The focus of our sustainability efforts at APL is centred around the responsible and susta'),(1381,'Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well','Environment & Sustainability','Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well- being of the communities we engage with and nurture life on our planet. We are dedicated to integrating the ESG principles deeply into our daily operations, by reducing carbon emissions, transitioning from traditional to renewable energy and implementing responsible water, and waste management practices. Adopting renewable energy and innovating with sustainable packaging, every step we take is a step toward preserving our planet for future generations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.aurobindo.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20journey%20is%20fueled%20by%20our%20commitment',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:37.266103+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'3ad6a6321fc6ba11e43385ece7e2aa88','COMP_TOP200_093',NULL,'9ec9453593730b1058dc6b7086221c25',NULL,'Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well- being of the communities we engage with and nurture life on our planet. We are dedicated to integrating the ESG principles deeply into our daily operations, by reducing carbon emissions, transitioning from traditional to renewable energy and implementing responsible water, and waste management practices. Adopting renewable energy and innovating with sustainable packaging, every step we take is a step toward preserving our planet for future generations.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:37.266103','{\"title\": \"Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well\", \"summary\": \"Our journey is fueled by our commitment towards enhancing the well- being of the communities we engage with and nurture life on our planet. We are dedicated to integrating the ESG principles deeply into our daily operations, by reducing carbon emissions, transitioning from traditional to renewable energy and implementing responsible water, and waste management practices. Adop