ustry, long dependent on fossil fuels, bears a critical responsibility to reduce carbon emissions and lead the shift toward eco-conscious operations.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393','{\"title\": \"In an era defined by climate urgency, sustainability isn’t optional\", \"summary\": \"In an era defined by climate urgency, sustainability isn’t optional—it’s essential. The supply chain industry, long dependent on fossil fuels, bears a critical responsibility to reduce carbon emissions and lead the shift toward eco-conscious operations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=In%20an%20era%20defined%20by%20climate%20urgency%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'In an era defined by climate urgency, sustainability isn’t optional'),(1384,'At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment','Environment & Sustainability','At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment—it’s embedded in our DNA. We\'ve implemented a holistic sustainability strategy that integrates cutting-edge technologies, alternative energy solutions, and ethical business practices. From optimizing route efficiency to adopting cleaner fuels, every step we take is aimed at minimizing our ecological footprint—while maximizing impact for a greener future.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=At%20AVG%20Logistics%2C%20environmental%20stewardship%20is%20more',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:39.995393+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'d8b2ba736cae34602218cd9e3d