 (EVs) and alternative fuels, significantly cutting emissions at the source. Using AI-driven route optimization, we reduce mileage, fuel use, and carbon output across operations. Our energy-efficient warehouses, powered by solar energy and equipped with smart lighting systems, lower energy consumption by up to 30%. Additionally, comprehensive recycling and waste-to-resource initiatives ensure we contribute as little as possible to landfills—turning waste into opportunity.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20sustainability%20is%20reflected%20in',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:39.995393+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'0bd09a549350f89f3923398869f6e8f9','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'9bdce5664457719e65e090679b221573',NULL,'Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move. A growing share of our fleet now runs on electric vehicles (EVs) and alternative fuels, significantly cutting emissions at the source. Using AI-driven route optimization, we reduce mileage, fuel use, and carbon output across operations. Our energy-efficient warehouses, powered by solar energy and equipped with smart lighting systems, lower energy consumption by up to 30%. Additionally, comprehensive recycling and waste-to-resource initiatives ensure we contribute as little as possible to landfills—turning waste into opportunity.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:39.995393','{\"title\": \"Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move\", \"summary\": \"Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move. A growing share of our fleet now runs on electric vehicles (EVs) and alternative fuels, significantly cutting emissions at the source. Using AI-driven route optimization, we reduce mileage, fuel use, and carbon output across operations. Our energy-efficient warehouses, pow