 Governance commitments, progress, and key metrics'),(1410,'The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs','Education & Skill Development','The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs. 1,300 Cr. to projects focusing on Skilling and Education, Health, Livelihoods, and Water Conservation since CSR rules were first announced in 2014.',NULL,NULL,'Rs. 1,300 Cr.','https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20Bajaj%20Group%20companies%20have%20contributed%20over',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:48.266035+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'55ac8f71960a3c378f35e493495ea0fb','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'cc754a17c4cfd359f28abf3f7824cf29',NULL,'The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs. 1,300 Cr. to projects focusing on Skilling and Education, Health, Livelihoods, and Water Conservation since CSR rules were first announced in 2014.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035','{\"title\": \"The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs\", \"summary\": \"The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs. 1,300 Cr. to projects focusing on Skilling and Education, Health, Livelihoods, and Water Conservation since CSR rules were first announced in 2014.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=The%20Bajaj%20Group%20companies%20have%20contributed%20over\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Rs. 1,300 Cr.\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Rs. 1,300 Cr.','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'The Bajaj Group companies have contributed over Rs'),(1411,'Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas','Education & Skill Development','Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas i.e. Skill-development in STEM. Our CSR initiatives are designed to address skill-gaps in STEM from school education to higher education. We are deeply committed to improving the livelihoods of the youth of our country by skilling and empowering them. We envision bringing Indian youth to the forefront of industrial transformation through BAL CSR Skilling Initiatives, the first two flagship CSR initiatives are Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) and Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS).',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Auto%20is%20committed%20to%20promoting%20science',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:48.266035+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'ce205802929df85cd930d02a4aea0780','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'fcae9bff803a683f24cc228c17012edd',NULL,'Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas i.e. Skill-development in STEM. Our CSR initiatives are designed to address skill-gaps in STEM from school education to higher education. We are deeply committed to improving the livelihoods of the youth of our country by skilling and empowering them. We envision bringing Indian youth to the forefront of industrial transformation through BAL CSR Skilling Initiatives, the first two flagship CSR initiatives are Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) and Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS).',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035','{\"title\": \"Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas\", \"summary\": \"Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas i.e. Skill-development in STEM. Our CSR initiatives are designed to address skill-gaps in STEM from school education to higher education. We are deeply committed to improving the livelihoods of the youth of our country by skilling and empowering them. We envision bringing Indian youth to the forefront of industrial transformation through BAL CSR Skilling Initiatives, the first two flagship CSR initiatives are Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) and Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS).\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Auto%20is%20committed%20to%20promoting%20science\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Bajaj Auto is committed to promoting science and technology as part of its CSR focus areas'),(1412,'Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd ','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd that provides best-in-class manufacturing skills training to young engineers. It is implemented in partnership with India’s top universities and engineering colleges by setting up state-of-the-art laboratories, with world-class equipment procured from across the globe. The centres provide skill training in contemporary and evolving technologies to engineering graduates (with both degrees and diplomas), helping them become competent and employable, thus bridging the industry-academia skill gap. BEST aims to support young learners from the economically weaker sections of society, those hailing from tier 2, tier 3 and tier 4 colleges/cities, and disadvantaged areas to enhance their employment opportunities.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Engineering%20Skills%20Training%20%28BEST%29%20is%20the',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:48.266035+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'7496698cf1102993b4f3aa404c24c1d4','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'688c7e26cba86a022833fdba238eab56',NULL,'Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd that provides best-in-class manufacturing skills training to young engineers. It is implemented in partnership with India’s top universities and engineering colleges by setting up state-of-the-art laboratories, with world-class equipment procured from across the globe. The centres provide skill training in contemporary and evolving technologies to engineering graduates (with both degrees and diplomas), helping them become competent and employable, thus bridging the industry-academia skill gap. BEST aims to support young learners from the economically weaker sections of society, those hailing from tier 2, tier 3 and tier 4 colleges/cities, and disadvantaged areas to enhance their employment opportunities.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035','{\"title\": \"Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd \", \"summary\": \"Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd that provides best-in-class manufacturing skills training to young engineers. It is implemented in partnership with India’s top universities and engineering colleges by setting up state-of-the-art laboratories, with world-class equipment procured from across the globe. The centres provide skill training in contemporary and evolving technologies to engineering graduates (with both degrees and diplomas), helping them become competent and employable, thus bridging the industry-academia skill gap. BEST aims to support young learners from the economically weaker sections of society, those hailing from tier 2, tier 3 and tier 4 colleges/cities, and disadvantaged areas to enhance their employment opportunities.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Engineering%20Skills%20Training%20%28BEST%29%20is%20the\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'Bajaj Engineering Skills Training (BEST) is the flagship CSR initiative of Bajaj Auto Ltd '),(1413,'We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative','Education & Skill Development','We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative. The second phase of BEST Program will have new verticals such as Electronics Manufacturing Systems (EMS), Firmware Development (FD), Systems Validation (SV) and E-Mobility (EM).',NULL,NULL,'INR 350 crore','https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20have%20committed%20approximately%20INR%20350%20crore',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:48.266035+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'60b7406ddfeff42eb1f94400b9cdec4a','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'0959818917cbaef6ab4f5d6af12a2506',NULL,'We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative. The second phase of BEST Program will have new verticals such as Electronics Manufacturing Systems (EMS), Firmware Development (FD), Systems Validation (SV) and E-Mobility (EM).',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035','{\"title\": \"We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative\", \"summary\": \"We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative. The second phase of BEST Program will have new verticals such as Electronics Manufacturing Systems (EMS), Firmware Development (FD), Systems Validation (SV) and E-Mobility (EM).\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20have%20committed%20approximately%20INR%20350%20crore\", \"budget_allocated\": \"INR 350 crore\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'INR 350 crore','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We have committed approximately INR 350 crore over the next 3 years for this initiative'),(1414,'Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e','Education & Skill Development','Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e-learning, self-paced course that aims to impart industry knowledge to ITI and polytechnic students using Bajaj’s experience in operational excellence. BMS continues to revolutionize ITI training by integrating industry-relevant modules based on Total Productive Maintenance (TPM) principles.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Manufacturing%20Systems%20%28BMS%29%20a%20flagship%20CSR',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:48.266035+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'7f3b8732e31fbc47dc0d23d5a984f4dd','COMP_TOP200_020',NULL,'c9e23fbdb10ad20bf4517084540f0d8a',NULL,'Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e-learning, self-paced course that aims to impart industry knowledge to ITI and polytechnic students using Bajaj’s experience in operational excellence. BMS continues to revolutionize ITI training by integrating industry-relevant modules based on Total Productive Maintenance (TPM) principles.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:48.266035','{\"title\": \"Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e\", \"summary\": \"Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e-learning, self-paced course that aims to impart industry knowledge to ITI and polytechnic students using Bajaj’s experience in operational excellence. BMS continues to revolutionize ITI training by integrating industry-relevant modules based on Total Productive Maintenance (TPM) principles.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Bajaj%20Manufacturing%20Systems%20%28BMS%29%20a%20flagship%20CSR\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Bajaj Manufacturing Systems (BMS) a flagship CSR initiative, is an e'),(1415,'Our dedication lies in enhancing the well','Education & Skill Development','Our dedication lies in enhancing the well- being of individuals, with a particular focus on marginalized communities residing in proximity to our manufacturing plants. We also contribute to education, health, environment, animal welfare projects, and other relevant areas for the sustainable development of the community and the nation. Through our CSR arm, Janki Bajaj Gram Vikas Sanstha (JBGVS), we implement and fund many projects that aims to uplift people from communities on the margins.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bajajauto.com/corporate/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20dedication%20lies%20in%20enhancing%20the%20well-',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:48.26