cardiac emergencies and incorporating health education into school curriculums.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bharatforge.com/sustainability/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=This%20initiative%20benefited%20over%20500%20school%20children',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:53.096233+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'05ea5c614ff685eb594beedd78454d8e','COMP_TOP200_150',NULL,'f880ef7a6dc84a21455e9d1b9a00fc2c',NULL,'This initiative benefited over 500 school children and teachers. The initiative aimed to raise awareness about heart health and equip participants with essential life-saving skills like CPR - Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation and AED - Automated External Defibrillator usage. With the active involvement of Bharat Forge employees and municipal schools, the program highlighted the importance of recognizing cardiac emergencies and incorporating health education into school curriculums.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233','{\"title\": \"This initiative benefited over 500 school children and teachers\", \"summary\": \"This initiative benefited over 500 school children and teachers. The initiative aimed to raise awareness about heart health and equip participants with essential life-saving skills like CPR - Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation and AED - Automated External Defibrillator usage. With the active involvement of Bharat Forge employees and municipal schools, the program highlighted the importance of recognizing cardiac emergencies and incorporating health education into school curriculums.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bharatforge.com/sustainability/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=This%20initiative%20benefited%20over%20500%20school%20children\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\