d awareness about celebrating festivals in an environmentally responsible way. Let’s continue to celebrate our traditions while protecting our planet.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:53.096233','{\"title\": \"Our employees also took part as trainers\", \"summary\": \"Our employees also took part as trainers. The objective of this initiative is to spread awareness about celebrating festivals in an environmentally responsible way. Let’s continue to celebrate our traditions while protecting our planet.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bharatforge.com/sustainability/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Our%20employees%20also%20took%20part%20as%20trainers.\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Our employees also took part as trainers'),(1461,'Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability','Education & Skill Development','Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability. The organization is committed to making a positive impact on society by addressing its most relevant needs. Each project or program is designed to create compelling and influential narratives that align with social objectives, with the ultimate goal of improving people’s lives. Bosch ensures that it’s projects not only benefit the beneficiaries and stakeholders but are also sustainable and scalable over time. By concentrating its social responsibility efforts on key areas such as employment enhancing vocational skill development, environmental and water conservation, healthcare, education and integrated community development, Bosch demonstrates its commitment to making a lasting difference to the communities it serves.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%E2%80%99s%20social%20engagement%20is%20characterized%20by',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:08:55.908553+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'d514c7579b0a4061aae84eddd0cf4836','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'0399508e53bbe7cc3fec5e02574f9eef',NULL,'Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability. The organization is committed to making a positive impact on society by addressing its most relevant needs. Each project or program is designed to create compelling and influential narratives that align with social objectives, with the ultimate goal of improving people’s lives. Bosch ensures that it’s projects not only benefit the beneficiaries and stakeholders but are also sustainable and scalable over time. By concentrating its social responsibility efforts on key areas such as employment enhancing vocational skill development, environmental and water conservation, healthcare, education and integrated community development, Bosch demonstrates its commitment to making a lasting difference to the communities it serves.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:55.908553',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:55.908553',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:08:55.908553',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:08:55.908553','{\"title\": \"Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability\", \"summary\": \"Bosch India’s social engagement is characterized by its dedication to sustainability. The organization is committed to making a positive impact on society by addressing its most relevant needs. Each project or program is designed to create compelling and influential narratives that align with social objectives, with the ultimate goal of improving people’s lives. Bosch ensures that it’s projects not