 the TB patients of the District Mewat (Nuh), Haryana.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Supporting%20and%20serving%20as%20a%20Ni-Kshay%20Mitra%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Supporting and serving as a Ni'),(1530,'The program has a three','Education & Skill Development','The program has a three-pronged approach to provide support to existing TB patients with nutritional support to maintain a healthy diet align the communities with the Government’s national drive to eradicate TB through community awareness programs and strengthen health delivery systems by working with communities and district health officials.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=The%20program%20has%20a%20three-pronged%20approach%20to',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:07.518894+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'7d9ddd9061b61445ca9b24f80b755ab5','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'c1daf0fde4907823d9dbe748aba8754e',NULL,'The program has a three-pronged approach to provide support to existing TB patients with nutritional support to maintain a healthy diet align the communities with the Government’s national drive to eradicate TB through community awareness programs and strengthen health delivery systems by working with communities and district health officials.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894','{\"title\": \"The program has a three\", \"summary\": \"The program has a three-pronged approach to provide support to existing TB patients with nutritional support to maintain a healthy diet align the communities with the Government’s national drive to eradicate TB through community awareness programs and strengthen health delivery systems by working with communities and district health officials.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=The%20program%20has%20a%20three-pronged%20approach%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'The program has a three'),(1531,'Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issue','Education & Skill Development','Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issues holistically, emphasizing community capacity building and awareness on various health issues, including preventive healthcare, first-aid, nutrition, anemia, kitchen gardening, immunization, adolescence health, water and sanitation, and access to health services via telemedicine. In Kanpur and Kanpur Rural, Uttar Pradesh, the foundation supports 60-70 \'Ekal Vidyalaya\' centers, providing informal primary education to tribal children. The initiative also includes backing \'Swachh Bharat Abhiyan\' with dustbin units in North-West Delhi, aiding the \'Paryas Society\' in Himachal Pradesh with dengue-testing kits, and supporting the TB eradication program of \'Delhi Commonwealth Women Association.\' Additionally, assistance is provided to \'The Lepra Trust India\' for leprosy-affected families.',NULL,NULL,'rs,','https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20the%20comprehensive%20community%20health%20initiative%2C%20LPL',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:07.518894+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'c51a6ddedf299490f9460c6b325510e5','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'ab5f279c31c72a738b2c6767bb562870',NULL,'Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issues holistically, emphasizing community capacity building and awareness on various health issues, including preventive healthcare, first-aid, nutrition, anemia, kitchen gardening, immunization, adolescence health, water and sanitation, and access to health services via telemedicine. In Kanpur and Kanpur Rural, Uttar Pradesh, the foundation supports 60-70 \'Ekal Vidyalaya\' centers, providing informal primary education to tribal children. The initiative also includes backing \'Swachh Bharat Abhiyan\' with dustbin units in North-West Delhi, aiding the \'Paryas Society\' in Himachal Pradesh with dengue-testing kits, and supporting the TB eradication program of \'Delhi Commonwealth Women Association.\' Additionally, assistance is provided to \'The Lepra Trust India\' for leprosy-affected families.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894','{\"title\": \"Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issue\", \"summary\": \"Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issues holistically, emphasizing community capacity building and awareness on various health issues, including preventive healthcare, first-aid, nutrition, anemia, kitchen gardening, immunization, adolescence health, water and sanitation, and access to health services via telemedicine. In Kanpur and Kanpur Rural, Uttar Pradesh, the foundation supports 60-70 \'Ekal Vidyalaya\' centers, providing informal primary education to tribal children. The initiative also includes backing \'Swachh Bharat Abhiyan\' with dustbin units in North-West Delhi, aiding the \'Paryas Society\' in Himachal Pradesh with dengue-testing kits, and supporting the TB eradication program of \'Delhi Commonwealth Women Association.\' Additionally, assistance is provided to \'The L