 specific to healthcare, LPL Founda\", \"summary\": \"Creating new knowledge, thought leadership and research specific to healthcare, LPL Foundation signed an MOU with Indian Institute of Management, Ahmedabad to establish a professional chair in healthcare at the institutetitled ‘Dr Lal PathLabs Chair in Healthcare’. This is an ongoing project that commenced in FY 2022- 23 and this phase of the program continues until 2025.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Creating%20new%20knowledge%2C%20thought%20leadership%20and%20research\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Creating new knowledge, thought leadership and research specific to healthcare, LPL Founda'),(1533,'Comprehensive School HealthProgram (CSHP) is a unique healthcurriculum','Education & Skill Development','Comprehensive School HealthProgram (CSHP) is a unique healthcurriculum-based program forschool students in Class VI & VII.The curriculum covers health care, health awareness and aims atbehavioral change towards betterhealth management with a focuson non-communicable diseases. The program also covers a trainthe-trainer program where teachersare trained to drive positive healthbehavior among their students in Delhi-NCR and Tri-City Chandigarh.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Comprehensive%20School%20HealthProgram%20%28CSHP%29%20is%20a%20unique',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:07.518894+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'77bccdd8d4ee7a3be5e302a754f09540','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'9cfb8a7c4b375f6cdb99f91216c21432',NULL,'Comprehensive School HealthProgram (CSHP) is a unique healthcurriculum-based program forschool students in Class VI & VII.The curriculum covers 