ely impacts 2,000 underprivileged women, with 200 engaging in income-generating activities. The Help Care Society receives aid through blanket donations, while Akshay Patra benefits from our support in the Airtel Delhi Half Marathon, assisting underprivileged children.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20our%20community%20health%20initiative%20in%20Indore',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:07.518894+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'f0a204df6c7afa3e0b0ff870eaaad4c3','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'c019501848c171c6e1709f16798fba1a',NULL,'Under our community health initiative in Indore (MP), we provide vital dialysis services to the underprivileged, addressing the healthcare gap. Additionally, our focus on prevention and awareness targets chronic diseases, emphasizing kidney care. In Mumbai, our Women Empowerment Program positively impacts 2,000 underprivileged women, with 200 engaging in income-generating activities. The Help Care Society receives aid through blanket donations, while Akshay Patra benefits from our support in the Airtel Delhi Half Marathon, assisting underprivileged children.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:07.518894','{\"title\": \"Under our community health initiative in Indore (MP), we provide vital dialysis services t\", \"summary\": \"Under our community health initiative in Indore (MP), we provide vital dialysis services to the underprivileged, addressing the healthcare gap. Additionally, our focus on prevention and awareness targets chronic diseases, emphasizing kidney care. In Mumbai, our Women Empowerment Program positively impacts 2,000 underprivileged women, with 200 engaging in income-generating activities. The Help Care Society receives aid through blanket donations, while Akshay Patra benefits from our support in the Airtel Delhi Half Marathon, assisting underprivileged children.\", \"focus_ar