9:07.525956',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:07.525956',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:07.525956','{\"title\": \"Our ESG commitments are centred around creating positive social impact for our patients an\", \"summary\": \"Our ESG commitments are centred around creating positive social impact for our patients and employees, reducing our environmental footprint, and ensuring responsible business practices to build trust with our diverse stakeholders. Strong governance mechanisms and policy frameworks help us operationalise and deliver on our commitments, and our goal of reaching 1.5 billion patients by 2030 guides us as we work every day to enhance access, affordability, and innovation through our medicines, reduce the global disease burden, and improve patient health outcomes.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20ESG%20commitments%20are%20centred%20around%20creating\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Our ESG commitments are centred around creating positive social impact for our patients an'),(1544,'By replacing fossil fuels with biofuels in boilers and expanding solar, wind, and hybrid e','Environment & Sustainability','By replacing fossil fuels with biofuels in boilers and expanding solar, wind, and hybrid energy use, we reduced Scope 1 and 2 emissions by 33% vs FY2023. Energy-saving initiatives also helped avoid 8,073 tonnes of CO₂ and saved 7.75 million kWh in FY2025.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.drreddys.com/our-people-and-our-citizenship/sustainability#:~:text=By%20replacing%20fossil%20fuels%20with%20biofuels%20in',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:07.52