eceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.',NULL,NULL,'₹500 crore','https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=CSR%20provisions%20don%27t%20apply%20to%20companies%20whose',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:16.938030+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'c21f0aa0752b5b55fa0f879b7fd128d5','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'9fe0e4345221fc7a46099f0a607b1b98',NULL,'CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or more, turnover of ₹1,000 crore or more, or net profits of ₹5 crore or more during the immediately preceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030','{\"title\": \"CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or mor\", \"summary\": \"CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or more, turnover of ₹1,000 crore or more, or net profits of ₹5 crore or more during the immediately preceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=CSR%20provisions%20don%27t%20apply%20to%20companies%20whose\", \"budget_allocated\": \"₹500 crore\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'₹500 crore','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or mor'),(1585,'Corporate CSR Initiative','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Not-ongoing%20projects%3A%20The%20unutilised%20part%20is%20to',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:16.938030+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'e253cf1ccf2e0b4bae3df97671cae6ec','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'e410fc0fbe69d374f6898e795d42d859',NULL,'Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:16.938030','{\"title\": \"Corporate CSR Initiative\", \"summary\": \"Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\"