se the use of renewable energy, and utilize offsets to mitigate residual emissions.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20first%20and%20foremost%20commitment%20is%20to',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:17.934655+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'7c19fef43dc5b2c73ed248f88c6c8d33','COMP_TOP200_073',NULL,'30f1531dae321636b959a11f2e9cc8a6',NULL,'Our first and foremost commitment is to revolutionize our manufacturing processes by investing in cutting-edge technologies and adopting eco-friendly practices to minimize our carbon footprint. We aim to enhance energy efficiency, increase the use of renewable energy, and utilize offsets to mitigate residual emissions.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655','{\"title\": \"Our first and foremost commitment is to revolutionize our manufacturing processes by inves\", \"summary\": \"Our first and foremost commitment is to revolutionize our manufacturing processes by investing in cutting-edge technologies and adopting eco-friendly practices to minimize our carbon footprint. We aim to enhance energy efficiency, increase the use of renewable energy, and utilize offsets to mitigate residual emissions.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20first%20and%20foremost%20commitment%20is%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Our first and foremost commitment is to revolutionize our manufacturing processes by inves'),(1603,'At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognisin','Environment & Sustainability','At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognising the pivotal role we play in saving water, a precious resource. We ensure that our painting processes are waterless, and also we have a five pronged approach to water conservation: reduce water consumption at our factories and workplaces, recycle all waste water, recharge rainwater by harvesting, reuse treated water and respect every drop of water.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.heromotocorp.com/en-in/company/sustainability/esg-sustainability.html#:~:text=At%20Hero%20MotoCorp%2C%20we%20are%20unwavering%20in',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:17.934655+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'1c6c8aaeec7cc365221108020bc381be','COMP_TOP200_073',NULL,'9748d011d0b5a8ae4bc44d8461e0b1ec',NULL,'At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognising the pivotal role we play in saving water, a precious resource. We ensure that our painting processes are waterless, and also we have a five pronged approach to water conservation: reduce water consumption at our factories and workplaces, recycle all waste water, recharge rainwater by harvesting, reuse treated water and respect every drop of water.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:17.934655','{\"title\": \"At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognisin\", \"summary\": \"At Hero MotoCorp, we are unwavering in our commitment to sustainable practices, recognising the pivotal role we play in saving water, a precious resource. We ensure that our painting processes are waterless, and also we have a five pronged approach to water conservation: reduce water consumption at our factories and workplaces, recycle all waste water, recharge rainwater by harvesting, re