ortal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'At Hyundai, environmental responsibility is a core priority'),(1610,'Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF)','Rural Development & Livelihood','Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF), dedicated to fostering ecological balance and expanding green cover across urban and rural landscapes. Key efforts include converting 12.6 acres of land near the Irungattukottai plant into green space, implementing agroforestry programs in Andhra Pradesh that have significantly improved tribal farmland productivity—demonstrating a scalable model for sustainable agriculture—and establishing one of the largest urban forests in Maharashtra, with 90.5 acres of land in Dange Chowk, Pune, where over 1 million trees have been planted using the Miyawaki method by 2026',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20IONIQ%20Forest%20is%20a%20flagship%20initiative',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:37.180844+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'c22242560b4c024acf3d18ee68c68ae2','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'9f70b7707462b9433d5b0c7d4bc7874a',NULL,'Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF), dedicated to fostering ecological balance and expanding green cover across urban and rural landscapes. Key efforts include converting 12.6 acres of land near the Irungattukottai plant into green space, implementing agroforestry programs in Andhra Pradesh that have significantly improved tribal farmland productivity—demonstrating a scalable model for sustainable agriculture—and establishing one of the largest urban forests in Maharashtra, with 90.5 acres of land in Dange Chowk, Pune, where over 1 million trees have been planted using the Miyawaki method by 2026',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844','{\"title\": \"Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF)\", \"summary\": \"Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF), dedicated to fostering ecological balance and expanding green cover across urban and rural landscapes. Key efforts include converting 12.6 acres of land near the Irungattukottai plant into green space, implementing agroforestry programs in Andhra Pradesh that have significantly improved tribal farmland productivity—demonstrating a scalable model for sustainable agriculture—and establishing one of the largest urban forests in Maharashtra, with 90.5 acres of land in Dange Chowk, Pune, where over 1 million trees have been planted using the Miyawaki method by 2026\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20IONIQ%20Forest%20is%20a%20flagship%20initiative\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'Hyundai IONIQ Forest is a flagship initiative by the Hyundai Motor India Foundation (HMIF)'),(1611,'EcoGram complements Hyundai’s broader environmental strategy, serving as a live demonstrat','Education & Skill Development','EcoGram complements Hyundai’s broader environmental strategy, serving as a live demonstration of how innovation, community engagement, and sustainability can work together to build cleaner, greener urban ecosystems.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal'