/csr#:~:text=Through%20our%20healthcare%20initiatives%20we%20envision%20on',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:37.180844+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'e9a85ca4d520bfd5290418d3621feafd','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'0c84701d128c0cfe88dec8a190719837',NULL,'Through our healthcare initiatives we envision on delivering inclusive health solutions that bridge geographic and social gaps in access to care.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844','{\"title\": \"Through our healthcare initiatives we envision on delivering inclusive health solutions th\", \"summary\": \"Through our healthcare initiatives we envision on delivering inclusive health solutions that bridge geographic and social gaps in access to care.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Through%20our%20healthcare%20initiatives%20we%20envision%20on\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Through our healthcare initiatives we envision on delivering inclusive health solutions th'),(1613,'Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in co','Education & Skill Development','Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in collaboration with IIT Madras, focused on transforming pediatric cancer care through genomic-led research. It aims to improve diagnosis and treatment of childhood cancers like leukemia and lymphoma by establishing India’s first community-based Cancer Tissue Biobank and the Hyundai Centre for Cancer Genomics. The initiative supports the development of a national childhood cancer genome database, enabling personalized care and advancing scientific understanding. By combining innovation with social impact, Hyundai Hope for Cancer is helping build a more inclusive and effective pediatric oncology ecosystem in India.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20Hope%20for%20Cancer%20is%20a%20pioneering',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:37.180844+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'fb7679d8fb226ce64c11b69dc396d2a1','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'0cc8dd27f01c767860f8dea250abc74a',NULL,'Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in collaboration with IIT Madras, focused on transforming pediatric cancer care through genomic-led research. It aims to improve diagnosis and treatment of childhood cancers like leukemia and lymphoma by establishing India’s first community-based Cancer Tissue Biobank and the Hyundai Centre for Cancer Genomics. The initiative supports the development of a national childhood cancer genome database, enabling personalized care and advancing scientific understanding. By combining innovation with social impact, Hyundai Hope for Cancer is helping build a more inclusive and effective pediatric oncology ecosystem in India.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844','{\"title\": \"Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in co\", \"summary\": \"Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in collaboration with IIT Madras, focused on transforming pediatric cancer care through genomic-led research. It aims to improve diagnosis and treatment of childhood cancers like leukemia and lymphoma by establishing India’s first community-based Cancer Tissue Biobank and the Hyundai Centre for Cancer Genomics. The initiative supports the development of a national childhood cancer genome database, enabling personalized care and advancing scientific understanding. By combining innovation with social impact, Hyundai Hope for Cancer is helping build a more inclusive and effective pediatric oncology ecosystem in India.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Hyundai%20Hope%20for%20Cancer%20is%20a%20pioneering\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Hyundai Hope for Cancer is a pioneering initiative by Hyundai Motor India Foundation in co'),(1614,'Sparsh Sanjeevani is a technology driven healthcare initiative that delivers primary medic','Healthcare & Nutrition','Sparsh Sanjeevani is a technology driven healthcare initiative that delivers primary medical services to underserved communities through mobile units and telemedicine centres. By integrating digital tools, it ensures affordable healthcare access to over 13.5 lakh people across 16 states, through 52 clinics and 10 mobile medical units.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hyundai.com/in/en/hyundai-story/csr#:~:text=Sparsh%20Sanjeevani%20is%20a%20technology%20driven%20healthcare',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:37.180844+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'9418a8e73fcce3881ee088868d933291','COMP_TOP200_041',NULL,'a1d65d9fa5e981370f39f5d83a82964d',NULL,'Sparsh Sanjeevani is a technology driven healthcare initiative that delivers primary medical services to underserved communities through mobile units and telemedicine centres. By integrating digital tools, it ensures affordable healthcare access to over 13.5 lakh people across 16 states, through 52 clinics and 10 mobile medical units.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:37.180844',NULL,