%20Nurture%3A%20With%20the%20aim%20of%20providing',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'4b2d531ba64c650ba7c0d7d6d50957ba','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'43dd6a865c226f21e7be4ce7cff82a95',NULL,'Project Nurture: With the aim of providing a strong foundation for orphans, homeless, and abandoned children, Project Nurture delivers long-term, family-based care to ensure holistic development and empowerment. It also guarantees access to quality education and basic amenities across 22 districts in 18 states of India.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Project Nurture\", \"summary\": \"Project Nurture: With the aim of providing a strong foundation for orphans, homeless, and abandoned children, Project Nurture delivers long-term, family-based care to ensure holistic development and empowerment. It also guarantees access to quality education and basic amenities across 22 districts in 18 states of India.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Project%20Nurture%3A%20With%20the%20aim%20of%20providing\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Project Nurture'),(1671,'Digital Transformation Van (DTV)','Education & Skill Development','Digital Transformation Van (DTV): The Digital Transformation Van primarily focuses on enhancing digital literacy for women, youth, and diverse social groups. The DTV travels to the most remote corners of India, bridging the digital gap in underdeveloped rural and urban areas of the country.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~: