he community members.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20solar%20powered%20vehicle%20is%20equipped%20with',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'843ee122f9f9f84234f7662be1a64e41','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'03f533d3f692f6f6a34fe27d85f56439',NULL,'The solar powered vehicle is equipped with latest e-learning tools, and provides certification courses in valuable, in-demand skills, including Digital Literacy, Basic IT Education, Cyber Security, Internet of Things and Financial Literacy. Additionally, the initiative includes awareness and mass literacy sessions for the community members.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"The solar powered vehicle is equipped with latest e\", \"summary\": \"The solar powered vehicle is equipped with latest e-learning tools, and provides certification courses in valuable, in-demand skills, including Digital Literacy, Basic IT Education, Cyber Security, Internet of Things and Financial Literacy. Additionally, the initiative includes awareness and mass literacy sessions for the community members.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20solar%20powered%20vehicle%20is%20equipped%20with\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'The solar powered vehicle is equipped with latest e'),(1673,'Smart Classroom Program','Education & Skill Development','Smart Classroom Program:Aligned with the Government of India’s ‘Digital India’ mission, the initiative bridges the digital divide in government schools by training educators and providing modern learning tools. Smart Classrooms equipped with computers, LED Smart TVs, printers, and power backup ensure uninterrupted digital learning for teachers and students. As part of the program, various awareness sessions are also conducted near the schools.',NULL,NULL,'rs,','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Smart%20Classroom%20Program%3AAligned%20with%20the%20Government%20of',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'be39e3178644bc69f763d7c08ef655a5','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'05d8dafb199865b567f7aa50dc95cb03',NULL,'Smart Classroom Program:Aligned with the Government of India’s ‘Digital India’ mission, the initiative bridges the digital divide in government schools by training educators and providing modern learning tools. Smart Classrooms equipped with computers, LED Smart TVs, printers, and power backup ensure uninterrupted digital learning for teachers and students. As part of the program, various awareness sessions are also conducted near the schools.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Smart Classroom Program\", \"summary\": \"Smart Classroom Program:Aligned with the Government of India’s ‘Digital India’ mission, the initiative bridges the digital divide in government schools by training educators and providing modern learning tools. Smart Classrooms equipped with computers, LED Smart TVs, printers, and power backup ensure uninterrupted digital learning for teachers and students. As part of the program, various awareness sessions are also conducted near the schools.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Smart%20Classroom%20Program%3AAligned%20with%20the%20Government%20of\", \"budget_allocated\": \"rs,\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'rs,','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Smart Classroom Program'),(1674,'Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom)','Education & Skill Development','Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom):This program focuses on improving access to sanitation facilities and raise awareness about menstrual hygiene, by constructing girls’ washrooms in the government schools and conducting regular menstrual hygiene and sanitation awareness sessions for community members.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Sanitation%20Program%20%28Construction%20of%20Girls%E2%80%99%20Washroom%29%3AThis%20program',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'207cb4e554bc185e081606135f81e975','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'fb28b941345f5e92589e3d380d004c3c',NULL,'Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom):This program focuses on improving access to sanitation facilities and raise awareness about menstrual hygiene, by constructing girls’ washrooms in the government schools and conducting regular menstrual hygiene and sanitation awareness sessions for community members.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom)\", \"summary\": \"Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom):This program focuses on improving access to sanitation facilities and raise awareness about menstrual hygiene, by constructing girls’ washrooms in the government schools and conducting regular menstrual hygiene and sanitation awareness sessions for community members.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Sanitation%20Program%20%28Construction%20of%20Girls%E2%80%99%20Washroom%29%3AThis%20program\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Sanitation Program (Construction of Girls’ Washroom)'),(1675,'Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program)','Education & Skill Development','Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program):Menstrual health remains a challenge in rural and underserved areas due to taboos and lack of resources. Indus Towers is addressing this by improving access to hygienic sanitary napkins through partnerships with Indian Railways and government schools. Vending machines with IoT-enabled monitoring have been installed at railway stations and schools, ensuring 24x7 availability and timely refills. Awareness sessions, reusable product distribution, and health camps further promote safe menstrual hygiene practices.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Nari%20Samman%20%28Sanitary%20Pad%20Program%29%3AMenstrual%20health%20remains',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'fcba24a3160092afd7853362190e14b2','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'a0105f59ce257b972aa085b86b1a47cd',NULL,'Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program):Menstrual health remains a challenge in rural and underserved areas due to taboos and lack of resources. Indus Towers is addressing this by improving access to hygienic sanitary napkins through partnerships with Indian Railways and government schools. Vending machines with IoT-enabled monitoring have been installed at railway stations and schools, ensuring 24x7 availability and timely refills. Awareness sessions, reusable product distribution, and health camps further promote safe menstrual hygiene practices.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program)\", \"summary\": \"Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program):Menstrual health remains a challenge in rural and underserved areas due to taboos and lack of resources. Indus Towers is addressing this by improving access to hygienic sanitary napkins through partnerships with Indian Railways and government schools. Vending machines with IoT-enabled monitoring have been installed at railway stations and schools, ensuring 24x7 availability and timely refills. Awareness sessions, reusable product distribution, and health camps further promote safe menstrual hygiene practices.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Nari%20Samman%20%28Sanitary%20Pad%20Program%29%3AMenstrual%20health%20remains\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Nari Samman (Sanitary Pad Program)'),(1676,'Plantation and Livelihood Program','Environment & Sustainability','Plantation and Livelihood Program: The program promotes agroforestry to improve green cover, enhance farmer incomes, and support carbon sequestration. By combining indigenous practices with modern techniques, it boosts farm productivity, reduces chemical inputs, and ensures sustainable livelihoods. Farmers benefit from intercropping, organic farming, and capacity-building initiatives. In partnership with 1t.org, Indus Towers has pledged to plant and nurture 1 million trees across India by 2027. This commitment supports the global Trillion Trees Movement and strengthens India’s climate goals by creating a vital carbon sink.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Plantation%20and%20Livelihood%20Program%3A%20The%20program%20promotes',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'149fb598feec8a4893c44b0c676b40fb','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'eeee778bdaf0525058006c70c1b6f897',NULL,'Plantation and Livelihood Program: The program promotes agroforestry to improve green cover, enhance farmer incomes, and support carbon sequestration. By combining indigenous practices with modern techniques, it boosts farm productivity, reduces chemical inputs, and ensures sustainable livelihoods. Farmers benefit from intercropping, organic farming, and capacity-building initiatives. In partnership with 1t.org, Indus Towers has pledged to plant and nurture 1 million trees across India by 2027. This commitment supports the global Trillion Trees Movement and strengthens India’s climate goals by creating a vital carbon sink.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Plantation and Livelihood Program\", \"summary\": \"Plantation and Livelihood Program: The program promotes agroforestry to improve green cover, enhance farmer incomes, and support carbon sequestration. By combining indigenous practices with modern techniques, it boosts farm productivity, reduces chemical inputs, and ensures sustainable livelihoods. Farmers benefit from intercropping, organic farming, and capacity-building initiatives. In partnership with 1t.org, Indus Towers has pledged to plant and nurture 1 million trees across India by 2027. This commitment supports the global Trillion Trees Movement and strengthens India’s climate goals by creating a vital carbon sink.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Plantation%20and%20Livelihood%20Program%3A%20The%20program%20promotes\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Plantation and Livelihood Program'),(1677,'Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay','Environment & Sustainability','Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay: In partnership with IIT Bombay, we are conducting R&D in clean energy, focusing on perovskite solar and biomass-based batteries. The project aims to scale perovskite tandem solar cells and develop silicon-doped carbon anodes for sodium-ion batteries derived from rice straw. These initiatives are targeting higher solar efficiency and sustainable, cost-effective energy storage solutions for India’s green future.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Bombay%3A',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'85292ef9464425ce46ad4917223d534c','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'68e7b06bc528339e584f1912c7486705',NULL,'Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay: In partnership with IIT Bombay, we are conducting R&D in clean energy, focusing on perovskite solar and biomass-based batteries. The project aims to scale perovskite tandem solar cells and develop silicon-doped carbon anodes for sodium-ion batteries derived from rice straw. These initiatives are targeting higher solar efficiency and sustainable, cost-effective energy storage solutions for India’s green future.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay\", \"summary\": \"Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay: In partnership with IIT Bombay, we are conducting R&D in clean energy, focusing on perovskite solar and biomass-based batteries. The project aims to scale perovskite tandem solar cells and develop silicon-doped carbon anodes for sodium-ion batteries derived from rice straw. These initiatives are targeting higher solar efficiency and sustainable, cost-effective energy storage solutions for India’s green future.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Bombay%3A\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Research & Development Project with IIT Bombay'),(1678,'Research & Development Project with IIT Madras','Environment & Sustainability','Research & Development Project with IIT Madras: In partnership with IIT Madras, we are conducting research on Glass Fibre Reinforced Polymer (GFRP) solutions to create stronger, lighter, and more sustainable infrastructure for the future. The project focuses on testing GFRP’s strength under tension, compression, shear, torsion, and bending to develop safe, standardized, and economical configurations. Additionally, the project also evaluates the durability and environmental benefits of GFRP compared to conventional materials like galvanized steel.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Madras%3A',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:09:45.104971+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'ee371b8094f2091a4ebd4c39abd495d8','COMP_TOP200_088',NULL,'0a7996ab74cf42196a1d78930e87d4a6',NULL,'Research & Development Project with IIT Madras: In partnership with IIT Madras, we are conducting research on Glass Fibre Reinforced Polymer (GFRP) solutions to create stronger, lighter, and more sustainable infrastructure for the future. The project focuses on testing GFRP’s strength under tension, compression, shear, torsion, and bending to develop safe, standardized, and economical configurations. Additionally, the project also evaluates the durability and environmental benefits of GFRP compared to conventional materials like galvanized steel.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:09:45.104971','{\"title\": \"Research & Development Project with IIT Madras\", \"summary\": \"Research & Development Project with IIT Madras: In partnership with IIT Madras, we are conducting research on Glass Fibre Reinforced Polymer (GFRP) solutions to create stronger, lighter, and more sustainable infrastructure for the future. The project focuses on testing GFRP’s strength under tension, compression, shear, torsion, and bending to develop safe, standardized, and economical configurations. Additionally, the project also evaluates the durability and environmental benefits of GFRP compared to conventional materials like galvanized steel.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.industowers.com/csr/#:~:text=Research%20%26%20Development%20Project%20with%20IIT%20Madras%3A\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Research & Development Project with IIT Madras'),(1680,'The core of our value system is rooted in the development of our economy, society and envi','Education & Skill Development','The core of our value system is rooted in the development of our economy, society and environment. We have embarked on a journey for a sustainable future through innovations in technology, backing like-minded institutions and collaborating with partner organizations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official