 a deep commitment to creating sustainable value for generations to come. This dedication is anchored in protecting nature, empowering and inspiring people and improving patient lives through responsible and ethical healthcare solutions.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=Through%20continuous%20innovation%2C%20improvement%2C%20and%20accountability%2C%20Lupin',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:06.909793+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'e40b1b3ba428861866e89d024eb3a7f9','COMP_TOP200_081',NULL,'ca1289e749bea4baa9123709c7425944',NULL,'Through continuous innovation, improvement, and accountability, Lupin demonstrates a deep commitment to creating sustainable value for generations to come. This dedication is anchored in protecting nature, empowering and inspiring people and improving patient lives through responsible and ethical healthcare solutions.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:06.909793',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:06.909793',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:06.909793',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:06.909793','{\"title\": \"Through continuous innovation, improvement, and accountability, Lupin demonstrates a deep \", \"summary\": \"Through continuous innovation, improvement, and accountability, Lupin demonstrates a deep commitment to creating sustainable value for generations to come. This dedication is anchored in protecting nature, empowering and inspiring people and improving patient lives through responsible and ethical healthcare solutions.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.lupin.com/sustainability#:~:text=Through%20continuous%20innovation%2C%20improvement%2C%20and%20accountability%2C%20Lupin\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Through continuous innovation, improvement, and accountability, Lupin demonstrates a deep '),(1808,'Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Ltd (MDL), Mumbai is the only Shipyard which builds Destroyers c','Education & Skill Development','Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Ltd (MDL), Mumbai is the only Shipyard which builds Destroyers class of Ships and conventional Submarines. While the warships and submarines built by us help in securing nation and making it formidable power, MDL believes in what Mahatma Gandhi said “a chain is as strong as its weak link”. Therefore, strengthening of weakest link is our mantra while undertaking CSR activities. MDL is committed to undertake various programs for integrating social and business goals in a sustainable manner through inclusive growth so as to make a positive impact for the society at large. MDL has adopted Corporate Social Responsibility policy in compliance with Section 135 of the Companies Act 2013 and Rules framed there under. The CSR Budget of MDL for the FY 2024-25 was Rs 45.93 Cr (2% of average profit of the previous three financial years as per section 198 of Companies Act – 2013). An additional Rs 0.65 Cr has been spent in excess of budget during FY 2024-25 which was also set off in expenditure for FY 2025-26. Out of total obligation of Rs 45.28 Cr, MDL has spent Rs 46.81 Cr towards CSR activities during FY 2025-26. Thus, MDL has complied with the requirement of spending 2% of average net profit with an excess amount spent of Rs 1.53 Cr as part of CSR expenditure for FY 2025-26, which will be set off against expenditure for FY 2026-27 in accordance with rules governing CSR expenditure. MDL has executed 35 projects in FY 2025-26 as part of its CSR initiatives mainly in sectors of Education, Health & Nutrition, Skill Development, Armed Forces Welfare, Sanitation, Research & Heritage promotion. The details list of the projects undertaken are available under CSR projects.',NULL,NULL,'Rs 45.93 Cr','https://mazagondock.in/English/csr#:~:text=Mazagon%20Dock%20Shipbuilders%20Ltd%20%28MDL%29%2C%20Mumbai%20is',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:12.750728+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'ae7111e118bb4e2caeccf3d07f659d77','COMP_TOP200_089',NULL,'275684035f73cefdc64a1904db561f38',NULL,'Mazagon Dock Shipbuilders Ltd (MDL), Mumbai is the only Shipyard which builds Destroyers class of Ships and conventional Submarines. While the warships and submarines built by us help in securing nation and making it formidable power, MDL believes in what Mahatma Gandhi said “a chain is as strong as its weak link”. Therefore, strengthening of weakest link is our mantra while undertaking CSR activities. MDL is committed to undertake various programs for integrating social and business goals in a sustainable manner through inclusive growth so as to make a positive impact for the society at large. MDL has adopted Corporate Social Responsibility policy in compliance with Section 135 of the Companies Act 2013 and Rules framed there under. The CSR Budget of MDL for the FY 2024-25 was Rs 45.93 Cr (2% of average profit of the previous three financial years as per section 198 of Companies Act – 2013). An additional Rs 0.65 Cr has been spent in excess of budget during FY 2024-25 which was also set off in expenditure for FY 2025-26. Out of total obligation of Rs 45.28 Cr, MDL has spent Rs 46.81 Cr towards CSR activities during FY 2025-26. Thus, MDL has complied with the requirement of spending 2% of average net profit with an excess amount spent of Rs 1.53 Cr as part of CSR expenditure for FY 2025-26, which will be set off against expenditure for FY 2026-27 in accordance with rules governing CSR expenditure. MDL has executed 35 projects in FY 2025-26 as part of its CSR initiatives mainly in sectors of Education, Health & Nutrition, Skill Development, Armed Forces Welfare, Sanitation, Research & Heritage promotion. The details list of the projects undertaken are available under CSR projects.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:12.750728',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:12.750728',NULL,NULL