we ar'),(1870,'We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business','Environment & Sustainability','We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business. Understanding the importance of a healthy planet for the sustainability of human societies, we are dedicated to playing our part in protecting the environment. We believe this responsibility is shared by individuals, governments, and businesses, and we are committed to safeguarding the environment for future generations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20consider%20environmental%20preservation%20a%20vital%20aspect',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:30.755592+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'aa6ef99c0369c0be35eef280ae3de745','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'c30cf19c7cb1cc477b9f76befceb79c7',NULL,'We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business. Understanding the importance of a healthy planet for the sustainability of human societies, we are dedicated to playing our part in protecting the environment. We believe this responsibility is shared by individuals, governments, and businesses, and we are committed to safeguarding the environment for future generations.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:30.755592',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:30.755592',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:30.755592',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:30.755592','{\"title\": \"We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business\", \"summary\": \"We consider environmental preservation a vital aspect of our business. Understanding the importance of a healthy planet for the sustainability of human societies, we are dedicated to playing our part in protecting the environment. We believe this responsibility is shared by individuals, governments, and businesses, and we are committed to safeguarding the environment for future generations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20consider%2