-social-responsibility#:~:text=Scholarships%20supported%20over%203%2C85%2C000%20students%20from%20multiple\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Scholarships supported over 3,85,000 students from multiple regions of the country for sec'),(1938,'Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our prod','Environment & Sustainability','Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our product creation, processes and policies as we endeavour to shape a better future together. Remaining steadfast in our commitment to sustainability, we invest prudently in eco-friendly technologies, lowering resource dependence and reducing our environmental impact. We monitor climate change, strive hard to curb greenhouse gas emissions and employ innovative energy-saving solutions. We collaborate with our value chain partners to implement sustainable solutions throughout our value chain.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.solargroup.com/sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20environmental%20priorities%20are%20an%20integral%20part',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:43.471876+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'1ae1a936ef13bb230f5dfa5fe35adee5','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'b0f9f5f23a0848cba2e878e692e89708',NULL,'Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our product creation, processes and policies as we endeavour to shape a better future together. Remaining steadfast in our commitment to sustainability, we invest prudently in eco-friendly technologies, lowering resource dependence and reducing our environmental impact. We monitor climate change, strive hard to curb greenhouse gas emissions and employ innovative energy-saving solutions. We collaborate with our value chain partners to implement sustainable solutions throughout our value chain.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:43.471876',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:43.471876',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:43.471876',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:43.471876','{\"title\": \"Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our prod\", \"summary\": \"Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our product creation, processes and policies as we endeavour to shape a better future together. Remaining steadfast in our commitment to sustainability, we invest prudently in eco-friendly technologies, lowering resource dependence and reducing our environmental impact. We monitor climate change, strive hard to curb greenhouse gas emissions and employ innovative energy-saving solutions. We collaborate with our value chain partners to implement sustainable solutions throughout our value chain.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.solargroup.com/sustainability.html#:~:text=Our%20environmental%20priorities%20are%20an%20integral%20part\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Our environmental priorities are an integral part of our corporate ethos, guiding our prod'),(1939,'We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communitie','Environment & Sustainability','We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communities that we serve and thereby catalyse overall development. Being a global pharma company, we strongly believe that business and responsibility go hand-in-hand. Lasting value can only be created, if the right balance between the triple bottom lines of economic, environmental and social is achieved.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20will%20leverage%20our%20people%2C%20expertise%20and',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:44.970559+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'2144c2c241b4f4bc4f56d583f63dd4a0','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'cbe39e8948a327f0fc153b3724e48bee',NULL,'We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communities that we serve and thereby catalyse overall development. Being a global pharma company, we strongly believe that business and responsibility go hand-in-hand. Lasting value can only be created, if the right balance between the triple bottom lines of economic, environmental and social is achieved.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559','{\"title\": \"We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communitie\", \"summary\": \"We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communities that we serve and thereby catalyse overall development. Being a global pharma company, we strongly believe that business and responsibility go hand-in-hand. Lasting value can only be created, if the right balance between the triple bottom lines of economic, environmental and social is achieved.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20will%20leverage%20our%20people%2C%20expertise%20and\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communitie'),(1940,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur','Education & Skill Development','We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20develop%20model%20schools%20in%20and%20around',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:44.970559+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'850090b837288cc313d1f3b987d59011','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'98ae3b646d757892ae372c93758376fc',NULL,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559','{\"title\": \"We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur\", \"summary\": \"We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20develop%20model%20schools%20in%20and%20around\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur'),(1941,'The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non','Healthcare & Nutrition','The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20Sun%20Pharma%20Science%20Foundation%20is%20an',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:44.970559+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'007599625a71a5729eebf3c077d98efb','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'60f9e464884e4e7d59d2836a37b4d647',NULL,'The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559','{\"title\": \"The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non\", \"summary\": \"The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20Sun%20Pharma%20Science%20Foundation%20is%20an\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non'),(1942,'Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 peo','Healthcare & Nutrition','Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 people located around areas close to our manufacturing plants and other establishments. These MHUs serve a mix of rural and underserved populations, visiting villages to provide treatment for common ailments, conduct pathological tests, enable referrals, and provide free medicines. This project is implemented in India through Sun Pharma Community Healthcare Society in the states of Assam, Maharashtra, Jammu & Kashmir, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, Gujarat, Madhya Pradesh, Tamil Nadu and Sikkim.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Healthcare%20Units%20%28MHUs%29%20deliver%20primary',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:44.970559+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'97ac213e48ed58da5b28e961461aad86','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'1172360ebe56f0e983b9031bd0fec629',NULL,'Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 people located around areas close to our manufacturing plants and other establishments. These MHUs serve a mix of rural and underserved populations, visiting villages to provide treatment for common ailments, conduct pathological tests, enable referrals, and provide free medicines. This project is implemented in India through Sun Pharma Community Healthcare Society in the states of Assam, Maharashtra, Jammu & Kashmir, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, Gujarat, Madhya Pradesh, Tamil Nadu and Sikkim.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559','{\"title\": \"Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 peo\", \"summary\": \"Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 people located around areas close to our manufacturing plants and other establishments. These MHUs serve a mix of rural and underserved populations, visiting villages to provide treatment for common ailments, conduct pathological tests, enable referrals, and provide free medicines. This project is implemented in India through Sun Pharma Community Healthcare Society in the states of Assam, Maharashtra, Jammu & Kashmir, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, Gujarat, Madhya Pradesh, Tamil Nadu and Sikkim.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Healthcare%20Units%20%28MHUs%29%20deliver%20primary\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Our Mobile Healthcare Units (MHUs) deliver primary healthcare services to over 565,000 peo'),(1943,'We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily','Healthcare & Nutrition','We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily accessible hygiene services. Towards this end, we provide access to clean drinking water in villages, construct good quality individual toilets and implement effective behaviour change programmes.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20support%20and%20encourage%20provision%20of%20safe',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:44.970559+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'c4c47da88f43c0aaf38b4f737faca28d','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'a9cd43d89f7220d9ace96a51d788b796',NULL,'We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily accessible hygiene services. Towards this end, we provide access to clean drinking water in villages, construct good quality individual toilets and implement effective behaviour change programmes.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:44.970559','{\"title\": \"We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily\", \"summary\": \"We support and encourage provision of safe drinking water, adequate sanitation, and easily accessible hygiene services. Towards this end, we provide access to clean drinking water in villages, construct good quality individual toilets and implement effective behaviour change programmes.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20support%20and%20encourage%20provision%20of%20safe\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_