sultation, stakeholder engagement, and so','Environment & Sustainability','Tata Steel places a strong emphasis on public consultation, stakeholder engagement, and social consent to operate as foundational pillars of its sustainability and governance framework. The company recognizes that meaningful dialogue with communities, regulatory bodies, and other stakeholders is essential not only for transparency and trust-building but also for ensuring that its operations align with societal expectations and environmental responsibilities. By actively seeking and respecting social consent, Tata Steel reinforces its commitment to ethical practices and inclusive development, thereby securing its social license to operate and contributing to long-term value creation for all stakeholders. Many of our operational areas are in and around indigenous communities, making community consultation crucial in protecting their rights.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.tatasteel.com/corporate/our-organisation/csr/#:~:text=Tata%20Steel%20places%20a%20strong%20emphasis%20on',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:48.356320+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'8bfe3fa0e929aba28e5663a4b1867465','COMP_TOP200_032',NULL,'d8fdd792aea12ef896c016ca7599c8cc',NULL,'Tata Steel places a strong emphasis on public consultation, stakeholder engagement, and social consent to operate as foundational pillars of its sustainability and governance framework. The company recognizes that meaningful dialogue with communities, regulatory bodies, and other stakeholders is essential not only for transparency and trust-building but also for ensuring that its operations align with societal expectations and environmental responsibilities. By actively seeking and respecting social consent, Tata Steel reinforces its commitment to ethical practices and inclusive development, thereby securing its social license to operate and contributing to long-term value creation for all stakeholders. Many of our operational areas are in and around in