, we believe that trees are vital for ensuring a healthy living environment. They are pivotal in our collective fight against climate change. We encourage every TechMighty to plant at least three trees each month to do their part and fight deforestation and climate change. We also provide alternatives for those without the resources to do so. For example, associates can choose to adopt three plants instead or participate in our regular plantation drives across multiple locations.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:49.990314',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:49.990314',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:49.990314',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:49.990314','{\"title\": \"At the Mahindra Group, we believe that trees are vital for ensuring a healthy living envir\", \"summary\": \"At the Mahindra Group, we believe that trees are vital for ensuring a healthy living environment. They are pivotal in our collective fight against climate change. We encourage every TechMighty to plant at least three trees each month to do their part and fight deforestation and climate change. We also provide alternatives for those without the resources to do so. For example, associates can choose to adopt three plants instead or participate in our regular plantation drives across multiple locations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.techmahindra.com/about-us/individual-social-responsibility/#:~:text=At%20the%20Mahindra%20Group%2C%20we%20believe%20that\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'At the Mahindra Group, we believe that trees are vital for ensuring a healthy living envir'),(1961,'Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to I','Education & Skill Development','Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to India’s rivers and waste finding its way back into productive use, Tata Power’s energy transition is becoming visible in the details. The FY 2025–26 Tata Power integrated sustainability report does not treat sustainability as a promise running parallel to the business. It shows it moving through the business itself, from the generation mix and factory floor to water systems, workplaces, ecosystems and communities.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.tatapower.com/blogs/nine-ways-tata-power-s-integrated-report-redefines-sustainability#:~:text=Somewhere%20between%20a%20cleaner%20megawatt%20entering%20the',NULL,'2026-10-17T14:10:47.044485+00:00',0,NULL,NULL,'7afaab536bccba40f5870340478022d1','COMP_TOP200_105',NULL,'e2c969f7f56d639b25d58d5bed34819c',NULL,'Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to India’s rivers and waste finding its way back into productive use, Tata Power’s energy transition is becoming visible in the details. The FY 2025–26 Tata Power integrated sustainability report does not treat sustainability as a promise running parallel to the business. It shows it moving through the business itself, from the generation mix and factory floor to water systems, workplaces, ecosystems and communities.',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:47.044485',NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:47.044485',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 14:10:47.044485',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-17 14:10:47.044485','{\"title\": \"Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to I\", \"summary\": \"Somewhere between a cleaner megawatt entering the grid, a Mahseer hatchling returning to India’s rivers and waste finding its way back into productive use, Tata Power’s energy transition is becoming visible in the details. The FY 2025–26 Tata Power integrated sustainability report does not treat sustainability as 