'COMP_TOP200_001',NULL,'fba818e945182d6ba0a4cfdacc174468',NULL,'Veterinary professionals provide world-class medical care to rescued wildlife in Vantara',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:19.629858','{\"title\": \"Veterinary professionals provide world\", \"summary\": \"Veterinary professionals provide world-class medical care to rescued wildlife in Vantara\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ril.com/about/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Veterinary%20professionals%20provide%20world-class%20medical%20care%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Veterinary professionals provide world'),(2364,'Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Socia','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Social Responsibility Committee of the board. The committee shall consist of 3 or more Directors, out of which 1 Director should be an Independent Director. In case a company is not required to appoint an Independent Director under Section 149(4), then its CSR committee should have at least 2 or more Directors.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Every%20company%20which%20satisfies%20the%20specified%20criteria',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:41.720628+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9ea094a7348d95170b1939f330deb6d0','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'75f71536a38352fac7a3bd43493a0dd0',NULL,'Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Social Responsibility Committee of the board. The committee shall consist of 3 or more Directors, out of which 1 Director should be an Independent Director. In case a company is not required to appoint an Independent Director under Section 149(4), then its CSR committee should have at least 2 or more Directors.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628','{\"title\": \"Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Socia\", \"summary\": \"Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Social Responsibility Committee of the board. The committee shall consist of 3 or more Directors, out of which 1 Director should be an Independent Director. In case a company is not required to appoint an Independent Director under Section 149(4), then its CSR committee should have at least 2 or more Directors.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Every%20company%20which%20satisfies%20the%20specified%20criteria\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'Every company which satisfies the specified criteria needs to constitute a Corporate Socia'),(2365,'CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or mor','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or more, turnover of ₹1,000 crore or more, or net profits of ₹5 crore or more during the immediately preceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.',NULL,NULL,'₹500 crore','https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=CSR%20provisions%20don%27t%20apply%20to%20companies%20whose',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:41.720628+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'799618f3301b18518b2e152c7ce9a192','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'9fe0e4345221fc7a46099f0a607b1b98',NULL,'CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or more, turnover of ₹1,000 crore or more, or net profits of ₹5 crore or more during the immediately preceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628','{\"title\": \"CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or mor\", \"summary\": \"CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or more, turnover of ₹1,000 crore or more, or net profits of ₹5 crore or more during the immediately preceding financial year. Furthermore, the circular reiterates that those activities that benefit only the employees or their families, one-off events, expenses towards the fulfilment of regulatory statutes, contributions to political parties, activities as part of the normal course of business or those undertaken outside of India do not qualify as CSR expenses.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=CSR%20provisions%20don%27t%20apply%20to%20companies%20whose\", \"budget_allocated\": \"₹500 crore\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'₹500 crore','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'CSR provisions don\'t apply to companies whose net worth is not more than ₹500 crore or mor'),(2366,'Corporate CSR Initiative','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Not-ongoing%20projects%3A%20The%20unutilised%20part%20is%20to',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:41.720628+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9296d5baff9dece08a4d1230284dc45f','COMP_TOP200_002',NULL,'e410fc0fbe69d374f6898e795d42d859',NULL,'Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:41.720628','{\"title\": \"Corporate CSR Initiative\", \"summary\": \"Not-ongoing projects: The unutilised part is to be transferred to the Fund referred to under Schedule VII, immediately within 6 months after the end of the financial year. Therefore, there is no question of parking it under an FD.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfc.bank.in/current-accounts/unspent-csr-account#:~:text=Not-ongoing%20projects%3A%20The%20unutilised%20part%20is%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'Corporate CSR Initiative'),(2367,'For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem a','Education & Skill Development','For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem and nobody seems to be doing it right. We decided to tackle it ourselves. Founded by IIT Roorkee alumni, Razorpay aims to revolutionize money management for online businesses by providing clean, developer-friendly APIs and hassle-free integration. We offer a fast, affordable and secure way for merchants, schools, ecommerce and other companies to accept and disburse payments online, own a fully-functional current account and avail working capital loans.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://razorpay.com/about/#:~:text=For%20a%20long%20time%2C%20we%20have%20felt',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:57.681621+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b84af0b24bf28924cf53d70f6f627819','COMP_0',NULL,'d64159589209b3409c244ec78a64d740',NULL,'For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem and nobody seems to be doing it right. We decided to tackle it ourselves. Founded by IIT Roorkee alumni, Razorpay aims to revolutionize money management for online businesses by providing clean, developer-friendly APIs and hassle-free integration. We offer a fast, affordable and secure way for merchants, schools, ecommerce and other companies to accept and disburse payments online, own a fully-functional current account and avail working capital loans.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:57.681621','{\"title\": \"For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem a\", \"summary\": \"For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem and nobody seems to be doing it right. We decided to tackle it ourselves. Founded by IIT Roorkee alumni, Razorpay aims to revolutionize money management for online businesses by providing clean, developer-friendly APIs and hassle-free integration. We offer a fast, affordable and secure way for merchants, schools, ecommerce and other companies to accept and disburse payments online, own a fully-functional current account and avail working capital loans.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://razorpay.com/about/#:~:text=For%20a%20long%20time%2C%20we%20have%20felt\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'For a long time, we have felt that enabling frictionless transactions is a major problem a'),(2368,'TCS follows the Tata group philosophy of building sustainable businesses that are rooted i','Environment & Sustainability','TCS follows the Tata group philosophy of building sustainable businesses that are rooted in the community and demonstrate care for the environment. Corporate sustainability is folded into our triple bottom line focus of people, planet, and purpose. Our thrust is on reducing carbon footprint, using renewable energies, and focusing on a regenerative approach to business. How do we enable this? By creating a greater consciousness of the environment we live in through collaborations with our employees, suppliers, customers, and the community at large.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official 