ducation & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=ICICI%20Bank%20uses%20128-bit%20encryption%2C%20which%20is\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'ICICI Bank uses 128'),(2378,'However, the Internet is an open system and ICICI Bank cannot, and does not, guarantee tha','Education & Skill Development','However, the Internet is an open system and ICICI Bank cannot, and does not, guarantee that the personal information which the Registered User furnishes will not be intercepted or accessed by others and decrypted. ICICI Bank, its affiliates and partners, and its and their respective directors, employees, agents and representatives shall not be liable or responsible should any confidential or other information provided by or pertaining to the Visitor (including credit card numbers, bank account numbers, passwords, personal identification numbers, IDs, transaction details, etc.) be intercepted and subsequently used by an unintended recipient.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.icici.bank.in/privacy#:~:text=However%2C%20the%20Internet%20is%20an%20open%20system',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:21:04.631559+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'69440db086f411e64b1db31e9845f117','COMP_TOP200_003',NULL,'363597fc5f6ca48a6cad87ef36de992b',NULL,'However, the Internet is an open system and ICICI Bank cannot, and does not, guarantee that the personal information which the Registered User furnishes will not be intercepted or accessed by others and decrypted. ICICI Bank, its affiliates and partners, and its and their respective directors, employees, agents and representatives shall not be liable or responsible should any confidential or other information provided by or pertaining to the V