ified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'We are proud to be a pioneer in the energy sector, navigating the ever'),(2399,'We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accor','Environment & Sustainability','We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accordance with the Global Reporting Initiative (GRI) and aligned with other reporting standards and guidelines. Our ESG performance is reflected through our ESG ratings, including a percentile score of 73 for Adani Power Limited in the Corporate Sustainability Assessment by DJSI-S&P Global. We have also received a \'B\' score for our performance towards Climate Change and Water Security commitments as per the Carbon Disclosure Project (CDP).',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20are%20in%20our%2010th%20year%20of',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:17.360757+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cdd700033183f11d49d0b07e4e2ed402','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'aa6a1059686da41a035db2f9fa9c79cb',NULL,'We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accordance with the Global Reporting Initiative (GRI) and aligned with other reporting standards and guidelines. Our ESG performance is reflected through our ESG ratings, including a percentile score of 73 for Adani Power Limited in the Corporate Sustainability Assessment by DJSI-S&P Global. We have also received a \'B\' score for our performance towards Climate Change and Water Security commitments as per the Carbon Disclosure Project (CDP).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{\"title\": \"We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accor\", \"summary\": \"We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accordance with the Global Reporting Initiative (GRI) and aligned with other reporting standards and guidelines. Our ESG performance is reflected through our ESG ratings, including a percentile score of 73 for Adani Power Limited in the Corporate Sustainability Assessment by DJSI-S&P Global. We have also received a \'B\' score for our performance towards Climate Change and Water Security commitments as per the Carbon Disclosure Project (CDP).\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20are%20in%20our%2010th%20year%20of\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'We are in our 10th year of Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) reporting, in accor'),(2400,'At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' an','Environment & Sustainability','At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' and a vision to be a world-class leader in businesses that enrich lives and contribute to nation-building through sustainable value creation. We are well-positioned to capitalize on any future opportunities for growth, empowered by our commitment to sustainability and our passion for making a positive impact on the environment and society. Join us on our journey to illuminate the nation and sustain excellence in sustainability.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Power%2C%20we%20are%20driven%20by',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:17.360757+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'daa1c8e815be4ff339951ed0b4d9bff2','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'6303a6310dbd2b5c7f68e10d8b7e01a7',NULL,'At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' and a vision to be a world-class leader in businesses that enrich lives and contribute to nation-building through sustainable value creation. We are well-positioned to capitalize on any future opportunities for growth, empowered by our commitment to sustainability and our passion for making a positive impact on the environment and society. Join us on our journey to illuminate the nation and sustain excellence in sustainability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{\"title\": \"At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' an\", \"summary\": \"At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' and a vision to be a world-class leader in businesses that enrich lives and contribute to nation-building through sustainable value creation. We are well-positioned to capitalize on any future opportunities for growth, empowered by our commitment to sustainability and our passion for making a positive impact on the environment and society. Join us on our journey to illuminate the nation and sustain excellence in sustainability.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=At%20Adani%20Power%2C%20we%20are%20driven%20by\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'At Adani Power, we are driven by the Adani Group\'s philosophy of \'Growth with Goodness\' an'),(2401,'We aim to continuously improve our climate governance','Education & Skill Development','We aim to continuously improve our climate governance. Recently, Adani Power Limited received assessment from CDP – the global environmental disclosure system – to measure the risks and opportunities on climate change as well as water security. The company has received a CDP score (Climate Change Score) of D which is a Disclosure band. This is as same as the Asia regional average of D, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. The company also received a C band (Water Security) which is an Awareness Band. This is lower than the Asia regional average of B, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. These CDP Score Reports will enable us to progress towards our sustainability goals.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20aim%20to%20continuously%20improve%20our%20climate',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:17.360757+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8018dea98276f38de395e10fa1ffcf78','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'8855db4691164f9a18c04783a5a61976',NULL,'We aim to continuously improve our climate governance. Recently, Adani Power Limited received assessment from CDP – the global environmental disclosure system – to measure the risks and opportunities on climate change as well as water security. The company has received a CDP score (Climate Change Score) of D which is a Disclosure band. This is as same as the Asia regional average of D, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. The company also received a C band (Water Security) which is an Awareness Band. This is lower than the Asia regional average of B, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. These CDP Score Reports will enable us to progress towards our sustainability goals.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{\"title\": \"We aim to continuously improve our climate governance\", \"summary\": \"We aim to continuously improve our climate governance. Recently, Adani Power Limited received assessment from CDP – the global environmental disclosure system – to measure the risks and opportunities on climate change as well as water security. The company has received a CDP score (Climate Change Score) of D which is a Disclosure band. This is as same as the Asia regional average of D, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. The company also received a C band (Water Security) which is an Awareness Band. This is lower than the Asia regional average of B, and lower than the thermal power generation sector average of B. These CDP Score Reports will enable us to progress towards our sustainability goals.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=We%20aim%20to%20continuously%20improve%20our%20climate\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We aim to continuously improve our climate governance'),(2402,'Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which','Education & Skill Development','Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which we operate. Our \'Biodiversity Policy,\' signed by our MD&CEO, aims for No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. By signing the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 22nd February 2020, we pledged to integrate biodiversity aspects into our management systems, ensuring No Net Loss and a positive environmental impact. We prioritise protecting and enhancing the natural environment around our plant locations, ensuring our operations do not harm high biodiversity areas or endangered species within our radius. We have implemented measures to reduce water consumption, minimize pollution, and lower air emissions intensity, including installing Flue Gas Desulphurisers (FGDs) at multiple locations. Our recycling programs and waste minimisation efforts further support our sustainability goals. As part of the Adani Group’s 100 million trees plantation pledge, we are committed to planting 7.85 million trees. Our site-specific restoration plans, such as the \'A New Leaf: Tiroda’s Green Belt Development Project,\' focus on re-vegetation and habitat restoration, significantly reviving degraded ecosystems and promoting biodiversity.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Power%20Limited%20%28APL%29%20is%20deeply%20committed',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:17.360757+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4820dce88a2de9f62d80225ebd1acdd6','COMP_TOP200_012',NULL,'d006b6c17ce2ad2a838b6cb5dbe75821',NULL,'Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which we operate. Our \'Biodiversity Policy,\' signed by our MD&CEO, aims for No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. By signing the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 22nd February 2020, we pledged to integrate biodiversity aspects into our management systems, ensuring No Net Loss and a positive environmental impact. We prioritise protecting and enhancing the natural environment around our plant locations, ensuring our operations do not harm high biodiversity areas or endangered species within our radius. We have implemented measures to reduce water consumption, minimize pollution, and lower air emissions intensity, including installing Flue Gas Desulphurisers (FGDs) at multiple locations. Our recycling programs and waste minimisation efforts further support our sustainability goals. As part of the Adani Group’s 100 million trees plantation pledge, we are committed to planting 7.85 million trees. Our site-specific restoration plans, such as the \'A New Leaf: Tiroda’s Green Belt Development Project,\' focus on re-vegetation and habitat restoration, significantly reviving degraded ecosystems and promoting biodiversity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:17.360757','{\"title\": \"Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which\", \"summary\": \"Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which we operate. Our \'Biodiversity Policy,\' signed by our MD&CEO, aims for No Net Loss (NNL) of biodiversity in all operations. By signing the India Business & Biodiversity Initiative (IBBI) on 22nd February 2020, we pledged to integrate biodiversity aspects into our management systems, ensuring No Net Loss and a positive environmental impact. We prioritise protecting and enhancing the natural environment around our plant locations, ensuring our operations do not harm high biodiversity areas or endangered species within our radius. We have implemented measures to reduce water consumption, minimize pollution, and lower air emissions intensity, including installing Flue Gas Desulphurisers (FGDs) at multiple locations. Our recycling programs and waste minimisation efforts further support our sustainability goals. As part of the Adani Group’s 100 million trees plantation pledge, we are committed to planting 7.85 million trees. Our site-specific restoration plans, such as the \'A New Leaf: Tiroda’s Green Belt Development Project,\' focus on re-vegetation and habitat restoration, significantly reviving degraded ecosystems and promoting biodiversity.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanipower.com/sustainability#:~:text=Adani%20Power%20Limited%20%28APL%29%20is%20deeply%20committed\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Adani Power Limited (APL) is deeply committed to sustainability and the ecosystem in which'),(2403,'We believe that the foundation for effective ESG management is robust and transparent gove','Environment & Sustainability','We believe that the foundation for effective ESG management is robust and transparent governance and integration of these considerations into the way we do business. This includes alignment with our overall strategy and embedding relevant matters into our risk management framework and our service offerings. We intend to further accelerate our green contribution and become the benchmark for environmental stewardship.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20the%20foundation%20for%20effective',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:12.960604+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4f8143ab4f26d15975ec2205ab4b22a2','COMP_TOP200_013',NULL,'ec85ae256de79978e245a57afc62ee22',NULL,'We believe that the foundation for effective ESG management is robust and transparent governance and integration of these considerations into the way we do business. This includes alignment with our overall strategy and embedding relevant matters into our risk management framework and our service offerings. We intend to further accelerate our green contribution and become the benchmark for environmental stewardship.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 