ptimum utilisation of resources, community efforts and engagement with all stakeholders are anchored in our business strategy.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604','{\"title\": \"We have embraced the philosophy of growth with goodness where along with focus on the fina\", \"summary\": \"We have embraced the philosophy of growth with goodness where along with focus on the financial and operational performance; environment conservation, optimum utilisation of resources, community efforts and engagement with all stakeholders are anchored in our business strategy.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=We%20have%20embraced%20the%20philosophy%20of%20growth\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'We have embraced the philosophy of growth with goodness where along with focus on the fina'),(2405,'Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable componen','Environment & Sustainability','Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable component of how we approach business. We have embedded the ESG framework to our core philosophy of value creation – keeping the interests of investors, community, and the environment in focus. Our sustainability roadmap is based on formulating appropriate policies, conforming to regulatory norms, mitigating risks, making regular disclosures, setting targets for minimizing our environmental footprint and strengthening corporate governance to meet those targets. We see these as a set of intertwined parameters that are all linked and manifest as a set of metrics that must speak for themselves. We view governance as not just the letter of the law, but equally about the spirit for us, to proactively understand regulations, stay ahead of any unforeseen violations and ensure transparency in all that we do.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.adaniports.com/Sustainability#:~:text=Our%20commitment%20to%20the%20Environment%2C%20Social%20and',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:12.960604+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b0e7960a79480f56223e82b676271a26','COMP_TOP200_013',NULL,'01e8867f7f38732902e18be60150a57a',NULL,'Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable component of how we approach business. We have embedded the ESG framework to our core philosophy of value creation – keeping the interests of investors, community, and the environment in focus. Our sustainability roadmap is based on formulating appropriate policies, conforming to regulatory norms, mitigating risks, making regular disclosures, setting targets for minimizing our environmental footprint and strengthening corporate governance to meet those targets. We see these as a set of intertwined parameters that are all linked and manifest as a set of metrics that must speak for themselves. We view governance as not just the letter of the law, but equally about the spirit for us, to proactively understand regulations, stay ahead of any unforeseen violations and ensure transparency in all that we do.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:12.960604','{\"title\": \"Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable componen\", \"summary\": \"Our commitment to the Environment, Social and Governance norms is an inextricable component of how we approach business. We have embedded the ESG framework to our core philosophy of value creatio