9b6df42e2eb9a3',NULL,'NTPC is India’s largest power conglomerate with roots planted way back in 1975 to accelerate power development in India. Since then, it has established itself as the dominant power major with presence in the entire value chain of the power generation business. From fossil fuels it has forayed into generating electricity via hydro, renewable energy and nuclear sources. This foray will play a major role in lowering its carbon footprint by reducing greenhouse gas emissions. To strengthen its core business, the corporation has diversified into the fields of consultancy, power trading, training of power professionals, rural electrification, ash utilization and coal mining as well.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:25:30.814130','{\"title\": \"NTPC is India’s largest power conglomerate with roots planted way back in 1975 to accelera\", \"summary\": \"NTPC is India’s largest power conglomerate with roots planted way back in 1975 to accelerate power development in India. Since then, it has established itself as the dominant power major with presence in the entire value chain of the power generation business. From fossil fuels it has forayed into generating electricity via hydro, renewable energy and nuclear sources. This foray will play a major role in lowering its carbon footprint by reducing greenhouse gas emissions. To strengthen its core business, the corporation has diversified into the fields of consultancy, power trading, training of power professionals, rural electrification, ash utilization and coal mining as well.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://ntpc.co.in/ntpc-overview#:~:text=NTPC%20is%20India%E2%80%99s%20largest%20power%20conglomerate%20with\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_categor