siness, the chemicals business follow\", \"summary\": \"With one of the best environmental policies in the business, the chemicals business follows environment-friendly processes and adheres to global safety standards. New processes and technologies are continuously adopted to minimise pollution and waste. In addition, natural resources are used responsibly and by products are disposed safely.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.grasim.com/sustainability#:~:text=With%20one%20of%20the%20best%20environmental%20policies\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'With one of the best environmental policies in the business, the chemicals business follow'),(2487,'POWERGRID has been contributing to the society through its CSR interventions even before t','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','POWERGRID has been contributing to the society through its CSR interventions even before the CSR Act, 2013 came into force. POWERGRID has aligned with 15 out of 17 Sustainable Development Goals launched by the United Nations in 2015. POWERGRID adopts 360° project approach for implementation of its CSR interventions thereby ensuring sustainable implementation of its CSR projects for the targeted beneficiaries. While designing and implementation of the interventions, POWERGRID consults and engages with all stakeholders. Techniques like, Need-Profile Analysis and Need-prioritization are used as effective community participation tools. Communities are also involved in the process of implementation as well as during participatory monitoring phases of the programs.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20been%20contributing%20to%20the%20socie