"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'With an aim to provide much needed shelter to attendants and care givers of aling hospital'),(2496,'POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt','Healthcare & Nutrition','POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt. hospitals, distributed Aid & Appliances to Persons with Disabilities and organized health camps in various parts of the country. POWERGRID in association with Artificial Limbs Manufacturing Corporation of India Ltd (ALIMCO) distributed free assistive aids like Motorized Tricycles, Tricycle wheelchair, Walking Sticks, Brail Kit , Crutches , artificial limbs, and hearing aids to 188 Divyangjan ( PwDs) at Damoh District of Madhya Pradesh.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20provided%20medical%20equipment%20%26%20ambulances%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'61ce8f3bdf144e06fad6ce961b347922','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'289db03427818910e3b84d852a1a8d6b',NULL,'POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt. hospitals, distributed Aid & Appliances to Persons with Disabilities and organized health camps in various parts of the country. POWERGRID in association with Artificial Limbs Manufacturing Corporation of India Ltd (ALIMCO) distributed free assistive aids like Motorized Tricycles, Tricycle wheelchair, Walking Sticks, Brail Kit , Crutches , artificial limbs, and hearing aids to 188 Divyangjan ( PwDs) at Damoh District of Madhya Pradesh.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt\", \"summary\": \"POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt. hospitals, distributed Aid & Appliances to Persons with Disabilities and organized health camps in various parts of the country. POWERGRID in association with Artificial Limbs Manufacturing Corporation of India Ltd (ALIMCO) distributed free assistive aids like Motorized Tricycles, Tricycle wheelchair, Walking Sticks, Brail Kit , Crutches , artificial limbs, and hearing aids to 188 Divyangjan ( PwDs) at Damoh District of Madhya Pradesh.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20provided%20medical%20equipment%20%26%20ambulances%20in\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'POWERGRID provided medical equipment & ambulances in various Govt'),(2497,'Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha','Rural Development & Livelihood','Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Improving%20Agriculture%20Productivity%20and%20Rural%20Livelihood%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d434274ddfbc4be8cff70ae4a5a912fb','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'a334b09c909345ef8cd0c3c27640bb67',NULL,'Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha\", \"summary\": \"Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Improving%20Agriculture%20Productivity%20and%20Rural%20Livelihood%20in\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'Improving Agriculture Productivity and Rural Livelihood in Kalahandi District of Odisha'),(2498,'POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi','Environment & Sustainability','POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi-Arid Tropics (ICRISAT) in developing a scalable site of learning to improve livelihoods and build resilience through integrated watershed management in 10 villages of Jaipatna block, Kalahandi district, Odisha. The watershed comprises an area of around 2500 ha. The overall objective is to develop capacity of the farmer in the region for improving rural livelihood through farmer friendly knowledge sharing and dissemination strategy to enhance awareness among different stakeholders about climate smart water efficient and nutritious cereals and vegetables for cultivating and its integration in regular diet.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20supported%20the%20International%20Crops%20Research',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'54daec9a86e6791abcd85fd6b406911a','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'3e967fda0758f9df20a3dc564ca883e6',NULL,'POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi-Arid Tropics (ICRISAT) in developing a scalable site of learning to improve livelihoods and build resilience through integrated watershed management in 10 villages of Jaipatna block, Kalahandi district, Odisha. The watershed comprises an area of around 2500 ha. The overall objective is to develop capacity of the farmer in the region for improving rural livelihood through farmer friendly knowledge sharing and dissemination strategy to enhance awareness among different stakeholders about climate smart water efficient and nutritious cereals and vegetables for cultivating and its integration in regular diet.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi\", \"summary\": \"POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi-Arid Tropics (ICRISAT) in developing a scalable site of learning to improve livelihoods and build resilience through integrated watershed management in 10 villages of Jaipatna block, Kalahandi district, Odisha. The watershed comprises an area of around 2500 ha. The overall objective is to develop capacity of the farmer in the region for improving rural livelihood through farmer friendly knowledge sharing and dissemination strategy to enhance awareness among different stakeholders about climate smart water efficient and nutritious cereals and vegetables for cultivating and its integration in regular diet.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20has%20supported%20the%20International%20Crops%20Research\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'POWERGRID has supported the International Crops Research Institute for the Semi'),(2499,'Carrying out rural developmental works in Jalalsar village of Bikaner District, Rajasthan','Rural Development & L