ial to bring all out development of the village. The domains such as health, environment, safety and security are likely to get positively impacted by this intervention. At the same time the marginalized communities are also going to benefit in the long run.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=With%20the%20construction%20of%20%E2%80%98pakka%E2%80%99%20road%20the',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'af8eaf0a11a83e43e51194523461e628','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'307db3902387574c183ee527d3e65330',NULL,'With the construction of ‘pakka’ road the impact has been positive on the Rural Community. The villagers now found it easier for Commuting for school children, office going people, elderly and those who wish to access various services. Access to various public service centers is now faster than before. It is said that creation of infrastructure especially linking villages to highways and nearby cities has the potential to bring all out development of the village. The domains such as health, environment, safety and security are likely to get positively impacted by this intervention. At the same time the marginalized communities are also going to benefit in the long run.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"With the construction of ‘pakka’ road the impact has been positive on the Rural Community\", \"summary\": \"With the construction of ‘pakka’ road the impact has been positive on the Rural Community. The villagers now found it easier for Commuting for school children, office going people, elderly and those who wish to access various services. Access to various public service centers is now faster than before. It is said that creation of infrastructure especially linking villages to highways and nearby cities has the potential to bring all out development of the