ortal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Education & Skill Development Initiative'),(2502,'POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installat','Education & Skill Development','POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installation and Commissioning of 20 Units of 120W (60W X 02Nos) of LED based Solar Street Lighting systems on NH-16 of Kasibugga in Andhra Pradesh. In absence of sufficient illumination, drivers and pedestrians are miserably failing to see the connecting approach roads, junctions, dividers and potential obstacles on road junctions during dusk and and night, which lead to road accidents many times. In order to address this issue local authorities have requested to provide the illumination at identified places on NH-16 at Kasibugga Sub-Division Limits from Kotabommali to Ichapuram PS limits in Srikakulam district, Andhra Pradesh',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20made%20an%20Agreement%20with%20District%20Administration%2C',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'31a6f8d4ee1b960c1903b3b6305596f9','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'85d939a217f5f768a0fe7bcdbb3aa0f2',NULL,'POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installation and Commissioning of 20 Units of 120W (60W X 02Nos) of LED based Solar Street Lighting systems on NH-16 of Kasibugga in Andhra Pradesh. In absence of sufficient illumination, drivers and pedestrians are miserably failing to see the connecting approach roads, junctions, dividers and potential obstacles on road junctions during dusk and and night, which lead to road accidents many times. In order to address this issue local authorities have requested to provide the illumination at identified places on NH-16 at Kasibugga Sub-Division Limits from Kotabommali to Ichapuram PS limits in Srikakulam district, Andhra Pradesh',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installat\", \"summary\": \"POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installation and Commissioning of 20 Units of 120W (60W X 02Nos) of LED based Solar Street Lighting systems on NH-16 of Kasibugga in Andhra Pradesh. In absence of sufficient illumination, drivers and pedestrians are miserably failing to see the connecting approach roads, junctions, dividers and potential obstacles on road junctions during dusk and and night, which lead to road accidents many times. In order to address this issue local authorities have requested to provide the illumination at identified places on NH-16 at Kasibugga Sub-Division Limits from Kotabommali to Ichapuram PS limits in Srikakulam district, Andhra Pradesh\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=POWERGRID%20made%20an%20Agreement%20with%20District%20Administration%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'POWERGRID made an Agreement with District Administration, Srikakulam for Supply, Installat'),(2503,'To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business ','Education & Skill Development','To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business skills and education, POWERGRID have provided women with sewing machines and training on tailoring skills in Beed, Gurugram and Koteshwar. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. This technical education is a means to eradicate unemployment among the unemployed women and provide them an opportunity to join vocational courses where they can learn skills and shape up their career that prepares them to earn a livelihood and support their families.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=To%20empower%20women%20and%20improve%20economic%20status',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fb5c19029200753d0d5477492c3adf8a','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'111f32d31cc705717d03ee8c9f1975fc',NULL,'To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business skills and education, POWERGRID have provided women with sewing machines and training on tailoring skills in Beed, Gurugram and Koteshwar. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. This technical education is a means to eradicate unemployment among the unemployed women and provide them an opportunity to join vocational courses where they can learn skills and shape up their career that prepares them to earn a livelihood and support their families.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business \", \"summary\": \"To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business skills and education, POWERGRID have provided women with sewing machines and training on tailoring skills in Beed, Gurugram and Koteshwar. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. This technical education is a means to eradicate unemployment among the unemployed women and provide them an opportunity to join vocational courses where they can learn skills and shape up their career that prepares them to earn a livelihood and support their families.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=To%20empower%20women%20and%20improve%20economic%20status\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'To empower women and improve economic status of women and their families through business '),(2504,'The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygieni','Education & Skill Development','The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygienic menstrual health of women and adolescent girls. This will discourage them against using traditional unhygienic methods. Aiming towards adolescent girls’ health and hygiene, sanitary napkin machines have been installed at various government schools at Firozpur under the aegis of POWERGRID CSR.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=The%20motif%20behind%20providing%20Sanitary%20napkin%20vending',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b38cef0208136fbb801415c52c895897','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'7b24e1cbb792fefffceff6f483317647',NULL,'The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygienic menstrual health of women and adolescent girls. This will discourage them against using traditional unhygienic methods. Aiming towards adolescent girls’ health and hygiene, sanitary napkin machines have been installed at various government schools at Firozpur under the aegis of POWERGRID CSR.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygieni\", \"summary\": \"The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygienic menstrual health of women and adolescent girls. This will discourage them against using traditional unhygienic methods. Aiming towards adolescent girls’ health and hygiene, sanitary napkin machines have been installed at various government schools at Firozpur under the aegis of POWERGRID CSR.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=The%20motif%20behind%20providing%20Sanitary%20napkin%20vending\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'The motif behind providing Sanitary napkin vending machines to women is to promote hygieni'),(2505,'Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women','Education & Skill Development','Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women : To improve the economic condition of the underprivileged women, Employment linked Skill Development programmes are continuously undertaken to provide them with self-employment opportunities. In this regard, POWERGRID has undertaken training programme on tailoring for the girls and women belonging to the weaker sections of the society. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. They needed to learn newer vocational skills such as tailoring (sewing) which can help them earn more income and become economically self-sufficient and independent. This will alleviate poverty, help them support their family needs without being dependent of husband and parents. In order to help them, POWERGRID started free tailoring (sewing) training centers in the villages.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20classes%20for%2006%20months%20in%20tailoring',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'10bb24508d53cec8bbb8769bd0a6c427','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'b62c2621bd5742c39351ce0bc360ec5d',NULL,'Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women : To improve the economic condition of the underprivileged women, Employment linked Skill Development programmes are continuously undertaken to provide them with self-employment opportunities. In this regard, POWERGRID has undertaken training programme on tailoring for the girls and women belonging to the weaker sections of the society. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. They needed to learn newer vocational skills such as tailoring (sewing) which can help them earn more income and become economically self-sufficient and independent. This will alleviate poverty, help them support their family needs without being dependent of husband and parents. In order to help them, POWERGRID started free tailoring (sewing) training centers in the villages.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women\", \"summary\": \"Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women : To improve the economic condition of the underprivileged women, Employment linked Skill Development programmes are continuously undertaken to provide them with self-employment opportunities. In this regard, POWERGRID has undertaken training programme on tailoring for the girls and women belonging to the weaker sections of the society. The main objective of this tailoring training program is to enhance the quality of life of women and teenage girls through enhancement of their skills and knowledge. They needed to learn newer vocational skills such as tailoring (sewing) which can help them earn more income and become economically self-sufficient and independent. This will alleviate poverty, help them support their family needs without being dependent of husband and parents. In order to help them, POWERGRID started free tailoring (sewing) training centers in the villages.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20classes%20for%2006%20months%20in%20tailoring\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Training classes for 06 months in tailoring for girls and women'),(2506,'Training Programme for 275 nos','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','Training Programme for 275 nos. of unemployed youth, Damoh-CEDMAP : POWERGRID provided financial assistance to train 325 nos. of unemployed youths of Damoh District through CEDMAP (Centre for Entrepreneurship Development Madhya Pradesh). The duration of the programe was for 4 months, training course has helped the beneficiaries in fetching good employment opportunity to earn a respectable and dignified living.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20Programme%20for%20275%20nos.%20of%20unemployed',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:27:13.835898+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'125d4835841ce7fd8a4b000ba396e33c','COMP_TOP200_030',NULL,'0871126be069759cb51148a98d423887',NULL,'Training Programme for 275 nos. of unemployed youth, Damoh-CEDMAP : POWERGRID provided financial assistance to train 325 nos. of unemployed youths of Damoh District through CEDMAP (Centre for Entrepreneurship Development Madhya Pradesh). The duration of the programe was for 4 months, training course has helped the beneficiaries in fetching good employment opportunity to earn a respectable and dignified living.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:27:13.835898','{\"title\": \"Training Programme for 275 nos\", \"summary\": \"Training Programme for 275 nos. of unemployed youth, Damoh-CEDMAP : POWERGRID provided financial assistance to train 325 nos. of unemployed youths of Damoh District through CEDMAP (Centre for Entrepreneurship Development Madhya Pradesh). The duration of the programe was for 4 months, training course has helped the beneficiaries in fetching good employment opportunity to earn a respectable and dignified living.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.powergrid.in/csr#:~:text=Training%20Programme%20for%20275%20nos.%20of%20unemployed\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'Training Programme for 275 nos'),(2507,'Corporate CSR Initiative','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','CIPET : A 6 - Month Certificate Cours