ified on Official Portal','https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=When%20you%20visit%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:28:57.813875+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2519a7de6c92fa8c33908a35c401d047','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'e0d537cd06f19a7db3d215b9699ed847',NULL,'When you visit Solar Industries India Ltd.Services and you have not otherwise identified yourself (e.g., via registration with a Solar Industries India Ltd.Service), our web servers automatically recognize your domain name, but not your e-mail address. We also collect firmographic information about your company, if you are visiting Solar Industries India Ltd.Services from your company domain. We collect the domain name and monitor general site use and traffic patterns to improve the Services that we offer.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{\"title\": \"When you visit Solar Industries India Ltd\", \"summary\": \"When you visit Solar Industries India Ltd.Services and you have not otherwise identified yourself (e.g., via registration with a Solar Industries India Ltd.Service), our web servers automatically recognize your domain name, but not your e-mail address. We also collect firmographic information about your company, if you are visiting Solar Industries India Ltd.Services from your company domain. We collect the domain name and monitor general site use and traffic patterns to improve the Services that we offer.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=When%20you%20visit%20Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.Services\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'When you visit Solar Industries India Ltd'),(2553,'Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and und','Environment & Sustainability','Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and understand how they navigate our Services. Cookies are small data files placed on your device by a website when you visit. Solar Industries India Ltd.uses cookies set by us or other companies for tracking purposes or to make our Services easier to use and tailored for individual users. Like many websites, we do not currently respond to “do not track” browser headers except where legally required. But with most Web browsers, you can take steps to limit tracking by erasing cookies from your device and by setting your browser to block all cookies or warn you before a cookie is stored. Cookies offer enhanced functionality to the user, but whether you allow a cookie to be placed on your device is up to you.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Cookies%20are%20currently%20the%20best%20way%20to',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:28:57.813875+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'52b17ecfaf600d60ed28d1bbfd8cf0aa','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'fd707c07b00e58389aaaa93c21bb644d',NULL,'Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and understand how they navigate our Services. Cookies are small data files placed on your device by a website when you visit. Solar Industries India Ltd.uses cookies set by us or other companies for tracking purposes or to make our Services easier to use and tailored for individual users. Like many websites, we do not currently respond to “do not track” browser headers except where legally required. But with most Web browsers, you can take steps to limit tracking by erasing cookies from your device and by setting your browser to block all cookies or warn you before a cookie is stored. Cookies offer enhanced functionality to the user, but whether you allow a cookie to be placed on your device is up to you.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{\"title\": \"Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and und\", \"summary\": \"Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and understand how they navigate our Services. Cookies are small data files placed on your device by a website when you visit. Solar Industries India Ltd.uses cookies set by us or other companies for tracking purposes or to make our Services easier to use and tailored for individual users. Like many websites, we do not currently respond to “do not track” browser headers except where legally required. But with most Web browsers, you can take steps to limit tracking by erasing cookies from your device and by setting your browser to block all cookies or warn you before a cookie is stored. Cookies offer enhanced functionality to the user, but whether you allow a cookie to be placed on your device is up to you.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Cookies%20are%20currently%20the%20best%20way%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Cookies are currently the best way to effectively identify unique website visitors and und'),(2554,'Solar Industries India Ltd','Environment & Sustainability','Solar Industries India Ltd.uses, and permits service providers to use, tracking scripts or \"tracers\" and web beacons that recognize a unique identifier from a cookie placed on your device by another website. For example, we use a tracer to determine whether you visit our pages after visiting a site where we placed a banner ad. We also use these technologies to compile information about your website usage and your interaction with email or other communications, to measure performance, and to provide content and ads that are more relevant to you. A web beacon is typically a transparent graphic image that can be embedded in online content, videos, and emails, and can allow a server to read certain types of information from your device, know when you have viewed the beacon, and the IP address of your device. For example, we include web beacons in our promotional email messages or newsletters to determine whether our messages have been opened or interacted with and whether our mailing tools are working properly.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.uses%2C%20and%20permits%20service',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:28:57.813875+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'592648a4fbc71f9003bba83776872bba','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'53823de9ceb5f6c79e47bf029371be5d',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd.uses, and permits service providers to use, tracking scripts or \"tracers\" and web beacons that recognize a unique identifier from a cookie placed on your device by another website. For example, we use a tracer to determine whether you visit our pages after visiting a site where we placed a banner ad. We also use these technologies to compile information about your website usage and your interaction with email or other communications, to measure performance, and to provide content and ads that are more relevant to you. A web beacon is typically a transparent graphic image that can be embedded in online content, videos, and emails, and can allow a server to read certain types of information from your device, know when you have viewed the beacon, and the IP address of your device. For example, we include web beacons in our promotional email messages or newsletters to determine whether our messages have been opened or interacted with and whether our mailing tools are working properly.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{\"title\": \"Solar Industries India Ltd\", \"summary\": \"Solar Industries India Ltd.uses, and permits service providers to use, tracking scripts or \\\"tracers\\\" and web beacons that recognize a unique identifier from a cookie placed on your device by another website. For example, we use a tracer to determine whether you visit our pages after visiting a site where we placed a banner ad. We also use these technologies to compile information about your website usage and your interaction with email or other communications, to measure performance, and to provide content and ads that are more relevant to you. A web beacon is typically a transparent graphic image that can be embedded in online content, videos, and emails, and can allow a server to read certain types of information from your device, know when you have viewed the beacon, and the IP address of your device. For example, we include web beacons in our promotional email messages or newsletters to determine whether our messages have been opened or interacted with and whether our mailing tools are working properly.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=Solar%20Industries%20India%20Ltd.uses%2C%20and%20permits%20service\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Solar Industries India Ltd'),(2555,'| Advertising and Remarketing | These cookies are used to understand and deliver ads, make','Environment & Sustainability','| Advertising and Remarketing | These cookies are used to understand and deliver ads, make them more relevant to you, and analyze the effectiveness of our advertising programs. They use the fact that you visited our Services to target online ads for Solar Industries India Ltd.Services to you on non-Solar Industries India Ltd.websites. Some of these cookies are placed on your device by a third party with which we contract to provide certain services. Blocking or deleting these cookies will not impact Service functionality. For details and to opt out, see Interest-based advertising. |',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.solargroup.com/cookies.html#:~:text=%7C%20Advertising%20and%20Remarketing%20%7C%20These%20cookies',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:28:57.813875+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5e737254591cb4aa3d46fce0a08bd1be','COMP_TOP200_044',NULL,'9dc4f9cc71160039eccd3d00f4fc04bd',NULL,'| Advertising and Remarketing | These cookies are used to understand and deliver ads, make them more relevant to you, and analyze the effectiveness of our advertising programs. They use the fact that you visited our Services to target online ads for Solar Industries India Ltd.Services to you on non-Solar Industries India Ltd.websites. Some of these cookies are placed on your device by a third party with which we contract to provide certain services. Blocking or deleting these cookies will not impact Service functionality. For details and to opt out, see Interest-based advertising. |',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:28:57.813875','{\"title\": \"| Advertising and Remarketing | These cookies are used to understand and deliver ads, make\", \"summary\": \"| Advertising and Remarketing | These cookies are used to understand and deli