eadership qualities among students, was undertaken in 12 schools and has impacted 1,194 children. This programme has proven successful, as evidenced by significant behavioural changes, increased self confidence, and a new-found eagerness to embrace challenges and acquire new knowledge.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{\"title\": \"Our LEAAD programme, which is aimed at fostering leadership qualities among students, was \", \"summary\": \"Our LEAAD programme, which is aimed at fostering leadership qualities among students, was undertaken in 12 schools and has impacted 1,194 children. This programme has proven successful, as evidenced by significant behavioural changes, increased self confidence, and a new-found eagerness to embrace challenges and acquire new knowledge.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20LEAAD%20programme%2C%20which%20is%20aimed%20at\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Our LEAAD programme, which is aimed at fostering leadership qualities among students, was '),(2668,'Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hinde','Education & Skill Development','Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hindering practical demonstrations of classroom theories. To address this gap, we have established science laboratories in K.G.B.V Hirapur for 100 students, giving them access to hand on experience to improve their academic performance and foster a growing interest in Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) subjects.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Several%20government%20schools%20face%20a%20shortage%20of',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:58.374821+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'559f2b11d3fe6e931298f0b352b1cde1','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'9235c5da9a5990fcf46666f30da753a8',NULL,'Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hindering practical demonstrations of classroom theories. To address this gap, we have established science laboratories in K.G.B.V Hirapur for 100 students, giving them access to hand on experience to improve their academic performance and foster a growing interest in Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) subjects.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{\"title\": \"Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hinde\", \"summary\": \"Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hindering practical demonstrations of classroom theories. To address this gap, we have established science laboratories in K.G.B.V Hirapur for 100 students, giving them access to hand on experience to improve their academic performance and foster a growing interest in Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM) subjects.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Several%20government%20schools%20face%20a%20shortage%20of\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Several government schools face a shortage of laboratories or inadequate facilities, hinde'),(2669,'We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health ini','Education & Skill Development','We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health initiatives and providing health outreach programs to vulnerable communities. The foundation\'s overarching goal is to ensure that high-quality primary, secondary, and tertiary healthcare services are accessible to everyone.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20improving%20the%20healthcare',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:58.374821+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'15630c18c27b862b672a899662a90925','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'09f5b7a2f2275bc1acc1a4a99c009f3a',NULL,'We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health initiatives and providing health outreach programs to vulnerable communities. The foundation\'s overarching goal is to ensure that high-quality primary, secondary, and tertiary healthcare services are accessible to everyone.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{\"title\": \"We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health ini\", \"summary\": \"We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health initiatives and providing health outreach programs to vulnerable communities. The foundation\'s overarching goal is to ensure that high-quality primary, secondary, and tertiary healthcare services are accessible to everyone.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20improving%20the%20healthcare\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We are dedicated to improving the healthcare ecosystem by focusing on community health ini'),(2670,'Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultat','Healthcare & Nutrition','Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultations, medication supply, and health counselling, directly to communities. With an average of 125 patients served daily, our designated MMUs focus on rural areas, providing guidance on nutrition, healthy lifestyles, and personalized health actions. Health Mobilisers, working under medical supervision, play a crucial role in enhancing the well-being of the communities we serve.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Medical%20Units%20%28MMUs%29%20bring%20vital',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:58.374821+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0935880e9083246a9d0bf16687762ca3','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'4d63f4131713ec93e81976a710868198',NULL,'Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultations, medication supply, and health counselling, directly to communities. With an average of 125 patients served daily, our designated MMUs focus on rural areas, providing guidance on nutrition, healthy lifestyles, and personalized health actions. Health Mobilisers, working under medical supervision, play a crucial role in enhancing the well-being of the communities we serve.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{\"title\": \"Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultat\", \"summary\": \"Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultations, medication supply, and health counselling, directly to communities. With an average of 125 patients served daily, our designated MMUs focus on rural areas, providing guidance on nutrition, healthy lifestyles, and personalized health actions. Health Mobilisers, working under medical supervision, play a crucial role in enhancing the well-being of the communities we serve.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Our%20Mobile%20Medical%20Units%20%28MMUs%29%20bring%20vital\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Our Mobile Medical Units (MMUs) bring vital healthcare services, such as outdoor consultat'),(2671,'We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp a','Healthcare & Nutrition','We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp and held health camps in various locations such as rural areas, hospitals, industries, institutes, public healthcare centres, and government offices, reaching a wide audience. In FY23 alone, 4,500+ women have benefited from our health camps, and we\'ve made a special effort to raise awareness about breast cancer through targeted interventions.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20have%20partnered%20with%20Shree%20Halol%20Stree',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:58.374821+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'94c81f81cbdc375341ea894174dec1b1','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'bedd7855cffeff9f076be3706a5d0722',NULL,'We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp and held health camps in various locations such as rural areas, hospitals, industries, institutes, public healthcare centres, and government offices, reaching a wide audience. In FY23 alone, 4,500+ women have benefited from our health camps, and we\'ve made a special effort to raise awareness about breast cancer through targeted interventions.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{\"title\": \"We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp a\", \"summary\": \"We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp and held health camps in various locations such as rural areas, hospitals, industries, institutes, public healthcare centres, and government offices, reaching a wide audience. In FY23 alone, 4,500+ women have benefited from our health camps, and we\'ve made a special effort to raise awareness about breast cancer through targeted interventions.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=We%20have%20partnered%20with%20Shree%20Halol%20Stree\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'We have partnered with Shree Halol Stree Samaj to conduct a Breast Tumour Detection Camp a'),(2672,'At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future','Education & Skill Development','At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future. Our flagship CSR initiative, ‘Polycab Utkarsh,’ is driven by a single, powerful goal, uplifting India’s electrician community through structured training. Launched in September 2024 under the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) framework, Utkarsh is aligned with Skill India, Construction Skill Development Council curriculum. The program offers 2-days intensive training module. Its unique dual-mode training on live and de-energized electrical circuit is complemented by safety awareness, communication skills, and customer management techniques. This ensures participants are ready for real-world challenges and can deliver safer, more reliable services to communities nationwide.',NULL,NULL,'rs 2','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=At%20Polycab%2C%20we%20believe%20that%20skill%20development',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:58.374821+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'366feffad778a92e42650b8482dfadc4','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'6917c16cf9f8a34509eefbce4f605cf3',NULL,'At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future. Our flagship CSR initiative, ‘Polycab Utkarsh,’ is driven by a single, powerful goal, uplifting India’s electrician community through structured training. Launched in September 2024 under the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) framework, Utkarsh is aligned with Skill India, Construction Skill Development Council curriculum. The program offers 2-days intensive training module. Its unique dual-mode training on live and de-energized electrical circuit is complemented by safety awareness, communication skills, and customer management techniques. This ensures participants are ready for real-world challenges and can deliver safer, more reliable services to communities nationwide.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:58.374821','{\"title\": \"At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future\", \"summary\": \"At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future. Our flagship CSR initiative, ‘Polycab Utkarsh,’ is driven by a single, powerful goal, uplifting India’s electrician community through structured training. Launched in September 2024 under the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) framework, Utkarsh is aligned with Skill India, Construction Skill Development Council curriculum. The program offers 2-days intensive training module. Its unique dual-mode training on live and de-energized electrical circuit is complemented by safety awareness, communication skills, and customer management techniques. This ensures participants are ready for real-world challenges and can deliver safer, more reliable services to communities nationwide.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=At%20Polycab%2C%20we%20believe%20that%20skill%20development\", \"budget_allocated\": \"rs 2\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'rs 2','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'At Polycab, we believe that skill development is the foundation of a brighter future'),(2673,'Recognizing the pivotal role of women\'s financial independence in societal progress, we ar','Education & Skill Development','Recognizing the pivotal role of women\'s financial independence in societal progress, we are committed to empowering women through diverse skill development initiatives. Our efforts include martial arts for girls, collaboration with Self Help Groups (SHGs) for agarbatti making, and implementation of sewing courses, among other initiatives.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://polycab.com/about-us/csr#:~:text=Recognizing%20the%20pivotal%20role%20of%20women%27s%20financial',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:58.374821+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0b1c25fb498d8ff87c3458c1e5e230b1','COMP_TOP200_055',NULL,'0edb05672a647243e23e5688d8bc8a46',NULL,'Recognizing the pivotal role of women\'s financial independence in societal progress, we are committed to empowering women through diverse skill development