ect_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'To address this challenge, LTM, under its CSR initiative Integrated Village Development Pr'),(2699,'With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from re','Rural Development & Livelihood','With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from residents across 3–4 neighboring villages, the check dam was constructed at a point where it could direct water across 70 acres of farmland. This intervention now supports 35–40 farmers who previously struggled to cultivate beyond a single paddy cycle.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=With%20guidance%20from%20civil%20surveys%20and%20feasibility',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b0e9988ee360b7e9667b1c0fba84ed12','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'8d2a138ad829a0f2e917677c1d543534',NULL,'With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from residents across 3–4 neighboring villages, the check dam was constructed at a point where it could direct water across 70 acres of farmland. This intervention now supports 35–40 farmers who previously struggled to cultivate beyond a single paddy cycle.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from re\", \"summary\": \"With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from residents across 3–4 neighboring villages, the check dam was constructed at a point where it could direct water across 70 acres of farmland. This intervention now supports 35–40 farmers who previously struggled to cultivate beyond a single paddy cycle.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=With%20guidance%20from%20civil%20surveys%20and%20feasibility\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'With guidance from civil surveys and feasibility studies, and active participation from re'),(2700,'Project Impact','Rural Development & Livelihood','Project Impact: Agriculture in the Madanpur Rampur block has always been at the mercy of erratic rainfall. Before the intervention, farmers could grow only one monsoon crop, often risking crop loss in dry spells. The check dam has changed that reality. Farmers can now irrigate their paddy fields whenever required and cultivate additional Rabi crops, an opportunity that never existed earlier due to water scarcity.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20Agriculture%20in%20the%20Madanpur%20Rampur',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ef79caa34673febfad9f375ca343f499','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'a7dca194911502cce8446327a7ec850c',NULL,'Project Impact: Agriculture in the Madanpur Rampur block has always been at the mercy of erratic rainfall. Before the intervention, farmers could grow only one monsoon crop, often risking crop loss in dry spells. The check dam has changed that reality. Farmers can now irrigate their paddy fields whenever required and cultivate additional Rabi crops, an opportunity that never existed earlier due to water scarcity.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"Project Impact\", \"summary\": \"Project Impact: Agriculture in the Madanpur Rampur block has always been at the mercy of erratic rainfall. Before the intervention, farmers could grow only one monsoon crop, often risking crop loss in dry spells. The check dam has changed that reality. Farmers can now irrigate their paddy fields whenever required and cultivate additional Rabi crops, an opportunity that never existed earlier due to water scarcity.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20Agriculture%20in%20the%20Madanpur%20Rampur\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'Project Impact'),(2701,'This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10–12 lakh inadditional annual income for the farming households. The check dam has not only stabilized agricultural productivity but has also strengthened economic security for families who once faced an uncertain year after year.',NULL,NULL,'₹10','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=This%20expanded%20cropping%20pattern%20across%2070%20acres',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'24696f3546118aa33660a8314be6a969','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'e9e7835446453b2c3189459665eec485',NULL,'This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10–12 lakh inadditional annual income for the farming households. The check dam has not only stabilized agricultural productivity but has also strengthened economic security for families who once faced an uncertain year after year.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10\", \"summary\": \"This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10–12 lakh inadditional annual income for the farming households. The check dam has not only stabilized agricultural productivity but has also strengthened economic security for families who once faced an uncertain year after year.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=This%20expanded%20cropping%20pattern%20across%2070%20acres\", \"budget_allocated\": \"₹10\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'₹10','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'This expanded cropping pattern across 70 acres has generated an estimated ₹10'),(2702,'In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector','Education & Skill Development','In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector-borne diseases such as malaria and dengue have long strained public health and household incomes. Districts such as Kalahandi, Balangir, and Bargarh have seen repeated outbreaks, with Madanpur Rampur Block identified as one of the worst-affected regions. The rise in cases has been steep. Kalahandi recorded 3,841 cases in 2022, 7,543 in 2023, and 14,399 in 2024. Of these, 11,075 were severe Plasmodium falciparum infections. Similar spikes were reported in Gudvella and Paikmal blocks, leaving communities vulnerable and health systems under pressure.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20western%20Odisha%E2%80%99s%20remote%20hills%20and%20villages%2C',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'d8afe94cd0e836bfc4e715c25afe4921','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'582cb304d6c873d2f8dc0cc2dfa090b2',NULL,'In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector-borne diseases such as malaria and dengue have long strained public health and household incomes. Districts such as Kalahandi, Balangir, and Bargarh have seen repeated outbreaks, with Madanpur Rampur Block identified as one of the worst-affected regions. The rise in cases has been steep. Kalahandi recorded 3,841 cases in 2022, 7,543 in 2023, and 14,399 in 2024. Of these, 11,075 were severe Plasmodium falciparum infections. Similar spikes were reported in Gudvella and Paikmal blocks, leaving communities vulnerable and health systems under pressure.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector\", \"summary\": \"In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector-borne diseases such as malaria and dengue have long strained public health and household incomes. Districts such as Kalahandi, Balangir, and Bargarh have seen repeated outbreaks, with Madanpur Rampur Block identified as one of the worst-affected regions. The rise in cases has been steep. Kalahandi recorded 3,841 cases in 2022, 7,543 in 2023, and 14,399 in 2024. Of these, 11,075 were severe Plasmodium falciparum infections. Similar spikes were reported in Gudvella and Paikmal blocks, leaving communities vulnerable and health systems under pressure.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20western%20Odisha%E2%80%99s%20remote%20hills%20and%20villages%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'In western Odisha’s remote hills and villages, vector'),(2703,'To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner,','Rural Development & Livelihood','To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner, under the Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP), launched a focused fumigation support program. Fifteen fumigation machines were provided across fifteen gram panchayats, five each in Madanpur Rampur, Gudvella, and Paikmal, to ensure local ownership and long-term use.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=To%20confront%20this%20growing%20challenge%2C%20LTM%2C%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'9504d57d84391e0a017e1b50f37efc18','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'4bc6b9d730447f15c8d9eb5ebd07a5b6',NULL,'To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner, under the Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP), launched a focused fumigation support program. Fifteen fumigation machines were provided across fifteen gram panchayats, five each in Madanpur Rampur, Gudvella, and Paikmal, to ensure local ownership and long-term use.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner,\", \"summary\": \"To confront this growing challenge, LTM, in collaboration with its implementation partner, under the Integrated Village Development Program (IVDP), launched a focused fumigation support program. Fifteen fumigation machines were provided across fifteen gram panchayats, five each in Madanpur Rampur, Gudvella, and Paikmal, to ensure local ownership and long-term use.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=To%20confront%20this%20growing%20challenge