-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"The initiative benefits over 500 residents\", \"summary\": \"The initiative benefits over 500 residents. For women and adolescent girls, access to toilets within their homes ensures privacy and security, while for families, it means cleaner surroundings and reduced disease risk. By addressing one of the most fundamental needs of rural life, LTM continues to empower communities and champion sustainable rural development—one household, one village at a time.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20initiative%20benefits%20over%20500%20residents.%20For\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'The initiative benefits over 500 residents'),(2709,'A new community service centre in Subir is simplifying citizens’ access to government sche','Education & Skill Development','A new community service centre in Subir is simplifying citizens’ access to government schemes. The center, built under the IVDP, assists communities across health, livelihood, education, agriculture, and documentation.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=A%20new%20community%20service%20centre%20in%20Subir',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'59b81f58b9700c88e4e68101c563b28d','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'acfffa3f21e19ba27be19d3c005c503a',NULL,'A new community service centre in Subir is simplifying citizens’ access to government schemes. The center, built under the IVDP, assists communities across health, livelihood, education, agric