g this landscape. Each van operates as a mobile classroom with laptops and regional-language content. Local youth trained as instructors deliver lessons aligned with NIPUN Bharat and NEP 2020.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"In the tribal belts of Surgana and Wadwani, Maharashtra, digital access used to be limited\", \"summary\": \"In the tribal belts of Surgana and Wadwani, Maharashtra, digital access used to be limited. LTM’s FLN and STEM Mobile Van Program is changing this landscape. Each van operates as a mobile classroom with laptops and regional-language content. Local youth trained as instructors deliver lessons aligned with NIPUN Bharat and NEP 2020.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20tribal%20belts%20of%20Surgana%20and\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'In the tribal belts of Surgana and Wadwani, Maharashtra, digital access used to be limited'),(2711,'The program reaches 2,800 students across 32 schools','Education & Skill Development','The program reaches 2,800 students across 32 schools. Attendance stays steady at 70–75%, and learning outcomes have improved by 10–15%. For many children, these vans mark their first exposure to digital learning.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=The%20program%20reaches%202%2C800%20students%20across%2032',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dfdc79a131e7be48481756688053a408','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'9a5f63150589994097cfb58172420b08',NULL,'The program