pumps improve hygiene and living conditions in Assam',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"Raised toilets and hand pumps improve hygiene and living conditions in Assam\", \"summary\": \"Raised toilets and hand pumps improve hygiene and living conditions in Assam\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Raised%20toilets%20and%20hand%20pumps%20improve%20hygiene\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Raised toilets and hand pumps improve hygiene and living conditions in Assam'),(2714,'Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean','Healthcare & Nutrition','Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean-water access. LTM introduced raised toilets and elevated hand pumps to ensure functionality even during heavy flooding. The structures reduce waterlogging and prevent contamination. They also help communities avoid waterborne diseases.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Frequent%20floods%20in%20Mandia%20Block%20in%20Assam',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1138138a57cbeb45cd25926ff2691327','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'c55651893c3735d54935fbfcd93a1b0e',NULL,'Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean-water access. LTM introduced raised toilets and elevated hand pumps to ensure functionality even during heavy flooding. The structures reduce waterlogging and prevent contamination. They also help communities avoid waterborne diseases.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean\", \"summary\": \"Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean-water access. LTM introduced raised toilets and elevated hand pumps to ensure functionality even during heavy flooding. The structures reduce waterlogging and prevent contamination. They also help communities avoid waterborne diseases.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Frequent%20floods%20in%20Mandia%20Block%20in%20Assam\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Frequent floods in Mandia Block in Assam disrupted sanitation and clean'),(2715,'As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of t','Rural Development & Livelihood','As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of two vital traditional water bodies—the Vaduganeri M.I. Tank and Kadantheri Lake of Tamil Nadu. These efforts were carried out in Koothur Village Panchayat and Pilimisai Village of Alathur Block, Perambalur District, along with LTM’s implementation partner.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=As%20part%20of%20the%20Integrated%20Village%20Development',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'541892e8dc554c40e31bc38b6ca4d083','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'82027748b93e7ab9f94de6473dc99e3f',NULL,'As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of two vital traditional water bodies—the Vaduganeri M.I. Tank and Kadantheri Lake of Tamil Nadu. These efforts were carried out in Koothur Village Panchayat and Pilimisai Village of Alathur Block, Perambalur District, along with LTM’s implementation partner.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of t\", \"summary\": \"As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of two vital traditional water bodies—the Vaduganeri M.I. Tank and Kadantheri Lake of Tamil Nadu. These efforts were carried out in Koothur Village Panchayat and Pilimisai Village of Alathur Block, Perambalur District, along with LTM’s implementation partner.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=As%20part%20of%20the%20Integrated%20Village%20Development\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'As part of the Integrated Village Development Project, LTM supported the rejuvenation of t'),(2716,'For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communitie','Education & Skill Development','For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communities due to heavy siltation and weakened structures. Reduced storage capacity, declining groundwater levels, and irregular water availability had begun affecting irrigation, livestock needs, and overall livelihoods. To address this, a systematic rejuvenation effort was undertaken during FY 2025–26 to restore the tanks’ ecological and functional balance.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=For%20years%2C%20these%20traditional%20tanks%20had%20been',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1ff5e028262a6a8615886acae0f64510','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'b52b2667bd9d0c987120d39759adf068',NULL,'For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communities due to heavy siltation and weakened structures. Reduced storage capacity, declining groundwater levels, and irregular water availability had begun affecting irrigation, livestock needs, and overall livelihoods. To address this, a systematic rejuvenation effort was undertaken during FY 2025–26 to restore the tanks’ ecological and functional balance.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communitie\", \"summary\": \"For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communities due to heavy siltation and weakened structures. Reduced storage capacity, declining groundwater levels, and irregular water availability had begun affecting irrigation, livestock needs, and overall livelihoods. To address this, a systematic rejuvenation effort was undertaken during FY 2025–26 to restore the tanks’ ecological and functional balance.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=For%20years%2C%20these%20traditional%20tanks%20had%20been\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'For years, these traditional tanks had been losing their ability to serve local communitie'),(2717,'Creation of a Bio','Environment & Sustainability','Creation of a Bio-Island a raised mud formation at the center of the waterbody to encourage local biodiversity through the growth of native flora and fauna.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Creation%20of%20a%20Bio-Island%20a%20raised%20mud',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6672a19ce63bede22b6a77553d85a1b9','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'7b23378e633ca7d510f782c26b43f003',NULL,'Creation of a Bio-Island a raised mud formation at the center of the waterbody to encourage local biodiversity through the growth of native flora and fauna.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"Creation of a Bio\", \"summary\": \"Creation of a Bio-Island a raised mud formation at the center of the waterbody to encourage local biodiversity through the growth of native flora and fauna.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Creation%20of%20a%20Bio-Island%20a%20raised%20mud\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Creation of a Bio'),(2718,'Project Impact','Rural Development & Livelihood','Project Impact: The rejuvenated water bodies now benefit 356 farming families, supporting irrigation and livestock across 168 acres of agricultural land. The intervention has revived five open wells and two bore wells, with several more experiencing improved recharge, strengthening the community’s year-round access to water. Farmers are now better equipped to cultivate crops such as maize, cotton, pulses, and vegetables with greater reliability.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20The%20rejuvenated%20water%20bodies%20now',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'e843aad954a0c9affd2ba37144f19775','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'d3f99030d612e97f03352b14e22b73dd',NULL,'Project Impact: The rejuvenated water bodies now benefit 356 farming families, supporting irrigation and livestock across 168 acres of agricultural land. The intervention has revived five open wells and two bore wells, with several more experiencing improved recharge, strengthening the community’s year-round access to water. Farmers are now better equipped to cultivate crops such as maize, cotton, pulses, and vegetables with greater reliability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"Project Impact\", \"summary\": \"Project Impact: The rejuvenated water bodies now benefit 356 farming families, supporting irrigation and livestock across 168 acres of agricultural land. The intervention has revived five open wells and two bore wells, with several more experiencing improved recharge, strengthening the community’s year-round access to water. Farmers are now better equipped to cultivate crops such as maize, cotton, pulses, and vegetables with greater reliability.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=Project%20Impact%3A%20The%20rejuvenated%20water%20bodies%20now\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NUL