n.',NULL,NULL,'₹200','https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20villages%20of%20Gattu%20Block%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:23:47.700856+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cc35c73b5c3a1023664863752f536256','COMP_TOP200_058',NULL,'25676cd03542f37f41f254af83f140c8',NULL,'In the villages of Gattu Block in Jogulamba Gadwal District, many women from self-help groups (SHGs) relied on seasonal agricultural wage labor, earning around ₹200 per day during sowing and harvesting periods. For the rest of the year, limited income opportunities left families financially vulnerable. Under the IVDP 2024–25, Bhavishya Bharat Trust identified this gap and introduced micro-enterprise development to create steady, year-round livelihoods for women.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:23:47.700856','{\"title\": \"In the villages of Gattu Block in Jogulamba Gadwal District, many women from self\", \"summary\": \"In the villages of Gattu Block in Jogulamba Gadwal District, many women from self-help groups (SHGs) relied on seasonal agricultural wage labor, earning around ₹200 per day during sowing and harvesting periods. For the rest of the year, limited income opportunities left families financially vulnerable. Under the IVDP 2024–25, Bhavishya Bharat Trust identified this gap and introduced micro-enterprise development to create steady, year-round livelihoods for women.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ltm.com/services/esg#:~:text=In%20the%20villages%20of%20Gattu%20Block%20in\", \"budget_allocated\": \"₹200\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'₹200','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'In the villages of Gattu Block in Jogulamba Gadwal District, many women from self'),(2721,