stakeholders including the social sector and the government in ensuring long-term sustainability and impact of the CSR projects undertaken by the company.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=There%20is%20a%20dedicated%20team%20of%20full-time',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:16:12.064937+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'19f55f5fb6c6c20e16f30727b879ed93','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'9adde4e6f75d356520b80751ab0d6d27',NULL,'There is a dedicated team of full-time professionals at the CSR department who work on planning, implementing, monitoring, improving, and reporting on CSR activities and projects. The team works in close coordination with Bosch India Foundation colleagues based at plant locations, as well as coordinate with a range of external stakeholders including the social sector and the government in ensuring long-term sustainability and impact of the CSR projects undertaken by the company.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:16:12.064937','{\"title\": \"There is a dedicated team of full\", \"summary\": \"There is a dedicated team of full-time professionals at the CSR department who work on planning, implementing, monitoring, improving, and reporting on CSR activities and projects. The team works in close coordination with Bosch India Foundation colleagues based at plant locations, as well as coordinate with a range of external stakeholders including the social sector and the government in ensuring long-term sustainability and impact of the CSR projects undertaken by the company.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=There%20is%20a%20dedicated%20team%20of%20full-time\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'There is a dedicated team of full'),(2777,'Bosch India Foundation is the social engagement arm of Bosch in India','Education & Skill Development','Bosch India Foundation is the social engagement arm of Bosch in India. Founded in March 2008, it focused on vocational skills and holistic community development. The Foundation currently works in more than 230 Villages and several urban locations across 6 States in India. Its community based interventions promote skill development and integrated community development through environment & water conservation, promoting education, and preventive healthcare. The Foundation also executes CSR projects for Bosch entities in India, including Bosch Limited, Bosch Chassis System India Private Limited, Bosch Rexroth India Private Limited, Bosch Automotive Electronics India Private Limited, Engineering Tools Application & Services Automotive India Private Limited, etc. With a team of professionals driving the community development strategy, BIF has created a strong grassroots connect across its intervention locations and works very closely with government, non-profit organizations, corporates, and academic institutions.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.bosch.in/our-company/our-responsibility/corporate-social-responsibility/index-2.html#:~:text=Bosch%20India%20Foundation%20is%20the%20social%20engagement',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:16:12.064937+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3fc8f74cb0842d3e7ee63a52de72c39e','COMP_TOP200_064',NULL,'2ce25093677af71ab4c5b8ac032a3047',NULL,'Bosch India Foundation is the social engagement arm of Bosch in India. Founded in March 2008, it focused on vocational skills and holistic community development. The Foundation currently works in more than 230 Village