e Development Goals (SDGs). Importantly, our initiatives are not limited by sector; rather, all the programs we support are geared towards the common goal of diminishing inequality.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=HDFC%20Life%20adopts%20a%20comprehensive%20strategy%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:42.646546+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'169e5464d7dcdf56c80bc40585566224','COMP_TOP200_070',NULL,'90e9c477531007c0b0fd475b9805758c',NULL,'HDFC Life adopts a comprehensive strategy in the field of education, spanning various domains such as primary and secondary education, catering to the needs of physically challenged individuals, promoting early childhood education, enhancing financial awareness, establishing connections, and fostering livelihood opportunities. Our influence spans significant focus areas that align with the United Nations\' Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). Importantly, our initiatives are not limited by sector; rather, all the programs we support are geared towards the common goal of diminishing inequality.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"HDFC Life adopts a comprehensive strategy in the field of education, spanning various doma\", \"summary\": \"HDFC Life adopts a comprehensive strategy in the field of education, spanning various domains such as primary and secondary education, catering to the needs of physically challenged individuals, promoting early childhood education, enhancing financial awareness, establishing connections, and fostering livelihood opportunities. Our influence spans significant focus areas that align with the United Nations\' Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). Importantly, our initiatives are not limited by sector; rather, all the programs we support are geared towards the common goal of diminishing inequality.\", \"focus_area\