NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"Education & Skill Development Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- Foundational Learning / ECE – For building a skilled and capable workforce , foundational learning plays a pivotal role which includes basic education and skills training. By investing HDFC Life contributes to the developmental of more skilled labor pool for the future needs. We thrive to create stable and prosperous future of the country by enabling the youngsters. HDFC Life demonstrates its ethical responsibility by actively contributing to build a stronger nation by helping the youngsters to harness their talents at the maximum.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20Foundational%20Learning%20/%20ECE%20%E2%80%93%20For\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Education & Skill Development Initiative'),(2803,'Education & Skill Development Initiative','Education & Skill Development','- Early Childhood Education - Early childhood education lays the foundation for a child\'s cognitive, social, and emotional development. HDFC Life invests in this critical stage, to contribute to the long-term well-being and success of individuals, which can lead to positive societal outcomes. It also aligns with various United Nations SDGs, such as Quality Education (SDG 4), Reduced Inequalities (SDG 10), and Good Health and Well-being (SDG 3), demonstrating our commitment to global sustainability.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20Early%20Childhood%20Education%20-%20Early%20childhood',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:42.646546+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fe8db3196ff13dc674c81e937f78ccb3','COMP_TOP200_070',NULL,'b98d227621fa813a2c2d4b15737ca3b0',NULL,'- Early Childhood Education - Early childhood education lays the foundation for a child\'s cognitive, social, and emotional development. HDFC Life invests in this critical stage, to contribute to the long-term well-being and success of individuals, which can lead to positive societal outcomes. It also aligns with various United Nations SDGs, such as Quality Education (SDG 4), Reduced Inequalities (SDG 10), and Good Health and Well-being (SDG 3), demonstrating our commitment to global sustainability.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"Education & Skill Development Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- Early Childhood Education - Early childhood education lays the foundation for a child\'s cognitive, social, and emotional development. HDFC Life invests in this critical stage, to contribute to the long-term well-being and success of individuals, which can lead to positive societal outcomes. It also aligns with various United Nations SDGs, such as Quality Education (SDG 4), Reduced Inequalities (SDG 10), and Good Health and Well-being (SDG 3), demonstrating our commitment to global sustainability.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20Early%20Childhood%20Education%20-%20Early%20childhood\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Education & Skill Development Initiative'),(2804,'Corporate CSR Initiative','Schedule VII Statutory CSR','- Persons with Disability – Investing in the welfare of persons with disabilities provides tangible benefits to the society, individuals and nation at large. HDFC Life believes that everyone deserves equal opportunities and access to resources, thus, we promote these principles for the long term sustainability of beneficiaries through our several programs.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20Persons%20with%20Disability%20%E2%80%93%20Investing%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:42.646546+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'a032d5dff248297bfa70e08564a435a5','COMP_TOP200_070',NULL,'445053f4a3a54e4dcf43987cfec26778',NULL,'- Persons with Disability – Investing in the welfare of persons with disabilities provides tangible benefits to the society, individuals and nation at large. HDFC Life believes that everyone deserves equal opportunities and access to resources, thus, we promote these principles for the long term sustainability of beneficiaries through our several programs.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"Corporate CSR Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- Persons with Disability – Investing in the welfare of persons with disabilities provides tangible benefits to the society, individuals and nation at large. HDFC Life believes that everyone deserves equal opportunities and access to resources, thus, we promote these principles for the long term sustainability of beneficiaries through our several programs.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20Persons%20with%20Disability%20%E2%80%93%20Investing%20in\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'Corporate CSR Initiative'),(2805,'Education & Skill Development Initiative','Education & Skill Development','- Financial Literacy / Linkages / Livelihoods - HDFC Life Financial Literacy Program is a multi dimensional approach to build the financial capabilities of underprivileged individuals impacting communities at large. We support continuous efforts and targeted interventions to bring positive changes in the financial well-being of underprivileged individuals. We reach out the target audience and providing them financial education, entrepreneurial training, counseling and coaching. With a tailored approach we bring them technologically driven, innovative solutions. These individuals are also introduced to the social welfare schemes and subsidies targeted towards underprivileged population launched by Government.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20Financial%20Literacy%20/%20Linkages%20/%20Livelihoods',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:42.646546+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cbe96f86c1a50d5331f98fd34d4ff8e9','COMP_TOP200_070',NULL,'b8d35ce0bf024989811076dd7f5d4b63',NULL,'- Financial Literacy / Linkages / Livelihoods - HDFC Life Financial Literacy Program is a multi dimensional approach to build the financial capabilities of underprivileged individuals impacting communities at large. We support continuous efforts and targeted interventions to bring positive changes in the financial well-being of underprivileged individuals. We reach out the target audience and providing them financial education, entrepreneurial training, counseling and coaching. With a tailored approach we bring them technologically driven, innovative solutions. These individuals are also introduced to the social welfare schemes and subsidies targeted towards underprivileged population launched by Government.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',N