opment Goals (SDGs). Importantly, our initiatives are not limited by sector; rather, all the programs we support are geared towards the common goal of diminishing inequality. Thematic Focus • Elementary / Secondary Education • Person with Disabilities • Foundational Learning /ECE • Financial Literacy / Linkages / Livelihood KNOW MORE',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20EDUCATION%20AND%20LIVELIHOOD%20HDFC%20Life%20adopts',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:42.646546+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'29a224d260124592c0f458a43c813284','COMP_TOP200_070',NULL,'09d0331a3f589afe9b217e976c28f140',NULL,'- EDUCATION AND LIVELIHOOD HDFC Life adopts a comprehensive strategy in the field of education, spanning various domains such as primary and secondary education, catering to the needs of physically challenged individuals, promoting early childhood education, enhancing financial awareness, establishing connections, and fostering livelihood opportunities. Our influence spans significant focus areas that align with the United Nations\' Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). Importantly, our initiatives are not limited by sector; rather, all the programs we support are geared towards the common goal of diminishing inequality. Thematic Focus • Elementary / Secondary Education • Person with Disabilities • Foundational Learning /ECE • Financial Literacy / Linkages / Livelihood KNOW MORE',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"Education & Skill Development Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- EDUCATION AND LIVELIHOOD HDFC Life adopts a comprehensive strategy in the field of education, spanning various domains such as primary and secondary education, catering to the needs of physically challenged individuals, promoting early childhood education, enhancing financial awareness, establishing connections, and fosteri