fclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20HEALTHCARE%20AND%20SANITATION%20At%20HDFC%20Life%2C',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:19:42.646546+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f8c40fffff5188610360f7240f7e20f6','COMP_TOP200_070',NULL,'476ff233e69fcc44f51f08e97e7591fd',NULL,'- HEALTHCARE AND SANITATION At HDFC Life, investing in the realm of health and sanitation, underscores our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. By directing resources towards initiatives that improve health and sanitation standards in the communities we operate in, we actively contribute to enhancing the quality of life for individuals and families. This commitment goes beyond profit-driven motives, demonstrating our dedication to creating positive social impact and sustainable change. Through our CSR efforts focused on health and sanitation, we aim to uplift communities, promote access to better healthcare facilities, and advocate for hygienic practices, aligning our business objectives with the greater well-being of society as a whole. Thematic Focus • Paediatric Cancer Care, Heart Care, Clubfoot • Nutrition / Medical Camps • Sanitation • Care for Elderly KNOW MORE',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- HEALTHCARE AND SANITATION At HDFC Life, investing in the realm of health and sanitation, underscores our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. By directing resources towards initiatives that improve health and sanitation standards in the communities we operate in, we actively contribute to enhancing the quality of life for individuals and families. This commitment goes beyond profit-driven motives, demonstrating our dedication to creating positive social impact and sustainable change. Through our CSR efforts focused on health and sanitation, we aim to uplift communities, promote access to better 