as: Thematic Focus • Urban Forest Creation • Bio-diversity restoration • Water body rejuvenation • Renewable Energy Integration KNOW MORE',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:19:42.646546','{\"title\": \"Environment & Sustainability Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY HDFC Life aims to reduce carbon footprint and contribute to reducing climate change impact. The company undertakes several initiatives to reduce carbon footprint through rationalizing consumption, increasing the use of environment-friendly technology and responsibly sourced energy interventions are focused on four key areas: Thematic Focus • Urban Forest Creation • Bio-diversity restoration • Water body rejuvenation • Renewable Energy Integration KNOW MORE\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hdfclife.com/about-us#:~:text=-%20ENVIRONMENTAL%20SUSTAINABILITY%20HDFC%20Life%20aims%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Environment & Sustainability Initiative'),(2824,'Education & Skill Development Initiative','Education & Skill Development','- SWABHIMAAN AGENTS OF GOOD Swabhimaan AOG platform provides conducive environment to the employees where they can make a difference in the society. Every employee is encouraged to volunteer and contribute towards various social causes that they pledge for. The Swabhimaan - Agent of Good employee volunteering program is designed to enable all to participate in socially relevant and beneficial projects that allow them to collaborate in their eco-systems and contribute to the society, acting as change-makers.',NULL,N