to shoulder with glob','Environment & Sustainability','India has now entered a revolutionary phase and is standing shoulder to shoulder with global giants; simultaneously, there are abundant and unending growth opportunities in the domestic market as well. The growth rate of the Indian economy is more than 9% today, and while western companies are making a beeline for India to partake of this growth, homegrown firms have a distinct upper hand. It is a fact that we are more familiar with the domestic market than any other international or foreign company and localisation is of great importance in the new business environment.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.muthootfinance.com/#:~:text=India%20has%20now%20entered%20a%20revolutionary%20phase',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:25:00.546316+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bbbbf78081e0efcfcd0faa6836e18d09','COMP_TOP200_071',NULL,'c2c8a3d8c0e1d6946b84cd4371d00b04',NULL,'India has now entered a revolutionary phase and is standing shoulder to shoulder with global giants; simultaneously, there are abundant and unending growth opportunities in the domestic market as well. The growth rate of the Indian economy is more than 9% today, and while western companies are making a beeline for India to partake of this growth, homegrown firms have a distinct upper hand. It is a fact that we are more familiar with the domestic market than any other international or foreign company and localisation is of great importance in the new business environment.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:25:00.546316','{\"title\": \"India has now entered a revolutionary phase and is standing shoulder to shoulder with glob\", \"summary\": \"India has now entered a revolutionary phase and is standing shoulder to shoulder with global giants; simultaneously, there are abundant and unending growth opportunities in the domestic market a