ts. 2 organizations in Malaysia were identified to donate to, which are Mercy (Medical Relief Society Malaysia) and NADMA (The National Disaster Management Agency). The handover ceremony to NADMA was held on 1st July 2020 at Office of the Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (Special Functions) at Putrajaya. The cheque was received by Yb Datuk Seri Mohd Redzuan Bin Md Yusof, Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (special tasks).',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.persistent.com/company-overview/community/#:~:text=At%20Persistent%20Malaysia%20was%20allocated%20USD25%2C000%20as',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:26:17.139315+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4b9f59b05b7092151f05d048ce20f210','COMP_TOP200_098',NULL,'f76a545a1016c5256e56b23af1f57e05',NULL,'At Persistent Malaysia was allocated USD25,000 as donation to support Malaysia’s COVID-19 relief efforts. 2 organizations in Malaysia were identified to donate to, which are Mercy (Medical Relief Society Malaysia) and NADMA (The National Disaster Management Agency). The handover ceremony to NADMA was held on 1st July 2020 at Office of the Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (Special Functions) at Putrajaya. The cheque was received by Yb Datuk Seri Mohd Redzuan Bin Md Yusof, Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (special tasks).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:26:17.139315','{\"title\": \"At Persistent Malaysia was allocated USD25,000 as donation to support Malaysia’s COVID\", \"summary\": \"At Persistent Malaysia was allocated USD25,000 as donation to support Malaysia’s COVID-19 relief efforts. 2 organizations in Malaysia were identified to donate to, which are Mercy (Medical Relief Society Malaysia) and NADMA (The National Disaster Management Agency). The handover ceremony to NADMA was held on 1st July 2020 at Office of the Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (Special Functions) at Putrajaya. The cheque was received by Yb Datuk Seri Mohd Redzuan Bin Md Yusof, Minister in the Prime Minister’s Department (special tasks).\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.persistent.com/company-overview/community/#:~:text=At%20Persistent%20Malaysia%20was%20allocated%20USD25%2C000%20as\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'At Persistent Malaysia was allocated USD25,000 as donation to support Malaysia’s COVID'),(2927,'Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth','Environment & Sustainability','Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth for the organization while catalysing positive economic, social and environmental value creation for its stakeholders in the short and long term.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Axis%20Bank%20is%20guided%20by%20a%20strategy',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:14:31.907595+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6f829ab80766dfd40bcf0d455ddb3efa','COMP_TOP200_101',NULL,'2ca0c73df3d9869aeb4f01739988c961',NULL,'Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth for the organization while catalysing positive economic, social and environmental value creation for its stakeholders in the short and long term.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:14:31.907595','{\"title\": \"Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth\", \"summary\": \"Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth for the organization while catalysing positive economic, social and environmental value creation for its stakeholders in the short and long term.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Axis%20Bank%20is%20guided%20by%20a%20strategy\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Axis Bank is guided by a strategy that focuses on achieving sustainable, profitable growth'),(2928,'Our CSR philosophy has always been to make a meaningful and measurable impact to the lives','Education & Skill Development','Our CSR philosophy has always been to make a meaningful and measurable impact to the lives of economically, physically and socially challenged communities of the country through an integrated approach of development. Our approach to community action aims to leverage our national presence, our strengths as a financial institution, and the strength of collaboration to bring positive and sustainable change in the lives of citizens in some of the most socio-economically deprived parts of the country. Overseen by our CSR Committee of the Board and guided by our CSR Policy, our interventions adopt a multi-dimensional approach focusing on creating sustainable livelihoods in rural India, promoting education and skills development, supporting financial literacy and financial inclusion of un-banked and underbanked sections of the society and promoting environmental sustainability, and driven directly by the Bank, the Axis Bank Foundation or their experienced implementation partners.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.axis.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20philosophy%20has%20always%20been%20to',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:14:31.907595+0