unitie\", \"summary\": \"We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communities that we serve and thereby catalyse overall development. Being a global pharma company, we strongly believe that business and responsibility go hand-in-hand. Lasting value can only be created, if the right balance between the triple bottom lines of economic, environmental and social is achieved.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20will%20leverage%20our%20people%2C%20expertise%20and\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'We will leverage our people, expertise and networks to address the needs of the communitie'),(2934,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur','Education & Skill Development','We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20develop%20model%20schools%20in%20and%20around',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:29:08.488045+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fef9601c41d137d2bf93a35c7445ceae','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'98ae3b646d757892ae372c93758376fc',NULL,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{\"title\": \"We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur\", \"summary\": \"We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rural school students to access and enjoy equal educational and development opportunities. Apart from building robust infrastructure, we help to implement technology-based learning programmes in schools. We also organise and support various co-curricular activities and related programmes, as operated through schools and educational institutions, located near our areas of operations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=We%20develop%20model%20schools%20in%20and%20around\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We develop model schools in and around our served communities, enabling and empowering rur'),(2935,'The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non','Healthcare & Nutrition','The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20Sun%20Pharma%20Science%20Foundation%20is%20an',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:29:08.488045+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'bec07626fb55663f6156307b2798d22b','COMP_TOP200_103',NULL,'60f9e464884e4e7d59d2836a37b4d647',NULL,'The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:29:08.488045','{\"title\": \"The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non\", \"summary\": \"The Sun Pharma Science Foundation is an independent non-profit organisation, registered under the Societies Act. Dedicated to promoting scientific endeavours in India, the Foundation encourages and rewards excellence in the medical and pharmaceutical sciences while channelling national and international knowledge and expertise in all subjects connected with the treatment of diseases that afflict humanity at large.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://sunpharma.com/csr/#:~:text=The%20Sun%20Pharma%20Science%20Foundation%20is%20an\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition'