0part%20of%20the%20Bank%E2%80%99s%20various%20%E2%80%9CAzadi\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'As part of the Bank’s various “Azadi Ka Amrit Mahotsav” celebrations, Indian Bank has spon'),(3018,'Indian Bank has dedicated a school bus “Tata Winger School 18 Seater SCV” to Tapan Rehabil','Education & Skill Development','Indian Bank has dedicated a school bus “Tata Winger School 18 Seater SCV” to Tapan Rehabilitation Society Karnal to facilitate the children with disability, which will help Tapan society to pick up the children from remote areas across Karnal district and bring them to the centre. On behalf of the Bank, Sh. Mahesh Kumar Bajaj, GM(TMO/BPR) Corporate Office, Chennai and Sh. Ashok Patnaik, FGM Chandigarh handed over the Keys of vehicle to the Founder Director Dr. Sujata (who was brand ambassador in Beti Bachao Beti Padhao “movement in Haryana) at Tapan Rehabilitation Society, Nilokheri, Karnal.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://indianbank.bank.in/en/corporate-social-responsiblity#:~:text=Indian%20Bank%20has%20dedicated%20a%20school%20bus',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:21:56.295652+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'8567ba5af5e4eccfcf72c7d32507be03','COMP_TOP200_113',NULL,'519cd88011808416ef947ac740044bb7',NULL,'Indian Bank has dedicated a school bus “Tata Winger School 18 Seater SCV” to Tapan Rehabilitation Society Karnal to facilitate the children with disability, which will help Tapan society to pick up the children from remote areas across Karnal district and bring them to the centre. On behalf of the Bank, Sh. Mahesh Kumar Bajaj, GM(TMO/BPR) Corporate Office, Chennai and Sh. Ashok Patnaik, FGM Chandigarh handed over the Keys of vehicle to the Founder Director Dr. Sujata (who was brand ambassador in Beti Bachao Beti Padhao “movement in Haryana) at Tapan Rehabilitation Society, Nilokheri, Karnal.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652','{\"title\": \"Indian Bank has dedicated a school bus “Tata Winger School 18 Seater SCV” to Tapan Rehabil\", \"summary\": \"Indian Bank has dedicated a school bus “Tata Winger School 18 Seater SCV” to Tapan Rehabilitation Society Karnal to facilitate the children with disability, which will help Tapan society to pick up the children from remote areas across Karnal district and bring them to the centre. On behalf of the Bank, Sh. Mahesh Kumar Bajaj, GM(TMO/BPR) Corporate Office, Chennai and Sh. Ashok Patnaik, FGM Chandigarh handed over the Keys of vehicle to the Founder Director Dr. Sujata (who was brand ambassador in Beti Bachao Beti Padhao “movement in Haryana) at Tapan Rehabilitation Society, Nilokheri, Karnal.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://indianbank.bank.in/en/corporate-social-responsiblity#:~:text=Indian%20Bank%20has%20dedicated%20a%20school%20bus\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Indian Bank has dedicated a school bus “Tata Winger School 18 Seater SCV” to Tapan Rehabil'),(3019,'Hon’ble Chief Minister of Uttar Pradesh Shri Yogi Adityanath ji flagged off three ambulanc','Healthcare & Nutrition','Hon’ble Chief Minister of Uttar Pradesh Shri Yogi Adityanath ji flagged off three ambulances from his residence which were donated by Indian Bank under CSR activity. Out of three two ambulances were allocated to KGMC Hospital, while One ambulance was allocated to Civil Hospital, Lucknow. The above function was also graced by the Executive Director of Indian Bank Shri Imran Amin Siddiqui along with Shri Ravinder Singh (General Manager- Indian Bank), Shri Pankaj Tripathi (Field General Manager, Lucknovw) and Shri Prabahat Ranjan Sinha (Zonal Manager, Lucknow).',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://indianbank.bank.in/en/corporate-social-responsiblity#:~:text=Hon%E2%80%99ble%20Chief%20Minister%20of%20Uttar%20Pradesh%20Shri',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:21:56.295652+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'64981e0d51a5e33ce9f99c3f593b750a','COMP_TOP200_113',NULL,'9278397088b035a968e7d7816876a8d5',NULL,'Hon’ble Chief Minister of Uttar Pradesh Shri Yogi Adityanath ji flagged off three ambulances from his residence which were donated by Indian Bank under CSR activity. Out of three two ambulances were allocated to KGMC Hospital, while One ambulance was allocated to Civil Hospital, Lucknow. The above function was also graced by the Executive Director of Indian Bank Shri Imran Amin Siddiqui along with Shri Ravinder Singh (General Manager- Indian Bank), Shri Pankaj Tripathi (Field General Manager, Lucknovw) and Shri Prabahat Ranjan Sinha (Zonal Manager, Lucknow).',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:21:56.295652','{\"title\": \"Hon’ble Chief Minister of Uttar Pradesh Shri Yogi Adityanath ji flagged off three ambulanc\", \"summary\": \"Hon’ble Chief Minister of Uttar Pradesh Shri Yogi Adityanath ji flagged off three ambulances from his residence which were donated by Indian Bank under CSR activity. Out of three two ambulances were allocated to KGMC Hospital, while One ambulance was allocated to Civil Hospital, Lucknow. The above function was also graced by the Executive Director of Indian Bank Shri Imran Amin Siddiqui along with Shri Ravinder Singh (General Manager- Indian Bank), Shri Pankaj Tripathi (Field General Manager, Lucknovw) and Shri Prabaha