ULL,'{}',NULL,'Statutory Annual Filing','Statutory CSR & Sustainability Report',NULL,'Official CSR Report PDF'),(3069,'Oil India Limited is deeply committed to advancing its Environmental, Social, and Governan','Education & Skill Development','Oil India Limited is deeply committed to advancing its Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) goals, reflecting its dedication to sustainable development and ethical practices. The company focuses on reducing its environmental impact through initiatives aimed at minimizing carbon emissions, improving resource efficiency, and investing in renewable energy technologies. Socially, OIL prioritizes community engagement, including educational and health programs, skill development, livelihood programs to enhance the well-being of the regions it operates in. OIL adheres to the highest standards of transparency, accountability, and ethical conduct, ensuring robust management practices and stakeholder engagement. By integrating these ESG principles into its core operations, OIL aims to foster long-term value creation and contribute positively to society and the environment.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.oil-india.com/sustainability/sustainability-home#:~:text=Oil%20India%20Limited%20is%20deeply%20committed%20to',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:25:41.351895+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'4667b1240e4b40f6fd80329ab08feeeb','COMP_TOP200_123',NULL,'e26178e8f020d081fce069786e442f5e',NULL,'Oil India Limited is deeply committed to advancing its Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) goals, reflecting its dedication to sustainable development and ethical practices. The company focuses on reducing its environmental impact through initiatives aimed at minimizing carbon emissions, improving resource efficiency, and investing in renewable energy technologies. Socially, OIL prioritizes community engagement, including educational and health programs, skill development, livelihood programs to enhance the well-being of the regions it op