₹ 4','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'Corporate CSR Initiative'),(3182,'We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in','Healthcare & Nutrition','We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in our community. Recognizing the critical importance of soil and water quality, we actively contribute to water conservation. Through these collective endeavors, we strive to improve ground water levels to boost agriculture and drinking water availability for villagers. Our focus on these initiatives reflects our commitment to building a sustainable future that prioritizes the well-being of the present and future generations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20deeply%20committed%20to%20ensuring%20environmental',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:17:41.284416+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'fb62144dedcdebdf931cb5d82a3bc3a6','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,'9b683902d07728d8d05e8a1822f13042',NULL,'We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in our community. Recognizing the critical importance of soil and water quality, we actively contribute to water conservation. Through these collective endeavors, we strive to improve ground water levels to boost agriculture and drinking water availability for villagers. Our focus on these initiatives reflects our commitment to building a sustainable future that prioritizes the well-being of the present and future generations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{\"title\": \"We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in\", \"summary\": \"We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in our community. Recognizing the critical importance of soil and water quality, we actively contribute to water conservation. Through these collective endeavors, we strive to improve ground water levels to boost agriculture and drinking water availability for villagers. Our focus on these initiatives reflects our commitment to building a sustainable future that prioritizes the well-being of the present and future generations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20deeply%20committed%20to%20ensuring%20environmental\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'We are deeply committed to ensuring environmental sustainability and ecological balance in'),(3183,'Environment & Sustainability Initiative','Environment & Sustainability','- By working hand in hand with local communities, environmental organizations, and government bodies.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20By%20working%20hand%20in%20hand%20with',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:17:41.284416+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'3ab100b92113c944bda385ff46b8ec85','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,'fe70d39c27e22f2982ae6488649681b0',NULL,'- By working hand in hand with local communities, environmental organizations, and government bodies.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{\"title\": \"Environment & Sustainability Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- By working hand in hand with local communities, environmental organizations, and government bodies.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20By%20working%20hand%20in%20hand%20with\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Environment & Sustainability Initiative'),(3184,'Environment & Sustainability Initiative','Environment & Sustainability','- We aim to create a lasting and positive impact on the environment.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20We%20aim%20to%20create%20a%20lasting',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:17:41.284416+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'87857cdc443b111a20b33bc3a77ca68c','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,'89a06628ad873a5b8fd8564861543ef8',NULL,'- We aim to create a lasting and positive impact on the environment.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{\"title\": \"Environment & Sustainability Initiative\", \"summary\": \"- We aim to create a lasting and positive impact on the environment.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=-%20We%20aim%20to%20create%20a%20lasting\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Environment & Sustainability Initiative'),(3185,'We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emp','Education & Skill Development','We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emphasis on inclusive education and vocational training. Our initiatives target youth and women, empowering them with the skills needed for meaningful employment as well as helping existing technicians with upskilling programs. Through focused projects, we aim to bridge skill gaps and create opportunities for diverse segments of the population. Our goal is not only to enhance livelihoods but also to promote entrepreneurship, fostering economic growth and self-sustainability. We envision a society where everyone can unlock their full potential and contribute meaningfully to the workforce and community.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20fostering%20skill%20and',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:17:41.284416+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'0fb1cdc9a009edcd52c2773b468c95e5','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,'c23e2a9fc2e1d6c8f4251e1ea70da804',NULL,'We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emphasis on inclusive education and vocational training. Our initiatives target youth and women, empowering them with the skills needed for meaningful employment as well as helping existing technicians with upskilling programs. Through focused projects, we aim to bridge skill gaps and create opportunities for diverse segments of the population. Our goal is not only to enhance livelihoods but also to promote entrepreneurship, fostering economic growth and self-sustainability. We envision a society where everyone can unlock their full potential and contribute meaningfully to the workforce and community.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{\"title\": \"We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emp\", \"summary\": \"We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emphasis on inclusive education and vocational training. Our initiatives target youth and women, empowering them with the skills needed for meaningful employment as well as helping existing technicians with upskilling programs. Through focused projects, we aim to bridge skill gaps and create opportunities for diverse segments of the population. Our goal is not only to enhance livelihoods but also to promote entrepreneurship, fostering economic growth and self-sustainability. We envision a society where everyone can unlock their full potential and contribute meaningfully to the workforce and community.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=We%20are%20dedicated%20to%20fostering%20skill%20and\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We are dedicated to fostering skill and entrepreneurship development, placing a strong emp'),(3186,'Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well','Education & Skill Development','Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well-being of the community around our manufacturing units. Our focus is on promoting education for all, targeting underprivileged communities by providing remedial classes as well as offering scholarship for girls to create an inclusive learning environment. Beyond education, we embark on livelihood enhancement projects tailored to the unique needs of the community, ensuring a holistic approach to care. Our goal is to build a community that values continuous learning while prioritizing the care and support needed for each member to thrive.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=Our%20mission%20is%20rooted%20in%20a%20steadfast',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:17:41.284416+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'c5c8d1042ece4f990864b80cffab5cc3','COMP_TOP200_136',NULL,'af4886dce95e366a0df0e3a7fb74bac5',NULL,'Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well-being of the community around our manufacturing units. Our focus is on promoting education for all, targeting underprivileged communities by providing remedial classes as well as offering scholarship for girls to create an inclusive learning environment. Beyond education, we embark on livelihood enhancement projects tailored to the unique needs of the community, ensuring a holistic approach to care. Our goal is to build a community that values continuous learning while prioritizing the care and support needed for each member to thrive.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:17:41.284416','{\"title\": \"Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well\", \"summary\": \"Our mission is rooted in a steadfast commitment to enhancing the overall well-being of the community around our manufacturing units. Our focus is on promoting education for all, targeting underprivileged communities by providing remedial classes as well as offering scholarship for girls to create an inclusive learning environment. Beyond education, we embark on livelihood enhancement projects tailored to the unique needs of the community, ensuring a holistic approach to care. Our goal is to build a community that values continuous learning while prioritizing the care and support needed for each member to thrive.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.crompton.co.in/pages/csr#:~:text=Our%20mission%20is%20rooted%20in%20a%20steadfast\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'