sr#:~:text=The%20program%20has%20a%20three-pronged%20approach%20to\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'The program has a three'),(3208,'Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issue','Education & Skill Development','Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issues holistically, emphasizing community capacity building and awareness on various health issues, including preventive healthcare, first-aid, nutrition, anemia, kitchen gardening, immunization, adolescence health, water and sanitation, and access to health services via telemedicine. In Kanpur and Kanpur Rural, Uttar Pradesh, the foundation supports 60-70 \'Ekal Vidyalaya\' centers, providing informal primary education to tribal children. The initiative also includes backing \'Swachh Bharat Abhiyan\' with dustbin units in North-West Delhi, aiding the \'Paryas Society\' in Himachal Pradesh with dengue-testing kits, and supporting the TB eradication program of \'Delhi Commonwealth Women Association.\' Additionally, assistance is provided to \'The Lepra Trust India\' for leprosy-affected families.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.lalpathlabs.com/csr#:~:text=Under%20the%20comprehensive%20community%20health%20initiative%2C%20LPL',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:18:37.649201+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'1301b533da89e3c298b4a3ee57560f00','COMP_TOP200_142',NULL,'ab5f279c31c72a738b2c6767bb562870',NULL,'Under the comprehensive community health initiative, LPL Foundation addresses health issues holistically, emphasizing community capacity building and awareness on various health issues, including preventive healthcare, first-aid, nutrition, anemia, kitchen gardening, 