d on May 1, 1995 under the Companies Act, 1956 as Info Edge (In','Education & Skill Development','The company was incorporated on May 1, 1995 under the Companies Act, 1956 as Info Edge (India) Private Limited and became a public limited company on April 27, 2006. Starting with a classified recruitment online business, naukri.com, Info Edge has grown and diversified rapidly, setting benchmarks as a pioneer for others to follow. Driven by innovation, creativity, an experienced and talented leadership team and a strong culture of entrepreneurship, today, it is India’s premier online classifieds company in recruitment, matrimony, real estate, education and related services.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.infoedge.in/About/Overview#:~:text=The%20company%20was%20incorporated%20on%20May%201%2C',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:22:36.100786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b86e2238fde685cc27da610580c9670c','COMP_TOP200_146',NULL,'995404265038801f4c702004295d2674',NULL,'The company was incorporated on May 1, 1995 under the Companies Act, 1956 as Info Edge (India) Private Limited and became a public limited company on April 27, 2006. Starting with a classified recruitment online business, naukri.com, Info Edge has grown and diversified rapidly, setting benchmarks as a pioneer for others to follow. Driven by innovation, creativity, an experienced and talented leadership team and a strong culture of entrepreneurship, today, it is India’s premier online classifieds company in recruitment, matrimony, real estate, education and related services.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:36.100786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:36.100786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:22:36.100786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:22:36.100786','{\"title\": \"The company was incorporated on May 1, 1995 under the Companies Act, 1956 as Info Edge (In\", \"summary\": \"The company was incorporated on May 1, 1995 under the Companies Act, 1956 as Info Edge (India) Private Limited and became a public limited co