 360 ONE Foundation reinforces the group’s commitment to maximise both financial and so'),(3275,'At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods','Rural Development & Livelihood','At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods. Our approach goes beyond simple cheque-writing. We leverage catalytic capital, where every rupee spent gives assurance that it has resulted in real change, not just the promise of one.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=At%20360%20ONE%20Foundation%2C%20we%20back%20bold',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.540174+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'5cac7a55a13a6c54c7503e386fd8c72f','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,'203a347fd97d96dfd4afd86955ab5cf3',NULL,'At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods. Our approach goes beyond simple cheque-writing. We leverage catalytic capital, where every rupee spent gives assurance that it has resulted in real change, not just the promise of one.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{\"title\": \"At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods\", \"summary\": \"At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods. Our approach goes beyond simple cheque-writing. We leverage catalytic capital, where every rupee spent gives assurance that it has resulted in real change, not just the promise of one.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=At%20360%20ONE%20Foundation%2C%20we%20back%20bold\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'At 360 ONE Foundation, we back bold ideas that move the needle on livelihoods'),(3276,'India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods','Rural Development & Livelihood','India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods. Despite the country’s demographic dividend, its youth face rising underemployment due to limited job creation and mismatched skills. At the same time, millions of nano enterprises remain mostly unorganised, informal and hyper-local. Unlocking the full potential of India’s workforce and enterprises is critical to India’s economic growth.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=India%20faces%20a%20dual%20challenge%20with%20respect',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.540174+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'84be438bdd9d0bede31044964aa03245','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,'7135152acb8c92089a2032b06dd3c8bb',NULL,'India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods. Despite the country’s demographic dividend, its youth face rising underemployment due to limited job creation and mismatched skills. At the same time, millions of nano enterprises remain mostly unorganised, informal and hyper-local. Unlocking the full potential of India’s workforce and enterprises is critical to India’s economic growth.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{\"title\": \"India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods\", \"summary\": \"India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods. Despite the country’s demographic dividend, its youth face rising underemployment due to limited job creation and mismatched skills. At the same time, millions of nano enterprises remain mostly unorganised, informal and hyper-local. Unlocking the full potential of India’s workforce and enterprises is critical to India’s economic growth.\", \"focus_area\": \"Rural Development & Livelihood\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=India%20faces%20a%20dual%20challenge%20with%20respect\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Rural Development & Livelihood',NULL,'India faces a dual challenge with respect to livelihoods'),(3277,'We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerab','Education & Skill Development','We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerable communities towards formal credit sources. We believe in holistic, long-term solutions which not only develop skills and capacities, digital and financial literacy, and enable market and government linkages, but also overlay financial access and inclusion. This mainstreams individuals and small businesses into the formal economy to facilitate sustained, market-linked livelihoods.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20strive%20to%20build%20necessary%20bridges%20between',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.540174+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'24df040dcd36e1e972a7346c89e709e6','COMP_TOP200_156',NULL,'5a3f00ff75678de0bd28a52aa3855074',NULL,'We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerable communities towards formal credit sources. We believe in holistic, long-term solutions which not only develop skills and capacities, digital and financial literacy, and enable market and government linkages, but also overlay financial access and inclusion. This mainstreams individuals and small businesses into the formal economy to facilitate sustained, market-linked livelihoods.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.540174','{\"title\": \"We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerab\", \"summary\": \"We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerable communities towards formal credit sources. We believe in holistic, long-term solutions which not only develop skills and capacities, digital and financial literacy, and enable market and government linkages, but also overlay financial access and inclusion. This mainstreams individuals and small businesses into the formal economy to facilitate sustained, market-linked livelihoods.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20strive%20to%20build%20necessary%20bridges%20between\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'We strive to build necessary bridges between informal and formal sectors, guiding vulnerab'),(3278,'Embracing our role as impact architects, 360 ONE Foundation leads the way in creating infl','Education & Skill Development','Embracing our role as impact architects, 360 ONE Foundation leads the way in creating influential thought leadership with leading industry partners. To encourage adoption of these game-changing approaches, we publicly share our reports, articles, and insights with the ecosystem, helping stakeholders learn, adapt, and accelerate impact. Explore our resource library and join the journey.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.360.one/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Embracing%20our%20role%20as%2