 business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined and focuses on sustained and effective Corporate Social Responsibility Projects. Today we define Corporate Social Responsibility as the way a company balances it’s economic, social and environmental objectives while addressing stakeholder expectations and enhancing shareholder value. Our employees are also encouraged to volunteer their time and skills and enjoy the experience of giving back to the communities in which they work.Read more',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/csr-policy#:~:text=As%20a%20responsible%20business%2C%203B%20BlackBio%20Dx',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'890aac9d269072e5af82e38489d85afb','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'b3cc7256405fa800c04423143956ca45',NULL,'As a responsible business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined and focuses on sustained and effective Corporate Social Responsibility Projects. Today we define Corporate Social Responsibility as the way a company balances it’s economic, social and environmental objectives while addressing stakeholder expectations and enhancing shareholder value. Our employees are also encouraged to volunteer their time and skills and enjoy the experience of giving back to the communities in which they work.Read more',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{\"title\": \"As a responsible business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined a\", \"summary\": \"As a responsible business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined and focuses on sustained and effective Corporate Social Responsibility Projects. Today we define Corporate Social Responsibility as the way a company balances it’s economic, social and environmental objectives while addressing stakeholder expectations and enhancing shareholder value. Our employees are also encouraged to volunteer their time and skills and enjoy the experience of giving back to the communities in which they work.Read more\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://3bblackbio.com/csr-policy#:~:text=As%20a%20responsible%20business%2C%203B%20BlackBio%20Dx\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'As a responsible business, 3B BlackBio Dx Limited takes pride in being socially inclined a'),(3280,'We believe that healthcare shouldn’t be a privilege but the right of every individual','Healthcare & Nutrition','We believe that healthcare shouldn’t be a privilege but the right of every individual. With this in mind, our healthcare initiatives are implemented directly or through collaboration with communities and NGOs etc. The Company intends to improve the lives of children and adults and mission to ensure health with dignity to underprivileged children and adults.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=We%20believe%20that%20healthcare%20shouldn%E2%80%99t%20be%20a',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'446eb696d0584d3efb1d378eeb090dd6','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'cb51e26a52a6342b72a4813b4f063e47',NULL,'We believe that healthcare shouldn’t be a privilege but the right of every individual. With this in mind, our healthcare initiatives are implemented directly or through collaboration with communities and NGOs etc. The Company intends to improve the lives of children and adults and mission to ensure health with dignity to underprivileged children and adults.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08: