 believe in customizing the implementation of CSR activities as per the need of the soci'),(3284,'Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessib','Healthcare & Nutrition','Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessible',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Cachar%20Cancer%20Hospital%20%26%20Research%20Centre%20is',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'841d80109dde6875fa51832e23f3c2c5','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'49a1ded6d0c54d1bd6707745ed4c253f',NULL,'Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessible',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{\"title\": \"Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessib\", \"summary\": \"Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessible\", \"focus_area\": \"Healthcare & Nutrition\", \"source_url\": \"https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Cachar%20Cancer%20Hospital%20%26%20Research%20Centre%20is\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Healthcare & Nutrition',NULL,'Cachar Cancer Hospital & Research Centre is committed to providing affordable and accessib'),(3285,'to support the hospital in its mission to expand access to quality cancer care and bring h','Healthcare & Nutrition','to support the hospital in its mission to expand access to quality cancer care and bring hope to',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-respo