),(3288,'During the Amphan super','Education & Skill Development','During the Amphan super-cyclone, Ramakrishna Mission undertook a project for relief and rehabilitation services. The project\'s two objectives included: providing primary relief and then ascertaining the number of houses adversely affected by the cyclone and helping them rebuild their roofs for the number of around 199 houses. 3B made a contribution for the construction of a primary school as part of the relief and rehabilitation services.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=During%20the%20Amphan%20super-cyclone%2C%20Ramakrishna%20Mission%20undertook',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b09df1317a6bc78a6a4cbc23cdd06fc0','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'e78b2b3e4709328cc1be89edbdad317a',NULL,'During the Amphan super-cyclone, Ramakrishna Mission undertook a project for relief and rehabilitation services. The project\'s two objectives included: providing primary relief and then ascertaining the number of houses adversely affected by the cyclone and helping them rebuild their roofs for the number of around 199 houses. 3B made a contribution for the construction of a primary school as part of the relief and rehabilitation services.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{\"title\": \"During the Amphan super\", \"summary\": \"During the Amphan super-cyclone, Ramakrishna Mission undertook a project for relief and rehabilitation services. The project\'s two objectives included: providing primary relief and then ascertaining the number of houses adversely affected by the cyclone and helping them rebuild their roofs for the number of around 199 houses. 3B made a contribution for the construction of a primary school as part of the relief and rehabilitation services.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=During%20the%20Amphan%20super-cyclone%2C%20Ramakrishna%20Mission%20undertook\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'During the Amphan super'),(3289,'Muskaan is a non','Education & Skill Development','Muskaan is a non-profit organization which works with vulnerable slum communities in Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh on issues of education, identity, violence, health and survival needs. Their primary focus is on the education of children unable to access mainstream schools. Other programs differ across slums, depending on the critical needs of the community and the capacities and resources within the organization to address them. They recognized a need to sustain the effort to really make ‘education’ a workable option for children in these communities, and therefore took on the decision to formulate an organization. New members joining the team brought their perspective on poverty and gender and enriched the response of the organization.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Muskaan%20is%20a%20non-profit%20organization%20which%20works',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'11217448de584653f6c75fbd026fe696','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'6a0aac52fc584e86d223491023497ad4',NULL,'Muskaan is a non-profit organization which works with vulnerable slum communities in Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh on issues of education, identity, violence, health and survival needs. Their primary focus is on the education of children unable to access mainstream schools. Other programs differ across slums, depending on the critical needs of the community and the capacities and resources within the organization to address them. They recognized a need to sustain the effort to really make ‘education’ a workable option for children in these communities, and therefore took on the decision to formulate an organization. New members joining the team brought their perspective on poverty and gender and enriched the response of the organization.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{\"title\": \"Muskaan is a non\", \"summary\": \"Muskaan is a non-profit organization which works with vulnerable slum communities in Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh on issues of education, identity, violence, health and survival needs. Their primary focus is on the education of children unable to access mainstream schools. Other programs differ across slums, depending on the critical needs of the community and the capacities and resources within the organization to address them. They recognized a need to sustain the effort to really make ‘education’ a workable option for children in these communities, and therefore took on the decision to formulate an organization. New members joining the team brought their perspective on poverty and gender and enriched the response of the organization.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Muskaan%20is%20a%20non-profit%20organization%20which%20works\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Muskaan is a non'),(3290,'Under their CSR initiative, 3B collaborated with Muskaan to facilitate projects under “Liv','Education & Skill Development','Under their CSR initiative, 3B collaborated with Muskaan to facilitate projects under “Livelihood Development Programs”; the aim of one of the programs is to provide baking training to a group of 20 students at IHM Bhopal. This was done in joint collaboration with IHM to bear the cost of the education of these students. This initiative will enable these students to find and sustain a good means of making an income and supporting themselves and their families while Muskaan will provide support to them to help develop and improve their resumes to help increase their chances of successfully getting employed. 3B also made additional contributions to cover the cost of transportation for these students and provided financial support to some of the older students to set up their food carts in market areas to sustain themselves and support their families.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Under%20their%20CSR%20initiative%2C%203B%20collaborated%20with',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'6c1458c4d6eb7dc9f2cfdf3ad3b191c3','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'a4d3dc20ebd231cd94aabea3f35f2cee',NULL,'Under their CSR initiative, 3B collaborated with Muskaan to facilitate projects under “Livelihood Development Programs”; the aim of one of the programs is to provide baking training to a group of 20 students at IHM Bhopal. This was done in joint collaboration with IHM to bear the cost of the education of these students. This initiative will enable these students to find and sustain a good means of making an income and supporting themselves and their families while Muskaan will provide support to them to help develop and improve their resumes to help increase their chances of successfully getting employed. 3B also made additional contributions to cover the cost of transportation for these students and provided financial support to some of the older students to set up their food carts in market areas to sustain 