 Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20the%20Tribal%20Society%20-%20Project',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'f3c2e437b72a5a8fd39696970bb41df6','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'dbcc2f4bf8332b47affb7bd0edf00ce4',NULL,'Friends of the Tribal Society - Project for \"EKAL VIDYALAYA - One Teacher School\" in tribal villages',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{\"title\": \"Friends of the Tribal Society\", \"summary\": \"Friends of the Tribal Society - Project for \\\"EKAL VIDYALAYA - One Teacher School\\\" in tribal villages\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20the%20Tribal%20Society%20-%20Project\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Friends of the Tribal Society'),(3292,'Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non','Education & Skill Development','Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non-profit organisation dedicated to the upliftment of tribals. FTS runs One Teacher School (OTS) or Ekal Vidyalaya, which imparts non- formal primary education to children between 6 and 14 years of age. An OTS typically comprises 25 – 30 children of classes I to III. An Ekal Vidyalaya imparts five-fold education; primary education, health care education, development education, awareness education and sanskar education. As on March 31, 2021, FTS was running 102,552 Ekal Vidyalaya supporting basic education of 26,32,065 students. Development Education or Gramothan is another aspect of Ekal’s five fold education which has been considered necessary after running of OTSs in the villages. Out of the realisation that the village community should be linked with a self – sustainable economic development programs by using local resources.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://3bblackbio.com/corporate-social-responsibility#:~:text=Friends%20of%20Tribals%20Society%20%28FTS%29%20established%20on',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:08:11.600786+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'96eebf4aa845133049705738b445ac94','COMP_TOP200_157',NULL,'cd59bb837f645c50890c8e57c442dd68',NULL,'Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non-profit organisation dedicated to the upliftment of tribals. FTS runs One Teacher School (OTS) or Ekal Vidyalaya, which imparts non- formal primary education to children between 6 and 14 years of age. An OTS typically comprises 25 – 30 children of classes I to III. An Ekal Vidyalaya imparts five-fold education; primary education, health care education, development education, awareness education and sanskar education. As on March 31, 2021, FTS was running 102,552 Ekal Vidyalaya supporting basic education of 26,32,065 students. Development Education or Gramothan is another aspect of Ekal’s five fold education which has been considered necessary after running of OTSs in the villages. Out of the realisation that the village community should be linked with a self – sustainable economic development programs by using local resources.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:08:11.600786','{\"title\": \"Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non\", \"summary\": \"Friends of Tribals Society (FTS) established on January 15, 1989 is a non-profit organisation dedicated to the upliftment of tribals. FTS runs One Teacher School (OTS) or Ekal Vidyalaya, which impar