e meaning of provisions of Chapter V-Acceptance of Deposits by Companies of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the Companies (Acceptance of Deposits) Rules, 2014.\", \"focus_area\": \"Schedule VII Statutory CSR\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.abmintl.in/#:~:text=The%20turnover%20of%20the%20Company%20in%20years\", \"budget_allocated\": \"rs 2023\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'rs 2023','Schedule VII Statutory CSR',NULL,'The turnover of the Company in years 2023'),(3315,'We use traffic log cookies to identify which pages are being used','Education & Skill Development','We use traffic log cookies to identify which pages are being used. This helps us analyse data about webpage traffic and improve our website in order to tailor it to customer needs. We only use this information for statistical analysis purposes and then the data is removed from the system.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://abmindia.com/privacy_policy.html#:~:text=We%20use%20traffic%20log%20cookies%20to%20identify',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:10:49.523474+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b36755187751a2b46898ece835f137be','COMP_TOP200_168',NULL,'a6b12c3f4a9354a10e9e4f9833aa7f3e',NULL,'We use traffic log cookies to identify which pages are being used. This helps us analyse data about webpage traffic and improve our website in order to tailor it to customer needs. We only use this information for statistical analysis purposes and then the data is removed from the system.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:49.523474',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:49.523474',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:49.523474',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:49.523474','{\"title\": \"We use traffic log cookies to identify which pages are being used\", \"summary\": \"We use traffic log cookies to identify which pages are being used. This helps us analyse data about webpage traffic and im