\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://abmindia.com/home/abm_quality_policy#:~:text=This%20is%20achieved%20by%20implementing%20and%20maintaining\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'This is achieved by implementing and maintaining the Quality Management System wherein we '),(3317,'ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers w','Education & Skill Development','ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers who had built their expertise at institutions that defined the global technology landscape — IBM, Bell Labs, IIM, ECIL, and ASCI. At a time when computing in India was in its infancy, these founders saw not just possibility, but obligation: to build a company that could bring world-class technology capability to Indian organisations. That founding conviction — rigorous expertise, applied boldly — has never changed. Today, listed on both BSE (Scrip Code: 530745) and NSE (Symbol: ACSTECH), with deployments ranging from AI systems for the Indian Armed Forces to geospatial work with ISRO and smart facility platforms across the Gulf, ACS Technologies stands as one of India\'s longest-standing and most trusted independent technology companies.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acstechnologies.co.in/#:~:text=ACS%20Technologies%20was%20incorporated%20in%201980%20by',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:10:57.032322+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'ec7d72947f1b0cd20638982af1c17bbd','COMP_TOP200_170',NULL,'b4e5768474536ce1375d567033d57b45',NULL,'ACS Technologies was incorporated in 1980 by a team of computer scientists and engineers who had built their expertise at institutions that defined the global techn