ry\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'ACS Technologies transformed our business with their custom software solutions'),(3319,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability','Environment & Sustainability','Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:10:55.281142+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'cd44f8b73b97d915bcd733815846acdf','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'8513461eb39a8cf913a6f8908c6d51d2',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{\"title\": \"Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability\", \"summary\": \"Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability. Sustainability to us isn’t just about the environment; it’s equally about people. We nurture our employees, ensure safety in every operation, empower our customers with end-to-end solutions, and uplift the communities we call home.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Growth%20to%20us%20is%20about%20responsibility%2C%20resilience%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Growth to us is about responsibility, resilience, and a firm commitment to sustainability'),(3320,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum','Environment & Sustainability','The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:10:55.281142+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'98aecb9d50c2b7528622813dcdc015dc','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'f2f7b5db449bd6453315a401009dabb3',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{\"title\": \"The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum\", \"summary\": \"The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum. From energy conservation to deploying renewable energy and green energy, using wastes in cement production as alternate fuels and to water conservation, emissions reduction to creating institutionalised mechanisms to monitor environmental risks and strict adherence to the company’s ‘zero non-compliance’ regime and much more, ACC Limited\'s sustained efforts have helped ingrain the sustainability agenda in the company’s DNA.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20Company%E2%80%99s%20sustainability%20initiatives%20cover%20a%20wide\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'The Company’s sustainability initiatives cover a wide spectrum'),(3321,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons','Environment & Sustainability','Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:10:55.281142+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'dda08d7ee1ad532366052b8203d3507f','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'e1de98964c41ae67bf11ccedc5b0c680',NULL,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{\"title\": \"Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons\", \"summary\": \"Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Responsibility Committee (CRC), which consists of independent directors overseeing sustainability matters across our organization. The Committee meets quarterly to review performance on key KPIs across our four pillars of sustainability: climate and energy, water and nature, circular economy, and people and communities. The Committee guides the business on the way forward, considering emerging global and national expectations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=Our%20Environmental%2C%20Social%2C%20and%20Governance%20%28ESG%29%20governance\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'Our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) governance is led by the Corporate Respons'),(3322,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which','Education & Skill Development','The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.acclimited.com/sustainability#:~:text=The%20ESG%20framework%20includes%20a%20set%20of',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:10:55.281142+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'2ee217d773a87b088026df19d20bad16','COMP_TOP200_169',NULL,'b760640f991e06dc698203e21c640840',NULL,'The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The business has committed to key ESG KPIs and has shared this information transparently. There is a well-defined assurance system that includes both internal audits and external third-party audits. All ESG disclosures are aligned with relevant international and national frameworks such as GRI, GHG protocol, IR, TCFD, and SEBI-BRSR, which act as guiding principles.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:10:55.281142','{\"title\": \"The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which\", \"summary\": \"The ESG framework includes a set of policies that serve as guiding documents, all of which are approved by the Board. The busi