 Ltd','Education & Skill Development','At AIA Engineering Ltd. we are committed to supporting India’s education system through innovative engineering solutions and are proud to contribute towards the flourishment of young minds of the country.As part of this initiative, AIA helped setup the GTU (Gujarat Technological University)-AIA Foundry Skill Development Centre at GPERI, Mehsana, India. Through industry-oriented curriculum, state-of-the-art equipment and expert-led training programs, the Centre aims to equip Degree and Diploma students with cutting-edge skills in metallurgy, induction heating, and foundry technologies',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20are%20committed',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:41.291238+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'463238d7d72d2f424d93249e345c2b19','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,'0dd9941fe33df94f2371023188f77a91',NULL,'At AIA Engineering Ltd. we are committed to supporting India’s education system through innovative engineering solutions and are proud to contribute towards the flourishment of young minds of the country.As part of this initiative, AIA helped setup the GTU (Gujarat Technological University)-AIA Foundry Skill Development Centre at GPERI, Mehsana, India. Through industry-oriented curriculum, state-of-the-art equipment and expert-led training programs, the Centre aims to equip Degree and Diploma students with cutting-edge skills in metallurgy, induction heating, and foundry technologies',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:11:41.291238','{\"title\": \"At AIA Engineering Ltd\", \"summary\": \"At AIA Engineering Ltd. we are committed to supporting India’s education system through innovative engineering solutions and are proud to contribute towards the flourishment of young minds of the country.As part of this initiative, AIA helped setup the GTU (Gujarat Technological University)-AIA Foundry Skill Development Centre at GPERI, Mehsana, India. Through industry-oriented curriculum, state-of-the-art equipment and expert-led training programs, the Centre aims to equip Degree and Diploma students with cutting-edge skills in metallurgy, induction heating, and foundry technologies\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20are%20committed\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'At AIA Engineering Ltd'),(3350,'At AIA Engineering Ltd','Healthcare & Nutrition','At AIA Engineering Ltd. we believe in the value of investing in health, and in the physical and mental wellbeing of the society. We have undertaken a number of initiatives to help and provide food, nutrition supplement, clothes, etc. to various sections of the society. Initiatives like holding meditation sessions by Chetana Empowerment Foundation and Covid 19 relief and rehabilitation have proved to be beneficial to more than 15000 people. AIA has also made CSR contributions to Zydus Foundation, Gujarat Cancer Society, Sanjivani Health and Relief Committee amongst others for health and well-being of public at large.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://aiaengineering.com/sustainability-csr#:~:text=At%20AIA%20Engineering%20Ltd.%20we%20believe%20in',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:11:41.291238+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'b57e2adc02e0abd0b165ecbe0e2f9e6c','COMP_TOP200_174',NULL,'22bf67c9672c44fd73dccadad5ceb650',NULL,'At AIA Engineering Ltd. we believe in the value of investing in health, and in the physical and mental wellbeing of the society. We have undertaken a number o