ential. The supply chain industry, long dependent on fossil fuels, bears a critical responsibility to reduce carbon emissions and lead the shift toward eco-conscious operations.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=In%20an%20era%20defined%20by%20climate%20urgency%2C\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'In an era defined by climate urgency, sustainability isn’t optional'),(3387,'At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment','Environment & Sustainability','At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment—it’s embedded in our DNA. We\'ve implemented a holistic sustainability strategy that integrates cutting-edge technologies, alternative energy solutions, and ethical business practices. From optimizing route efficiency to adopting cleaner fuels, every step we take is aimed at minimizing our ecological footprint—while maximizing impact for a greener future.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=At%20AVG%20Logistics%2C%20environmental%20stewardship%20is%20more',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:13:51.558511+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'47971a41daa0cc6f661b3e5f13c43534','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'83827a78edde32f4f59a1cdf2e716e37',NULL,'At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment—it’s embedded in our DNA. We\'ve implemented a holistic sustainability strategy that integrates cutting-edge technologies, alternative energy solutions, and ethical business practices. From optimizing route efficiency to adopting cleaner fuels, every step we take is aimed at minimizing our ecological footprint—while maximizing impact for a greener future.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511','{\"title\": \"At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment\", \"summary\": \"At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment—it’s embedded in our DNA. We\'ve implemented a holistic sustainability strategy that integrates cutting-edge technologies, alternative energy solutions, and ethical business practices. From optimizing route efficiency to adopting cleaner fuels, every step we take is aimed at minimizing our ecological footprint—while maximizing impact for a greener future.\", \"focus_area\": \"Environment & Sustainability\", \"source_url\": \"https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=At%20AVG%20Logistics%2C%20environmental%20stewardship%20is%20more\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Environment & Sustainability',NULL,'At AVG Logistics, environmental stewardship is more than a commitment'),(3388,'Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move','Education & Skill Development','Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in every mile we move. A growing share of our fleet now runs on electric vehicles (EVs) and alternative fuels, significantly cutting emissions at the source. Using AI-driven route optimization, we reduce mileage, fuel use, and carbon output across operations. Our energy-efficient warehouses, powered by solar energy and equipped with smart lighting systems, lower energy consumption by up to 30%. Additionally, comprehensive recycling and waste-to-resource initiatives ensure we contribute as little as possible to landfills—turning waste into opportunity.',NULL,N