ions','Education & Skill Development','Sustainability extends beyond our operations. We actively prioritize biodiversity conservation, avoiding wildlife corridors and ensuring all vehicles are PUC-compliant to safeguard ecosystems. Our commitment also includes employee training and stakeholder partnerships that embed sustainability deeply into our culture. By aligning our efforts with global climate goals, we strive to protect both the planet and the communities we serve.',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Sustainability%20extends%20beyond%20our%20operations.%20We%20actively',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:13:51.558511+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'88c0621548345f8b1b004cea92f47a98','COMP_TOP200_186',NULL,'52d1dd1d8bcf5981a31072ea7cae10c1',NULL,'Sustainability extends beyond our operations. We actively prioritize biodiversity conservation, avoiding wildlife corridors and ensuring all vehicles are PUC-compliant to safeguard ecosystems. Our commitment also includes employee training and stakeholder partnerships that embed sustainability deeply into our culture. By aligning our efforts with global climate goals, we strive to protect both the planet and the communities we serve.',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED','2026-10-19 12:13:51.558511','{\"title\": \"Sustainability extends beyond our operations\", \"summary\": \"Sustainability extends beyond our operations. We actively prioritize biodiversity conservation, avoiding wildlife corridors and ensuring all vehicles are PUC-compliant to safeguard ecosystems. Our commitment also includes employee training and stakeholder partnerships that embed sustainability deeply into our culture. By aligning our efforts with global climate goals, we strive to protect both the planet and the communities we serve.\", \"focus_area\": \"Education & Skill Development\", \"source_url\": \"https://avglogistics.com/sustainability-esg#:~:text=Sustainability%20extends%20beyond%20our%20operations.%20We%20actively\", \"budget_allocated\": \"Verified on Official Portal\", \"verification_status\": \"PUBLISHED\"}',NULL,'ACTIVE','{\"raw_category\": \"category\", \"raw_budget_text\": \"budget\", \"raw_project_name\": \"project_name\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','Education & Skill Development',NULL,'Sustainability extends beyond our operations'),(3391,'Our CSR journey has been marked by unwavering consistency','Education & Skill Development','Our CSR journey has been marked by unwavering consistency-a steadfast rhythm of purpose that has remained resolute through changing seasons and evolving landscapes. Through AU Foundation, the CSR arm of AU Small Finance Bank, we have evolved from being benefactors to becoming catalysts of self-reliant growth. We are sketching paths to empowerment-not with rigid blueprints, but with dynamic strokes that honor the unique aspirations and potential of every individual and community we serve. Each initiative we undertake reflects our unwavering belief that empowerment begins with access access to education, healthcare and sustainable livelihoods and more. We are building bridges to a more equitable future-not merely filling gaps but unlocking potential and exploring new possibilities',NULL,NULL,'Verified on Official Portal','https://www.au.bank.in/csr#:~:text=Our%20CSR%20journey%20has%20been%20marked%20by',NULL,'2026-10-19T12:13:11.743948+00:00',0,'LINK_OK',NULL,'836f75f032c5343c6cf8b85b5ed93626','COMP_TOP200_184',NULL,'4ff545bd6a4591a59fa6b04b46c0e481',NULL,'Our CSR journey has been marked by unwavering consistency-a steadfast rhythm of purpose that has remained resolute through changing seasons and evolving landscapes. Through AU Foundation, the CSR arm of AU Small Finance Bank, we have evolved from being benefactors to becoming catalysts of self-reliant growth. We are sketching paths to empowerment-not with