onal KPIs and ensure alignment with organizational goals.\nDrive budgetary control and accountability across departments.\nForecasting & Analysis\nPrepare and update rolling forecasts and latest estimates (LE) on a monthly/quarterly basis.\nConduct variance analysis between actuals, budgets, and forecasts.\nPerform scenario and sensitivity analysis to assess the impact of changing assumptions.\nDecision Support\nProvide actionable insights to business leaders for informed decision-making.\nDevelop business cases and financial models for new initiatives.\nSupport strategic projects such as automation and cost optimization.','2026-10-06',NULL,'https://eibd.fa.em2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/44655','https://eibd.fa.em2.oraclecloud.com/hcmRestApi/resources/latest/recruitingCEJobRequisitions?onlyData=true&finder=findReqs;siteNumber=CX_1&expand=requisitionList&offset=975&limit=25','2026-10-08T06:17:53.503378+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_ORACLE_TALEO)','37ddf42b77556f364fba8371f5a8a57859608b5ca0de7bef192137db44545bb6','COMP_TOP200_017','https://eibd.fa.em2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/44655','75e89110088e2156c600160c349d5243',NULL,'{\"id\": \"44655\", \"title\": \"Team Member - FP&A\", \"location\": \"India\", \"dept\": null}','ATS_API_ORACLE_TALEO','2026-10-08 06:19:10.666139',NULL,'2026-10-08 06:21:25.455776',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-08 06:21:25.455776',NULL,'\r\n<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\">\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no\">\r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n\r\n    <script nonce=\"9926c7f27c\">\r\n        (function (w, d, s, l, i) {\r\n            w[l] = w[l] ||