eadquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n                <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/fed09ea3-5cdb-4e2b-a362-c.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/customHeader.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/sitebuilderframework.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/BS3ColumnizedSearch.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/fontawesome4.7/css/font-awesome-4.7.0.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n<style>\nbody > .modal-backdrop {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n.menu.desktop .nav > li .dropdown-menu li a{ color : white !important}\n#header .links a{ color: white !important;}\n.dropdown-menu.company-dropdown.headerdropdown.backgroundcolordc8b140b5a119dc3 .menu{ color : black !important}\n.custom-header-menu .nav.nav-pills{ width: 807px !important; }\n.custom-header-signinLanguage .inner.limitwidth{ max-width: 1200px; }\n.customPlugin{ margin-bottom: 0 !important; }\n\n</style>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\"></script></body>\n\n        \n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/9349339a-5cfe-46bb-98d8-3.png\" type=\"image/x-icon\" />\n            <style id=\"antiClickjack\" type=\"text/css\">body{display:none !important;}</style>\n            <script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"antiClickJackScript\">\n                if (self === top) {\n                    var antiClickjack = document.getElementById(\"antiClickjack\");',NULL,'All populated fields verified against raw source evidence.','STALE',NULL,'SuccessFactors',NULL,NULL,'Zaheerabad',1,'2026-10-13T10:46:22.237111+00:00','1438573100',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Purpose of the Role\\\": \\\"Ensure maximum availability, reliability, and safety of engine shop equipment through preventive, predictive, and breakdown maintenance activities. Responsible for maintaining CNC machines, engine assembly equipment, automated systems, engine test beds, and utility equipment while supporting continuous improvement and new project implementation.\\\", \\\"Equipment Maintenance\\\": \\\"Maintain and troubleshoot CNC machines (preferably Mazak), engine assembly equipment, and automated production systems.\\\\nMaintain fixturized torquing machines, leak testing machines, sealant dispensing systems, washing machines, and conveyors.\\\\nEnsure reliable operation of engine test beds, cooling chiller units, servo stabilizers, and utility equipment.\\\\nPerform preventive, predictive, and condition-based maintenance activities as per schedule.\\\", \\\"Automation & Controls\\\": \\\"Troubleshoot Siemens PLCs, HMIs, SCADA systems, VFDs, and servo drives.\\\\nPerform PLC programming modifications, parameter backup, and restoration.\\\\nConfigure and maintain I/O modules, vision systems, and communication networks.\\\\nMaintain electrical control panels, PCC panels, and machine safety circuits.\\\", \\\"Breakdown Analysis & Reliability Improvement\\\": \\\"Conduct root cause analysis (RCA) for breakdowns.\\\\nImplement corrective and preventive actions to eliminate chronic issues.\\\\nImprove MTTR and MTBF through reliability initiatives and Kaizen projects.\\\\nMonitor machine performance and recommend improvements.\\\", \\\"Spare Parts Management\\\": \\\"Plan and maintain inventory of critical and consumable spare parts.\\\\nEnsure timely availability of spares to minimize downtime.\\\\nControl maintenance costs through effective spare management.\\\", \\\"Safety & Compliance\\\": \\\"Ensure equipment safety interlocks are functional.\\\\nImplement Poka-Yoke and machine safety improvements.\\\\nAdhere to EHS standards and safe maintenance practices.\\\", \\\"Project & Improvement Activities\\\": \\\"Support installation, commissioning, and startup of new equipment.\\\\nParticipate in capacity enhancement and automation projects.\\\\nDrive continuous improvement initiatives to improve productivity and quality.\\\", \\\"Education Qualification\\\": \\\"Bachelor of Engineering (Electrical / Electronics / Mechatronics)\\\", \\\"General Experience\\\": \\\"3-8 Years\\\", \\\"Critical Experience\\\": \\\"Technical Skills\\\", \\\"Technical Skills\\\": \\\"Siemens PLC, HMI & SCADA\\\\nServo Drives & Servo Motors\\\\nCNC Machine Maintenance (Mazak Preferred)\\\\nElectrical Troubleshooting\\\\nPneumatics & Hydraulics\\\\nEngine Test Bed Maintenance\\\\nFixturized Torquing System Maintenance\\\\nLeak Test Equipment Maintenance\\\\nSealant Dispensing System Maintenance\\\\nVFD Programming & Maintenance\\\\nPreventive & Predictive Maintenance\\\\nRoot Cause Analysis\\\", \\\"System Generated Secondary Skills\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nHydraulics, CNC, Electrical, Engineer, Engineering, Manufacturing, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"','Siemens PLC, HMI & SCADA\nServo Drives & Servo Motors\nCNC Machine Maintenance (Mazak Preferred)\nElectrical Troubleshooting\nPneumatics & Hydraulics\nEngine Test Bed Maintenance\nFixturized Torquing System Maintenance\nLeak Test Equipment Maintenance\nSealant Dispensing System Maintenance\nVFD Programming & Maintenance\nPreventive & Predictive Maintenance\nRoot Cause Analysis',NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-AD, IN','Assistant Manager - Maintenance (ETA)'),(5360,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_c765c3dba362','AM/Deputy Mgr. Paint Shop',NULL,NULL,'Mohali, Mohali-Plant 1, IN','Mohali-Plant 1','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nJob allocation to Team Members according to the production plan and Transfer of clear and complete work assignments/ instructions into orders to subordinate positions on Productivity, Quality, Safety,Delivery .\nControl of absenteeism.Ensure availability of direct/Indirect material online.\nMonitoring of breakdowns, Tools and equipment problems.Ensure that Daily production formats are filled as actuals.Verify cleaning of plant, machinery and equipment and fixture as per the cleaning schedule.\nResponsible to achieve required targets on Productivity, Quality and Safety for Respective Production Line.\nCoordination with sheet metal as a Supplier and with Assembly shop as an Internal Customer for Quality and Quantity.Interaction with other sections of the Paint shop- Technical Support, planning, Process, Maintenance and QA to improve and achieve the required targets.\nEnsure that Actions are planned and taken without undue delay for the Issues raised during Product Audit, Process Audits and Internal Audits for ISO 9001:2008 and ISO 14001:2004 and Monitor the Effectiveness of The actions through audit trends.\nCoordination for the Production trials for new model launch.\nHandling internal customer quality concerns.Initiate the Continual Improvement Project/Action through KVP for Productivity Improvement, Quality Improvement, Cost reduction, Safety Enhancement Etc.\nEnsure compliance to ISO 9001:2008 and ISO 14001:2004 and safety requirements',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mohali-AMDeputy-Mgr_-Paint-Shop-Moha/1353960600','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=100','2026-10-13T