ing and DMU sign off considering existing homologation requirements and future upcoming regulations.\n10.    Ensure EN / PR release, EBOM, Installation drg release through PLM and track and coordinate other aggregate releases\n11.    Participate in vehicle benchmarking, Vehicle Target setting and Cascading the same to System level targets.\n12.    Manage homologation documentation, testing, etc.\n13.    Expreienced in GNOVAC/ Vehicle quality audits',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"1. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Concept preparations and evaluation based on weight, cost, attributes, vehicle variants/ platform modularity.\\\\n2. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Lead Packaging & integration of Vehicle systems.\\\\n3. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Vehicle calculation knowledge like, Wheel base calc, CG calc, Vehicle performance calc.\\\\n4. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Lead DMU packaging reviews, Concerns resolution, Preparation of DMU reports & Sign off.\\\\n5. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support in Validation concerns tracking and resolution along with CFT\\\\n6. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support in Service concerns tracking and resolution along with CFT\\\\n7. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support in Plant concerns tracking and resolution along with CFT\\\\n8. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support Build at different phase of programme\\\\n9. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Vehicle packaging and DMU sign off considering existing homologation requirements and future upcoming regulations.\\\\n10. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Ensure EN / PR release, EBOM, Installation drg release through PLM and track and coordinate other aggregate releases\\\\n11. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Participate in vehicle benchmarking, Vehicle Target setting and Cascading the same to System level targets.\\\\n12. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Manage homologation documentation, testing, etc.\\\\n13. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Expreienced in GNOVAC/ Vehicle quality audits\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"8-12 Years of Experience\\\", \\\"Industry Preferred\\\": \\\"Automotive\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"BE/B.Tech\\\\u00a0(Mechanical/Automotive)\\\", \\\"General Requirements\\\": \\\"1. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Vehicle system level functioning/design of Commercial Vehicle Systems, Categories & Application\\\\n2. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Knowledge of Frame design and Key design principles of other aggregates\\\\n3. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Knowledge on manufacturing processes, plant assembly layouts\\\\n4. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Knowledge of SAM process\\\\n5. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0DMU (Digital \\\\u00a0Mock Up), 3D modelling, Assembly, Drafting (vehicle layouts)\\\\n6. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Hands on Experience on Catia & Team center PLM\\\\n7. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Exposure to existing and future Homologation requirements of Commercial Vehicles CAE, Testing & Validation\\\\n8. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Hand on experience on coordination with overall product development team including all aggregates, attributes, design and verification/validation\\\\n9. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Knowledge of product complexity/modularity management, manufacturing methods\\\\n10. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Knowledge of MPDS, APQP, DFMEA, DFA, DFM, DFS, QC Tools\\\\n11. \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Knowledge of 8D\\\", \\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nDrafting, Manufacturing Engineer, Engineering Manager, Engineer, Engineering, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pune, Chakan_MahTower, IN','Lead Engineer-Vehicle Integration'),(5375,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_81981cf7c740','Asst. Manager - Part Engineering',NULL,NULL,'Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN','Banglore CO','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nDelivering Technical Manuals for new launches:  Delivery of vehicle documentation (Electronic Parts Catalogue).\nAddress Part Technical queries from dealers. Maintain the EPC Portal for current and new products.\nIdentifying serviceable parts with system engineer, coordinating with design engineers for service BOM creation and readiness, post that upload in EPC portal.\nCoordination with multiple stake holder for price settlement of i.e. Basic Part Cost, Packaging Cost and Transportation Cost.\nPrepare and release part change information communication to the field team\nShould be technically strong in Automobile (ICE & EV) with hands on experience\nCoordinate with Engineering Team on ECN release and approval by putting across Service/ Customer Care requirements\nMulti-task handling & Usage of Latest Technology e.g AI.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Asst_-Manager-Part-Engineering-Bang/1437175500','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=160','2026-10-13T12:15:02.966062+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','5a47dfc5908da1f290b3d76b0a10d795e148b9dcea41353916386c03eacf20ca','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Asst_-Manager-Part-Engineering-Bang/1437175500','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Asst. Manager - Part Engineering\", \"location\": \"Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Education Qualification\", \"Critical Skills\", \"System Generated Secondary Skills\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:07.898575',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:20.238016',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:20.238016',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Conten