D)','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nThe prime objective is to generate revenue from the Govt. by way of claiming legitimate Export Incentives through various incentive schemes run by the Govt. to keep the prices competitive in international markets. It requires deep knowledge of Foreign Trade Policy, and the ability to liaise with various Government depts. like DGFT, Customs, Ministry of Commerce, Dept. of Revenue etc.\nProcurement of All Industry Rate (AIR) of Drawback for various export products\nProcurement of Brand Rate (BR) of Drawback for specific export products\nProcurement of Remission of Duties & Taxes on Export Product (RoDTEP) licences for various export products\nFulfilment of Export Obligation Fulfilment for EPCG licences\nCompetition data analysis for Auto and Tractor business\nLiasioning with Govt. Agencies like SIAM, EEPC, FIEO & DGFT\nLiasioning with different Govt. depts. like Ministry of Commerce, Dept. of Revenue\nSAP knowledge of F&A and MM module\nRe-conciliation of Drawback & RoDTEP amounts with Accounts\nClose co-ordination with logistic team for availability of necessary details',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Manager-Exports-MUM/1437169300','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=160','2026-10-13T12:15:05.487154+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','f89b24c1c00d2c9008ca7a1c3a3625965858e3c44a55464d1d755e628c658e2e','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Manager-Exports-MUM/1437169300','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Manager - Exports\", \"location\": \"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Education Qualification\", \"System Generated Secondary Skills\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:09.684080',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:20.404137',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 