s on Export Product (RoDTEP) licences for various export products\nFulfilment of Export Obligation Fulfilment for EPCG licences\nCompetition data analysis for Auto and Tractor business\nLiasioning with Govt. Agencies like SIAM, EEPC, FIEO & DGFT\nLiasioning with different Govt. depts. like Ministry of Commerce, Dept. of Revenue\nSAP knowledge of F&A and MM module\nRe-conciliation of Drawback & RoDTEP amounts with Accounts\nClose co-ordination with logistic team for availability of necessary details',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"The prime objective is to generate revenue from the Govt. by way of claiming legitimate Export Incentives through various incentive schemes run by the Govt. to keep the prices competitive in international markets. It requires deep knowledge of Foreign Trade Policy, and the ability to liaise with various Government depts. like DGFT, Customs, Ministry of Commerce, Dept. of Revenue etc.\\\\nProcurement of All Industry Rate (AIR) of Drawback for various export products\\\\nProcurement of Brand Rate (BR) of Drawback for specific export products\\\\nProcurement of Remission of Duties & Taxes on Export Product (RoDTEP) licences for various export products\\\\nFulfilment of Export Obligation Fulfilment for EPCG licences\\\\nCompetition data analysis for Auto and Tractor business\\\\nLiasioning with Govt. Agencies like SIAM, EEPC, FIEO & DGFT\\\\nLiasioning with different Govt. depts. like Ministry of Commerce, Dept. of Revenue\\\\nSAP knowledge of F&A and MM module\\\\nRe-conciliation of Drawback & RoDTEP amounts with Accounts\\\\nClose co-ordination with logistic team for availability of necessary details\\\", \\\"Education Qualification\\\": \\\"Postgraduate preferably MBA Finance\\\", \\\"System Generated Secondary Skills\\\": \\\"Apply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN','Manager - Exports'),(5380,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_9d349f6940a4','Sr. Engineer - VIPTIS',NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Chennai-MRV-AD','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\n1. Packaging and integrating vehicle systems into a vehicle\n2. Monitor Virtual vehicle layout and finalize PandH (Proportions and Hard points) and Vehicle Architecture\n3. Manage Variants andmeet project specific communisation and standardization targets\n4. Conceptualize and detailed design VI systems meeting cost weight and functional targets\n5. Exposure to Team centre Â Enterprise, TC-engineering and TC-project (Product Lifecycle Management tools)\n6. Ensure CAD Vehicle Layout to facilitate design engg for modification insertion / introduction of the new parts in the vehicle by collecting all the CAD models together and locating at vehicle location\n7. Manage Vehicle level Engineering Bill of Material to support Vehicle Build during Product Development\n8. Ensure compliance of customer requirements arising out of QFD to deliver the vehicle as per the customer requirements by continuously monitoring design of various systems\nExperience\n10 to 12 Years\nIndustry Preferred\nQualifications\nBE/B.Tech\nGeneral Requirements\nOur commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\nAt Mahindra and Mahindra Limited, we believe that diversity drives innovation, and inclusion is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to cultivating a workplace where every individual feels valued, respected, and empowered to thrive.\nWe are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to age, caste, race, religion, color, ethnic origin, gender identity, nationality, physical or mental disability, medical condition, sexual orientation, educational background, marital or domestic partnership status, pregnancy or childbirth, veteran status, citizenship status, ancestry, financial status, or any other personal characteristic protected by applicable law.\nWe actively encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply and bring their unique perspectives to our teams. We are committed to ensuring an accessible and inclusive experience for all applicants.\nTogether, we rise by embracing differences and building a future that reflects the communities we serve.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Sr_-Engineer-VIPTIS-Chen/1437229600','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=160','2026-10-13T12:15:08.291861+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','a2ed4a31798a94eb05d7776b5abb34ac5756850d6e714812d7a6a5e2bc68fa9c','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Sr_-Engineer-VIPTIS-Chen/1437229600','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Sr. Engineer - VIPTIS\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:10.063843',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:21.770031',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:21.770031',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.cs