&startrow=320\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Area Sales Manager\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1435654500\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Lucknow-Area-Sales-Manager-Luck/1435654500/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Lucknow, Lucknow, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Lucknow-Area-Sales-Manager-Luck/1435654500/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1435654500\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Lucknow, Lucknow, IN','Area Sales Manager'),(5403,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_f9c6bbbdf038','Deputy Manager - Trims',NULL,NULL,'Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN','Banglore CO','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,'BE',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nDesign and development of Interior / Exterior trims (IP, Console, Pillar trims, Door trims, Front grill, FR & RR Bumper, Wheel Arches, Door-cladding, Mud guard/ Flap etc. ) ,\nExperience in creating Concepts and data inputs for business case preparation and project costing at kick off stage.\nExperience in feasibility studies of styling data CAS-0 to Class-A for trims parts( tooling direction, draft analysis, Homologation checks, Surface quality etc.)\nMaster Section Development, 3D CAD modelling of Engineering surfaces and considering other vehicle parts packaging like Veh DAC , E&E , other BIW & GSM parts etc.\nInteraction with Development Team / Suppliers / Tool makers for Mfg. Feasibility ,packaging / tooling feasibility study.\nIncorporation of Changes suggested in DFM/DFS/DFA, CAE, DMU feedback, Service & Mold flow simulation etc. into engineering design.\nBenchmarking study for competition vehicles and systems for packaging, performance, assembly etc. at vehicle level and tear down level.\nPreparation of SOR/Technical Requirement Document for FSS parts\nIncorporation of GD&T for parts and assembly drawings\nWork effectively in a team environment with a cross-functional team\nKey deliverables :\nGood CAD proficiency on CATIA V5 in below modules\nAssembly design, Surface modelling (Generative Shape Design Module),Part modelling, Detailing (Drafting),3D Annotation (Functional Tolerancing & Annotation)\nGood knowledge of Int / Ext trims materials and manufacturing processes, design and devp\nExperience in concerns resolution during validation & service trials\nKnowledge of component and vehicle level DVP and homologation\nExperience in concerns resolution during validation & service trials\nExcellent communication skills in English & Self-starter with a high passion for success.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nBE Mechanical',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Deputy-Manager-Trims-Bang/1435641900','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=200','2026-10-13T12:15:16.394208+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','36e3f25c9949b4a4f241812bd0bcaee918dda39952132b21efbe5c780319d78c','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Deputy-Manager-Trims-Bang/1435641900','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Deputy Manager - Trims\", \"location\": \"Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Industry Preferred\", \"Qualifications\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:14.597457',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:24.238140',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:24.238140',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=