ilures.\n•    Co-Ordinate for meeting the seats related DVP (Regulatory, Functional, Durability) & achieving the first time right for each program and proposing mitigation plans.\n•    Must be aware of upcoming regulations & consider the changes well in advance to ensure future ready seating system for upcoming programs.\n•    Support the team lead for achieving the best possible FI targets.\n•    Must work collaboratively with CFT’s like CAE, BSR, NVH, STA, DE, VD, PQ, NovaC, Validation, PVT etc to ensure high Quality product Design in line with the industry best practices to enhance Customer’s Experience.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nBE/B.Tech\n\nBEHAVIOURAL SKILLS:\n•    Strong problem-solving skills.\n•    Passion for understanding user experience and idea generation.\n•    Technical Know-How of latest seating technologies around the globe & acumen to closely predict the upcoming trends.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Senior-Engineer-Chen/1435326200','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=220','2026-10-13T12:15:24.812715+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','7e08666b24b1f9265d197a4314c7f82b59e4f4266129b2f282a3dfc46e7c36c2','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Senior-Engineer-Chen/1435326200','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Senior Engineer\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Key Competencies\", \"Soft Skills\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:17.013993',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:24.906123',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:24.906123',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-