ng system for upcoming programs.\n•    Support the team lead for achieving the best possible FI targets.\n•    Must work collaboratively with CFT’s like CAE, BSR, NVH, STA, DE, VD, PQ, NovaC, Validation, PVT etc to ensure high Quality product Design in line with the industry best practices to enhance Customer’s Experience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'•    Strong problem-solving skills.\n•    Passion for understanding user experience and idea generation.\n•    Technical Know-How of latest seating technologies around the globe & acumen to closely predict the upcoming trends.',NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support the team lead to execute the seating system delivery by meeting all the project requirements such as Cost, Weight, Performance & timeline in Passenger Vehicle programs.\\\\n\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support with Technical Expertise for appropriate benchmarking, future road map & Proof-of-concept readiness.\\\\n\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Well versed with seat structural CAE requirements along with ability to read & interpret the results & support the team lead with viable proposals for action plan against failures.\\\\n\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Co-Ordinate for meeting the seats related DVP (Regulatory, Functional, Durability) & achieving the first time right for each program and proposing mitigation plans.\\\\n\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Must be aware of upcoming regulations & consider the changes well in advance to ensure future ready seating system for upcoming programs.\\\\n\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Support the team lead for achieving the best possible FI targets.\\\\n\\\\u2022 \\\\u00a0 \\\\u00a0Must work collaboratively with CFT\\\\u2019s like CAE, BSR, NVH, STA, DE, VD, PQ, NovaC, Validation, PVT etc to ensure high Quality product Design in line with the industry best practices to enhance Customer\\\\u2019s Experience.\\\", \\\"Key Competencies\\\": \\\