nufacturing Facility by coordinating layout planning, infrastructure planning, project monitoring, capacity planning and manufacturing readiness activities to ensure timely achievement of project milestones and SOP objectives.\nRoles and Responsibilities:\nSupport preparation and updating of plant layouts, shop layouts and infrastructure planning documents. Coordinate with Civil, Mechanical, Electrical, Manufacturing Engineering and Production teams for infrastructure planning activities.\nSupport capacity planning, utility requirement planning and manufacturing readiness activities.\nMonitor project schedules and track progress against planned milestones.\nPrepare project MIS reports, presentations and progress dashboards for management review.\nCoordinate with consultants, contractors and internal stakeholders for timely closure of project action items.\nSupport planning and execution of equipment installation, commissioning and SOP readiness activities.\nMaintain project documentation, drawing revisions and planning records.\nAssist in budgeting, project cost tracking and resource planning activities.\nEnsure compliance with safety, quality and project management requirements.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nFull Time B. Tech in Mechanical Engineering\nJob Segment:\nManufacturing Engineer, Mechanical Engineer, Engineer, Electrical, Engineering, Automotive\nApply Now\nStart apply with LinkedIn\nStart\nPlease wait...',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Nagpur-Dy_-Manager-Factory-Planning-Nagp/1434237200','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=260','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','55d46b72ff7a4ff06b0fa72574e640f1f5aa3f45fd481700aa86f0a397b95e17','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Nagpur-Dy_-Manager-Factory-Planning-Nagp/1434237200','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Dy. Manager - Factory Planning\", \"location\": \"Nagpur, Nagpur, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Industry Preferred\", \"Qualifications\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:19.844871',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:25.889769',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/j2w/j2w.fallbacks.js\"></script>\n                \n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://performancemanager4.successfactors.com/verp/vmod_v1/ui/extlib/jquery_3.5.1/jquery.js\" onerror=\"loadFallbacks(\'/platform/js/jquery/jquery-3.5.1.min.js\', \'/platform/js/jquery/jquery-migrate-3.1.0.min.js\')\"></script>\n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://performancemanager4.successfactors.com/verp/vmod_v1/ui/extlib/jquery_3.5.1/jquery-migrate.js\"></script>\n            <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/jquery/jquery-migrate-1.4.1.js\"></script>\n  