nce with cloud platforms (\\\\nAWS\\\\n,\\\\nAzure\\\\n,\\\\nGCP\\\\n).\\\\nExpertise in containerization and orchestration tools such as\\\\nDocker\\\\nand\\\\nKubernetes\\\\n.\\\\nStrong scripting skills in languages like\\\\nPython\\\\n,\\\\nBash\\\\n, or\\\\nPowerShell\\\\n.\\\\nFamiliarity with version control systems (\\\\nGit\\\\n) and infrastructure-as-code tools (\\\\nTerraform\\\\nor\\\\nCloudFormation\\\\n).\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"5.5yrs to 7.5yrs\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"BE/ME or Btech/Mtech\\\", \\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nEngineering Manager, Engineer, Engineering, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Coimbatore\", \"title\": \"Lead Engineer\", \"location\": \"Coimbatore, Coimbatore (FD), IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=380\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Lead Engineer\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1434247100\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Coimbatore-Lead-Engineer-Coim/1434247100/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Coimbatore, Coimbatore (FD), IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Coimbatore-Lead-Engineer-Coim/1434247100/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1434247100\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Coimbatore, Coimbatore (FD), IN','Lead Engineer'),(5426,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_197b63be6cba','Manager - Tractor PDI & Cabin Assembly',NULL,NULL,'Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-FD, IN','Zaheerabad-FD','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nAs the Manager for Tractor PDI & Cabin Assembly at Mahindra & Mahindra Ltd, you will oversee and direct daily operations within the plant, including production, manufacturing, maintenance, engineering support, TPM activities, safety, regulatory compliance, distribution, and warehousing. Reporting to the plant general manager, your primary objective is to ensure cost-effective, timely delivery of high-quality products while maintaining a safe, secure, and sanitary work environment.\nYour critical responsibilities include managing the development, implementation, and continuous improvement of operational methods, equipment, systems, and infrastructure essential to achieving the plant\'s goals. You will lead initiatives to monitor and improve process efficiency and personnel productivity by identifying and removing operational obstacles.\nAdditional duties encompass overseeing recruitment, performance management, and comprehensive training programmes for all personnel involved in plant operations. You will develop production work schedules that meet both internal targets and customer expectations, regularly monitoring progress to ensure alignment with these goals.\nSpecifically, you will:\nDirect all facets of manufacturing operations to achieve operational excellence.\nEnsure compliance with safety regulations and company policies to create a secure workplace.\nImplement effective Total Productive Maintenance (TPM) strategies to maximise equipment availability and reliability.\nCollaborate with engineering teams to support continuous process improvements and technical problem-solving.\nLead cross-functional teams to enhance quality assurance standards and cost optimisation efforts.\nFoster a culture of accountability, collaboration, and innovation within the plant.\nAlign plant activities with Mahindra & Mahindra’s sustainability goals and strategic business objectives.\nManage distribution and warehousing logistics to guarantee efficient supply chain flow.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Zaheerabad-Manager-Tractor-PDI-&-Cabin-Assembly-Zahe/1434266900','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=280','2026-10-13T12:15:30.835695+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','69aeb693782efd64003bc721008c7a5ab95a849e629e8bc388285e3ffeb24e3e','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Zaheerabad-Manager-Tractor-PDI-&-Cabin-Assembly-Zahe/1434266900','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Manager - Tractor PDI & Cabin Assembly\", \"location\": \"Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-FD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Education Qualification\", \"General Experience\", \"Critical Experience\", \"System Generated Secondary Skills\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:22.442196',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:27.118499',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:27.118499',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/j2w/j2w.fallbacks.js\"></script>\n                \n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://performa