rade skill level of Associates\n• Conduct various process audits and closure of NC’s.\n• Responsible for adhering to Quality Management systems, 5S, IPMS & QDMS\n• Knowledge of Fixture Operation & Maintenance\n• Identify Bottlenecks in Process & reduce Cycle Time.\n• Identify scope for continual improvemet in JH & 5S along with maintaining safety at work.\n• Maintain OLE records and restore minor stoppages & breakdowns quickly by ICA/PCA to minimize recurrence\n• Shop Floor Management\n• Timely disposal of non confirming products & scrap',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Zaheerabad-Assistant-Manager-Body-PU-Production-Zahe/1434241700','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=280','2026-10-13T12:15:32.460820+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','07eeb903f59e84a818ae1b9a201384053fc4d1ce155935e33471887445e8d09a','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Zaheerabad-Assistant-Manager-Body-PU-Production-Zahe/1434241700','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Assistant Manager - Body PU Production\", \"location\": \"Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Education Qualification\", \"Critical Experience\", \"System Generated Secondary Skills\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:23.004743',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:27.443760',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:27.443760',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                