: \\\"\\\\u2022 Adherence to Daily / Monthly production schedule by following Safety & Quality Management System.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Daily Work Management- Monitor the set targets on a day to day basis effectively by managing priorities.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Man Management - Able to resolve day to day Shop floor Associate issues & Conflicts\\\\n\\\\u2022 Ensure timely actions for internal/external Quality customer concerns and sustenance of the same.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Adherence to training plan to improve/upgrade skill level of Associates\\\\n\\\\u2022 Conduct various process audits and closure of NC\\\\u2019s.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Responsible for adhering to Quality Management systems, 5S, IPMS & QDMS\\\\n\\\\u2022 Knowledge of Fixture Operation & Maintenance\\\\n\\\\u2022 Identify Bottlenecks in Process & reduce Cycle Time.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Identify scope for continual improvemet in JH & 5S along with maintaining safety at work.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Maintain OLE records and restore minor stoppages & breakdowns quickly by ICA/PCA to minimize recurrence\\\\n\\\\u2022 Shop Floor Management\\\\n\\\\u2022 Timely disposal of non confirming products & scrap\\\", \\\"Education Qualification\\\": \\\"B.E Mechanical /Production\\\", \\\"Critical Experience\\\": \\\"\\\\u2022 Experience in Handling Production issues\\\\n\\\\u2022 Knowledge about TPM process\\\\n\\\\u2022 Basics of Pneumatics, plugging, wiring, part fitment , sealing and automotive vehicle systems.\\\\n\\\\u2022 Knowledge of quality system ISO 9001, ISO 14001, ISO 45001\\\\n\\\\u2022 Knowledge of cargo/chassis, automation setting of new auto body part, Torque Integrity, 1D&3D geometry, Poka-Yoke , CMM, Weld Integrity\\\\n\\\\u2022 Usage of QC tools and techniques like MYB approach & 7 QC tools\\\\n\\\\u2022 Vehicle parts knowledge\\\", \\\"System Generated Secondary Skills\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nIndustrial, Manufacturing, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-AD, IN','Assistant Manager - Body PU Production'),(5430,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_5165004b7c68','Buyer - Indirect Procurement',NULL,NULL,'Pune office, Pune-AD, IN','Pune-AD','India',NULL,NULL,'4) Experience of MS office tools','graduate',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nUnderstand the requirements (Scope of Work and SLAs) from various user departments relating to Packaging ( Corrugation, Steel, Polymer, wood, returnable) across all the plants of AFS ( Auto - Farm Sector), Spare Parts and Allied Business\nUnderstanding the requirements (Scope of Work) from various user departments\nDecide the vendor panel and Float RFQs wherever necessary\nReceive and Analyse quotes and Decide Target Price\nConduct Negotiations and Achieve Target Price as jointly decided by senior management\nDomain knowledge on Packaging commodities and purchasing processes.\nShould be costing and negotiations for packaging cost settlement.\nCommercial contract settlement for Packaging activities:-\n1) Supplier assessment & Price settlement for packaging commodities like corrugation, polybags, VCI, Pine wood, rubber wood, Steel crates/ Skids, returnable packaging, etc\n2)Should be costing and negotiations for packaging cost settlement. Identify competent supplier base and develop along with user.\nMarket intelligence and forecasting of Raw material prices - Commodity price trend tracking and benchmarking.\n3) Differential Sourcing Strategy - Benchmarking of Technology and Prices in Industry, innovative packaging solutions, adapting best practices in other industries.\nValue Engineering / Cost Reductions -  Ability to generate new ideas of bringing Material cost either by selection of material, alternate Source or by optimization of design / process cost.\nPackaging Commodity Wise Vendor Panneling and Decide Procurement and supply strategy.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\n1) Effective written and spoken communication\n2) Understanding Costing, Should be costing, Cost drivers and levers\n3) Ability to Negotiate with large and reputed agencies and close deals\n4) Experience of MS office tools',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Pune-office-Buyer-Indirect-Procurement-Pune/1434235800','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=280','2026-10-13T12:15:32.476310+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','9135889c7dd3e1e68bc0e8b52d62139f18f35d0f83afde9c268ecd30a5cf1ae8','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Pune-office-Buyer-Indirect-Procurement-Pune/1434235800','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Buyer - Indirect Procurement\", \"location\": \"Pune office, Pune-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"General Requirements\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:24.793776',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:27.714040',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:27.714040',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.resp