 of Technology and Prices in Industry, innovative packaging solutions, adapting best practices in other industries.\nValue Engineering / Cost Reductions -  Ability to generate new ideas of bringing Material cost either by selection of material, alternate Source or by optimization of design / process cost.\nPackaging Commodity Wise Vendor Panneling and Decide Procurement and supply strategy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"Understand the requirements (Scope of Work and SLAs) from various user departments relating to Packaging ( Corrugation, Steel, Polymer, wood, returnable) across all the plants of AFS ( Auto - Farm Sector), Spare Parts and Allied Business\\\\nUnderstanding the requirements (Scope of Work) from various user departments\\\\nDecide the vendor panel and Float RFQs wherever necessary\\\\nReceive and Analyse quotes and Decide Target Price\\\\nConduct Negotiations and Achieve Target Price as jointly decided by senior management\\\\nDomain knowledge on Packaging commodities and purchasing processes.\\\\nShould be costing and negotiations for packaging cost settlement.\\\\nCommercial contract settlement for Packaging activities:-\\\\n1) Supplier assessment & Price settlement for packaging commodities like corrugation, polybags, VCI, Pine wood, rubber wood, Steel crates/ Skids, returnable packaging, etc\\\\n2)Should be costing and negotiations for packaging cost settlement. Identify competent supplier base and develop along with user.\\\\nMarket intelligence and forecasting of Raw material prices - Commodity price trend tracking and benchmarking.\\\\n3) Differential Sourcing Strategy - Benchmarking of Technology and Prices in Industry, innovative packaging solutions, adapting best practices in other industries.\\\\nValue Engineering / Cost Reductions - \\\\u00a0Ability to generate new ideas of bringing Material cost either by selection of material, alternate Source or 