antee at the dealership.Monthly visit to ASC and monitor his performance along with ASC coordinator.Service camps on monthly basisc.Monthly visits to customer and update M Response data\nPreferred Industries',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"System Generated Secondary Skills\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nEngineer, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Jaipur, Jaipur, IN','Customer Care Manager'),(5438,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_356f2b95fbc4','Senior Executive - Maintenance Engineer',NULL,NULL,'Mohali, Mohali, IN','Mohali','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bachelor\'s',NULL,NULL,'QUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to work under pressure and deliver timely solutions.\nExcellent communication skills to coordinate effectively across multidisciplinary teams and external vendors.\nA proactive approach towards workplace safety, compliance, and environmental stewardship.\nCapability to manage multiple tasks, prioritize activities, and lead maintenance operations efficiently in a dynamic environment.\nCommitment to fostering a collaborative and inclusive workplace culture aligned with company values.\nLocation: Based in Mohali with no travel requirements, allowing focus on on-site operational excellence.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mohali-Senior-Executive-Maintenance-Engineer-Moha/1433778800','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=320','2026-10-13T12:15:39.929281+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','29c33d4cab137e86cd89a83d45349f56ab87572d8fda2aa806c651f5ec6e400b','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mohali-Senior-Executive-Maintenance-Engineer-Moha/1433778800','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Senior Executive - Maintenance Engineer\", \"location\": \"Mohali, Mohali, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Plant & Facility Maintenance\", \"Automation & Control Systems\", \"HVAC, Refrigeration & Utilities\", \"Greenhouse & Aeroponic Systems\", \"Preventive & Predictive Maintenance\", \"Safety & Compliance\", \"Continuous Improvement\", \"Team & Vendor Management\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"General Requirements\", \"Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:26.637359',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:30.048166',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:30.048166',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/j2w/j2w.fallbacks.js\"></script>\n                \n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://performancemanager4.successfactors.com/verp/vmod_v1/ui/extlib/jquery_3.5.1/jquery.js\" onerror=\"loadFallbacks(\'/platform/js/jquery/jquery-3.5.1.min.js\', \'/platform/js/jquery/jquery-migrate-3.1.0.min.js\')\"></script>\n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://performancemanager4.successfactors.com/verp/vmod_v1/ui/extlib/jquery_3.5.1/jquery-migrate.js\"></script>\n            <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/jquery/jquery-migrate-1.4.1.js\"></script>\n            <title>Mahindra Careers</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n    <meta name=\"title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"adventure aerospace aftermarket automotive boats brand brands business businesses careers change channels clean companies company connect contact contacts counts cultural culture defence directors equipment estate facebook farm finance financial followers formula global good googleapis graph group growth history http https india industry information innovation instagram investors jobs know leadership learn listed mahindra mahindrarise marazzo marketplace media mobility motor news october outreach overview people performance plant presence press previous programmes purpose read real releases reports resources responsibility results rise room services social sport statistics steel stories sustainability tech technology trails twitter users valley video views visit watch wheelers work world youtube\" />\n\n    <meta prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns#\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns#\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n                <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/fed09ea3-5cdb-4e2b-a362-c.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/customHeader.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/sitebuilderframework.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/BS3ColumnizedSearch.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/fontawesome4.7/css/font-awesome-4.7.0.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n<style>\nbody > .modal-backdrop {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n.menu.desktop .nav > li .dropdown-menu li a{ color : white !important}\n#header .links a{ color: white !important;}\n.dropdown-menu.company-dropdown.headerdropdown.backgroundcolordc8b140b5a119dc3 .menu{ color : black !important}\n.custom-header-menu .nav.nav-pills{ width: 807px !important; }\n.custom-header-signinLanguage .inner.limitwidth{ max-width: 1200px; }\n.customPlugin{ margin-bottom: 0 !important; }\n\n</style>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\"></script></body>\n\n        \n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/9349339a-5cfe-46bb-98d8-3.png\" type=\"image/x-icon\" />\n            <style id=\"antiClickjack\" type=\"text/css\">body{display:none !important;}</style>\n            <script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"antiClickJackScript\">\n                if (self === top) {\n                    var antiClickjack = document.getElementById(\"antiClickjack\");',NULL,'All populated fields verified against raw source evidence.','STALE',NULL,'SuccessFactors',NULL,NULL,'Mohali',1,'2026-10-13T12:15:39.929281+00:00','1433778800',NULL,NULL,'Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to work under pressure and deliver timely solutions.\nExcellent communication skills to coordinate effectively across multidisciplinary teams and external vendors.\nA proactive approach towards workplace safety, compliance, and environmental stewardship.\nCapability to manage multiple tasks, prioritize activities, and lead maintenance operations efficiently in a dynamic environment.\nCommitment to fostering a collaborative and inclusive workplace culture aligned with company values.\nLocation: Based in Mohali with no travel requirements, allowing focus on on-site operational excellence.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Plant & Facility Maintenance\\\": \\\"Ensure the efficient and uninterrupted operation of tissue culture laboratories, aeroponic growing systems, greenhouses, cold storage units, utilities, irrigation, and fertigation infrastructure.\\\\nDiagnose and resolve complex electrical, mechanical, automation, and instrumentation challenges swiftly to minimize production impact.\\\\nDrive initiatives to improve equipment reliability, extending asset lifespan, and reducing downtime.\\\", \\\"Automation & Control Systems\\\": \\\"Oversee the maintenance, fault diagnosis, and repair of PLC, SCADA, and other automation control systems critical to operational performance.\\\\nVigilantly monitor alarms, operational trends, data logs, and control system outputs to preemptively address potential issues.\\\\nContribute to engineering projects that include system modifications, technology upgrades, and process optimization for enhanced productivity.\\\", \\\"HVAC, Refrigeration & Utilities\\\": \\\"Manage and maintain HVAC units, chillers, air handling units (AHUs), refrigeration equipment, and environmental controls to uphold strict temperature and humidity standards.\\\\nImplement energy conservation measures and promote utility efficiency in compliance with sustainability goals.\\\\nCoordinate with maintenance teams to ensure these systems contribute to optimal environmental conditions for sensitive biological materials and produce.\\\", \\\"Greenhouse & Aeroponic Systems\\\": \\\"Maintain and monitor fan-pad cooling, ventilation systems, pumps, motors, valves, sensors, and environmental controllers to ensure consistent operation.\\\\nSafeguard uninterrupted functioning of irrigation, fertigation, and other critical environmental control systems that support plant growth.\\\", \\\"Preventive & Predictive Maintenance\\\": \\\"Develop comprehensive preventive maintenance schedules tailored to equipment requirements and operational demands.\\\\nMaintain detailed logs of equipment history, inspection records, and maintenance activities to support data-driven decision making.\\\\nTrack maintenance performance metrics including equipment uptime, mean time between failures (MTBF), mean time to repair (MTTR), and maintenance costs to continuously improve asset management.\\\", \\\"Safety & Compliance\\\": \\\"Ensure strict adherence to electrical, mechanical, refrigeration, and workplace safety regulations and standards.\\\\nImplement and oversee Lockout-Tagout (LOTO) procedures, conduct thorough risk assessments, and promote a culture of safety throughout the facility.\\\\nSupport and participate in safety audits, inspections, and manage contractor safety processes to maintain a secure working environment.\\\", \\\"Continuous Improvement\\\": \\\"Lead strategic projects aimed at enhancing automation capabilities, boosting reliability, increasing energy efficiency, and reducing operational costs.\\\\nStay abreast of industry best practices to continuously innovate and optimize facility performance and maintenance strategies.\\\", \\\"Team & Vendor Management\\\": \\\"Collaborate closely with production, operations, quality, and engineering teams to align maintenance activities with business objectives.\\\\nEffectively manage relationships with contractors, vendors, and service providers to ensure quality and timely delivery of maintenance services.\\\\nEnsure the availability of critical spare parts and materials, while exercising vigilant control over the maintenance budget to maximize value.\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"A robust background of 5 to 10 years in roles focused on maintenance and operations within industrial environments such as tissue culture, seed production, greenhouse management, aeroponics, cold storage, or automated manufacturing.\\\\nDemonstrated experience working within controlled-environment agricultural systems or similar sectors is highly valued, bringing insight into specialized equipment and process requirements.\\\\nProven track record of troubleshooting complex electrical, mechanical, and automation systems to maintain high operational uptime.\\\\nExperience in leading maintenance teams, managing vendor partnerships, and spearheading continuous improvement projects is preferred.\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"A Bachelor\'s degree in Electrical Engineering or Electrical & Electronics Engineering (B.E./B.Tech) from a recognized institution is required.\\\\nAdditional certifications related to automation systems (PLC/SCADA), maintenance management, or safety standards would be advantageous.\\\\nContinual professional development through workshops or training in emerging technologies, energy management, and safety compliance is encouraged.\\\", \\\"General Requirements\\\": \\\"Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to work under pressure and deliver timely solutions.\\\\nExcellent communication skills to coordinate effectively across multidisciplinary teams and external vendors.\\\\nA proactive approach towards workplace safety, compliance, and environmental stewardship.\\\\nCapability to manage multiple tasks, prioritize activities, and lead maintenance operations efficiently in a dynamic environment.\\\\nCommitment to fostering a collaborative and inclusive workplace culture aligned with company values.\\\\nLocation: Based in Mohali with no travel requirements, allowing focus on on-site operational excellence.\\\", \\\"Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Mahindra HZPC Pvt. Ltd. proudly embraces diversity in all its forms as a fundamental strength and core value. We are dedicated to cultivating an inclusive workplace where every team member is respected, valued, and empowered to contribute their unique perspectives.\\\\nWe actively promote equity by providing equal opportunities for growth, development, and career advancement, ensuring that no individual faces barriers due to background, identity, or circumstances.\\\\nOur recruitment practices focus on demonstrating fairness and eliminating bias, fostering a culture that encourages collaboration, innovation, and belonging for all colleagues.\\\\nWe believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce drives excellence and sustainability, reinforcing our commitment to social responsibility and community engagement.\\\\nJob Segment:\\\\nManufacturing Engineer, Electrical Engineering, Electronics Engineer, Maintenance Engineer, Electrical, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mohali, Mohali, IN','Senior Executive - Maintenance Engineer'),(5439,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_414344d8ecaa','Assistant Manager - EHS',NULL,NULL,'Haridwar, Haridwar Plant, IN','Haridwar Plant','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nAssist in the development of the Health, Safety and Environment systems to meet the requirements of OHSAS 18001 and ISO 14001.\nAssist with the Implementation of the HSE Strategy on the project.\nIdentify and mitigate risks associated with work.\nEnsure Compliance with all statutory and client Safety regulations.\nUndertake Safety inspections and Audits.\nIncident investigation and root cause analysis of accident/incident.to educate employees by regular training on SHE guidelines, to inculcate Safety culture wherein employees\nFollow the laid down SHE rules.to enforce Compliance on the Shop floor for SHE guidelines.\nTo create a culture where in all employees involve in Safety and Report unsafe observations and unsafe conditions.\nTo encourage and create culture where in employees report near misses.\nTo work with the team to meet sustainability target for reduction in energy, water and waste reduction.\nTo ensure that PTW (Permit to work) is followed at site for all maintenance and production work which requires permit.\nTo do risk assessment of all processes with the team.\nTo ensure Management of Change is followed for all change.\nPreparation of Safety Operating procedure. Identification and prevention of hazards in the plant.\nDocumentation and records management for safety operations procedures.\nCalculate and maintain Statistics related to safety parameters.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Haridwar-Assistant-Manager-EHS-Hari/1433767000','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=320','2026-10-13T12:15:36.830594+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','512ad14d47eac71f68495767acccdf822fc36fcbb4d9b073cd0938f4190fb3bd','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Haridwar-Assistant-Manager-EHS-Hari/1433767000','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Assistant Manager - EHS\", \"location\": \"Haridwar, Haridwar Plant, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Education Qualification\", \"General Experience\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:27.737945',NULL,'202