llection for Exterior Interior vehicle dimensions as per SAE J1100 in Standard template\nBenchmarking for Occupant protection and Side Impact dimensions\nCollect Passenger compartment Integration must and wants from assembly and service\nCollect lessons learnt from other projects on overall vehicle passenger compartment and ensure implementation\nPreparation of Seating Buck\nFunctional block diagrams, Interface mapping Clearance Clash analysis\nGenerate Individual lessons learnt document at respective gateways\nCollect lessons learnt from other projects on assembly DMU and ensure implementation\nCollect must and wants from assembly team\nCollect tentative Process Flow Chart for Identifying DMU Assay DVP\nIdentify Assembly DMU DVP with CME team\nConduct DMU Assembly simulations of vehicle systems for Assembly feasibility, operator reach tool reach\nAssembly simulation DVP signoff by VV Gateway\nDigital to actual monitoring of assembly on prototype vehicle builds\nExperience\n2 to 3 years in Vehicle Integration.\nIndustry Preferred\nQualifications\nB.E/B.Tech, M.E/M.Tech\nGeneral Requirements\nOur commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\nAt Mahindra and Mahindra Limited, we believe that diversity drives innovation, and inclusion is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to cultivating a workplace where every individual feels valued, respected, and empowered to thrive.\nWe are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to age, caste, race, religion, color, ethnic origin, gender identity, nationality, physical or mental disability, medical condition, sexual orientation, educational background, marital or domestic partnership status, pregnancy or childbirth, veteran status, citizenship status, ancestry, financial status, or any other personal characteristic protected by applicable law.\nWe actively encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply and bring their unique perspectives to our teams. We are committed to ensuring an accessible and inclusive experience for all applicants.\nTogether, we rise by embracing differences and building a future that reflects the communities we serve.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Senior-Engineer-VIPTIS-Chen/1433770400','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=340','2026-10-13T12:15:39.221114+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','28905de91c28dc5350c4845d1dbbc08f440a8677df9f237d3d135f738e7eb59f','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Senior-Engineer-VIPTIS-Chen/1433770400','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Senior Engineer - VIPTIS\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:30.612005',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:31.123326',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:31.123326',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n            