and seam welding.\"\n(6) Should be able to apply loads and Boundary conditions required for linear and nonlinear Static analysis.\n(7) Should be able to carry out Modal, frequency response and transient analysis for vehicle components and systems.\"\n(8)Should be able to do Fatigue life estimation for Vehicle structure, Spot and seam welds.\n(9) Ability to post process results, make reports and present results to design team.\n(10) Should be able to recommend design modifications to meet acceptance criteria based on analysis results, manufacturing and packaging constraints.\n(11) Should have knowledge of different tests for Vehicle systems and test instrumentations.\n(12) Should be able to correlate CAE results with physical test results.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nEngineering Manager, Manufacturing Engineer, Engineer, Welding, Engineering, Automotive, Manufacturing\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Chennai\", \"title\": \"Lead Engineer-CAE\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=480\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Lead Engineer-CAE\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433316900\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Chennai-Lead-Engineer-CAE-Chen/1433316900/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Lead-Engineer-CAE-Chen/1433316900/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433316900\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Lead Engineer-CAE'),(5450,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_0fbf394a515d','GPPH - Platform 5 & UPP',NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan_MahTower, IN','Chakan_MahTower','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,'BE',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nTechnical:\nSoR/drawings : Timely finalization with inputs on supplier and cost feasibility inputs in coordination with PEH\nEnsures timely & comprehensive feedback from SBC (material cost) assessment\nEnsures timely & comprehensive feedback from supplier\nTechnical sign-off :Timely completion of technical sign-off along with PEH to ensure that only the suppliers capable of meeting TCP targets are signed-off\nTechno-Commercial:\nSBC & Quote Synthesis : Deliver on TCP targets for part development\nTimely completion of SBC & quote synthesis (incl. supplier feedback, capex / investments)\nEnsure supplier capacity to provide parts as per projected volume in time & at scale\nDecision on cost trade-offs across commodities minimizing TCP deviations at vehicle-level\nEnsure that underlying assumptions of SBC & quote synthesis are similar, so that, SBC and supplier quote are in striking distance of each other\nSuppliers in the panel should be capable of meeting TCP targets for each part\nCommercial:\nSupplier Panel & VoB : Coordinate with SSU to ensure timely closure with help of PSL1\nEnsure only the vendors who cleared technical sign-off get onboarded\nPart development:\nDelivery as per material cost targets & within budgeted investment for bought-out parts\nDelivery of right quality parts as per Project MRD2\nTimely completion of vendor PPAP and handover to SQE & SCM\nOther Business decisions:\nFinalize the project budget related to part development. Provide inputs to PFH for business case\nSystem-level target drill-down : Provide feedback on techno-commercial feasibility to PEH\nMake vs Buy decisions : Timely finalization in line with platform TCP targets, in coordination with PMH & CPH\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nDisruptive innovation and change catalyst, Market knowledge and technology\nStrong knowledge in automotive product/ecosystem with a desire to learn new aspects of business\nJob Segment:\nAutomotive\nApply Now\nStart apply with LinkedIn\nStart\nPlease wait...',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-GPPH-Platform-5-&-UPP-Chak/1322384400','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=360','2026-10-13T12:15:40.597730+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','38ec4a1b5c4c8ac6cd93fda341b6cebfeb24427141d227997725bda3baa497e6','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-GPPH-Platform-5-&-UPP-Chak/1322384400','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"GPPH - Platform 5 & UPP\", \"location\": \"Chakan, Chakan_MahTower, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"General Requirements\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:32.611790',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:32.576091',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:32.576091',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\