uality parts as per Project MRD2\nTimely completion of vendor PPAP and handover to SQE & SCM\nOther Business decisions:\nFinalize the project budget related to part development. Provide inputs to PFH for business case\nSystem-level target drill-down : Provide feedback on techno-commercial feasibility to PEH\nMake vs Buy decisions : Timely finalization in line with platform TCP targets, in coordination with PMH & CPH',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"Technical:\\\\nSoR/drawings : Timely finalization with inputs on supplier and cost feasibility inputs in coordination with PEH\\\\nEnsures timely & comprehensive feedback from SBC (material cost) assessment\\\\nEnsures timely & comprehensive feedback from supplier\\\\nTechnical sign-off :Timely completion of technical sign-off along with PEH to ensure that only the suppliers capable of meeting TCP targets are signed-off\\\\nTechno-Commercial:\\\\nSBC & Quote Synthesis : Deliver on TCP targets for part development\\\\nTimely completion of SBC & quote synthesis (incl. supplier feedback, capex / investments)\\\\nEnsure supplier capacity to provide parts as per projected volume in time & at scale\\\\nDecision on cost trade-offs across commodities minimizing TCP deviations at vehicle-level\\\\nEnsure that underlying assumptions of SBC & quote synthesis are similar, so that, SBC and supplier quote are in striking distance of each other\\\\nSuppliers in the panel should be capable of meeting TCP targets for each part\\\\nCommercial:\\\\nSupplier Panel & VoB : Coordinate with SSU to ensure timely closure with help of PSL1\\\\nEnsure only the vendors who cleared technical sign-off get onboarded\\\\nPart development:\\\\nDelivery as per material cost targets & within budgeted investment for bought-out parts\\\\nDelivery of right quality parts as per Project MRD2\\\\nTimely completion of vendor PPAP and handover to SQE & SCM\\\\nOther Business decisions:\\\\nFinalize the project budget related to part development. Provide inputs to PFH for business case\\\\nSystem-level target drill-down : Provide feedback on techno-commercial feasibility to PEH\\\\nMake vs Buy decisions : Timely finalization in line with platform TCP targets, in coordination with PMH & CPH\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"20 + years of relevant experience in areas of different commodities involved in Purchase, costing and sourcing.\\\\nExpertise in business case preparations with overall vehicle attributes & evaluation will be an added advantage.\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"BE / B. Tech / M. Tech in Automotive/Mechanical streams\\\", \\\"General Requirements\\\": \\\"Disruptive innovation and change catalyst, Market knowledge and technology\\\\nStrong knowledge in automotive product/ecosystem with a desire to learn new aspects of business\\\\nJob Segment:\\\\nAutomotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan_MahTower, IN','GPPH - Platform 5 & UPP'),(5451,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_4eda0a3a0924','Assistant Manager-R&D',NULL,NULL,'Mohali, R&D Mohali, IN','R&D Mohali','India',NULL,NULL,'02 years','M.Tech',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nWe are seeking a highly skilled and experienced professional for the\n4 Poster Test Lab\nto support durability and fatigue testing activities. The candidate will be responsible for operating, maintaining, and troubleshooting servo-hydraulic test systems, executing fatigue test programs, and ensuring accurate data acquisition and reporting.\nFatigue Test Operations\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nPrefered : M.Tech\nMechatronics, Instrumentation, Mechanical with 02 years work experience\nOr B.Tech :\nMechatronics, Instrumentation, Mechanical with 03 years work experience.\nJob Segment: