ve actions are taken using a structured approach for supplier quality concerns during build and validation.\n9. Supplier quality improvement by implementing best industry practices.\n10. Continual improvement of part quality, supplier performance, system, and process using Six Sigma and Kaizen approaches.\n11. Engineering change management\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nBE/B.Tech  in Mechanical Engineering',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Assistant-Manager-Trims-CDMM-&-STA-Bang/1432891200','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=380','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','d3cfb75e120e68534804d7d30191b645ee27466615decab2203f96732d8b347a','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Assistant-Manager-Trims-CDMM-&-STA-Bang/1432891200','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Assistant Manager - Trims CDMM & STA\", \"location\": \"Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Industry Preferred\", \"Qualifications\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:34.439658',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:33.263674',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.co