,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"\'Key Deliverables :\\\\nAchieving & Sustaining Zero Breakdowns on Electro Pneumatic Fixtures without compromising Safety.\\\\nEnsuring Zero Defects in Down Stream Quality concerns related to Fixtures, Guages\\\\nBIW & Fixtures PIST Measurement & Improvement\\\\nResponsibilities :\\\\nExecution of Maintenance Methodologies ( Breakdown, Preventive, Predictive & Corrective Maintenance) of Fixtures\\\\nPlanning & Procurement of Fixture Spares & Maintaining consumable items stock.\\\\nMaintaining Equipment Critical Spares\\\\nExecution & Sustenance of Poka Yoke for Down Stream Quality Concerns\\\\nFixture Refurbishment Plan as per Schedule and Requirement.\\\\nImplementation of EN Changes by fixture units modification\\\\nEnsuring healthy condition of Line Side Trolleys , BIW handling trolleys & Hoists Lifting Tackles\\\\nStrong understanding on PFMEA,Control Plan , Quality tools , Problem Solving technicques , GD&T,etc\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"12-15 Years\\\", \\\"Industry Preferred\\\": \\\"Automobile\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"Diploma in Mechanical Engineering / BE in Mechanical Engineering (Mandatory)\\\", \\\"General Requirements\\\": \\\"BIW & Fixture measurement with CMM & Improvement\\\\nKaizen & Poka Yoke Development\\\", \\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nMechanical Engineer, Engineer, Maintenance, Engineering, Automotive, Manufacturing\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-AD, IN','Manager - Maintenance - Body PU'),(5456,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_8351e5359174','Manager - PCM',NULL,NULL,'Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(FD), IN','MUM-KND-AFS(FD)','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\nWe are looking for a experienced Tool Costing Engineer responsible for estimating and preparing accurate quotation for plastic injection mould, rubber/seals, glass, Thermoset, lighting(lamps) moulds.\nThe candidate will work closely with SSU, Tooling cell(CDMM), Design team to develop competitive and technically sound tooling cost.\nPrepare tooling cost based on Mould specifications sheet, TSO content, 3D models in certain cases. Analyse tool complexity, tool steel requirements, hot/cold runner and other tooling requirements\nSupport tooling cost reduction/Value engineering initiative without compromising on the quality and tool functionality.\nSet MHR for Tool Room machines, Maintain/update steel & BOP lists time to time.\nDevelop STD estimation cost models for tools & generate data base.\nSupport business requirements to adhere time line requirements for the estimations.\nPreferred Industries\nAutomobile\nFarm Sector\nEducation Qualification\nBachelor of Engineering; Bachelor of Engineering in Mechanical; Bachelor of Engineering in Automobile; Bachelor of Engineering in Production\nGeneral Experience\n5 to 8 years in tool room and techno commercial field\nCritical Experience\nSystem Generated Core Skills\nConflict Management\nCost Estimation\nProcess Knowledge - Assembly\nInfluencing Skills\nProject Management\nMaterial Costing\nContinuous Process Improvement\nVendor On-boarding\nSystem Generated Secondary Skills\nRelationship Management\nTarget Costing\nBenchmarking\nTrend Analysis',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Manager-PCM-MUM/1433103900','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=380','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','64e2fa4301feb97428ccee2c6f080cd724b741142fd6e6789c579bb3719ef939','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Manager-PCM-MUM/1433103900','d745b4b7d761