f DFMEA, PFMEA, Control Plans and PPAP.\nProduct Validation & Issue Resolution\nPlan and assess product validation, identify quality and reliability concerns, drive root-cause analysis and ensure timely closure of issues.\nComponent & Supplier Quality\nEnsure component quality readiness through development, validation and PPAP, working closely with suppliers and cross-functional teams.\nManufacturing & Production Readiness\nAssess plant build and production setup readiness to ensure processes are capable of consistently meeting defined product quality requirements.\nNew Product Launch Quality\nEnsure quality readiness for product launch, including First Time Right (FTR) declaration and closure of critical quality issues before market introduction.\nPost-Launch Quality & Customer Feedback\nMonitor field quality and customer feedback after launch, identify improvement opportunities and drive corrective actions with relevant stakeholders.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nDiploma/BE / Btech',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Dy-Manager-Quality-Planning-Chennai-Chen/1432850300','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=380','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','86f9d7bb92965bd22b416923fd916a4278c1ef445f9b2d2bbedebf08ddf5a2c9','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Dy-Manager-Quality-Planning-Chennai-Chen/1432850300','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Dy Manager - Quality Planning Chennai\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-FD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Qualifications\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-12 01:08:35.618603',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:34.309058',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\"