rojects for Body Shop facilities in line with approved specifications, schedules, and budgets.\\\\nMonitor construction activities, contractor performance, and work quality to ensure compliance with engineering and safety standards.\\\\nCoordinate with project, production, utility, EHS, and vendor teams for timely completion of infrastructure and utility works.\\\\nSupport installation readiness, equipment foundation works, and commissioning activities for Body Shop operations.\\\\nMonitor operation and maintenance of buildings, roads, drainage systems, utility infrastructure, and other civil assets.\\\\nEnsure availability, reliability, and upkeep of utility-related infrastructure supporting Body Shop production requirements.\\\\nConduct routine inspections and identify corrective actions to maintain asset health, safety, and operational efficiency.\\\\nVerify contractor measurements, work completion status, and documentation for project execution and maintenance activities.\\\\nEnsure adherence to statutory requirements, environmental regulations, and company standards related to infrastructure facilities.\\\\nMaintain engineering drawings, asset records, maintenance history, and project documentation.\\\\nSupport cost optimization, energy-saving, and continuous improvement initiatives related to infrastructure and utility systems.\\\\nAssist in troubleshooting infrastructure-related issues to minimize operational disruptions and improve facility performance.\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"5+ years in Civil Engineering, industrial building projects, infrastructure development with exposure to Greenfield automotive manufacturing projects is preferred. Experience in Body Shop facilities preferred.\\\", \\\"Industry Preferred\\\": \\\"Automobile OEMs, Industrial Construction, EPC Companies, Heavy Engineering and Manufacturing Industries\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"B.E./B.Tech Civil Engineering\\\\nJob Segment:\\\\nCivil Engineer, Engineer, Engineering, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Nagpur\", \"title\": \"Dy. Manager - Building, Utilities & Other Infra for Body Shop (Civil)\", \"location\": \"Nagpur, Nagpur, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=520\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Dy. Manager - Building, Utilities & Other Infra for Body Shop (Civil)\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1422511900\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Nagpur-Dy_-Manager-Building%2C-Utilities-&-Other-Infra-for-Body-Shop-%28Civil%29-Nagp/1422511900/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Nagpur, Nagpur, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Nagpur-Dy_-Manager-Building%2C-Utilities-&-Other-Infra-for-Body-Shop-%28Civil%29-Nagp/1422511900/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1422511900\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nagpur, Nagpur, IN','Dy. Manager - Building, Utilities & Other Infra for Body Shop (Civil)'),(5465,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_8a6f3b813574','Sr. Manager - Building, Utilities & Other Infra for Liasoning with Govt Depts (Civil)',NULL,NULL,'Nagpur, Nagpur, IN','Nagpur','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,'B.E',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nPurpose of the role:\nLead statutory liaison, regulatory compliance and government relations activities for the Greenfield Automotive Manufacturing Facility and ensure timely approvals, compliance adherence, project execution support and operational readiness throughout the infrastructure lifecycle\nRoles and responsibilities:\nLead statutory, regulatory and government liaison activities for the Greenfield Automotive Manufacturing Facility to ensure timely approvals, clearances and compliance required for project execution, commissioni