ors jobs know leadership learn listed mahindra mahindrarise marazzo marketplace media mobility motor news october outreach overview people performance plant presence press previous programmes purpose read real releases reports resources responsibility results rise room services social sport statistics steel stories sustainability tech technology trails twitter users valley video views visit watch wheelers work world youtube\" />\n\n    <meta prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns#\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns#\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n                <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/fed09ea3-5cdb-4e2b-a362-c.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/customHeader.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/sitebuilderframework.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/BS3ColumnizedSearch.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/fontawesome4.7/css/font-awesome-4.7.0.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n<style>\nbody > .modal-backdrop {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n.menu.desktop .nav > li .dropdown-menu li a{ color : white !important}\n#header .links a{ color: white !important;}\n.dropdown-menu.company-dropdown.headerdropdown.backgroundcolordc8b140b5a119dc3 .menu{ color : black !important}\n.custom-header-menu .nav.nav-pills{ width: 807px !important; }\n.custom-header-signinLanguage .inner.limitwidth{ max-width: 1200px; }\n.customPlugin{ margin-bottom: 0 !important; }\n\n</style>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\"></script></body>\n\n        \n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/9349339a-5cfe-46bb-98d8-3.png\" type=\"image/x-icon\" />\n            <style id=\"antiClickjack\" type=\"text/css\">body{display:none !important;}</style>\n            <script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"antiClickJackScript\">\n                if (self === top) {\n                    var antiClickjack = document.getElementById(\"antiClickjack\");',NULL,'All populated fields verified against raw source evidence.','STALE',NULL,'SuccessFactors',NULL,NULL,'Kolkata',1,'2026-10-13T12:16:02.786312+00:00','1432443600',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Field Technical Expert is responsible for providing advanced technical support, troubleshooting complex product or equipment issues, conducting field investigations, and supporting customers and internal teams to ensure optimal product performance and customer satisfaction. The role acts as a bridge between customers, field operations, engineering, and quality teams.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"The Field Technical Expert is responsible for providing advanced technical support, troubleshooting complex product or equipment issues, conducting field investigations, and supporting customers and internal teams to ensure optimal product performance and customer satisfaction. The role acts as a bridge between customers, field operations, engineering, and quality teams.\\\", \\\"Technical Support & Troubleshooting\\\": \\\"Diagnose and resolve complex technical issues related to products, equipment, or systems at customer sites.\\\\nConduct root cause analysis (RCA) and recommend corrective and preventive actions.\\\\nProvide expert-level guidance to service engineers, technicians, and customers.\\\\nSupport product performance evaluations and technical problem resolution.\\\", \\\"Field Operations\\\": \\\"Visit customer locations to inspect, analyze, and resolve technical concerns.\\\\nPerform technical audits, assessments, and product evaluations.\\\\nMonitor product performance and identify improvement opportunities.\\\\nEnsure timely closure of technical complaints and field issues.\\\", \\\"Customer Management\\\": \\\"Serve as the primary technical point of contact for key customers.\\\\nDeliver technical presentations, training programs, and product demonstrations.\\\\nBuild strong customer relationships through proactive technical support.\\\\nSupport customer acceptance and implementation of technical solutions.\\\", \\\"Quality & Continuous Improvement\\\": \\\"Collaborate with Quality, Engineering, and Manufacturing teams to address recurring issues.\\\\nAnalyze field data and prepare technical reports.\\\\nRecommend product design, process, or quality improvements.\\\\nSupport warranty analysis and failure investigations.\\\", \\\"Documentation & Reporting\\\": \\\"Prepare detailed service reports, investigation reports, and technical documentation.\\\\nMaintain records of customer visits, technical issues, and corrective actions.\\\\nShare technical knowledge and best practices across teams\\\", \\\"General Experience\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nElectronics Engineer, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineer, Field Engineer, Engineer, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Kolkata\", \"title\": \"Field Technical Expert\", \"location\": \"Kolkata, MTBD-Kolkata, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=560\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Field Technical Expert\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1432443600\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Kolkata-Field-Technical-Expert-MTBD/1432443600/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Kolkata, MTBD-Kolkata, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Kolkata-Field-Technical-Expert-MTBD/1432443600/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1432443600\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kolkata, MTBD-Kolkata, IN','Field Technical Expert'),(5563,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_095_938878da9029','Govt. Ad Sales - Senior Manager/DGM - Paytm Ads - Mumbai','Business','Paytm Ads','Mumbai, Maharashtra',NULL,'India','onsite','Full-time Employment',' Become an expert in Paytm Ads solutions for businesses of all sizes and adapt recommendations quickly to suit varying ','be',NULL,NULL,'About Us: \n\nPaytm is India\'s leading mobile payments and financial services distribution company. Pioneer of the mobile QR payments revolution in India, Paytm builds technologies that help small businesses with payments and commerce. Paytm’s mission is to serve half a billion Indians and bring them to the mainstream economy with the help of technology.\n\nAbout the team: \nPaytm Ads is Paytm\'s digital advertising vertical that offers innovative ad solutions to clients across industries It offers advertisers the opportunity to engage with 300Mn+ users who interact with over 200 payment & retail services, online and offline - offered on the Paytm app. Paytm Ads maps the user transactions to their lifestyle choices and creates customized segmentation cohorts for sharp shooting ad campaigns to the most relevant TG.\n\nExpectations/ Requirements: \n\nWe are hiring for the role of Government Ad Sales for FMCG, Consumer. Internet, Gaming verticals. The responsibilities would be as follows:\n\n Become an expert in Paytm Ads solutions for businesses of all sizes and adapt recommendations quickly to suit varying client needs.\n Own end-to-end key business metrics like ads revenue, educate and lead strategic conversations with clients and navigate complex relationships.\n Be the voice of Paytm ads in the industry and present Paytm&#39;s advertising solutions to CXOs, media heads, brand managers, agency partners of large brands in the market.\n Build a strong pipeline of media briefs and respond with customized pitches and proposals aligned with the client’s business and marketing objectives.\n Work closely with the campaign delivery and optimization team to monitor and deliver expected results to the advertiser.\n Lead initiatives which require significant cross team collaboration to build innovative advertising solutions for key advertisers.\n Provide constant feedback to the product team to improve advertising\nperformance and customer experience.\n\nDesired Qualifications:\n Relevant years of experience in advertising sales managing large clients (digital preferred) for the vertical lead, relevant years of experience for the account manager.\n Experience in handling Government clients is must.\n Proven experience in managing programs / categories / business verticals.\n Strong stakeholder management experience; ability to work cross-functionally and with a wide range of employees with different skill sets.\n Ability to deep-dive into a problem; very strong analytical and presentation skills required.\n High bias for action required.\n Ability to thrive and perform in an ambiguous setting; sound judgment and flexibility in balancing program requirements, tight deadlines, and keeping people and projects moving on schedule.\n\nWhy join us:\nWe offer you the opportunity to develop your career, working in a diverse and inclusive workplace where the diverse backgrounds, perspectives and life experiences of our people are celebrated and create a great place to grow, thrive and belong. Most importantly, for us Work is Fun!!\n\nCompensation:\nIf you are the right fit, we believe in creating wealth for you with enviable 500 mn+ registered users,21 mn+ merchants and depth of data in our ecosystem, we are in a unique position to democratize credit for deserving consumers & merchants – and we are committed to it. India’s largest digital lending story is brewing here. It’s your opportunity to be a part of the story! democratize credit for deserving consumers & merchants – and we are committed to it. India’s largest digital lending story is brewing here.\n','1790149346688',NULL,'https://jobs.lever.co/paytm/535dbc67-3694-42df-9652-072981446f44/apply','https://api.lever.co/v0/postings/paytm?mode=json','2026-10-13T12:17:34.456683+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_LEVER)','5d95202f9c72fcccee06956db4dfc4e561d3e75532232d5381bedecf5b590214','COMP_TOP200_095','https://jobs.lever.co/paytm/535dbc67-3694-42df-9652-072981446f44/apply','5ee7d993f06e038df9ccbb2d7adef4ca',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Govt. Ad Sales - Senior Manager/DGM - Paytm Ads - Mumbai\", \"location\": \"Mumbai, Maharashtra\", \"date\": null, \"function\": \"Paytm Ads\", \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities\", \"Qualifications\", \"Company Description\"]}','ATS_API_LEVER','2026-10-12 01:20:33.897327',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:32:33.072901',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:32:33.072901',NULL,'<!doctype html><html class=\"no-js\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"/><meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\"/><title>Online recharge | Easy mobile recharge for prepaid and \n    postpaid bill @Paytm.com</title><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=0\"/><meta http-equiv=\"Cache-Control\" content=\"no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://paytm.com/ca