is and management decision-making.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nCA / ICWA',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Deputy-Manager-Credit-Management-MUM/1438611700','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=80','2026-10-13T10:46:22.237111+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','38cd528eea02b5a95af682c0c3c05d788cefbe1895af076ebd1ef10e179b6d17','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Deputy-Manager-Credit-Management-MUM/1438611700','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Deputy Manager - Credit Management\", \"location\": \"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(FD), IN\", \"external_id\": \"1438611700\", \"raw_evidence\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Deputy Manager - Credit Management\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1438611700\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Mumbai-A_O-Deputy-Manager-Credit-Management-MUM/1438611700/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(FD), IN\\\"}\"}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:09.991450',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:09.986114',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:09.986114',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href