AD), IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=360\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Strategic Sourcing - Vehicle Proprietary\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1424744300\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Mumbai-A_O-Strategic-Sourcing-Vehicle-Proprietary-MUM/1424744300/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Strategic-Sourcing-Vehicle-Proprietary-MUM/1424744300/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1424744300\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN','Strategic Sourcing - Vehicle Proprietary'),(5881,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_2c5e1b66ca99','Deputy General Manager - Smart Factory',NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan_MahTower, IN','Chakan_MahTower','India',NULL,NULL,'\'- Experience with Manufacturing Technology platforms such as Siemens, Rockwell, Mitsubishi, Schneider Electric, SAP, Mi','BE',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\n\'- Develop and execute the Smart Factory / Industry 4.0 roadmap aligned with business and manufacturing objectives.\n- Identify opportunities for digitalization, automation, connected operations, and data-driven decision-making.\n- Lead implementation of technologies such as:\n- Industrial IoT (IIoT)\n- MES/MOM systems\n- SCADA and PLC integration\n- Machine connectivity and industrial networks\n- Digital dashboards and real-time production monitoring\n- Advanced analytics and AI/ML\n- Predictive maintenance\n- Digital quality management\n- Digital work instructions and operator solutions\n- Digital twins and simulation\n- Robotics and autonomous systems\n- Integrate OT systems with IT platforms, ensuring secure and reliable data flow.\n- Develop manufacturing KPIs, dashboards, and analytics for OEE, downtime, throughput, quality, scrap, energy, and maintenance performance.\n- Lead pilot projects and scale successful digital solutions across production lines and plants.\n- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to understand business problems and translate them into practical digital solutions.\n- Establish standards and best practices for smart manufacturing architecture, data, connectivity, and technology deployment.\n- Evaluate emerging Industry 4.0 technologies and recommend solutions based on business value, scalability, and ROI.\n- Support cybersecurity, data governance, system reliability, and compliance requirements for connected manufacturing environments.\n- Develop business cases, investment proposals, project plans, and ROI assessments for smart factory initiatives.\n- Manage external technology partners, system integrators, and solution providers.\n- Train and coach manufacturing teams on digital tools, technologies, and data-driven ways of working.\n- Establish continuous-improvement mechanisms to measure and sustain the benefits of digital transformation.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\n\'- Smart Manufacturing & Industry 4.0\n- Digital Transformation\n- Manufacturing Automation\n- IT/OT Integration\n- Industrial IoT\n- Manufacturing Data & Analytics\n- Continuous Improvement\n- Project & Change Management\n- Technology Strategy\n- Cross-functional Leadership\n- Problem Solving\n- Innovation & Business Acumen',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Deputy-General-Manager-Smart-Factory-Chak/1424769800','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=240','2026-10-13T12:16:11.490029+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','e1f86d72c3085279eb2c9bc52c78ab2e8f81979c12770a07289c3a70f2878556','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Deputy-General-Manager-Smart-Factory-Chak/1424769800','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Deputy General Manager - Smart Factory\", \"l