on\\\": \\\"Apply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zaheerabad, Zaheerabad-FD, IN','Dy.Manager - ER & D  FD ZHB'),(5890,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_21d2ecfbbab9','Manager-MQA Aggregates',NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan, IN','Chakan','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nProvide quality system support & mentoring in the department to ensure the process and outgoing product quality meets the specified requirements.\nResolving Customer complaints, failed part analysis, ICA/PCA identification, Verification & Implementation & Communicate planned actions to PVT & Service.\nEnsure that customer focus is maintained at different buyoffs and is regularly calibrated and aligned to audit results.\nSupport for analysis of quality concerns & ensure quality tools / techniques are used as per MQS guidelines.\nFacilitate all the manufacturing and other areas in using quality tools and techniques & ensuring defect free product\nEnsure proper MIS for management reporting, timely & periodical updation & release\nPro-actively identify process gaps, concerns, and executing corrective measures along with CFT\nChange Management- FTR Approval (Fitment Verification jointly with CFT), APQP activities & documentation\nOn time closure of New project quality gateway deliverables for new models & ensuring First time right product\nEstablish and sustain Quality Management System as per ISO 9001:2015 / IATF 16949 standard',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Manager-MQA-Aggregates-Chak/1434253900','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=300','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','65ef72c3b48df5846cdae15c86b8c1f51462d39d3b7a6ce38fe99fa542652df4','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahi