fied requirements.\nResolving Customer complaints, failed part analysis, ICA/PCA identification, Verification & Implementation & Communicate planned actions to PVT & Service.\nEnsure that customer focus is maintained at different buyoffs and is regularly calibrated and aligned to audit results.\nSupport for analysis of quality concerns & ensure quality tools / techniques are used as per MQS guidelines.\nFacilitate all the manufacturing and other areas in using quality tools and techniques & ensuring defect free product\nEnsure proper MIS for management reporting, timely & periodical updation & release\nPro-actively identify process gaps, concerns, and executing corrective measures along with CFT\nChange Management- FTR Approval (Fitment Verification jointly with CFT), APQP activities & documentation\nOn time closure of New project quality gateway deliverables for new models & ensuring First time right product\nEstablish and sustain Quality Management System as per ISO 9001:2015 / IATF 16949 standard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"Provide quality system support & mentoring in the department to ensure the process and outgoing product quality meets the specified requirements.\\\\nResolving Customer complaints, failed part analysis, ICA/PCA identification, Verification & Implementation & Communicate planned actions to PVT & Service.\\\\nEnsure that customer focus is maintained at different buyoffs and is regularly calibrated and aligned to audit results.\\\\nSupport for analysis of quality concerns & ensure quality tools / techniques are used as per MQS guidelines.\\\\nFacilitate all the manufacturing and other areas in using quality tools and techniques & ensuring defect free product\\\\nEnsure proper MIS for management reporting, timely & periodical updation & release\\\\nPro-actively identify process gaps, concerns, and executing corrective measures along with CFT\\\\nChange Management- FTR Approval (Fitment Verification jointly with CFT), APQP activities & documentation\\\\nOn time closure of New project quality gateway deliverables for new models & ensuring First time right product\\\\nEstablish and sustain Quality Management System as per ISO 9001:2015 / IATF 16949 standard\\\", \\\"System Generated Secondary Skills\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nEngineer, Automotive, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Chakan\", \"title\": \"Manager-MQA Aggregates\", \"location\": \"Chakan, Chakan, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=400\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Manager-MQA Aggregates\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1434253900\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Chakan-Manager-MQA-Aggregates-Chak/1434253900/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Chakan, Chakan, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Manager-MQA-Aggregates-Chak/1434253900/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1434253900\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan, IN','Manager-MQA Aggregates'),(5891,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_53877d2405c2','Assistant Manager- PMO (FD CDMM)',NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan-FD, IN','Chakan-FD','India',NULL,NULL,'Expertise in budget estimation and cost estimation for Electriacal & Electronics parts','BE',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nPart Development\n1. Maintain the part-wise BOM & meet the associated Capex related to the part development\n2. Delivery as per the material cost targets and investmenst for bought-out parts\n3. Delivery of the right quality of parts w.r.t. Project MRD in co-ordination with CDMM delivery team\n4. Ensure timely completion of vendor PPAP & Handover to SQE/SCM - Work closely with CDMM delivery team\nTechnical\n1. SOR/Drawing release - Timely fonalization of Supplier Inputs & Cost feasibility inputs in co-ordination with PEL\n2. Technical Sign-off  - Timely completion of technical sign-off alongwith PEL & COE with capable suppliers meeting the TCP targets\nTechno-commercial\n1. Quote Synthesis - Ensure quality and timely submission of Quote Synthesis (Incl - Supplier feedback, Capex/Investment, Part pricing, & Process) along-with CDMM delivery team.\n2 . Ensure supplier capacity to suplly parts as per projected volume in time & at scale\n3. Decision on cost treade-off for the commodity to minimize TCP deviations at vehicle level\n4. Ensure the underlying assumptions of SBC, SOR, & QS are similar To monitor QCD performance of project on a periodic basis\nCommercial\n1. SUpplier Panel &VOB : Co-ordinate with CDMM, SSU for timely closure of project VOBs with the help of PSL\n2. Ensure only the suppliers meeting the technical sign-off gets on-boarded.\nOther Business Decisions\n1. Project Budget Estimation  - Provide Part development related inputs to PPH for business case preperation\n2. System-level target drill down - Provide inputs on ttechno-commercial feasibility to PEL\n3. MAke Vs Buy Decision - Timely inputs for the finalizatio of Make Vs Buy inline with platform TCP targets, in co-ordination with PPH, PMH, & CDMM Counterparts\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\n\'Technical\n- Good knowledge of Cables, Electriacal & Electronics parts - Wiring Harness,Switches, Sensors\n- Excellent knowledge of supplier base for cables, Electriacal & Electronics parts\n- Expertise in budget estimation and cost estimation for Electriacal & Electronics parts\nLeadership\n• Very good leadership skills with excellent communication\n• Good Negotiation skills\n• Good interpersonal skills and team player\n• Conflict resolution',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Assistant-Manager-PMO-%28FD-CDMM%29-Chak/1381616000','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=300','2026-10-13T12:16:33.829330+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','e3ff808b9aadea4f13ca72403608699b5e8dd8170ffc3c8b2a41f6612a784251','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Assistant-Manager-PMO-%28FD-CDMM%29-Chak/1381616000','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Assistant Manager- PMO (FD CDMM)\", \"location\": \"Chakan, Chakan-FD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"General Requirements\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:28.041816',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:28.037282',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:28.037282',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/j2w/j2w.fallbacks.js\"></script>\n                \n                \n                <script type=\"text/