er cyber security risks through designated cyber risk assessment tools.\n5)Coordinate with suppliers to develop, implement, and close action plans identified during onsite assessments, digital assessments, and audits.\n6) Coordinate with suppliers, service providers, and internal stakeholders to organize and conduct training programs related to supplier business capability building and risk management.\n7)Prepare and maintain MIS reports and dashboards for management review and decision-making.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Manager-Supplier-Risk-Managemen-MUM/1424272800','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=300','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','c277f6017a003cd96bc47ee318662ec71a77c2cdca399ccaf6317a4537df7481','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Manager-Supplier-Risk-Managemen-MUM/1424272800','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Manager - Supplier Risk Managemen\", \"location\": \"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Education Qualification\", \"General Experience\", \"System Generated Secondary Skills\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:28.905156',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:28.900919',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\"