\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Haridwar\", \"title\": \"Deputy Manager - CAI\", \"location\": \"Haridwar, Haridwar Plant, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=440\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Deputy Manager - CAI\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433766900\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Haridwar-Deputy-Manager-CAI-Hari/1433766900/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Haridwar, Haridwar Plant, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Haridwar-Deputy-Manager-CAI-Hari/1433766900/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433766900\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Haridwar, Haridwar Plant, IN','Deputy Manager - CAI'),(5894,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_b972c45f0f0e','DGM - Partnerships & Alliances',NULL,NULL,'Mumbai - Worli, Mumbai - Worli, IN','Mumbai - Worli','India',NULL,NULL,'Expertise in financial modelling, valuation techniques, and strategic analysis.','Bachelor',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nWe are seeking a dynamic leader to drive Mahindra Group’s growth through strategic acquisitions, partnerships, and alliances. This role will involve identifying high-value opportunities, structuring deals, and performing thorough due diligence. As DGM, you will work closely with senior leadership to align deals with long-term business objectives and ensure seamless execution with internal and external stakeholders.\nKey Responsibilities:\nM&A Strategy Development:\nFormulate and drive the group’s M&A strategy, aligning with long-term business goals and growth priorities.\nOpportunity Identification:\nScout for acquisition targets, partnership prospects, and divestiture opportunities that align with strategic priorities.\nDeal Lifecycle Management:\nLead the complete deal process—due diligence, financial modelling, valuation, negotiations, and deal closure.\nCross-Functional Collaboration:\nCoordinate with internal teams (strategy, finance, legal, HR, and operations) to ensure smooth evaluation, execution, and integration.\nStrategic Insights:\nProvide actionable insights to executive leadership on market trends, competitive landscapes, and new business opportunities.\nExternal Stakeholder Management:\nBuild strong relationships with external advisors, investment banks, legal teams, and consultants to streamline deals.\nMarket Research & Business Intelligence:\nStay on top of industry trends and emerging opportunities to shape M&A strategies and corporate investments.\nCorporate Strategy Support:\nAssist with broader strategic initiatives, including joint ventures, strategic investments, and alliances beyond M&A.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nFinancial Acumen:\nExpertise in financial modelling, valuation techniques, and strategic analysis.\nCommunication Skills:\nExceptional communication and presentation skills to articulate complex ideas effectively to leadership and stakeholders.\nLeadership & Project Management:\nStrong leadership, project management, and cross-functional collaboration abilities.\nAdaptability:\nAbility to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic business environment with shifting priorities.\nIndustry Knowledge:\nDeep understanding of competitive landscapes, market trends, and industry dynamics.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-Worli-DGM-Partnerships-&-Alliances-Mumb/1433773700','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=320','2026-10-13T12:16:35.248223+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','f17b0e75a94217d284bb16140fae0f7aa06f4a2c00b7d246b2c0765aafda507e','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-Worli-DGM-Partnerships-&-Alliances-Mumb/1433773700','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"DGM - Partnerships & Allian