s social sport statistics steel stories sustainability tech technology trails twitter users valley video views visit watch wheelers work world youtube\" />\n\n    <meta prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns#\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta prefix=\"og: http://ogp.me/ns#\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Mahindra Careers\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd is a billion-dollar global enterprise headquartered in India with operations spanning over 21 industries in more than 100 countries.\" />\n                <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/fed09ea3-5cdb-4e2b-a362-c.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/customHeader.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/sitebuilderframework.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/BS3ColumnizedSearch.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/fontawesome4.7/css/font-awesome-4.7.0.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n<style>\nbody > .modal-backdrop {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n.menu.desktop .nav > li .dropdown-menu li a{ color : white !important}\n#header .links a{ color: white !important;}\n.dropdown-menu.company-dropdown.headerdropdown.backgroundcolordc8b140b5a119dc3 .menu{ color : black !important}\n.custom-header-menu .nav.nav-pills{ width: 807px !important; }\n.custom-header-signinLanguage .inner.limitwidth{ max-width: 1200px; }\n.customPlugin{ margin-bottom: 0 !important; }\n\n</style>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\"></script></body>\n\n        \n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"//rmkcdn.successfactors.com/1bf0fd1f/9349339a-5cfe-46bb-98d8-3.png\" type=\"image/x-icon\" />\n            <style id=\"antiClickjack\" type=\"text/css\">body{display:none !important;}</style>\n            <script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"antiClickJackScript\">\n                if (self === top) {\n                    var antiClickjack = document.getElementById(\"antiClickjack\");',NULL,'All populated fields verified against raw source evidence.','STALE',NULL,'SuccessFactors',NULL,NULL,'Mumbai A.O',1,'2026-10-13T12:16:35.792606+00:00','1433900500',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1. Capacity Planning & Readiness',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"1. Capacity Planning & Readiness\\\", \\\"1. Capacity Planning & Readiness\\\": \\\"Drive long-term capacity planning aligned with production and business growth plans.\\\\nEstablish supplier capacity mapping and readiness assessment across critical commodities and platforms.\\\\nIdentify capacity constraints, risks, and bottlenecks; develop and execute mitigation plans.\\\\nLead supplier capacity enhancement projects and monitor execution through launch and stabilization phases.\\\\nGovern capacity readiness for new product programs and growth initiatives.\\\\n2. New Project Capacity & Industrialization\\\", \\\"2. New Project Capacity & Industrialization\\\": \\\"Lead capacity assessments for new and carry-over parts during sourcing and project approval stages.\\\\nEnsure supplier manufacturing readiness, investment adequacy, and capacity feasibility.\\\\nDrive cross-functional reviews and track industrialization and capacity commissioning plans.\\\\n3. Supply Chain Risk Management & Business Continuity\\\", \\\"3. Supply Chain Risk Management & Business Continuity\\\": \\\"Develop capacity risk dashboards and early warning mechanisms.\\\\nIdentify vulnerable and single-source supply situations and drive alternate sourcing strategies.\\\\nLead contingency planning and proactively manage supply chain risks to ensure business continuity.\\\\n4. Supply Disruption & Capacity Challenge Resolution\\\", \\\"4. Supply Disruption & Capacity Challenge Resolution\\\": \\\"Support resolution of critical supply issues arising from capacity constraints.\\\\nDrive debottlenecking and capacity improvement initiatives at supplier locations.\\\\nLead reviews and closure of key supply chain and capacity-related issues.\\\\n5. Supplier Development & Stakeholder Management\\\", \\\"5. Supplier Development & Stakeholder Management\\\": \\\"Build strong partnerships with key suppliers and influence capacity investment decisions.\\\\nSupport supplier evaluation from a scalability and capacity perspective.\\\\nPromote best practices in capacity planning, productivity, and manufacturing excellence.\\\\n6. Governance & Functional Leadership\\\", \\\"6. Governance & Functional Leadership\\\": \\\"Establish standard processes, tools, and governance mechanisms for capacity planning.\\\\nDrive leadership reviews on capacity readiness, risks, and mitigation plans.\\\\nMentor teams and strengthen organizational capability in supplier capacity assessment and risk evaluation.\\\", \\\"Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"Capacity readiness for current and future business requirements.\\\\nEarly identification and mitigation of supplier capacity risks.\\\\nSuccessful execution of supplier capacity enhancement initiatives.\\\\nImproved supply chain resilience and business continuity.\\\\nEffective governance of capacity planning across commodities and platforms.\\\\nCapacity readiness for new product launches and growth programs.\\\", \\\"Education Qualification\\\": \\\"Bachelors of Technology; Bachelor of Engineering; Bachelors of Technology in Mechanical; Bachelors of Technology in Electrical and Electronics; Bachelors of Technology in Electronics and Telecommunication; Bachelor of Engineering in Mechanical; Bachelor of Engineering in Electrical and Electronics; Bachelor of Engineering in Electronics and Telecommunication\\\", \\\"General Experience\\\": \\\"15\\\\u00a0- 20 years of experience in Automotive Sourcing, Supply Chain, Supplier Development, Manufacturing Excellence, Industrial Engineering, or Capacity Planning.\\\", \\\"Critical Experience\\\": \\\"Proven experience in leading supplier capacity creation and supply chain risk mitigation initiatives.\\\\nExperience in managing cross-functional teams and influencing senior stakeholders.\\\\nExposure to new program management, supplier industrialization, and business continuity planning.\\\", \\\"System Generated Secondary Skills\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nIndustrial Engineer, Engineer, Electrical, Automotive, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Mumbai A.O\", \"title\": \"Lead - Capacity Planning (Vehicle Systems)\", \"location\": \"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=460\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Lead - Capacity Planning (Vehicle Systems)\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433900500\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Mumbai-A_O-Lead-Capacity-Planning-%28Vehicle-Systems%29-MUM/1433900500/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Mumbai-A_O-Lead-Capacity-Planning-%28Vehicle-Systems%29-MUM/1433900500/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433900500\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mumbai A.O, MUM-KND-AFS(AD), IN','Lead - Capacity Planning (Vehicle Systems)'),(5898,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_b348d5e1ec5c','Senior Engineer - VIPTIS',NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Chennai-MRV-AD','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\nBenchmark data collection for Exterior Interior vehicle dimensions as per SAE J1100 in Standard template\nBenchmarking for Occupant protection and Side Impact dimensions\nCollect Passenger compartment Integration must and wants from assembly and service\nCollect lessons learnt from other projects on overall vehicle passenger compartment and ensure implementation\nPreparation of Seating Buck\nFunctional block diagrams, Interface mapping Clearance Clash analysis\nGenerate Individual lessons learnt document at respective gateways\nCollect lessons learnt from other projects on assembly DMU and ensure implementation\nCollect must and wants from assembly team\nCollect tentative Process Flow Chart for Identifying DMU Assay DVP\nIdentify Assembly DMU DVP with CME team\nConduct DMU Assembly simulations of vehicle systems for Assembly feasibility, operator reach tool reach\nAssembly simulation DVP signoff by VV Gateway\nDigital to actual monitoring of assembly on prototype vehicle builds\nExperience\n2 to 3 years in Vehicle Integration.\nIndustry Preferred\nQualifications\nB.E/B.Tech, M.E/M.Tech\nGeneral Requirements\nOur commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\nAt Mahindra and Mahindra Limited, we believe that diversity drives innovation, and inclusion is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to cultivating a workplace where every individual feels valued, respected, and empowered to thrive.\nWe are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to age, caste, race, religion, color, ethnic origin, gender identity, nationality, physical or mental disability, medical condition, sexual orientation, educational background, marital or domestic partnership status,