king skills.\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively in cross-functional teams and with senior stakeholders.\nJob Segment:\nEngineer, Engineering, Automotive\nApply Now\nStart apply with LinkedIn\nStart\nPlease wait...',NULL,'Digital Transformation Strategy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Summary\\\": \\\"The role is responsible for driving digital transformation across the sales and pre-sales value chain of the EV Commercial Vehicle business, by identifying process improvement opportunities, implementing technology solutions (CRM, mobile applications, portals, and Gen AI-enabled tools), and enabling data-driven decision-making. The role acts as the bridge between business functions (Sales, Marketing, Customer Experience) and technology teams, and is accountable for the end-to-end digitisation of the pre-sales and sales journey \\\\u2014 from lead generation through to conversion \\\\u2014 while accelerating operational excellence, enhancing customer experience, and supporting organisational growth through digital innovation.\\\", \\\"Key Responsibilities\\\": \\\"Digital Transformation Strategy\\\", \\\"Digital Transformation Strategy\\\": \\\"Develop and execute digital transformation roadmaps for the sales and pre-sales function, aligned with business objectives.\\\\nIdentify opportunities to improve operational efficiency through automation, digitisation, and emerging technologies such as Gen AI.\\\\nCollaborate with business leaders to define transformation priorities and success metrics.\\\\nDrive adoption of digital-first practices across the sales, marketing and service functions.\\\\nSales & Pre-Sales Digitization\\\", \\\"Sales & Pre-Sales Digitization\\\": \\\"Own the EV Commercial Vehicle pre-sales digitisation process end-to-end, including CRM (Salesforce) and mobile application rollout.\\\\nDigitise the marketing lead-generation process leveraging Generative AI for portfolio analysis and targeting.\\\\nCreate and own the product roadmap for all digital products (portals and websites) supporting sales and pre-sales.\\\\nAnalyse and streamline existing sales processes, identifying areas for improvement and automation.\\\\nBusiness Process Excellence\\\", \\\"Business Process Excellence\\\": \\\"Analyse existing business processes and identify improvement opportunities.\\\\nLead process re-engineering initiatives to improve productivity, quality, and customer experience.\\\\nImplement best practices for workflow optimisation and standardisation.\\\\nTrack and measure process performance through KPIs and dashboards.\\\\nTechnology & Solution Implementation\\\", \\\"Technology & Solution Implementation\\\": \\\"Lead the evaluation, selection, and deployment of digital platforms and business applications, including CRM, sales automation platforms and analytics tools.\\\\nManage implementation of low-code/no-code solutions, workflow automation, and enterprise systems.\\\\nCoordinate with internal IT teams, external vendors, and business stakeholders.\\\\nEnsure solutions meet business, security, and compliance requirements, including data privacy (DPDPA).\\\\nData Analytics & Reporting\\\", \\\"Data Analytics & Reporting\\\": \\\"Champion data-driven decision-making across the organisation.\\\\nDesign and implement management dashboards and reporting frameworks.\\\\nLeverage analytics to identify trends, opportunities, and business insights.\\\\nImprove data quality, governance, and accessibility.\\\\nStakeholder Management\\\", \\\"Stakeholder Management\\\": \\\"Act as a key liaison between business functions (Sales, Marketing, CX) and technology teams.\\\\nFacilitate workshops, requirement-gathering sessions, and solution reviews; prepare BRDs and user stories with acceptance criteria.\\\\nBuild strong relationships with leadership teams to drive transformation adoption.\\\\nManage change management and user adoption activities, including impact and risk analysis.\\\\nProject & Program Management\\\", \\\"Project & Program Management\\\": \\\"Lead cross-functional digital projects from conceptualisation to deployment.\\\\nDefine project scope, timelines, budgets, and resource requirements.\\\\nMonitor project risks and ensure timely delivery of outcomes, including UAT sign-off.\\\\nReport progress, benefits realisation, and ROI to senior management.\\\\nInnovation & Emerging Technologies\\\", \\\"Innovation & Emerging Technologies\\\": \\\"Evaluate emerging technologies such as AI, Generative AI, RPA, IoT, and advanced analytics.\\\\nIdentify use cases that create measurable business value in the sales and pre-sales journey.\\\\nConduct pilots and proof-of-concepts for innovative solutions.\\\\nFoster a culture of continuous improvement and innovation.\\\", \\\"Job Profile\\\": \\\"Work closely with key stakeholders across Sales, Marketing, Service and operations to understand business needs and objectives, translating them into actionable product requirements, BRDs, user stories with clear acceptance criteria.\\\\nEvaluate, select, and implement digital tools and technologies that enhance the sales and pre-sales process, including CRM systems (Salesforce Sales Cloud / Service Cloud), sales automation platforms, mobile applications, and analytics / Gen AI tools.\\\\nCreate and own the product roadmap for all digital products (mobile applications, portals and websites) supporting EV pre-sales and sales digitisation, in line with business requirements.\\\\nAnalyse and streamline existing sales and service processes, identifying areas for improvement, automation, and Gen AI-led digitisation (e.g. marketing lead-generation and portfolio analysis).\\\\nCollaborate with the design team to create the best user experience for product features and co-design UI mock-ups and wireframes; work closely with engineering through the full product development lifecycle from concept to commercial launch.\\\\nLead the end-to-end product development lifecycle, from ideation to implementation, ensuring timely and successful delivery of digital products, including User Acceptance Testing (UAT) sign-off.\\\\nLead change management processes and execute impact analysis to identify, analyse, and prepare risk-mitigation tactics that improve product strategy and drive user adoption.\\\\nEnsure digital products and processes are designed and implemented in alignment with data privacy and regulatory requirements (e.g. DPDPA).\\\", \\\"Key Skills\\\": \\\"Digital Transformation Strategy\\\\nBusiness Process Re-engineering (BPR)\\\\nProject & Program Management\\\\nBusiness Analysis & Requirements Management (BRDs, User Stories)\\\\nData Analytics and Dashboarding\\\\nProcess Automation and Workflow Design\\\\nChange Management & GTM\\\\nStakeholder Engagement (Sales, Marketing, IT, Engineering)\\\\nProblem Solving and Decision Making\\\\nTeam Collaboration & Vendor Management\\\\nCRM Systems (Salesforce Sales Cloud & Service Cloud)\\\\nERP (SAP)\\\\nDealer Management System (DMS)\\\\nMobile Application Product Management\\\\nDriving Product Roadmaps, UX/UI Wireframing & Mock-ups\\\\nAgile and Waterfall Project Management Methodologies\\\\nAI and Generative AI Applications (Pre-Sales / Marketing)\\\\nData Privacy & Compliance (DPDPA)\\\", \\\"Key Performance Indicators\\\": \\\"Digital adoption rate\\\\nProcess / sales-cycle efficiency improvement (%)\\\\nAutomation benefits realised\\\\nProject delivery timelines\\\\nCost optimisation achieved\\\\nROI from digital initiatives\\\\nData quality & reporting accuracy\\\\nSales digitization / lead-to-conversion uplift\\\\nUAT sign-off & product launch adherence\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"6 to 10 years of overall experience, with demonstrated exposure to digital transformation / sales-process digitization, ideally within automotive, EV, or allied manufacturing businesses.\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"Bachelor\'s degree in Engineering or a related field (e.g. Mechanical, Computer Science, Auto Manufacturing).\\\\nMBA / PGDM (IT or Systems) or equivalent qualification preferred.\\\\nStrong analytical and data-driven decision-making skills.\\\\nExcellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively in cross-functional teams and with senior stakeholders.\\\\nJob Segment:\\\\nEngineer, Engineering, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"job_title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mumbai, MUMBAI-KND-AD, IN','Manager - Digital Transformation'),(5901,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_a55883ca8823','Lead Engineer-Electrical & Electronics',NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Chennai-MRV-AD','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nThe role requires a deep understanding of various communication protocols (CAN, TCP/IP, HTTP, MQTT, LIN, UART) and embedded architectures.\nTelematics Protocol Expertise\n: Hands-on experience with serial protocols, CAN analysis (vector-canoe, CANalyzer), and CAN simulation tools.\nSoftware Testing\n: Proficiency in integration, black-box, sanity, smoke, unit testing, and validation of software APIs.\nDefect & Log Analysis\n: Identify defects, generate reports, and perform log analysis for debugging.\nNetwork Simulators\n: Knowledge of 2G, 3G, 4G simulators is advantageous.\nCellular Protocols\n: Familiarity with 5G, LTE, UMTS, GSM, and location-based technologies is a plus.\nSystem Knowledge\n: Strong understanding of hardware systems, I/Os, and debugging processes.\nCloud & Security\n: Exposure to cloud technologies, product security methods, and connectivity trends.\nMobile & ECU Testing\n: Experience with mobile app testing and automotive ECUs from a telematics perspective.',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Lead-Engineer-Electrical-&-Electronics-Chen/1423347500','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=340','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','0527f5b5f064be15fa85badbf35e5c24fbdc2ea12a16eb198fa6ab1a86c878d3','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Lead-Engineer-Electrical-&-Electronics-Chen/1423347500','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Lead Engineer-Electrical & Electronics\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:31.591735',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:31.586062',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/j2w/j2w.fallbacks.js\"></script>\n                \n                \n                <script type=\