ia at system level interfacing to Software and Hardware\n3) Drive System Architecture design discussions with EV Module teams including embedded software and hardware teams\n4) Able to create Block Diagram, Flow charts, State Diagrams, Sequence Diagrams and timing diagrams for a function\n5) Lead any new technology/ new function discussion and adopt the same into system architecture\n6) Be the focal point for any change requirements and assess the impact on the vehicle architecture/design/performance/etc\n7) Drive in-depth technical discussions on the areas of system architecture of electric powertrain\n8) Able to create System degradation strategies applicable to EV domain\n9) Thorough Knowledge on Automotive Communication Networks CAN, LIN, Ethernet\n10) Hands on experience on ALM Polarian, CANOE, Canalyzer, CAN db++ editor, Matlab/ Simulink and Diagnostic tools\n11) Ability to Debug ongoing field concerns and provide relevant solution on the Requirement and Architecture level',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"Expertise in Architecting and designing system functions for Electric Vehicle Powertrains:\\\\n1) Identify, Analyse and synthesize all the stakeholder\\\\u2019s needs, Vehicle Requirements (VRS), Service requirements, Homologation requirements, Customer, System Design requirements (SDS)\\\\n2) Designs the system architecture of various vehicle level functions, entry and exit criteria at system level interfacing to Software and Hardware\\\\n3) Drive System Architecture design discussions with EV Module teams including embedded software and hardware teams\\\\n4) Able to create Block Diagram, Flow charts, State Diagrams, Sequence Diagrams and timing diagrams for a function\\\\n5) Lead any new technology/ new function discussion and adopt the same into system architecture\\\\n6) Be the focal point for any change requirements and assess the impact on the vehicle architecture/design/performance/etc\\\\n7) Drive in-depth technical discussions on the areas of system architecture of electric powertrain\\\\n8) Able to create System degradation strategies applicable to EV domain\\\\n9) Thorough Knowledge on Automotive Communication Networks CAN, LIN, Ethernet\\\\n10) Hands on experience on ALM Polarian, CANOE, Canalyzer, CAN db++ editor, Matlab/ Simulink and Diagnostic tools\\\\n11) Ability to Debug ongoing field concerns and provide relevant solution on the Requirement and Architecture level\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"3-6 Years\\\", \\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nArchitecture, Automotive, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Bangalore\", \"title\": \"Deputy Manager - System Architecture\", \"location\": \"Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=480\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Deputy Manager - System Architecture\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433297800\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Bangalore-Deputy-Manager-System-Architecture-Bang/1433297800/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Bangalore-Deputy-Manager-System-Architecture-Bang/1433297800/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433297800\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bangalore, Banglore CO, IN','Deputy Manager - System Architecture'),(5903,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_48eee58cdc93','Deputy Manager MQA Engine',NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan, IN','Chakan','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\n● To coordinate the Quality activities.\n● Understand Custom