nchmark Quality Parameters and Improve Product Quality of Tools and Dies.\\\\n\\\\u25cf Working closely with various stakeholders (Internal & External)\\\\n\\\\u25cf In process & Final inspection of the Panels, Dies & Fixtures.\\\\n\\\\u25cf Generating Quality indicator dashboard for Senior Management reviews highlighting key quality risks.\\\\n\\\\u25cf To carryout Different Audits like\\\\u00a0 Process Audit & GNODA-C / GNOFA-C Audit.\\\\n\\\\u25cf To carry MSA & SPC study.\\\\n\\\\u25cf To maintain the Measuring Instruments, Accessories, Material handling equipment in good working condition.\\\\n\\\\u25cf To maintain the safe working condition & good house keeping in the Department\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"8 to 10 yrs\\\", \\\"Industry Preferred\\\": \\\"Automobile\\\", \\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nAutomotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Chakan\", \"title\": \"Deputy Manager MQA Engine\", \"location\": \"Chakan, Chakan, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=480\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Deputy Manager MQA Engine\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433317500\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Chakan-Deputy-Manager-MQA-Engine-Chak/1433317500/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Chakan, Chakan, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chakan-Deputy-Manager-MQA-Engine-Chak/1433317500/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433317500\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chakan, Chakan, IN','Deputy Manager MQA Engine'),(5904,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_93fa7f5df810','Sr Lead Engineer - Body Systems CoE',NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Chennai-MRV-AD','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,'BE',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nA comprehensive understanding of vehicle durability, NVH and crash performance\nAbility to extract  DVP requirements related to Body systems from PDB (Product Description Book) provided by Product Planning.\nSharing Inputs for creating master sections of Body systems and verifying its adequacy with ref to Performance.\nEnsuring Lesson learnt related to performance are deployed  in the early  stage of the design.\nAnalyzing benchmark tests & reports in terms of performance for the Body systems.\nDefining the component and system level DVPs  of Body systems based on RWUP (Real World Usage Pattern) study .\nSetting Performance Targets based on RWUP.\nSharing valuable inputs related to Performance and making  CFMEA and DFMEA Robust.\nDeep  understanding of  materials used in Body systems and  its manufacturing process.\nProvide performance inputs for making BIW CAD data maturity along with relevant Benchmarks\nReview and Analyze  the released Body Systems data and share performance feedback of BIW Joinery, Sections and Load path etc.\nDesign action recommendation/solution based on the CAE results (Crash, NVH, Durability) / Test /Lab results that are not meeting the Performance.\nProvide Design Proposals to meet Weight targets without compromising on Performance.\nGood understanding needed on the Regulation and GNCAP/ENCAP/BENCAP requirement in Crash\nChecking the supplier level DVPs and provide feedback\nVerify the test plan and test setup for component, system and vehicle level testing  sign off.\nAssessing the subsystem & components level testing in the testing Labs\nIdentify Root cause for the BIW/System/Sub-system level failures in vehicle testing / Lab / Supplier Rig level Testing and propose solution to meet Performance Targets in consultation with CoE Heads.\nEnsuring the recommended solutions for any deviation sign off\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nBE  / BTech / ME / MTech in Mechanical / Automobile / CAE',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Sr-Lead-Engineer-Body-Systems-CoE-Chen/1433308500','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=360','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','ca43fe14017f5c7b6edc93d726553171c7ffe89df5f702ad424faad56c11beb1','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Sr-Lead-Engineer-Body-Systems-CoE-Chen/1433308500','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Sr Lead Engineer - Body Systems CoE\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:31.980270',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:31.976158',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform