nd vehicle level testing\\\\u00a0 sign off.\\\\nAssessing the subsystem & components level testing in the testing Labs\\\\nIdentify Root cause for the BIW/System/Sub-system level failures in vehicle testing / Lab / Supplier Rig level Testing and propose solution to meet Performance Targets in consultation with CoE Heads.\\\\nEnsuring the recommended solutions for any deviation sign off\\\", \\\"Experience\\\": \\\"12 to 15 years\\\", \\\"Qualifications\\\": \\\"BE\\\\u00a0 / BTech / ME / MTech in Mechanical / Automobile / CAE\\\", \\\"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\\\": \\\"Job Segment:\\\\nEngineering Manager, Systems Engineer, Manufacturing Engineer, Drafting, Engineering, Automotive\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"',NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Chennai\", \"title\": \"Sr Lead Engineer - Body Systems CoE\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=480\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Sr Lead Engineer - Body Systems CoE\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433308500\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Chennai-Sr-Lead-Engineer-Body-Systems-CoE-Chen/1433308500/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Sr-Lead-Engineer-Body-Systems-CoE-Chen/1433308500/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433308500\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Sr Lead Engineer - Body Systems CoE'),(5905,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_16ad564bdf0d','Customer Engagement Manager - MEAL',NULL,NULL,'Hyderabad, Hyderabad, IN','Hyderabad','India',NULL,NULL,'Designing & Implementing Customer Experience','be',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nCustomer Complaints Management & Social Media (Online Reputation Management)\n1.Follow the processes on Customer complaints Management in Dealer & Regional office fraternities\n2. Monitor Turn Around Time (TAT) for Resolution\n3. Ensure Process Adherence for Listening to Customer Voices on Social media | 1st Level Loop Closure | Constant Customer Updates during Resolution\n4. Real Time Alert for high sentiment situations\n5. Take ownership for key critical organisational reputation influencing situations\n6. Liaison with Sprinklr (Social Listening Tool) & Interactive Avenues (Vendor partner for Social Listening)\n7. Internal Escalation - Highlight Opportunities for Error and Escalate Real time\n8. Provide end to end Sales support to field teams\n9. Support on EV Charging ecosystem end to end\nCustomer relationships\n1. Professionally, courteously and respectfully interact with customers to provide a consistent premium customer experience building dealer after sales loyalty\n2. Act as SPOC to manage EV customer relationships for EV customers\n3. Work on Intello poor feedback\n4. Manage the Unscheduled visits / WH customers and their concerns\nField Sales Support\n1. Real time Field Support on Key concerns (handling approach)\n2. Monitor Repeat Escalations and discuss solutions with the Zonal & Nationals heads (Sales)\n3. Drive corrective actions based on RCA (Root Cause Analysis) of escalated concerns through AO teams\nReal time alerts on Senior Management Escalations\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nDesigning & Implementing Customer Experience\nUnderstanding of Sales ecosystem\nMarket Acumen & Market Intelligence\nIncident Management\nProduct Knowledge & Application\nBasic technical understanding\nAbility to deliver great customer experiences in a very active environment and to be invigorated by constant personal interaction.\nStrong interest in technology, particularly EV/ software products',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Hyderabad-Customer-Engagement-Manager-MEAL-Hyde/1433311000','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=360','2026-10-13T12:16:39.589029+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','34352e51410f7a36d85c9308ad571744ac772a962fa25ad18b720effe80665f7','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Hyderabad-Customer-Engagement-Manager-MEAL-Hyde/1433311000','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Customer Engagement Manager - MEAL\", \"location\": \"Hyderabad, Hyderabad, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Industry Preferred\", \"General Requirements\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:32.025131',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:32.022046',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:32.022046',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n                \n                <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/platform/js/j2w/j2w.fallbacks.js\"></script>\n                \n 