g Officer -MEAL\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1433311100\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Kolkata-Trade-Marketing-Officer-MEAL-Kolk/1433311100/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Kolkata, Kolkata, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Kolkata-Trade-Marketing-Officer-MEAL-Kolk/1433311100/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1433311100\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kolkata, Kolkata, IN','Trade Marketing Officer -MEAL'),(5908,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_55c705872246','Manager - Parts Planning & Pricing',NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV, IN','Chennai-MRV','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Strong knowledge of, Spare Parts Management Functions, , including serviceable parts identification, parts cataloging, pricing processes, procurement readiness, and aftermarket support., Ability to identify and understand, vehicle spare parts, , their applications, serviceability requirements, BOM linkage, and launch readiness requirements., Good understanding of new product launch processes, IDK/IWK parts management, DMS requirements, and spare parts procurement workflows., Job Segment:, Engineer, Automotive, Engineering, Apply Now, Start apply with LinkedIn, Start, Please wait...',NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nCoordinate with cross functional teams including Parts Engineering, PPL, PSL, SBU, Suppliers, ADCC, PMH and PFH to establish and update basic pricing for serviceable parts.\nCarry out basic parts pricing for:\nM6, M4 and M2 project-specific peculiar parts.\nAll International Operations (IO) model project-specific peculiar parts.\nField escalations related to FI, OHSD and Part Infoline.\nEngineering Changes (EN) and Product Action Bulletin (PAB) running change parts for both Domestic and IO markets.\nPrepare commodity-wise Serviceable Parts Lists and circulate them to relevant CFTs for initiation and completion of basic pricing activities.\nConduct periodic reviews and discussions with PPH and PPL teams to obtain supplier quotations required for pricing activities.\nProvide technical clarification and support to PPH, PPL and suppliers to ensure receipt of complete and accurate quotations.\nRegularly review pricing progress with PPL, PSL, SBU, Suppliers, ADCC, PMH and PFH and ensure timely updating and completion of basic pricing in the system.\n\nTECHNICAL SKILLS / KNOWLEDGE:\nStrong knowledge of\nSpare Parts Management Functions\n, including serviceable parts identification, parts cataloging, pricing processes, procurement readiness, and aftermarket support.\nAbility to identify and understand\nvehicle spare parts\n, their applications, serviceability requirements, BOM linkage, and launch readiness requirements.\nGood understanding of new product launch processes, IDK/IWK parts management, DMS requirements, and spare parts procurement workflows.\nJob Segment:\nEngineer, Automotive, Engineering\nApply Now\nStart apply with LinkedIn\nStart\nPlease wait...',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Manager-Parts-Planning-&-Pricing-Chen/1432842800','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=380','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','81811cbb713bb0f26e09fdda07465f296a00adc6bd0bee44717aeefcb83a9fb8','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Manager-Parts-Planning-&-Pricing-Chen/1432842800','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Manager - Parts Planning & Pricing\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Purpose of the role\", \"Key Responsibilities\", \"Education Qualification\", \"General Experience\", \"Technical Knowledge\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:32.816001',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:32.816001',