te them to relevant CFTs for initiation and completion of basic pricing activities.\nConduct periodic reviews and discussions with PPH and PPL teams to obtain supplier quotations required for pricing activities.\nProvide technical clarification and support to PPH, PPL and suppliers to ensure receipt of complete and accurate quotations.\nRegularly review pricing progress with PPL, PSL, SBU, Suppliers, ADCC, PMH and PFH and ensure timely updating and completion of basic pricing in the system.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\"{\\\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\\\": \\\"Purpose of the role\\\", \\\"Purpose of the role\\\": \\\"Ensure timely and accurate completion of Basic Pricing for all serviceable parts to enable spare parts procurement, dealer ordering readiness, and seamless after-sales support for all new vehicle launches across domestic and international markets.\\\\nKey Responsibilities\\\", \\\"Key Responsibilities\\\": \\\"Coordinate with cross functional teams including Parts Engineering, PPL, PSL, SBU, Suppliers, ADCC, PMH and PFH to establish and update basic pricing for serviceable parts.\\\\nCarry out basic parts pricing for:\\\\nM6, M4 and M2 project-specific peculiar parts.\\\\nAll International Operations (IO) model project-specific peculiar parts.\\\\nField escalations related to FI, OHSD and Part Infoline.\\\\nEngineering Changes (EN) and Product Action Bulletin (PAB) running change parts for both Domestic and IO markets.\\\\nPrepare commodity-wise Serviceable Parts Lists and circulate them to relevant CFTs for initiation and completion of basic pricing activities.\\\\nConduct periodic reviews and discussions with PPH and PPL teams to obtain supplier quotations required for pricing activities.\\\\nProvide technical clarification and support to PPH, PPL and suppliers to ensure receipt of complete and accurate quotations.\\\\nRegularly review pricing progress with PPL, PSL, SBU, Suppliers, ADCC, PMH and PFH and ensure timely updating and completion of basic pricing in the system.\\\", \\\"Education Qualification\\\": \\\"BE/Diploma\\\", \\\"General Experience\\\": \\\"Technical Knowledge\\\", \\\"Technical Knowledge\\\": \\\"Strong knowledge of\\\\nSpare Parts Management Functions\\\\n, including serviceable parts identification, parts cataloging, pricing processes, procurement readiness, and aftermarket support.\\\\nAbility to identify and understand\\\\nvehicle spare parts\\\\n, their applications, serviceability requirements, BOM linkage, and launch readiness requirements.\\\\nGood understanding of new product launch processes, IDK/IWK parts management, DMS requirements, and spare parts procurement workflows.\\\\nJob Segment:\\\\nEngineer, Automotive, Engineering\\\\nApply Now\\\\nStart apply with LinkedIn\\\\nStart\\\\nPlease wait...\\\"}\"','Strong knowledge of\nSpare Parts Management Functions\n, including serviceable parts identification, parts cataloging, pricing processes, procurement readiness, and aftermarket support.\nAbility to identify and understand\nvehicle spare parts\n, their applications, serviceability requirements, BOM linkage, and launch readiness requirements.\nGood understanding of new product launch processes, IDK/IWK parts management, DMS requirements, and spare parts procurement workflows.\nJob Segment:\nEngineer, Automotive, Engineering\nApply Now\nStart apply with LinkedIn\nStart\nPlease wait...',NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257','{\"city\": \"Chennai\", \"title\": \"Manager - Parts Planning & Pricing\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV, IN\", \"source_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=500\", \"ats_platform\": \"SuccessFactors\", \"evidence_text\": \"{\\\"title\\\": \\\"Manager - Parts Planning & Pricing\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"1432842800\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"/job/Chennai-Manager-Parts-Planning-&-Pricing-Chen/1432842800/\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"Chennai, Chennai-MRV, IN\\\"}\", \"detail_fetched\": false, \"application_url\": \"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Manager-Parts-Planning-&-Pricing-Chen/1432842800/\", \"external_job_id\": \"1432842800\", \"detail_fetch_status\": \"NOT_FETCHED\"}','ats_direct_successfactors','DIRECT',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV, IN','Manager - Parts Planning & Pricing'),(5909,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_011_f81ca8a49ffc','Senior Engineer- VES',NULL,NULL,'Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN','Chennai-MRV-AD','India',NULL,NULL,NULL,'BE',NULL,NULL,'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\nTo design, develop and implement Lighting System - Exterior & Interior\nBenchmarking of lighting technologies\nPOC, SOR, DVP, TSO & development for lighting systems, meeting all functional, quality & regulatory standards / requirements with in project time line.\nInteract with supplier from concept to SOP capturing all SOR requirements & address build & validation issues\nManaging and tracking of design release, development, validation & field failures\nKnowledge in Optics & CAE Thermal, Vibration & Condensations\nShould have additional knowledge in Wiring harness, Electronics\nReview & release technical specifications & other documentations\nShould have detail knowledge in Optics, CAD packaging & design, DFMEA and GD&T\nMust demonstrate a high degree of problem solving ability, especially in the field of expertise. Usage of  tools used in  DFMEA, problem solving tools and techniques and project management tools ,\nFluent in use of personal computer programs such as Access, Excel, Word, Power Point, project etc.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nInterfacing with all inter dept teams right from marketing to service as so to start from understanding the marketing requirements and till service related activities. i.e., from start to end of project\nAbreast on latest technologies across industry\nMaintaining quality level targets as per agreement\nAdhering to committed timelines\nProgram management & detailed documentation\nOpen to short/medium term travel on need basis, across India & overseas',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Senior-Engineer-VES-Chen/1432843100','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=380','2026-10-17T12:30:19.260257+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'VERIFIED_HTTP_200',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','5b69754f02fc5b7c8bc8b739f91d512ba7e79e3858430334caa8ee7a42862181','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Chennai-Senior-Engineer-VES-Chen/1432843100','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Senior Engineer- VES\", \"location\": \"Chennai, Chennai-MRV-AD, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Qualifications\", \"General Requirements\", \"Our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:32.956172',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:32.953047',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-17 12:30:19.260257',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.css?h=275f70e9\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/csb/css/navbar-fixed-top.css\" />\n 