 readiness, operational efficiency and future infrastructure scalability.\nRoles & Responsibilities:\nLead mechanical design coordination activities across all Greenfield project packages to ensure alignment with project timelines, operational requirements and Start of Production (SOP) readiness.\nCoordinate Civil, Mechanical, Electrical and utility engineering designs to ensure seamless integration of infrastructure, utility systems and manufacturing facilities.\nReview layouts, engineering drawings, technical specifications, utility schematics and design deliverables to ensure compliance with project requirements, statutory regulations and future expansion plans.\nManage engineering consultants, design service providers and technical agencies to achieve project objectives related to quality, cost, delivery and compliance\nDrive design standardization, value engineering and optimization initiatives to improve reliability, maintainability, operational efficiency and lifecycle cost of infrastructure and utility systems.\nIdentify and resolve design interfaces, technical conflicts and project execution constraints to support smooth construction, installation and commissioning activities.\nEnsure timely release, control and revision management of approved drawings, specifications and engineering documents to support procurement, construction and project execution.\nSupport equipment utility integration, installation planning, commissioning activities and operational readiness to ensure successful achievement of SOP milestones.\nMonitor engineering changes, maintain design documentation and ensure compliance with applicable codes, standards, statutory requirements and company engineering practices.\nSupport future capacity expansion, modernization initiatives, utility augmentation and infrastructure optimization projects in line with long-term business growth requirements.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS & REQUIREMENTS:\nB.E./B.Tech Mechanical Engineering\nJob Segment:\nMechanical Engineer, Engineer, Electrical, Engineering, Automotive\nApply Now\nStart apply with LinkedIn\nStart\nPlease wait...',NULL,NULL,'https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Nagpur-Sr_-Manager-Building%2C-Utilities-&-Other-Infrastructure-for-Design-Coordination-%28Mechanical%29-Nagp/1422330600','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/search/?q=&startrow=400','2026-10-13T12:16:41.205999+00:00','EXPIRED',0.98,'PUBLISHED',NULL,'Crawler (ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS)','e98a72a5b4f15ceb069661ac459456ff9ccb2e7d13c70da71e12a4fc0e18128a','COMP_TOP200_011','https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/job/Nagpur-Sr_-Manager-Building%2C-Utilities-&-Other-Infrastructure-for-Design-Coordination-%28Mechanical%29-Nagp/1422330600','d745b4b7d7619bb600dcbb9abbe6fe63',NULL,'{\"title\": \"Sr. Manager - Building, Utilities & Other Infrastructure for Design Coordination (Mechanical)\", \"location\": \"Nagpur, Nagpur, IN\", \"date\": null, \"function\": null, \"pay_band\": null, \"sections_extracted\": [\"Responsibilities & Key Deliverables\", \"Experience\", \"Industry Preferred\", \"Qualifications\"]}','ATS_API_SUCCESSFACTORS','2026-10-13 05:21:35.174354',NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:35.167781',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-13 05:21:35.167781',NULL,'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"html5\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\" lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n        <head>\n            <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\" />\n            <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n                <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n                        <link type=\"text/css\" class=\"keepscript\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://jobs.mahindracareers.com/platform/bootstrap/3.4.8_NES/css/bootstrap.min.css\" />\n                            <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/platform/css/j2w/min/bootstrapV3.global.responsive.min.c