ing-copy\"}}, \"bundle\": {\"id\": \"6f1ca642-16c8-4d51-b1c1-01c7efdea1d4\", \"type\": \"media_type--media_type\", \"resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"drupal_internal__target_id\": \"image\"}}, \"status\": true, \"changed\": \"2025-02-24T03:46:01+00:00\", \"created\": \"2023-11-23T17:53:17+00:00\", \"metatag\": [{\"tag\": \"meta\", \"attributes\": {\"name\": \"title\", \"content\": \"| Berger Paints\"}}, {\"tag\": \"link\", \"attributes\": {\"rel\": \"canonical\", \"href\": \"http://admin.bergerpaints.com/jsonapi/node/career_page\"}}], \"langcode\": \"en\", \"thumbnail\": {\"id\": \"b6b98f99-8e3d-42ab-80cd-c0d243e29885\", \"uid\": {\"id\": \"a61cd31a-0e8e-45c2-a1c1-95accf982daf\", \"type\": \"user--user\", \"resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"drupal_internal__target_id\": 2}}, \"uri\": {\"url\": \"https://berger-dev-s3-bucket.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/2023-11/integrity_icon.png\", \"value\": \"s3://2023-11/integrity_icon.png\"}, \"type\": \"file--file\", \"links\": {\"self\": {\"href\": \"http://admin.bergerpaints.com/jsonapi/file/file/b6b98f99-8e3d-42ab-80cd-c0d243e29885\"}}, \"status\": true, \"changed\": \"2023-11-23T17:53:23+00:00\", \"created\": \"2023-11-23T17:53:17+00:00\", \"filemime\": \"image/png\", \"filename\": \"integrity_icon.png\", \"filesize\": 2420, \"langcode\": \"en\", \"relationshipNames\": [\"uid\"], \"resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Integrity\", \"title\": null, \"width\": 116, \"height\": 116, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 9708}, \"drupal_internal__fid\": 9708}, \"revision_user\": null, \"default_langcode\": true, \"revision_created\": \"2023-11-23T17:53:23+00:00\", \"field_media_image\": {\"id\": \"b6b98f99-8e3d-42ab-80cd-c0d243e29885\", \"uid\": {\"id\": \"a61cd31a-0e8e-45c2-a1c1-95accf982daf\", \"type\": \"user--user\", \"resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"drupal_internal__target_id\": 2}}, \"uri\": {\"url\": \"https://berger-dev-s3-bucket.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/2023-11/integrity_icon.png\", \"value\": \"s3://2023-11/integrity_icon.png\"}, \"type\": \"file--file\", \"links\": {\"self\": {\"href\": \"http://admin.bergerpaints.com/jsonapi/file/file/b6b98f99-8e3d-42ab-80cd-c0d243e29885\"}}, \"status\": true, \"changed\": \"2023-11-23T17:53:23+00:00\", \"created\": \"2023-11-23T17:53:17+00:00\", \"filemime\": \"image/png\", \"filename\": \"integrity_icon.png\", \"filesize\": 2420, \"langcode\": \"en\", \"relationshipNames\": [\"uid\"], \"resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Integrity\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 116, \"height\": 116, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 9708}, \"drupal_internal__fid\": 9708}, \"relationshipNames\": [\"bundle\", \"revision_user\", \"uid\", \"thumbnail\", \"field_media_image\"], \"resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1078}, \"drupal_internal__mid\": 1078, \"drupal_internal__vid\": 1088, \"revision_translation_affected\": true}, \"drupal_internal__tid\": 13364, \"drupal_internal__revision_id\": 13511, \"revision_translation_affected\": true}], \"field_banner_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Career-Web-Banner\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1920, \"height\": 755, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 19102}, \"field_banner_mobile_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Career-Mobile-Banner\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 430, \"height\": 683, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 19103}}, \"field_job_heading_one\": \"Put Your Career On The Right Track !\", \"field_job_heading_six\": \"Type\", \"field_job_heading_two\": \"Current Openings\", \"field_pillars_section\": [{\"id\": \"d97ff071-39a2-4b60-b66c-47056fc35646\", \"body\": \"<p>We’re committed to an open and transparent working environment, promoting free exchange of ideas and information. Instead of hierarchical decision-making, we encourage a collaborative approch toward taking important decisions. We value effective communication at every step.&nbsp;</p>\", \"title\": \"pillar 1\", \"field_body_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/open%20and%20non%20hierarchical%20%281%29.png\", \"field_main_heading_icon\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/pillas-icon.png\", \"field_main_pillar_heading\": \"Open & Non-Hierarchial\", \"field_body_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1664, \"height\": 813, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1692}, \"field_main_heading_icon_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 51, \"height\": 47, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1561}}, {\"id\": \"bb49d568-7853-4333-9351-751847e6b84c\", \"body\": \"<p>We believe in fostering compassion and humility to minimize stress, enhance job satisfaction, and promote a positive workplace. Each person’s concerns are given importance and listened to. We strive to ensure everyone feels safe and are rooting for one another.&nbsp;</p>\", \"title\": \"pillar 2\", \"field_body_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/Humble%20and%20compassionate%20%281%29.png\", \"field_main_heading_icon\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/pillas-icon_0.png\", \"field_main_pillar_heading\": \"Humble & Compassionate\", \"field_body_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Humble & Compassionate\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1664, \"height\": 813, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1693}, \"field_main_heading_icon_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 51, \"height\": 47, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1563}}, {\"id\": \"c246464c-7e57-44f7-85a3-5fa6d874b4b5\", \"body\": \"<p>At Berger, we strive to build a workforce powered by self-accountability. Employees are encouraged to act independently and make decisions. They have the liberty to work at their own pace and approach as long as performance objectives are met.&nbsp;</p>\", \"title\": \"pillar 3\", \"field_body_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/Autonomy%20and%20experimentatoin%20%281%29.png\", \"field_main_heading_icon\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/pillas-icon_1.png\", \"field_main_pillar_heading\": \" Autonomy & Experimentation\", \"field_body_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1664, \"height\": 813, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1694}, \"field_main_heading_icon_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 51, \"height\": 47, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1565}}, {\"id\": \"ee33755f-31f0-4112-bfc0-5309eed2b4da\", \"body\": \"<p>Understanding that change is a constant part of life, Berger believes in creating an agile workplace. Our employees are supported to deal with the unexpected curveballs life throws their way and work towards productivity in the workplace.&nbsp;</p>\", \"title\": \"pillar 4\", \"field_body_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-11/Agile%20and%20Process%20Driven.png\", \"field_main_heading_icon\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-07/pillas-icon_2.png\", \"field_main_pillar_heading\": \"Agile & Process Driven\", \"field_body_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Agile & Process Driven\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 318, \"height\": 395, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 9506}, \"field_main_heading_icon_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 51, \"height\": 47, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 1661}}], \"field_articles_section\": [{\"id\": \"47ab64cd-fc57-4449-a933-9e9fa721d829\", \"path\": \"/blogs/bergers-comprehensive-management-trainee-program\", \"title\": \"Career Blog1: Nurturing Future Leaders: Berger\'s Comprehensive Management Trainee Program\", \"field_name\": \"Nurturing Future Leaders: Berger\'s Comprehensive Management Trainee Program\", \"field_quickread\": \"Berger Paints, a leading player in the paint industry, recently welcomed 30 talented Management Trainees to their family. The induction program for these young minds was designed to equip them with the knowledge and skills necessary to thrive in the competitive world of paints and coatings.\\r\\n\\r\\nOver the course of several weeks, these trainees engaged in a holistic learning experience, from meeting key stakeholders to diving deep into the diverse segments of Berger\'s offerings.\", \"field_name_of_author\": \"Berger Paints India\", \"field_date_of_the_blog\": \"2023-09-28\", \"field_image_of_article\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-03/1_8%20%281%29.png?VersionId=oZUtkvv0OaWnJNCKA0mFcYmgIMLxlaGM\", \"field_image_of_article_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"bergers-comprehensive-management-trainee-program\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1396, \"height\": 780, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 12507}}, {\"id\": \"24bea03d-ab93-4a76-a57c-f02f5840f6ab\", \"path\": \"/blogs/leadership-development-drive-from-berger-paints-india\", \"title\": \"Career Blog2: Line Manager Capability Program: A Leadership Development Drive from Berger Paints India\", \"field_name\": \"Line Manager Capability Program: A Leadership Development Drive From Berger Paints India\", \"field_quickread\": \"Berger Paints India has always been invested in the growth of employees. Therefore, the company has introduced employee training programs time and again for individual and organizational growth. Additionally, the leading paint company understands the significance of effective leadership for an upward journey in a saturated industry.\", \"field_name_of_author\": \"Berger Paints India\", \"field_date_of_the_blog\": \"2023-10-03\", \"field_image_of_article\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202023-05-12%20at%2015.48.57%20%281%29.jpeg?VersionId=IgtWym1AGJ_Zrc_jRtwicPZieWT0Aklf\", \"field_image_of_article_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"leadership-development-drive-from-berger-paints-india\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1116, \"height\": 623, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 12529}}, {\"id\": \"50159194-5fb3-4d79-af3d-5ee5e669b252\", \"path\": \"/blogs/berger-paints-india-introduces-new-program-for-management-trainees\", \"title\": \"Career Blog3: Berger Paints India Introduces New Program for Management Trainees\", \"field_name\": \"Berger Paints India Introduces New Program For Management Trainees\", \"field_quickread\": \"Berger Paints India truly believes in the fact that the growth of a leader comes from a continuous process of learning. That\'s why the company provides its leaders with sufficient training opportunities to enrich and enhance their managerial skills. \\r\\n\", \"field_name_of_author\": \"Berger Paints India\", \"field_date_of_the_blog\": \"2023-10-03\", \"field_image_of_article\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-03/3_8%20%281%29.png?VersionId=IcZ8EFNQMHIuN8Or4Jo9xFnIpe.LfeSh\", \"field_image_of_article_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"berger-paints-india-introduces-new-program-for-management-trainees\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1396, \"height\": 780, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 12512}}, {\"id\": \"384fa73b-6f8f-4d58-b5df-3a968a7350b5\", \"path\": \"/blogs/berger-paints-india-nurtures-talents-to-let-the-next-generation-take-up-center-stage\", \"title\": \"Career Blog4: Berger Paints India Nurtures Talents to Let the Next Generation Take Up Center Stage\", \"field_name\": \"Berger Paints India Nurtures Talents To Let The Next Generation Take Up Center Stage\", \"field_quickread\": \"The massive evolution in the business landscape requires businesses to constantly think about the future. Nurturing new talents and setting them on the path of innovation is necessary for businesses to secure their future. Berger Paints India is truly dedicated to passing on the torch to the upcoming generation while continuing to be associated with growth and success in the future. \\r\\n\", \"field_name_of_author\": \"Berger Paints India\", \"field_date_of_the_blog\": \"2023-10-03\", \"field_image_of_article\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-04/Career-blog.png?VersionId=scxcOGO_2jo9dGDjIUELvIVuWyBBeylN\", \"field_image_of_article_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"berger-paints-india-nurtures-talents-to-let-the-next-generation-take-up-center-stage\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1396, \"height\": 780, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 14275}}], \"field_job_heading_five\": \"Location\", \"field_job_heading_four\": \"Department \", \"field_question_section\": [{\"id\": \"710d1fad-dfca-473e-93aa-42348c69efdf\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">With a rich legacy and a relentless commitment to quality, we at Berger Paints have consistently redefined the standards of the paint industry. Our journey is marked by a passion for colours, a dedication to superior products, and an unwavering focus on customer satisfaction. Join us at Berger Paints, where you become part of a dynamic team driving the vibrant future of the paint industry in India.</p>\", \"title\": \"  Who We Are?\", \"field_career_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Who%20are%20we.png\", \"field_career_answer_heading\": \"One of the Fastest Growing Paint Companies in India\", \"field_career_question_question\": \"Who We Are?\", \"field_career_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Who We Are?\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1920, \"height\": 996, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 6140}}, {\"id\": \"727922ae-80c1-4df8-9a68-d8266e8dcda8\", \"body\": \"<p>Our team is dedicated to creating and delivering innovative solutions that redefine the aesthetic and protective aspects of multiple spaces. From formulating cutting-edge paint products to developing sustainable and scientific waterproofing solutions, we are committed to enhancing the spaces where people live and work. At Berger Paints, we don\'t just paint walls; we colour experiences, build legacies and contribute to a brighter, more vibrant future.</p>\", \"title\": \"What We Do?\", \"field_career_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/where%20we%20belong.png\", \"field_career_answer_heading\": \"Deliver Innovative and Trusted End-to-End Solutions\", \"field_career_question_question\": \"What We Do?\", \"field_career_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"What We Do?\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1920, \"height\": 996, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 6142}}, {\"id\": \"c7c19162-f89c-4f63-b089-cce101b803c1\", \"body\": \"<p>At Berger Paints, we prioritize professional growth through a dynamic work environment, continuous learning opportunities, and a commitment to cultivating the skills and expertise of our team members. Choose us for a career that values your development, fosters innovation, and offers a platform for lasting success.</p>\", \"title\": \"Why Choose Us?\", \"field_career_image\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/how%20we%20act.png\", \"field_career_answer_heading\": \"We Prioritize You\", \"field_career_question_question\": \"Why Choose Us?\", \"field_career_image_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Why Choose Us?\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 1920, \"height\": 996, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 6138}}], \"field_job_heading_seven\": \"Posted on\", \"field_job_heading_three\": \"Job Title\", \"field_usable_heading_one\": \"Locations\", \"field_usable_heading_two\": \"Career Blogs \", \"field_career_path_section\": [{\"id\": \"567c0dac-c7f3-4031-be12-04821d03a0e0\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Frontline Sales Officers are responsible for selling paint in one area, ensuring customers are happy and sales are growing.</p>\", \"title\": \"Sales Officer\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/mid-level-mktng.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Marketing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Sales Officer\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 180, \"height\": 123, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7055}}, {\"id\": \"a887eea1-a28e-47cf-9adc-a5d1c266b9a2\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Assistant Area Sales Managers oversee a group of sales officers to achieve sales goals and targets.</p>\", \"title\": \"Assistant Area Sales Manager\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Assistant%20Area%20Sales%20Manager_1.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Marketing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Assistant Area Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 191, \"height\": 191, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7092}}, {\"id\": \"ce9776ed-4fec-4595-a790-75d518f5558e\", \"body\": \"<p>Area Sales Managers lead depot operations autonomously, typically filled by MBAs from prestigious institutions</p>\", \"title\": \"Area Sales Manager\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Area%20Sales%20Manager_1.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Marketing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Area Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 168, \"height\": 197, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7093}}, {\"id\": \"b3646678-29b8-48d5-bee8-427d74d53545\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">A Product Manager is responsible for guiding the development, marketing, and success of a specific product in the company\'s portfolio.</p>\", \"title\": \"Product Manager\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Product%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Marketing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Product Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 179, \"height\": 157, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7094}}, {\"id\": \"a26b23ca-f2e1-46ed-b685-22a613529542\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">A Category Manager oversees and strategizes the success across a lineup of diverse products in style.</p>\", \"title\": \"Category Manager\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Category%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Marketing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Category Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 222, \"height\": 176, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7095}}, {\"id\": \"cba48e49-796e-47cd-8bfb-5e8f691c61b9\", \"body\": \"<p>A Category Head leads and innovates within a specific product category to drive growth and excellence in offerings.</p>\", \"title\": \"Category Head\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Category%20Head.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Marketing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Category Head\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 103, \"height\": 178, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7096}}, {\"id\": \"e12fcb98-8fb7-4d69-b3ab-5bd2988f0811\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Frontline Sales Officers drive revenue growth by managing sales operations within their assigned territories with expertise.</p>\", \"title\": \"Sales Officer (Sales)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": null, \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Sales%20Officer.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Sales\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Sales Officer\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 248, \"height\": 176, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7082}}, {\"id\": \"4e92c5d3-addb-464b-b498-21e42df5080e\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Leadership role overseeing Sales Officers, driving team performance, and achieving sales targets in assigned areas.</p>\", \"title\": \"Assistant Area Sales Manager (Sales)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Assistant%20Area%20Sales%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Sales\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Assistant Area Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 191, \"height\": 191, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7083}}, {\"id\": \"27f1663c-f362-4fed-a406-4d0627b632f3\", \"body\": \"<p>Lead depot operations, oversee sales, and guide teams effectively. MBAs from top colleges secure this role.</p>\", \"title\": \"Area Sales Manager (Sales)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Area%20Sales%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Sales\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Area Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 168, \"height\": 197, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7084}}, {\"id\": \"69439ea6-793c-496e-a148-eea81c03f64f\", \"body\": \"<p>Oversees multiple depots, manages sales divisions, and drives growth. Essential leadership role in expanding operations.</p>\", \"title\": \"Divisional Sales Manager (Sales)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Divisional%20Sales%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Sales\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Divisional Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 121, \"height\": 156, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7085}}, {\"id\": \"302e493d-5ebf-4194-8025-a7a37f93db6a\", \"body\": \"<p>Responsible for managing operations and growth within a state. Key leadership role for statewide success.</p>\", \"title\": \"State Head (Sales)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Mktng-lead_1.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Sales\", \"field_position_heading\": \"State Head\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 129, \"height\": 156, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7086}}, {\"id\": \"b7ad5bdd-05d5-427d-920b-0125e30c7c6e\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Lead retail region, drive sales strategies, and achieve growth targets. Crucial role in expanding market presence.</p>\", \"title\": \"Regional Sales Manager (Sales)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Regional%20Sales%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Sales\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Regional Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 232, \"height\": 149, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7087}}, {\"id\": \"7b543c76-83fa-4865-9bad-c7fd00e20e53\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Frontline sales officers to manage and boost sales in their allotted markets, essential for business growth.</p>\", \"title\": \"Sales Officer (industrial)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Sales%20Officer_0.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Industrial\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Sales Officer\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 248, \"height\": 176, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7088}}, {\"id\": \"beaf9714-2e60-45de-8d00-026fc5874db6\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Lead and support Sales Officers for achieving sales goals, ensuring success and growth in the area.</p>\", \"title\": \"Assistant Area Sales Manager (industriral)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Assistant%20Area%20Sales%20Manager_0.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Industrial\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Assistant Area Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 191, \"height\": 191, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7089}}, {\"id\": \"37f81a7d-0cea-414c-aae4-0199e2832920\", \"body\": \"<p>In charge of boosting sales and profitability within a designated geographic area for overall success.</p>\", \"title\": \"Area Sales Manager (industrial)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Area%20Sales%20Manager_0.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Industrial\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Area Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 168, \"height\": 197, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7090}}, {\"id\": \"746e35d2-c82c-4127-a1ac-2d80d4ff15cd\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Supporting and guiding Area Sales Managers to drive sales success within their divisions, achieving growth targets.</p>\", \"title\": \"Divisional Sales Manager (industrial)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Divisional%20Sales%20Manager_0.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Industrial\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Divisional Sales Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 121, \"height\": 156, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7091}}, {\"id\": \"7bf6f64b-e1e9-4796-84ec-444ebfc25959\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Officers ensure raw materials, shift plans, and maintenance support are in place. Graduate Engineer Trainees secure this role.</p>\", \"title\": \"Officer (Manufacture)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Officer.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Manufacturing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Officer\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 145, \"height\": 167, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7097}}, {\"id\": \"44b3dfc9-dee5-4bb9-927a-8e4d10e965e3\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Supervise a factory section with a team of officers to ensure smooth operations and productivity.</p>\", \"title\": \"Officer Supervisor(manufature)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Officer%20Supervisor.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Manufacturing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Officer Supervisor\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 110, \"height\": 163, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7098}}, {\"id\": \"acb015f7-93e4-43ef-8959-506df2ad0cf4\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Assistant Manager/Manager leads and manages a specific factory section, overseeing operations and responsibilities with autonomy.</p>\", \"title\": \"Assistant Manager/Manager(manufacture)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Assistant%20Manager.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Manufacturing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Assistant Manager/Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 208, \"height\": 160, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7099}}, {\"id\": \"f93d5bd9-5749-4bb7-bde5-06f4b83b3e1f\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The Factory Head is responsible for supervising and managing the entire factory\'s operations and activities.</p>\", \"title\": \"Factory Head (manufacture)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Factory%20Head.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Manufacturing\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Factory Head\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 113, \"height\": 172, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7100}}, {\"id\": \"92e8f9a8-601f-41b8-b01e-7ba579249bab\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Chartered Accountants get appointed as Executives in Audit, managing financial assessments and reports for the company.</p>\", \"title\": \"Executive (finance)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Officer_0.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Finance & Accounts\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Executive\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 145, \"height\": 167, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7103}}, {\"id\": \"fd282553-dacc-498c-ac1f-42ed9d2d1f2a\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Assistant Manager/Manager gain experience working in diverse areas like Audit, Treasury, Finance Controller, Commercial, Factory Controller, Taxation.</p>\", \"title\": \"Assistant Manager/Manager(finance)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Assistant%20Manager_1.png\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Finance & Accounts\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Assistant Manager/Manager\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"img\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 208, \"height\": 160, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 7102}}, {\"id\": \"c3ca847a-7217-4f94-8670-1f6226aa3413\", \"body\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Senior Managers lead departments such as Internal Audit, Treasury, Finance, Taxation, and more, driving strategic financial operations.</p>\", \"title\": \"Senior Manager (finance)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2023-09/Divisional%20Sales%20Manager_