 \"<p>Handling multiple regions of sales function</p>\", \"title\": \"Zonal HR Business Partner (HR)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-04/Zonal%20HR%20Business%20Partner.png?VersionId=6akcppYOUkKdWG_3Z_BQNxPTe0Eva0.c\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Human Resource\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Zonal HR Business Partner\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Zonal HR Business Partner\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 191, \"height\": 191, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 14140}}, {\"id\": \"ae66e7f7-66dc-4661-aa3a-4483aff74efa\", \"body\": \"<p>Handle HR &amp; IR of a factory</p>\", \"title\": \"Factory HR (HR)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-04/Factory%20HR.png?VersionId=T_mTlKLqGWqcac_ED8sSXpwkBSfTHWkd\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Human Resource\", \"field_position_heading\": \"Factory HR\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"Factory HR\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 113, \"height\": 172, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 14142}}, {\"id\": \"10bbfe15-1ace-4fd5-afde-31f5cbe6d81c\", \"body\": \"<p>Centre of Excellence for Compensation &amp; Benefits</p>\", \"title\": \"COE-C&B (HR)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-04/COE-C%26B.png?VersionId=XEr._mtaVtVL.OmLaZ6yjVpmPjqEEF4h\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Human Resource\", \"field_position_heading\": \"COE-C&B\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"COE-C&B\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 222, \"height\": 176, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 14143}}, {\"id\": \"2c57b809-fc69-43e7-8a41-c6bb5c61ecc8\", \"body\": \"<p>Centre of Excellence for Learning &amp; Development and Talent Management</p>\", \"title\": \"COE-L&D and Talent Management (HR)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-04/COE-L%26D%20and%20Talent%20Management.png?VersionId=cMHpKDPcLvMiTcFPbuP1zKQqEzFxetv2\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Human Resource\", \"field_position_heading\": \"COE-L&D and Talent Management\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"COE-L&D and Talent Management \", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 179, \"height\": 157, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 14144}}, {\"id\": \"4f7adcaf-caa8-4943-ac85-306aeff1ade0\", \"body\": \"<p>Human Resources Business Partner for Sales and Marketing for Berger Paints</p>\", \"title\": \"HRBP-S&M (HR)\", \"field_year_figure\": null, \"field_year_heading\": \"years of experience:\", \"field_position_logo\": \"/s3fs-public/2024-04/HRBP-S%26M.png?VersionId=S6MHK9RrVDZHyztdnmDMQXGxjnpJIKRv\", \"field_position_rank\": null, \"field_department_list\": \"Human Resource\", \"field_position_heading\": \"HRBP-S&M\", \"field_position_logo_resourceIdObjMeta\": {\"alt\": \"HRBP-S&M\", \"title\": \"\", \"width\": 232, \"height\": 149, \"drupal_internal__target_id\": 14147}}], \"field_usable_heading_four\": \"Programs supporting students to step into the real world with extensive training and innovative projects.\", \"field_usable_heading_three\": \"Career path\", \"field_client_testimonial_section\": [{\"id\": \"42e8889b-9ea1-4fd2-9ac5-22d2ca881b96\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Bhaskar Dasgupta\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-03/bhaskar_da.png?VersionId=X1EpEc_3du2MmUAYYnQ26Xgb.1njVaVO\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-03/bhaskar_da.png?VersionId=X1EpEc_3du2MmUAYYnQ26Xgb.1njVaVO\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Assistant Vice President - Retail Sales\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>Success is largely dependent on various factors. Being in the right place at the right time, with the correct mentors has contributed to my growth. As long as one is honest and hardworking with clarity of thought, Berger will provide them with ample opportunities.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"86659498-c702-42b3-afaf-8dc4d9d2db30\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Anish Basu\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-03/anish_basu.jpg?VersionId=6hDOuREwi_5C1HH0cbCDV7BYRO1SHFcP\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-03/anish_basu.jpg?VersionId=6hDOuREwi_5C1HH0cbCDV7BYRO1SHFcP\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"General Manager - Supply Chain & Logistics\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>What stands out about Berger is its unwavering commitment to fostering employee growth and providing ample opportunities for advancement. From the moment I joined as a young management trainee, I was encouraged to set ambitious goals and supported in achieving them.&nbsp;</p><p>The strength of any company is its people, and here at Berger, we are like a family. It is a truly enthusiastic environment to work in, where everyone\'s unique perspectives and contributions are embraced.&nbsp;</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"9a020b22-8c99-427f-8068-459942af264a\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Nikita Choudhury\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-04/nikita_chaudhary.jpg?VersionId=OvDm7o3a4UZ0cM3ytkxFzXi.JGi4NKuF\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-04/nikita_chaudhary.jpg?VersionId=OvDm7o3a4UZ0cM3ytkxFzXi.JGi4NKuF\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Assistant Manager - Finance & Accounts\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>The company\'s culture promotes an openness to new ideas, enabling personal and professional development through the valuable lessons learned from mistakes. The inclusive atmosphere encourages taking risks, shaping a positive and dynamic setting. Berger, for me, is more than just a workplace; it\'s a professional home that inspires and supports, especially during tough times.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"72fae6fd-450f-48c0-94db-059b0a3df66a\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Ayush Shome\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/ayush_shome.jpg?VersionId=Z2_53eA5UsZ2l8IoEMjERSwyvfZNY0uQ\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/ayush_shome.jpg?VersionId=Z2_53eA5UsZ2l8IoEMjERSwyvfZNY0uQ\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Executive Manager - Corp. TQM (Total Quality Management)\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>My journey at Berger Paints started five and a half years ago when I walked through the doors as a Graduate Engineer Trainee fresh out of college. I felt most welcomed in the open and friendly work environment here. The organization\'s commitment to innovation and excellence inspired me to strive for nothing but the best, driving me towards continuous improvement and shaping not only my career but also my entire professional identity.&nbsp;</p><p>Joining Berger isn\'t just a career move; it\'s stepping into a family that believes in your potential, encourages budding talent, and fosters a culture of inclusivity and empowerment.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"41fd1205-95a4-4f3d-908f-b4c11ced8d62\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Debarshi Mukherjee\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/debarshi_mukherjee.jpg?VersionId=AKDEY7wbZwCycPrnCr1n_x1Dx.j67avv\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/debarshi_mukherjee.jpg?VersionId=AKDEY7wbZwCycPrnCr1n_x1Dx.j67avv\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Manager - Legal & Administration\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>I am fortunate to start my career in an organisation which has a culture that embraces &nbsp;flexibility, nurtures independence and promotes diversity of thought. It has helped me both in my professional growth and personal development. I have an outstanding mentor and energetic colleagues and my work has given me the chance to learn from the best of professionals.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"5b3670ae-e0a9-410b-ad76-89ae6a29af49\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Kalpesh Darji\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/kalpesh_darji.jpeg?VersionId=AaOeTtlFETZTmW5VGHqANjiT5czQZFlC\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/kalpesh_darji.jpeg?VersionId=AaOeTtlFETZTmW5VGHqANjiT5czQZFlC\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Deputy General Manager - Retail Sales\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>It is said that most of the jobs can be taught, and that is true, I have realized it throughout my career in Beger since last 13 years. I have seen that a person with right attitude and actual need for the job makes him a right fit for a company like Berger Paints. This is a place where people get chance to experiment, make mistakes, Learn and grow. I joined as a junior Manager here before 13 years and since then there have been 6 promotions. I have learned things and have been growing to my expectations as the culture of the organisation is such that it allows people to come up to their full potential. For the people who want to grow consistently and have right attitude towards work, this becomes the best organisation to be associated with.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"cc83c877-a8b6-4e1f-9705-42199c90f836\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Prithvi Banerjee\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/prithvi_banerjee.jpeg?VersionId=Z0pel_07PpUQBt_AWFiWhbfWWM4UgFyh\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/prithvi_banerjee.jpeg?VersionId=Z0pel_07PpUQBt_AWFiWhbfWWM4UgFyh\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Area Sales Manager - Distribution\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>At Berger Paints, inclusivity is not just a buzzword – it\'s ingrained in our culture. From the approachable senior management to open-door policies, the environment here fosters comfort and gives you a sense of belongingness. Recognition is swift for those who show passion and ownership, paving the way for professional growth and<br>development. Berger paints isn\'t just a workplace; it\'s more of a family where your dedication is rewarded, and success is celebrated.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"61397fa9-5d63-41ef-a417-c098f0bb4ebb\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Ramanjit Narang\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/testimonial_picture-_ramanjit_narang_1.png?VersionId=cuojIf3a76CA8IDXCnAno5adBNMPsbSD\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/testimonial_picture-_ramanjit_narang_1.png?VersionId=cuojIf3a76CA8IDXCnAno5adBNMPsbSD\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Deputy General Manager - Retail Sales\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>Most Important thing about Berger is Upward Communication and this leads to family kind of Environment at Workplace. This open communication channel leads to continuous learning at Workplace and that finally leads to desired results in business and growth in personal career too..</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"07f1a902-3462-4025-b773-8ec0822f1935\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Suman Bandyopadhyay\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/suman_bandyopadhyay.jpeg?VersionId=Oxrvi0LOLlcEhzPhh4kdNnR4K5Gzjha2\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/suman_bandyopadhyay.jpeg?VersionId=Oxrvi0LOLlcEhzPhh4kdNnR4K5Gzjha2\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"General Manager - Project Sales\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>Growing an organisation requires two things from a team; passion and capability. Passion comes from a sense of ownership of an assignment, and capability comes from the correct opportunity with able guidance, and the independence of practising it at work. Berger Paints seeks to run by the same principles every single day. This way of life has been embedded into Berger\'s family, forming an age old culture that defines the brand. I have been very fortunate to be part of this family, where team spirit and relationship is the catalyst for high performance.</p>\"}, {\"id\": \"9669227c-b0d7-4f7a-bf5e-d3bbf3b35dff\", \"field_rating\": null, \"field_client_name\": \"Yogesh Jain\", \"field_client_image\": {\"thumbnail\": \"/2024-05/yogesh_jain.png?VersionId=22mCmPFybnj8FIJ5VnAUsSdozI_nphv1\", \"field_media_image\": \"/2024-05/yogesh_jain.png?VersionId=22mCmPFybnj8FIJ5VnAUsSdozI_nphv1\"}, \"field_youtube_link\": null, \"field_client_position\": \"Brand Manager - Interior Emulsions\", \"field_client_description\": \"<p>Berger seamlessly blends a century of heritage with the agility of a startup, creating a dynamic and forward-thinking workplace. Despite its century long legacy, the organization maintains a refreshingly non-hierarchical structure, fostering an environment of experimentation and creativity, where every idea is valued. The friendly culture cultivates strong relationships among colleagues, promoting collaboration and mutual support.&nbsp;</p><p>One of Berger’s greatest strengths lies in its ability to cultivate empathy within its workforce that extends beyond professional relationships, creating a sense of community and understanding that transcends traditional boundaries.</p>\"}], \"field_testimonial_section_headin\": {\"value\": \"<h2><strong>Passion Drives Success</strong></h2>\", \"summary\": \"Our Team Shares Their Stories\"}}','http_status_404','LISTING_FALLBACK',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\", \"raw_department\": \"department\", \"raw_employment_type\": \"employment_type\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Corporate','Full-time','India','berger career page'),(11327,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_130_1f41dd938694','company logo','Corporate',NULL,'India',NULL,NULL,'On-site','Full-time',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'company logo',NULL,NULL,'https://www.bergerpaints.com/','https://www.bergerpaints.com/','2026-10-19T12:15:39.229100+00:00','ACTIVE',0,'LINK_FALLBACK',NULL,NULL,'1f41dd9386942fecb6a0cd18ec799fbcc496baead58802feecf126bfcd404928','COMP_TOP200_130','https://www.berge