es, discover new varieties, and read insightful blogs to enhance your culinary journey.\"}, \"subtitle\": \"Your one-stop destination for cheesy recipes\", \"description\": \"<p><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\\\">Love cheese? Here’s a place where you can find popular and exotic cheese recipes and not just that, you can also customize each of them based on occasion and the number of folks you are preparing it for. What’s more, you can discover new varieties of cheese, read insightful and informative blogs, decode myths and find lesser-known cheese facts too!&nbsp;</span></p>\", \"card_description\": \"<p>It’s not easy being really cheesy. But we tried, just for you! Discover everything cheese from recipes to myth-busting information and more.</p>\"}','closed_role_detected: page not found','LISTING_FALLBACK',NULL,'{\"raw_title\": \"raw_metadata.title\", \"raw_location\": \"location\", \"raw_department\": \"department\", \"raw_employment_type\": \"employment_type\"}',NULL,'{}',NULL,'Corporate','Full-time','India','Cheese It Up! '),(11458,'JOB_COMP_TOP200_059_0366fbd84e42','Website Policy','Corporate',NULL,'India',NULL,NULL,'On-site','Full-time',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Website Policy',NULL,NULL,'https://www.bharatpetroleum.in/website-policy','https://www.bharatpetroleum.in/website-policy','2026-10-19T12:16:03.196390+00:00','ACTIVE',0,'LINK_OK','2026-10-19 12:16:03.196390',NULL,'0366fbd84e42ce1dcbab8fe4e3a01f08e0236979725b032d7555865044f076fa','COMP_TOP200_059','https://www.bharatpetroleum.in/website-policy','671c404cc9bcd1746627d324e3824e71',NULL,'Website Policy',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:03.196390',NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:03.196390',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:03.196390',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'SOURCE_CONFIRMED',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'New Delhi / Mumbai',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NOT_FETCHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OWNED',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-19 12:16:0